&#xD;
  Paints are composed of solvents, resins, pigments, and additives. Accordingly, handling workers have many risk factors because they are exposed to the physiological mechanisms and toxicity of hazardous chemicals. According to the Occupational Safety and Health Act, in accordance with Article 39, Paragraph 1, based on the results of the exposure status survey and hazardous risk assessment, etc., substances prohibited for manufacturing, etc., substances permitted for manufacturing, etc., hazardous substances subject to management, harmful factors subject to work environment measurement, etc. They are classified and managed as harmful factors subject to exposure standards, Many workplaces are not only taking measures to comply with applicable regulations, but are also making efforts to prevent risks in advance through facility improvement and additional measures to reduce the accident rate among workers. However, since cost is essential when considering improvement measures or the installation of improvement facilities in a workplace, there are many difficulties in making improvements in reality unless the cost-effective improvement effect is shown as a visible result or there is no mandatory reason on legal grounds. Therefore, in order to solve these difficulties and encourage direct investment such as facility improvement, there appears to be a great need for basic data that quantifies the basis for measurement results based on environmental improvement or the increase in efficiency due to improved perceived awareness of workers.Accordingly, this paper is the same process as the COLOR (hereinafter CCL#1) process, a painted steel plate production process that handles paint, at workplace A, where a ventilation system-type working environment improvement facility (Air Blower Duct System) is installed, but the working environment improvement facility is installed. Investigate the satisfaction level of the working environment of COLOR #2 (hereinafter referred to as CCL #2), which is not working, compare the satisfaction level of workers with the working environment before and after improvement, and check the working environment measurement results before and after installation of the relevant process (CCL #1). The correlation with the results of the environmental satisfaction survey was inferred. As a result of a survey of the CCL#1 process with a ventilation system installed and the CCL#2 process without a ventilation system, the perception of the ventilation system was generally positive for both processes, while the worker's perception of dust generation was higher for the CCL#1 process than for the CCL process. Considering that the response was higher than the #2 process, the direct effect through facility improvement was judged to be minimal. However, in response to the recognition of efforts to improve the workplace's working environment and the need for further improvement, the CCL#1 process showed a positive perception of improvement efforts, while the need for further improvement was highly frequent in CCL#2. Through this, it could be inferred that efforts to improve the workplace through facility improvement were positive in improving the awareness of CCL#1 workers. In order to change the actual concentration of pollutants, we checked the work environment measurement results before and after installation of CCL #1. As a result, although the concentration may be insignificant compared to the exposure standard, the measured concentration of pollutants after installation is more than 50% of the concentration of pollutants measured before installation. A downward trend was confirmed. Through this, although workers' satisfaction with the working environment through facility improvement was minimal, the improvement effect in actual pollutant concentration was confirmed. Additional investigation revealed that there was no significant impact on the presence or absence of a ventilation system, but the working environment characteristics of CCL#1 and the entire workplace were compared to determine the uniqueness of the survey results depending on whether or not paint was handled.&#xD;
  As a result, the response to the ventilation system was similar in that it was generally positive, and the response to the frequency of dust generation and exposure to hazardous substances was high in both comparison groups, while the response to the frequency of odor occurrence was low. Differences were confirmed in responses to the working environment. Compared to CCL#1 workers, workers at all workplaces were more negative about efforts to improve the working environment at the workplace and showed greater demand for future improvements. Based on the results, it appears that the correlation between the paint handling process and the characteristics of the working environment is not significant at the relevant workplace. Through this survey, we looked into workers' satisfaction with the working environment through facility improvement and the results of measuring the actual workplace working environment. As a result, contrary to expectations at the beginning of the survey, it was confirmed that there was no significant effect on workers' satisfaction with the working environment, as there was no significant change in the results before and after facility improvement. However, the fact that the improvement effect was confirmed to be small in the measurement results was a positive factor. According to these results, when planning to improve the working environment, it seems necessary for workplaces to more closely review improvement measures rather than unreasonable facility improvements, and reflect the opinions of workers. It seems desirable to establish the most efficient measures through,

11373.abstract_en:
Experimental Study for the Supplementation of Certification Standards of Gas Mask Filters&#xD;
&#xD;
Yang, Won Jun&#xD;
(Supervisor Kim, Ki-Youn)&#xD;
Dept. of Global Safety Engineering&#xD;
The Graduate School of Industry&#xD;
Seoul National University of Science and Technology&#xD;
&#xD;
 Poisoning from hazardous chemicals predominantly occurs through respiratory exposure rather than skin contact for workers, making gas masks critically important for prevention. Gas masks are essential in preventing industrial accidents and occupational diseases caused by chemicals, as they use appropriate filters depending on the chemical. In industrial settings, gas masks are used to eliminate or reduce workers' exposure to harmful gases and vapors. The effectiveness of a gas mask is determined by its filter, with the crucial factor being how long the activated carbon within the filter can reliably adsorb harmful gases. To maintain stable performance, the filter must not be damaged by external stress. Additionally, to ensure effective breakthrough time in environments with harmful gases, factors such as the form of the container holding the activated carbon, adsorption kinetics, and the carbon's adsorption capacity for vapors must be cons&#xD;
 Filters can be exposed to various external stresses, such as during shipping, handling, and usage. In industrial settings, filters are often loaded with various items. In such environments, significant loads can be applied to each filter, potentially affecting their structural integrity and functional efficiency, leading to reduced lifespan and performance over time. However, the domestic certification standards for gas masks only state that the filter's adsorbent must be "firmly filled and not exposed by impact," with only a drop test from 2 cm up to 2,000 times being conducted. Thus, the certification standards for industrial gas mask filters lack design and testing criteria for actual external stresses encountered during shipping, handling, and usage.&#xD;
 The performance testing of the filter's detoxification capability is only conducted by manufacturers sampling products every two years after the initial certification test, with no specific procedures for continuous performance management of products exposed to distribution and handling environments.&#xD;
 Therefore, this study aims to suggest improvements to the certification standards for gas mask filters by conducting experimental research on the structural safety testing of low-concentration composite filters currently used and stored in industrial settings and analyzing their breakthrough times. The structural safety test analyzed the changing structural tensile stresses by applying 1 MPa to each model through finite element analysis.&#xD;
 Firstly, the structural analysis results according to the filter case shape show that shape significantly affects durability and performance. Cylindrical shapes exhibit lower principal stresses compared to trapezoidal shapes, highlighting cylindrical filters as a better choice for minimizing damage.&#xD;
 Secondly, the thickness of the filter case is also a critical factor. The analysis showed that structures at 1.4 mm thickness failed to maintain performance, while those at 4.6 mm did not undergo structural deformation up to 1 MPa.&#xD;
 These research results are expected to serve as crucial indicators for applying materials and thickness in future filter design and manufacturing.&#xD;
 The detoxification performance test for the filters was conducted according to the gas mask performance testing procedures outlined in the Ministry of Employment and Labor's protective gear certification notice. Test results showed that filters from each manufacturer met the breakthrough time certification criteria. Additionally, there were differences in the effectiveness of the filters depending on the gas type for each manufacturer. In the cyclohexane and ammonia gas tests, product A showed the highest performance, while in the sulfur dioxide gas test, product B performed the best. Overall, product A had the highest average breakthrough time for the three types of gases.&#xD;
 This study confirms the need to supplement certification standards for the structural and detoxification performance testing of filters, considering the environments of use, storage, and management.

11374.abstract_en:
Abstract&#xD;
Analysis of Workers’ Understanding Level of &#xD;
Risk Assessment in Health Sector&#xD;
&#xD;
Kim, Jang Sung&#xD;
(Supervisor Kim, Ki-Youn)Dept. of Safety Engineering&#xD;
Graduate School&#xD;
Seoul National University of Science and Technology&#xD;
&#xD;
This study was designed to investigate the level of worker understanding of risk assessment in the health sector. General characteristics of the workplace and hazardous risk factors in the health field affect workers’ understanding.&#xD;
This study is a cross-sectional study conducted by the Korea Occupational Safety and Health Agency. The data for the development of the health sector risk assessment guide is 265 workplaces.&#xD;
Analysis was performed using descriptive statistics, t-test, ANOVA, and Pearson correlation analysis. The results of regression analysis using SPSS (ver.25.0) are as follows.&#xD;
This is the level of understanding of risk assessment in the health sector according to general characteristics. Employee understanding of risk assessment according to the number of full-time workers was found to be higher in workplaces with 300 or fewer employees (t=6.39, P&lt;.002), and depending on work type, regular workers were found to have a higher understanding of risk assessment in the health sector than contract workers. (t=2.90, P&lt;.01). Pearson Correlation analysis showed a significant positive correlation (P=&lt;.01) for all hazards and risks.&#xD;
Regression analysis was conducted to analyze the impact of understanding of risk assessment in the health sector on general characteristics and understanding by field. As a result of the significance test of the regression coefficient, as a result of the significance test of the regression coefficient, employment type (β= .169, p&lt;0.5) and heat and cold health care (β= .486, p&lt;0.01) were all significantly positive for overall satisfaction ( +) was found to have an effect. &#xD;
In order to ensure the effectiveness of risk assessment in the health sector and prevent occupational diseases, continuous identification of hazards and risks by industry and process in the health sector and effectiveness must be verified in the field, and workers' right to know must be guaranteed by expanding the number of health professionals.&#xD;

11375.abstract_en:
Air pollutants are various substances that have a significant impact on the environment. Fine particulate matter (PM10 and PM2.5) can penetrate deeply into the respiratory system, reaching the alveoli and potentially causing respiratory diseases, cardiovascular diseases, and even cancer. Ammonia(NH3) is a precursor of fine and fine particulate matter, which can indirectly harm the environment and health. The sources and concentrations of air pollutants like ammonia and ultrafine particulate matter vary depending on regional characteristics. Studies in China, Europe and the United States have shown that agriculture is a major contributor to the anthropogenic formation of fine particulate matter. In Korea, basic research related to air pollutants from agricultural areas has been conducted, but compared to urban areas, the establishment of air pollutant monitoring networks in agricultural regions is still insufficient.&#xD;
Recently, the number of elderly people and foreign migrant workers in rural areas has increased. Elderly farmers generally react sensitively to exposure to air pollutants such as fine particulate matter. Foreign workers may have limited health awareness about the risks, exposure pathways, and health impacts of air pollutants due to cultural differences, language barriers, and varying levels of education.&#xD;
Therefore, this study aims to accurately monitor the concentrations of air pollutants, including fine particulate matter, in a specific agricultural area in real-time, compare and analyze the causes and components of air pollutants by season, and collect basic data to protect the health of agricultural workers from air pollutants, thereby contributing to the safety, improvement, and enhancement of the agricultural environment.&#xD;
The study was conducted in selected agricultural areas in Yeoju, Gyeonggi Province. Selection criteria included crop distribution uniformity, surrounding influences, cooperation from farm owners, geographic requirements, and installation feasibility. The measurement period was set from March 2023 to February 2024, targeting PM10, PM2.5, NH3, and NO2. For measuring fine particulate matter, the Spirant BAM device was used for real-time monitoring. For NH3 and NO2, the MEZUS 210 NOx Analyzer (UV fluorescence method, Kentech, Korea) was used, which is approved by the Ministry of Environment. Data collected were used to calculate hourly average concentrations, monthly averages, and seasonal averages, and graphs were generated. One-way ANOVA in SPSS was used to compare monthly and seasonal statistical differences.&#xD;
Monitoring results in the agricultural area (rice field) showed that the seasonal average concentration of PM10 was highest in spring (59.94±22.82㎍/㎥) and winter (59.00±11.40㎍/㎥), followed by autumn (40.10±9.67㎍/㎥) and summer (28.3±8.5㎍/㎥). The seasonal average concentration of PM2.5 was highest in spring (27.27±6.42㎍/㎥), followed by autumn (16.98±3.43㎍/㎥), winter (16.32±7.51㎍/㎥), and summer (14.40±5.21㎍/㎥). NH3 concentrations were highest in winter (131.53±28.68ppb), followed by spring (33.15±11.55ppb) and summer (22.65±2.23ppb). NO2 concentrations were highest in winter (29.62±9.83ppb), followed by autumn (21.14±10.31ppb), spring (11.69±2.32ppb), and summer (4.70±1.37ppb). One-way ANOVA results indicated that the monthly concentrations of PM10 and PM2.5 showed statistically significant differences (p&lt;0.05), while NH3 and NO2 did not show statistically significant differences (p&gt;0.05). Seasonal comparisons showed that PM10 and PM2.5 concentrations were highest in spring due to soil cultivation, agricultural machinery use, fertilizer application, and particulate matter from China, while they were lowest in summer due to the washing effect of high rainfall. NH3 and NO2 concentrations were relatively higher in winter due to lower temperatures and less sunlight, which may be also influenced by surrounding peanut root bacteria and the characteristics of rice paddies.&#xD;
PM10, PM2.5, NH3, and NO2 emitted from agricultural areas (rice fields) can threaten health. Therefore, in April, when farming begins, it is recommended to enhance awareness of the risks of particulate matter exposure among agricultural workers through information dissemination, education, and training. Measures such as monitoring PM10 and PM2.5 concentrations, halting agricultural activities, adjusting work hours, and implementing dust suppression methods are recommended when particulate matter levels are high. NH3 and NO2 concentrations were relatively higher in winter, and NH3, being a colorless substance, poses a risk of unnoticed high exposure for workers. This study found high NH3 concentrations in late autumn and winter. Therefore, it is necessary to identify the exact causes of high NH3 and NO2 emissions in winter in agricultural areas (rice fields) and take specific measures to reduce these concentrations. This study did not fully identify the influences of crop characteristics, soil properties, and geographical features. Future research should conduct detailed analyses based on crop types, soil characteristics, and geographical features to identify exact causes.

11376.abstract_en:
As the construction industry becomes increasingly sophisticated and complex, work using large construction equipment is increasing, and fatal accidents caused by the equipment are steadily occurring. Construction machinery is mainly used at construction sites, and owners are required to register it with the Ministry of Land, Infrastructure and Transport and undergo periodic inspections. Inspectors who conduct safety inspections for construction machinery have not yet conducted work environment measurements because they believe they work in the service industry and have minimal exposure to harmful factors. However, recently, some inspectors have reported noise-induced hearing loss, and as &#xD;
employers' safety awareness has improved since the enforcement of the Serious Accident Punishment Act, interest in workers' health has also increased. In this study, a work environment measurement exposure assessment was conducted targeting two people from the same exposure group at each of 18 inspection stations. According to previous research, noise, dust, silicon oxide (quartz) that may be contained in vehicle exterior soil, and emissions were measured. The work environment measurement was conducted for hazardous factors such as titanium dioxide, toluene, xylene, methyl isobutyl ketone, and acetone contained in gases (nitrogen oxides, carbon monoxide, sulfur dioxide), paint for magnetic particle inspection used in non-destructive testing, black magnetic particles, and fluorescent magnetic particles.&#xD;
As a result of the noise measurement, the average noise exposure level of all 18 inspection stations was 78.4 dB(A), and some of the inspectors at 3 of them exceeded 85 dB(A), so they were required to thoroughly wear protective equipment such as earplugs to protect their hearing, including special health checkups. This must be managed. In addition, when measuring smoke emissions and horns, people are momentarily exposed to up to 98 to 101 dB(A), so active measures are needed to protect inspectors from noise by wearing earplugs or communicating with customers through a microphone in the control room during the test. As a result of correlation analysis of the inspectors’ noise exposure level according to the number of vehicle inspections, a statistically significant result was derived with a Pearson correlation coefficient of 0.365 (p=0.002). The remaining harmful factors were not detected or were detected in trace amounts. Additional exposure assessment research by inspectors is needed considering the type of construction machinery vehicle, age, external condition, degree of use of construction machinery, measurement period (seasonal factors), and additional hazardous factors (EC) among air emissions. In addition, although on-site inspectors &#xD;
inspect more vehicles than inspectors inside the inspection station, accurate evaluation is difficult due to external factors during business trips or while in transit, which is a limitation that could not be measured in this study. Compared with the exposure standards notified by the Ministry of Employment and Labor, the inspectors’ exposure evaluation complies with all standards. But some inspection stations confirmed that noise is at a level where there is a health effect. However, the number of vehicle inspections at the inspection station changes every day and inspectors rotate between inspection stations, so all inspection stations need health management for noise-induced hearing loss.This study was the first to conduct an exposure assessment of hazardous factors for domestic construction machinery inspectors and is expected to be used as basic data on the inspectors' working environment and have academic significance for their health management.

11377.abstract_en:
Title : Exposure assessment of hexavalent chromium in aircraft engine maintenance workers&#xD;
This study conducted an assessment of hexavalent chromium (Cr6+) exposure among aircraft engine maintenance workers.&#xD;
Hexavalent chromium is known to be a carcinogen. In general,Workers are exposed to hexavalent chromium during operations such as&#xD;
manufacturing, plating, alloying, painting, and welding of products containing chromium and its compounds. In the aviation industry, &#xD;
it is known that exposure is mainly possible when painting primers containing chromic acid or removing them for repairs. Recent research&#xD;
has confirmed the potential generation of hexavalent chromium in aircraft engines due to catalytic action by trivalent (Cr3+) and tetravalent&#xD;
(Cr4+) chromium components present in stainless steel alloy parts and calcium compounds in film-forming lubricants, particularly at high&#xD;
operating temperatures. Thus, this study aimed to determine the occurrence of hexavalent chromium in airline engines, assess the level of&#xD;
hexavalent chromium exposure among engine maintenance workers, and obtain foundational data to protect workers' health from the&#xD;
carcinogenic effects of hexavalent chromium. The research object and method is to collect bulk samples from three types of aircraft engine&#xD;
parts (PW4000, GE90, CFM) handled at an airline's aircraft engine maintenance plant to check whether hexavalent chromium is produced,&#xD;
and to conduct the work at the workshop. The study involved collecting bulk samples from three types of engine components (PW4000,&#xD;
GE90, CFM) handled in an airline engine maintenance facility to confirm the generation of hexavalent chromium, and collecting air samples &#xD;
from work areas and workers involved in these tasks to evaluate hexavalent chromium exposure levels. Additionally, biological monitoring &#xD;
(urinary chromium) was conducted to assess human absorption. Sample collection and analysis methods followed the guidelines of the Korea &#xD;
Occupational Safety and Health Agency. The results confirmed the generation of hexavalent chromium in all three engine types; however, &#xD;
no hexavalent chromium was detected in air samples collected from work areas or workers' breathing zones.&#xD;
This suggests that the generated by products are strongly adsorbed onto metal surfaces due to high heat and pressure, preventing their &#xD;
dispersion into the air during handling operations. Furthermore, urinary chromium analysis conducted on all workers (n=40) showed&#xD;
an overall mean concentration of 0.29±0.16 μg/g creatinine, This result is below the special health examination criteria for daily and weekend &#xD;
urinary chromium concentrations of 10 and 30 μg/g creatinine, respectively. This indicates levels similar to those of the general population not &#xD;
exposed to chromium and less than 10% of the levels reported in other studies involving chromium-exposed workers.&#xD;
Although the relative risk of exposure to workers is low, preventive measures such as local exhaust ventilation, respiratory  protection&#xD;
equipment, protective clothing, glove usage, special health examinations, and education on safe working practices for exposure prevention&#xD;
should be continuously implemented to prevent occupational health hazards from carcinogenic hexavalent chromium exposure.

11378.abstract_en:
Abstract&#xD;
&#xD;
Perception and Improvement of Risk Assessment &#xD;
in Plant Construction Site&#xD;
&#xD;
Lee, San&#xD;
(Supervisor Kim, Ki Youn)&#xD;
Dept. of Global Safety Engineering&#xD;
Graduate School of Industry and Engineering&#xD;
Seoul National University of Science and Technology&#xD;
&#xD;
In recent years, plant construction sites are becoming larger, more complex, and diversified to maintain the competitiveness of the industry, and work methods and components are constantly changing due to the demand for a variable work environment. However, the complexity of work caused in this paradigm shift process and the resulting increase in careless behavior of workers are causing various industrial safety damages and disasters. Accordingly, in recent years, various efforts are required to reduce serious accidents in plant construction sites.&#xD;
In this study, at a practical level, it was intended to understand the perception of workers, including managers, on the current risk assessment applied in plant construction sites, and to suggest ways to enhance an effective risk assessment system at plant industrial sites.&#xD;
To this end, from March 4 to March 30 in 2024, this study conducted a survey on the perception of the risk assessment system for safety and health managers, management supervisors, general workers, managers of suppliers, and daily workers. In addition, independent sample t-test and one-way variance analysis were conducted to verify the difference in risk assessment perception according to demographic characteristics using the SPSS 27.0 program for the collected data, and multiple regression analysis was conducted to verify the effect of risk assessment perception on safety and health awareness.&#xD;
The following is a comprehensive summary of the results of the study analysis.&#xD;
First, among the demographic characteristics, the difference in perception of risk assessment according to gender, age, type of cohabitation, job and industry was not found to be significant. However, the difference in recognition of risk assessment according to education, experience and health status, education and training/communication/recognition of risk assessment, compliance with risk assessment regulations and procedures, and participation in risk assessment activities was found to be significant.&#xD;
Second, it was found that in the group of managers, participation in risk assessment activities, compliance with risk assessment regulations and procedures, and risk assessment activities had a positive (+) effect on safety and health awareness.&#xD;
Third, it was found that participation in risk assessment activities, compliance with risk assessment regulations and procedures, and participation in risk assessment activities in the worker group had a positive (+) effect on safety and health awareness.&#xD;
Therefore, the results of this study can be used as basic data to prepare a direction that can be efficiently applied to plant construction sites and optimally applied to workplace safety management.&#xD;
&#xD;
Keywords: Risk assessment, Plant construction, Manager, Worker, Perception.

11380.abstract_en:
The sprinkler system is an automatic fire extinguishing system designed to quickly detect and control fires in their initial stages. This system effectively suppresses fires and prevents fire growth while allowing ample time for occupants to evacuate safely. The primary extinguishing mechanism in the sprinkler system is surface cooling, which involves the discharge of liquid from the sprinkler head. This liquid penetrates the flames, directly reaching and cooling the surfaces of combustible materials or the surrounding area . To ensure the consistent application of this surface cooling effect, water must be evenly distributed on the floor, regardless of the fire’s location. However, achieving uniform distribution is challenging due to the design of the sprinkler head , specifically the deflectors and frame arms.&#xD;
 This study used methods derived from a previous study to conduct simulations for analyzing the spray distribution. The water density distribution on the floor was examined by changing four variables: the distance between heads, flow rate adjustment based on head distance, frame arm direction, and head installation height.&#xD;
 The research showed that maintaining consistent water discharge and spray pressure from the heads resulted in an approximate average increase in spray density of 2.5–5.5% for every 0.05-m reduction in distance between the heads. The liquid discharged from adjacent heads was directed toward the lower partsof the deflect or and frame, enabling a more uniform spray distribution and higher spray density. When the flow rate was adjusted based on the distance between the sprinkler heads, which is necessary to set the water density based on the flow rate and spread area, the average spray density remained constant, resembling values obtained under the minimum distance between heads.  Shortening the distance between heads contributed to a more uniform spray distribution. When installed with the frame rotated to 45° or 90°, the spray from adjacent heads reached underneath the sprinkler head, promoting a more uniform spray distribution and an increase in spray density. Finally, higher installation heights of the heads extended the reach of the discharged liquid, resulting in a uniform spray distribution and increased spray density.

11381.abstract_en:
Analysis of Spray Characteristics for Various Fire Sprinkler Head Type Under &#xD;
Minimum Required Flow Rate Condition&#xD;
Bang, Saemi &#xD;
Supervisor Kim, Taehoon&#xD;
Dept. of Safety Engineering&#xD;
Graduate School of&#xD;
Seoul National University of Science and Technology&#xD;
A sprinkler is a representative water-based fire suppression system used to automatically detect and spray water to extinguish fires in their early stages. The fire suppression performance of a sprinkler is determined by its water density and spray characteristics. Water density refers to the amount of water sprayed over a floor area, and it must be maintained above a certain level regardless of direction to effectively extinguish a fire. Additionally, even with the same water density, the atomization varies depending on the head shape, resulting in different droplet momenta within the spray. Larger and faster droplets can penetrate the fire source more effectively. n this study, the spray characteristics of four types of sprinkler heads (circular, flush, pendent, and upright) were analyzed. The analysis was conducted under conditions of 0.1 MPa discharge pressure and 80 LPM flow rate, examining the uniformity of water density in different directions and the momentum of droplets within the spray. Experiments included measuring water density using pan collectors and conducting PTV experiments with a high-speed camera and metal halide lamp.The water density measurement results showed that the circular head had the highest standard deviation, indicating the lowest uniformity, while the upright head had the lowest standard deviation, indicating the highest uniformity. Examining the uniformity of water density in both radial and azimuthal directions, the upright head exhibited the highest uniformity. The droplet size and velocity measurements indicated that larger droplets had greater momentum and were sprayed further from the head, regardless of the head type. When evaluating momentum based on head type, the flush head produced smaller droplets with lower momentum, whereas the upright head had the highest momentum.

11382.abstract_en:
Abstract&#xD;
Comparative Analysis of Explosion Hazard Radius within Gas Turbine  Enclosures of Combined Heat and Power Plants Using Computational &#xD;
Fluid Dynamics and IEC 60079-10&#xD;
With the government's plan to promote the hydrogen economy, the demand for hydrogen gas turbines, which offer great flexibility in power generation, is expected to increase. Consequently, there is a growing need for research and development on the safety of hydrogen, which contrasts with its economic feasibility. Previous studies on flammable gas leakage analysis have been categorized into research on chemical species diffusion, gas leakage, and  explosion hazard radius. However, there has been a lack of comparative studies using Computational Fluid Dynamics (CFD) with the Pseudo Source Model and the  explosion hazard radius of hazardous locations according to IEC 60079-10 for high-pressure hydrogen, high-pressure methane, low-pressure hydrogen, and  low-pressure methane.&#xD;
This study compares and analyzes the CFD results using the Pseudo Source  Model and the explosion hazard radius calculated for hazardous locations according to IEC 60079-10. The summary of the results is as follows:&#xD;
According to the IEC Code calculations for hydrogen and methane used as gas  turbine fuels, the ventilation evaluation and explosion hazard radius increased in the order of low-pressure methane, low-pressure hydrogen, high-pressure methane, and high-pressure hydrogen. The analysis of leakage and diffusion behavior within the gas turbine enclosure using CFD showed that, after 2  seconds of detector operation and 3 seconds after gas turbine shutdown, the rate  of concentration increase by vertical distance from the leakage source and the diffusivity of hydrogen in the air reaching the gas turbine surface were faster  than those of methane. Furthermore, the increase in the explosion hazard radius  after 2 and 3 seconds for high-pressure hydrogen was 4.5 times greater than that for high-pressure methane.&#xD;
The IEC Code calculations showed that the explosion hazard radius ratio of hydrogen to methane by distance was 1.4 times greater for hydrogen. Additionally, the ratio of the explosion hazard radius according to the IEC Code calculations to that from CFD analysis decreased in the order of high-pressure hydrogen, high-pressure methane, low-pressure hydrogen, and low-pressure  methane. The CFD analysis results indicated that the explosion hazard radius for  hydrogen was twice that of methane. Therefore, it can be concluded that the risk of hydrogen is higher than that of methane in the event of an accidental  leak within the gas turbine enclosure.&#xD;
Keywords: Hydrogen, Gas turbine, Simulation, IEC 60079-10, Hazardous Radius

11384.abstract_en:
Due to the nature of public enterprises, deficits are inevitable; however, in the case of Seoul Metro Corporation, it originated not as a single entity but as a merger of two separate public corporations. The expected outcome of this merger should be positive, as it aimed to achieve synergies, reduce redundant tasks, and enhance workforce and financial efficiency compared to the previous state of the two separate corporations. The purpose of integration was to achieve benefits such as reducing duplicated tasks, ensuring employee safety, and improving financial performance.&#xD;
Before conducting a comparative analysis of Seoul Metro Corporation before and after integration, a review of previous studies on the organization and workforce efficiency was undertaken. Through this study, it was observed that Seoul Metro Corporation deteriorated both organizationally and in terms of manpower compared to its pre-merger state. It was identified that there is a need for improvement, particularly in organizational and workforce aspects. Notably, if there had been no large-scale regular employee conversion in 2018, partial improvement effects might have been evident.&#xD;
In conclusion, the Seoul Metro Corporation integration was deemed inappropriate. Suggestions for organizational improvement were proposed, and it was recognized that the workforce aspect needs to be reconsidered after the retirement of employees with little time left until the mandatory retirement age within the Seoul Metro Corporation.

11385.abstract_ko:
제 목 : 1종 전기기관차의 절연구간 내 비상제동 체결에 의한 운행장애의 예방 매뉴얼 정립 &#xD;
&#xD;
 열차 운행 중간에 비상상황 발생으로 역과 역 사이의 본선 구간에 열차가 정차 하는 경우, 후속 열차들이 전부 지연되는 연속 장애가 발생할 수 있으므로 신속한 조치가 필요하다. 특히, 절연구간 내에서 의도하지 않은 비상제동의 체결로 열차 가 정차하는 경우, 전기기관차가 급전을 받지 못하여 운행장애가 생기는 경우가 빈번하게 일어나고 있다. 전기기관차가 절연구간 사이에 정차하게 되어 자력으로 그 구간에서 빠져나오지 못하게 되면 구원열차를 수배하여야 하므로, 정차시간이 길어져 후속 열차들이 연속적으로 지연되는 큰 비효율이 발생하게 된다. &#xD;
&#xD;
 운행장애 예방 매뉴얼 정립을 위한 연구의 기초로서 절연구간 존재의 원인, 구조 및 각종 절연구간의 길이를 조사 분석하고 절연구간의 전국 분포현황을 알아본다. 절연구간에 대하여 명확하게 파악한 후에 운행장애의 예방이 가능하기 때문이다. 나아가 운행장애는 의도하지 않은 비상제동에 의한 경우가 대부분이므로 인적오 류에 기인한 전기기관차 비상제동 체결의 원인을 파악한다. 최근 5년간 절연구간 내 비상제동 체결에 의한 운행장애로 판명된 실제 사례는 “한국철도공사 KOVIS 포털 사건사고 통계”로부터 조사하여 분석이 가능하다.&#xD;
&#xD;
 한국철도공사의 문서 중에 1종 전기기관차인 8200호대 및 8500호대 기관차의 절 연구간 통과방법에 대해서 기록한 매뉴얼은 존재한다. 하지만, 매뉴얼에는 절연구 간을 안전하게 통과하는 방법에 대한 내용은 상대적으로 빈약하게 기술되어 있는 반면, 이미 사건이 발생하여 정차한 후 조치하는 방법에 대한 내용이 주를 이루어 기술되어 있다. 또한, 각 기관차사업소마다 구비되어 있는 내규에는 절연구간 통 과방법이 기술되어 있으나, 개별적인 절연구간의 특성에 따라 통과방법이 서로 다 르게 설명되어 있어서 통일된 매뉴얼로 사용하기에는 부적합하다. 따라서 1종 기 관차의 절연구간 통과방법이 간략하게 명시된 규격화된 매뉴얼이 필요한 실정이 다.&#xD;
&#xD;
 본 연구에서는 한국철도공사 청량리고속철도기관차승무사업소에 근무 중인 운전 업무 종사자들을 대상으로 설문조사를 실시한다. 1차 설문조사에는 운전업무 종사 자 90명을 상대로 1종 전기기관차가 절연구간을 안전하게 통과하기 위해서 필요 한 작위 행위, 부작위 행위를 중요한 순서대로 나열하도록 하는 내용이 포함되어 있어서, 실제 운전 취급자가 운행장애를 예방하기 위하여 주의해야 할 내용들의 순위를 서열척도(ordinal scale)로 파악할 수 있다. 이를 토대로 2차 설문조사에서 는 15년 경력 이상의 지도운용팀장 10명을 대상으로 AHP 설문조사를 실시한다. 이 결과를 기초로 절연구간 통과를 위한 운행장애 예방 매뉴얼을 정립할 수 있다. 매뉴얼은 짧은 시간 동안 통과하는 절연구간의 운행장애 예방 효과를 극대화하기 위하여 최대한 간략하게 제작되어야 하며, 운전자가 한눈에 알아보고 숙지할 수 있도록 내용 이해의 편의성을 가장 중요하게 고려하여 제작되어야 한다.

11385.abstract_en:
A Manual Development to Avoid Operation Failure by Emergency Braking in Insulation Section of the Class 1 Electric Locomotive&#xD;
&#xD;
 In the event of an emergency situation occurring during train operation, leading to the train coming to a stop in the mainline section between stations, a cascading disruption may ensue, causing delays to subsequent trains. Swift measures are essential, especially when unintentional emergency braking within insulated sections results in a halted train, leading to frequent instances of operational disruptions due to electric locomotives being unable to receive power. If an electric locomotive comes to a stop within an insulated section and cannot exit autonomously, a rescue train must be dispatched, prolonging the stoppage time and causing significant inefficiencies as subsequent trains are consecutively delayed.&#xD;
&#xD;
 As a foundational study for establishing a manual for preventing operational disruptions, this research investigates the causes, structure, and lengths of various insulated sections, analyzing the nationwide distribution of insulated sections. Clear comprehension of insulated sections is crucial for preventing operational disruptions. Furthermore, since operational disruptions are predominantly caused by unintentional emergency braking, understanding the reasons behind emergency braking due to human error in electric locomotives is examined. Actual cases of operational disruptions caused by emergency braking within insulated sections over the past five years can be surveyed and analyzed through safety management statistics from the Korean Railroad Corporation's network.&#xD;
 &#xD;
 While manuals documenting the passage methods of 1st class electric locomotives (8200 and 8500 series) through insulated sections exist in the documentation of the Korean Railroad Corporation, information on safely traversing insulated sections is relatively scant, with an emphasis on post-incident measures after a train has already come to a stop. Moreover, each locomotive operating office's regulations contain descriptions of insulated section passage methods, but the methods vary depending on the characteristics of individual insulated sections, rendering them unsuitable for unified use. Therefore, there is a practical need for a standardized manual that succinctly specifies the passage methods of 1st class locomotives through insulated sections.&#xD;
&#xD;
 In this study, a survey is conducted targeting operational personnel working at the Cheongnyangni High-Speed Railway Locomotive Operation Office of the Korean Railroad Corporation. The first survey, administered to approximately 90 operational personnel, includes content that requires ranking the importance of intentional and unintentional actions necessary for the safe passage of 1st class electric locomotives through insulated sections in ascending order. Based on this, the second survey employs Analytic Hierarchy Process (AHP) on 10 team leaders with over 15 years of experience in operations. With these results as a basis, a manual for preventing operational disruptions during the passage of insulated sections can be established. The manual should be concise to maximize its effectiveness in preventing operational disruptions during the brief passage through insulated sections, prioritizing ease of understanding for the driver's quick comprehension.

11386.abstract_en:
In line with the development and change of the current railway operation system, that is, signal technology, the purpose of this study is to be the basis for the competent selection of appropriate railway traffic controllers through manual and subject improvement in terms of railway signal in the controller evaluation process. To accomplish this, first of all, prepare a practical basis for which areas of knowledge and technology should be focused more on in the process of selecting railroad traffic control, which is required first for each control field and based on the interface recognized by the controller when controlling the train. To do this, we intend to understand the weight priority when controlling the controller through the AHP technique.&#xD;
The results of this study are as follows.&#xD;
First, signal control was analyzed as the most important factor in the weight priority for the integrated major classification factor of controllers based on manned and unmanned driving, followed by a driving vehicle with a slight 0.336. Electricity in the subway was 0.131, information communication 0.100, and mechanical facilities 0.091 followed.&#xD;
Second, the driving vehicle sector was recognized as the most important area for train control with 0.375 in the priority of manned driving-based controller control (large category), followed by signal control with 0.296, followed by 0.154 in the subway power sector, 0.097 in information communication, and 0.078 in mechanical facilities. On the other hand, in the priority of unmanned driving-based controller control (large category), the signal control sector was recognized as the most important area in train control with 0.388, followed by vehicle driving with 0.296, followed by subway power sector with 0.109, information communication with 0.104, and mechanical facilities with 0.103.&#xD;
Third, in the integrated priority of manned and unmanned driving-based controller's driving vehicle (middle classification), braking was 0.46, which was recognized as the most important area for train control, followed by propulsion with 0.28, followed by door element with 0.25&#xD;
Fourth, in the priority of manned driving-based controller's driving vehicle (middle classification), braking system was recognized as the most important area for train control with 0.51, followed by propulsion drive with 0.28, and door element with 0.21. On the other hand, in the priority of unmanned driving-based controller's driving vehicle (middle classification), braking system was recognized as the most important area for train control with 0.39, followed by door with 0.33, and propulsion element with 0.28.&#xD;
Fifth, the highest factor as the priority of the integrated signal control weight of controllers based on manned and unmanned driving is the TTC device, which is the highest at 0.44, followed by the ground device at 0.22 and the vehicle listed value at 0.19. And the signal facility in the line was the lowest at 0.15. The highest factor in the priority of the controller signal control weight based on manned driving is the TTC device, which is the same as the ground device and the vehicle listed value at 0.18. And the signal facility in the line was the lowest at 0.15. On the other hand, the highest factor in the priority of the controller signal control weight based on unmanned driving was 0.31 with the TTC device, followed by the ground device at 0.33 and the vehicle listed value at 0.21. And the signal facility in the line was the lowest at 0.15.&#xD;
Sixth, in the integrated priority of the subway power (intermediate classification) field of the controller based on manned and unmanned driving, SCADA was recognized as the most important field when controlling trains with 0.59, followed by the substation with 0.23, and the processing front lane with 0.18. The highest weight priority in the field of manned driving-based controller's subway power was SCADA, followed by the substation with 0.60, followed by the substation with 0.24, and the processing front lane with 0.16. On the other hand, SCADA was the highest factor in the weight priority of the unmanned driving-based controller's subway power field, followed by the processing front lane with 0.58, and the substation with 0.18.&#xD;
Seventh, in the integrated priority of information communication (intermediate category) for controllers based on manned and unmanned driving, wired and wireless network was 0.40, which was recognized as the most important area in controlling trains, followed by information transmission at 0.31, followed by information transmission at 0.29, which was slightly lower. In the integrated priority of the information communication (intermediate category) field of controllers based on manned driving, wired and wireless network was recognized as the most important area in controlling trains at 0.39, followed by information transmission at 0.35 with a slight difference, followed by information transmission at 0.26. On the other hand, in the integrated priority of the information communication (intermediate category) field of controllers based on unmanned driving, wired and wireless networks were recognized as the most important area in controlling trains at 0.44, followed by information facilities at 0.35, and information transmission was low at 0.21.&#xD;
In the eighth priority of integration in the field of mechanical equipment (intermediate category) of controllers based on manned and unmanned driving, PSD was 0.69, which was the most important area for train control, followed by 0.17 and air conditioning facilities and elevators 0.15, which were slightly lower in recognition. In the integration priority of the manned driving-based controller's mechanical equipment (intermediate category) field, PSD was 0.70, which was clearly the most important area for train control, followed by 0.17 for air conditioning facilities and elevators 0.14, which ranked low in recognition. On the other hand, in the integration priority of the unmanned driving-based controller's mechanical equipment (intermediate category) field, PSD was clearly the most important area for train control, followed by 0.19 for air conditioning facilities and elevators 0.17, which ranked low in recognition.&#xD;
Finally, as a result of deriving and applying the overall ranking of controllers based on the control system, respectively, in consideration of both the major and middle classification weights,&#xD;
It was found that controllers based on manned driving generally have a higher perception that driving vehicles and signal control are more important than other fields. In particular, the weighting degree was the highest in the priority of driving vehicles, and in the middle-class weighting, the braking system was the highest among systems and devices at 0.191. In terms of control, the TTC, the core of the signal control field, was the highest at 0.145, followed by the propulsion system at 0.107, the SCADA at 0.092, the entrance at 0.077, the PSD at 0.054, the ground device and the vehicle listed at 0.053, the signal facilities in the line at 0.044; the wired and wireless network at 0.038, the substation at 0.037, the processing front lane at 0.025, the information transmission device at 0.023, the guidance facility at 0.016, the air conditioning and the elevator at 0.013 and 0.011, respectively. On the other hand, in the case of unmanned driving-based controllers, the driving vehicle and the signal control field were significantly higher than those of other fields, similar to manned driving-based controllers. In the case of unmanned driving-based controllers, signal control was 0.388 in the major category, and the ground device in the signal control field at 0.129 in the middle category, followed by the TTC at 0.120, which was higher than the driving vehicle in the control field. Braking device 0.116, door 0.098, propulsion device 0.083, vehicle listing device 0.081, PSD 0.066, SCADA 0.063, in-track signal facility 0.058, wired and wireless network 0.045, guidance facility 0.037, processing front lane 0.022, information transmission 0.022, substations and air conditioning facilities 0.020, and elevators 0.017.&#xD;
The purpose of this study is to improve the standard teaching materials based on signal control along with the signal system based on unmanned driving, in which the existing railway signals, control systems, and manpower fields are somewhat concentrated on driving vehicles. The reality is that regulations, related manuals, and textbooks that understand railway signals that are absolutely necessary for the current controller have not been sufficiently provided. It is judged that it is urgent to strengthen guidelines and manuals related to signal control and control handling. In addition, this study understands the tasks and characteristics of controllers based on unmanned driving and manned driving, and based on the data from the results of the priority weight analysis of the control aspect derived from the study, an improvement (draft) is applied to the table of contents of the newly published control standard teaching materials (manuals). In addition, through a review of the current status of some railway general university control-related departments and curriculum courses, some areas with high control priorities on the control side are applied to suggest additional subject incorporation. This study is expected to broaden the understanding of railway control signals to students and prospective controllers studying railway control by strengthening the current control standard textbooks and curriculum courses, such as the principle of railway linkage charts, understanding various interfaces between railway control signal facilities and on-site signal facilities, safety-based precautions when handling signals, and procedures for action in case of a railroad control signal facility failure.&#xD;

11387.abstract_en:
A Study on Safety Resilience Effect on Safety Behavior and Accidents Prevention of Railway Crews&#xD;
&#xD;
Kim, Byoung Ho&#xD;
(Supervisor  Kim, Si Gon)&#xD;
Dept. of Railway Safety&#xD;
Graduate School of Railway&#xD;
Seoul National University of Science and Technology&#xD;
&#xD;
  This study was conducted to analyze the impact on safety behavior and accident prevention, which are mainly used in the crew sector, using E. Holnagel's high-dimensional safety concept of safety resilience, as the category has recently increased under the revised railway safety Act in 2020.&#xD;
  In order to achieve the research objectives, previous studies on safety resilience, safety behavior, and railway accidents were reviewed and major constituent concepts were established. The independent variable was set as the Responding-Monitering-Learning-Anticipating four major competencies of Professor Holnagel's safety resilience, and the dependent variables were composed of compliance, habits, and mistakes and violations, which are safety behaviors of Park Young-seok, which were frequently used in the railway field, and accidents were also set as dependent variables. To verify this, 114 valid surveys for railway crew of the Seoul Metro were conducted with frequency analysis, factor and reliability analysis, technical statistics and normality analysis, correlation analysis, regression analysis, and independent sample t-test.&#xD;
  As a result of the study, it was found that among the safety resilience competencies, responding, monitoring, and learning competencies had a positive (+) effect on safety behavior in order. Among the safety resilience competencies, responding and learning were found to have a negative (-) effect on anxiety behavior in order. Among the safety resilience competencies, the responding competency was found to have a negative (-) effect on the accident. Among the safety behaviors, the unsafe behavior was found to have a positive (+) effect on the accident. In addition, there was no difference between the safety resilience and safety behavior by job of the engineer and the deputy director, and it was confirmed that the accident experience showed a significant difference.&#xD;
  In conclusion, the safety resilience capabilities that significantly affected safety behavior and accidents are Responding and Learning capabilities, and the crew sector needs to improve and prepare a system to strengthen them. In addition, since the crew's safety and safety behaviors had a significant impact on causing accidents, it seems necessary to devise measures to implement safety behaviors and prevent safety behaviors.&#xD;
  We look forward to the development of the railway safety field through the implications and alternatives obtained through this study and continuous follow-up studies.

11392.abstract_en:
Hazardous materials include substances or articles that pose a potential risk to public health and safety, property, or the environment due to their chemical, physical, or biological properties. The study on the safe transportation of hazardous materials by rail focuseson assessing the risks associated with transporting dangerous goods by rail and seeking appropriate prevention/ mitigation measures for these risks. The primary objective of this study is to ensure the safe and secure movement of hazardous materials by the Egyptian National Railways (ENR) while minimizing the potential for accidents, incidents, and their subsequent&#xD;
consequences. In this study, risk assessment will be carried out on the transportation of hazardous materials in the Egyptian railways as well as managing risks. Working methods include the analysis of the literature,&#xD;
systematization, and generalization, and the Bowtie Risk Assessment Model was used as a robust methodology for analyzing risks, through identifying hazards, threats/ Initiating events, and potential consequences of each initiating event. this has helped in developing control measures as preventive barriers to prevent the occurrence of initiating events as well as developing mitigation measures as mitigative barriers to reduce the severity of consequences. Practical outcomes are also provided on how to reduce accidents and incidents in the transport of hazardous materials by rail.

11398.abstract_en:
title : A study of brain function characteristics of service members at high risk for accidents in the military&#xD;
  Since any organization suffers not only economic losses but also a great deal of damage to its public image when a casualty occurs due to an accident, it invests a large amount of money to prevent accidents, installs safety systems, and conducts various preventive activities such as periodic inspections. Surprisingly, however, even in the best environments and with the best safety systems, safety incidents due to human error continue to increase.&#xD;
  While the military is making various efforts to prevent non-combat losses, it continues to lose more than 80 people a year due to safety accidents and suicides. In particular, because our soldiers are called by the state regardless of their will through the conscription system and are forced to enlist and serve the state, unlike accidents that occur in society, people feel sorry and anxious, and often hold the military responsible. Since 2015, suicides by officers and enlisted personnel have outnumbered suicides by soldiers, and when they occur in the military, it not only lowers the morale of the unit, but also limits normal unit operations for several months, resulting in a significant loss of combat power.&#xD;
  If you analyze the accidents that have occurred in the military so far, you will find that the psychological conditions of stress and depression are often associated with military accidents, and soldiers are often unable to adapt to military life. Therefore, this study aimed to find out whether the brain function and autonomic nervous system of soldiers who are at risk of accidents that do not adapt to military life are different from soldiers who are doing well in the military through EEG, pulse waves, and questionnaires, and whether they are different from officers, NCOs, and military personnel who are doing well in the military because they want to.&#xD;
  Until now, there have been many studies on job stress, psychological load, suicidal thoughts, etc. by surveying soldiers serving in the military, and a few studies using only brain waves. However, there are no studies of soldiers, officers, and NCOs using EEG, pulse waves, or surveys.&#xD;
  For the purpose of the study, soldiers who are at risk of accidents due to their inability to adapt to military life were divided into three groups according to the system that manages the risk of accidents in three stages according to their psychological health status. ‘Accident Risk Tier 1 Soldiers’ are 32 Help and Care Soldiers that the unit has determined to be at risk for accidents and are being managed separately. 'Accident Risk Stage 2 Soldiers' are 47 Green Camp soldiers who are judged to be at a high risk of accidents and are receiving counseling and expert service adaptation training for two weeks. The "Accident Risk Level 3 Soldiers" are 26 soldiers from the Military Service Review and Management Corps who have been deemed to be at a very high risk of accidents and are in the process of being discharged. and 135 regular soldiers who are doing well in the military, 27 officers and NCOs, 37 military personnel was selected as a comparison subject and subjected to EEG and pulse wave measurements and a survey.&#xD;
  EEG and pulse wave measuring instruments were measured using a two-channel system portable measuring device developed by Laxar and OmniC&amp;S, which is registered as a medical device. and The data was analyzed using the SPSS statistical program. Data comparisons between groups were analyzed using independent samples t-tests and one-way analysis of variance. Pearson correlation and regression analysis were used to analyze the association between EEG and pulse wave measurements and survey results.&#xD;
  Here are the results of the study.&#xD;
  First, we analyzed the EEG and pulse waves of the three groups of soldiers at risk of accidents and the groups of ordinary soldiers, officers and NCOs, and military personnel, and found significant differences in some indices. Soldiers who were at risk for accidents generally showed low ‘Concentration Level’, high ‘Psychological stress’, and poor ‘Imbalance of left and right brain activity’ in their EEG indices. Also The pulse wave index showed high levels of 'Body stress' and low levels of 'Physical Vitality' and 'Autonomic nervous system health'.&#xD;
  Second, the brainwave index and pulse wave index were found to be correlated. In the comparison of officers and soldiers, "Psychological stress" in EEG and "Physical Vitality" in pulse waves were correlated. Also In the comparison by executive group, "Imbalance of left and right brain activity" in EEG and "Cumulative fatigue" in pulse wave were associated.&#xD;
  Third, EEG and pulse wave indices were associated with the survey's maladaptive and suicidal ideation scales. In both the officer and soldier group comparisons and the soldier-by-soldier comparisons, the "Brain Activity" index of the EEG and the "Body Stress" index of the pulse wave correlated with the maladaptive and suicidal ideation scales.&#xD;
  The results of this study will help identify soldiers who are at high risk for accidents that could result in human error and suicides. Also In addition to the military, EEG and pulse waves are expected to be utilized in high-risk occupations such as construction to reduce the risk of accidents.

11401.abstract_en:
Recent advances in Quantum Dot Light Emitting Diode (QLED) technology have led to significant improvements in reliability and efficiency, but electrostatic discharges (ESD) generated during the QLED manufacturing process affect the reliability of QLEDs. This ESD causes damage to QLEDs, but there is a lack of research on this topic. Therefore, this study aims to analyze the mechanism of QLED damage caused by ESD, propose standards for ESD management in the QLED manufacturing process, and propose antistatic flooring to prevent ESD caused by human-body voltage to prevent ESD damage to QLEDs. The analysis of the mechanism of QLED damage caused by ESD shows that when ESD is applied to QLEDs, damage to QLEDs occurs from 2 kV, and it affects not only the pixel where ESD is applied but also the pixels in the path of ESD. Therefore, it is necessary to manage ESD below 1 kV in the QLED manufacturing process to prevent damage caused by ESD.&#xD;
In the display process, ESD caused by the human-body voltage of workers causes damage to QLEDs. ESD is prevented by utilizing antistatic flooring to dissipate the static electricity accumulated on workers' bodies, but friction causes damage to the flooring, reducing its antistatic effect. We analyzed the friction resistance and antistatic effect of conductive paint and conductive rubber mats, which are commonly used as antistatic mats, through experiments. The results showed that the conductive rubber mat maintained its antistatic effect despite surface damage due to the conductive particles inside.&#xD;
The results of this study are expected to contribute to the prevention of damage to QLEDs caused by ESD by analyzing the damage mechanism of QLEDs caused by ESD and suggesting ESD management standards and effective ESD prevention measures caused by human-body voltage.&#xD;
&#xD;
&#xD;
Keywords : Quantum Dot Light Emitting Diode, Electrostatic Discharge, Electrostatic Dicharge Path, Degradation, Conductive Rubber Mat

11405.abstract_ko:
제 목 : 반복하중 하 볼트의 거동 특성을 고려한 풀림 수명 예측 기법에 관한 연구 본 논문에서는 산업기계 및 구조체에서 다양한 운용조건에 따라 발생하는 볼트 풀림으로 인한 중대 사고 예방을 위해 볼트 풀림 수명과 재료 피로 과정 의 상사성 비교를 통한 실 구조체에 적용 가능한 볼트 풀림 수명 예측 방법론 을 제시하였다. 또한, 본 연구를 통해 얻어진 다양한 조건에서의 풀림 수명 데 이터베이스(DB)를 이용하여 풀림 수명 열화 모델, 잔여 수명 산정, 고장 예지 적용에 사용될 수 있는 방안을 제안하였다. 해당 방법론은 기존의 단일 볼트 풀림의 기계적 거동 및 일정 정현파에서의 풀림 수명 평가 방법에서 접근하지 못한 설계 관점, 실제 설비 운용 조건, 유 지보수 관점까지 고려하여 볼트 풀림 수명 예측을 검증하였다. 첫 번째로, 볼트 풀림 특성 실험 DB를 통해 볼트 풀림과 재료 피로와의 상 사성을 확인하였다. 볼트 풀림 과정에서도 재료의 피로 수명에 상응하는 내구 한도의 존재와 진폭 변위-수명(D-N) 관계를 도출하였다. 두 번째로, 설계 관점에서 복잡한 구조체에서의 볼트 풀림 수명을 예측 하 는 방안을 제시하였다. 유한요소해석의 등가 모델을 구성하여 구조체의 취약 한 부위를 식별하고, 해당 지점의 변위 진폭 값을 산출하여 이에 대한 검증을 실제 시험 값과 비교하여 볼트 풀림 수명 예측 가능성을 검증하였다. 또한, 가 변 진폭 하중에서의 볼트 풀림 수명은 선형누적손상규칙을 적용하여 정량적인 수명 예측이 가능함을 입증하였다. 세 번째로, 본 연구에서 획득한 볼트 풀림 DB를 통해 볼트 풀림 현상을 대 표적인 열화 모델로 개발하고, 이를 볼트 조립 구조체에 상태기반 유지보수에 활용할 수 있는 방법을 제시하였다. 따라서 본 연구에서 도출 되어진 진폭 변 위-수명(D-N) 곡선, 볼트 풀림의 열화 모델, 재료 피로의 수명 평가 방법을 적 용한 볼트 풀림 수명 예측방법은 향후 산업 설비 등 볼트 풀림 수명 예측 시 유의미한 자료로 활용될 뿐만 아니라 신뢰도 향상에 기여할 것으로 판단된다. &#xD;
&#xD;
주제어: 볼트 풀림, 볼트 풀림 수명, 수명 예측 방법, 선형손상누적법칙, 건전성 예측 및 관리

11405.abstract_en:
In this study, a bolt loosening life prediction methodology under cyclic loading was proposed by drawing an analogy between bolt loosening and material fatigue processes, with practical considerations. This method aims to prevent serious accidents caused by bolt loosening in industrial machinery and structures under various operating conditions. In addition, a database (DB) of loosening life data collected under various conditions in this study was used to propose a method for developing a loosening life phenomenological model (degradation model), estimating the remaining useful life, and fault diagnosis.&#xD;
  The methodology was verified for bolt loosening life prediction by considering design aspects, real facility operating conditions, and maintenance perspectives that were not addressed in the conventional evaluation methods of single bolt loosening mechanical behavior and loosening life under cyclic loading.&#xD;
  First, the similarity between bolt loosening and material fatigue was confirmed using a bolt-loosening characteristic experiment DB.  The similarities include the displacement-life (D N) curve, which is analogous to the stress-life (S N) curve observed in material fatigue, the dependency of loosening life on displacement amplitude (Δd/2), the existence of an endurance limit, and the applicability of Basquin’s equation related to these factors.&#xD;
  Second, a method was proposed for predicting the loosening life of bolts in complex structures from a design perspective. The weakest part of the structure was identified by constructing an equivalent model for finite element analysis, and the maximum vulnerable displacement amplitude value was calculated. The possibility of predicting the loosening life of bolts was verified by comparing the verification with the actual test value. In addition, it was proven that the loosening life of bolts under variable amplitude load can be quantitatively predicted by applying the linear cumulative damage rule.&#xD;
  Third, a degradation model of the bolt loosening was developed using the bolt loosening DB obtained in this study, and a method for applying it to condition-based maintenance of bolt assembly structures was proposed.  &#xD;
  Therefore, the amplitude D-N curve derived in this study, the deterioration model of bolt loosening, and the bolt loosening life prediction method used to evaluate the life of material fatigue are expected to be useful data in predicting the life of bolt loosening in industrial facilities in the future.&#xD;
&#xD;
Keyword : Bolt loosening, Bolt loosening life, Life prediction method, Linear cumulative damage rule, Prognostics and health management (PHM)&#xD;

11407.abstract_ko:
제 목 : 스마트 건설안전관리시스템의 인지도, 수용의도에 관한 연구&#xD;
&#xD;
 본 연구는 안전사고 예방을 위해 구축된 스마트 건설안전관리시스템을 살펴보고, 서울시 스마트안전 현장 적용 매뉴얼에서 제시하고 있는 스마트 건설안전시스템 10종에   대한 중요도-성과도 분석(IPA:Importance-Performance Analysis)을 통해 건설안전 관리시스템의 인지도와 수용의도에 미치는 영향을 고찰하였다.    &#xD;
 스마트 건설안전관리시스템 10개 요인의 중요도와 성과도는 차이가 있는 것으로 파악되었으며, 중요도는 높고 성과도는 낮은 중점개선 과제가 도출되었다. 또한 스마트 건설안전관리시스템이 수용의도에 미치는 영향 관계에 있어서는 이동식360°카메라원격점검시스템, 중장비협착방지시스템, 스마트환경센서, 스마트에어백조끼, 근로자위치추적시스템, 현장통합관제시스템 순으로 수용의도에 유의한 영향을 미치는 것으로 나타났다. &#xD;
 현장 관리자가 인지하는 스마트 건설안전관리시스템 10개 요인 중 중요도는 높고 성과도가 낮은 중점개선의 과제는 근로자위치추적시스템, 스마트안전고리체결로 나타났고, 현장의 근로자가 인지하는 중점개선의 과제는 위험변위자동계측시스템, 스마트안전모턱근체결로 나타났다. &#xD;
 사업 규모가 800억원 미만인 사업장에서 인지하는 중점개선 과제는 근로자위치추적시스템, 스마트안전고리체결로 나타났고. 사업 규모가 800억원 이상인 사업장에서 인지하는 중점개선 과제는 근로자위치추적시스템으로 나타나고 있어서 근로자위치추적시스템은 사업장의 규모에 상관없이 공통적으로 우선 개선해야 하는 스마트 건설안전관리시스템으로 파악되었다. &#xD;
 본 연구를 통해 스마트 안전관리시스템이 건설 현장에 정착되어 현장근로자에게 안전한 작업환경이 마련되고, 안전관리자에게는 효율적이고 효과적인 안전관리가 될 수 있기를 기대한다.

11407.abstract_en:
Abstract&#xD;
&#xD;
A study on Awareness and Acceptance Intention of Smart Construction Safety Management System&#xD;
&#xD;
Yun, Chang Hee&#xD;
(Supervisor Park, Jong Yil)&#xD;
Dept. of Global Safety Engineering&#xD;
Graduate School of Industry&#xD;
Seoul National University of Science and Technology&#xD;
&#xD;
  This study examines the smart construction safety management system built to prevent safety accidents and examines the impact on the awareness and acceptance intention of the construction safety management system through the Importance-Performance Analysis (IPA) of 10 smart construction safety systems presented in the Seoul Smart Safety Field Application Manual.&#xD;
  The importance and performance levels of the 10 factors of the smart construction safety management system were found to be different, and priority improvement tasks with high importance and low performance levels were derived. In addition, in terms of the influence of smart construction safety management system on acceptance intention, mobile 360° camera remote inspection system, heavy equipment pinch prevention system, smart environmental sensor, smart airbag vest, worker location tracking system, and site integrated control system were found to have a significant influence on acceptance intention. &#xD;
  Among the 10 factors of the smart construction safety management system perceived by site managers, the key improvement tasks with high importance and low performance were the worker location tracking system and smart safety collar, while the key improvement tasks perceived by workers on site were the risk displacement automatic measurement system and smart safety chinstrap. &#xD;
  The priority improvement issues identified by companies with a business size of less than KRW 80 billion were worker location tracking system and smart safety chain. Worker tracking system was identified as the priority improvement task for companies with a business size of more than 80 billion won, so worker tracking system was identified as a smart construction safety management system that should be improved first regardless of the size of the company. &#xD;
  Through this research, it is hoped that the smart safety management system will be established at construction sites to provide a safe working environment for site workers and efficient and effective safety management for safety managers.&#xD;

11408.abstract_en:
This study examines the serial multiple mediation effect of safety leadership on site safety behaviours through the sequential mediation of headquarters and site safety systems and the moderated mediation effect of headquarters safety systems on site safety behaviours depending on a different level of safety leadership. &#xD;
&#xD;
This study collected the results of 1957 small and medium-sized construction enterprises from the safety and health assessment of the credit bureau eCredible. The safety and health assessment consisted of two questions on representative safety leadership, eight questions on headquarters safety system, eight questions on site safety system, and four questions on site safety behaviour.&#xD;
&#xD;
The results showed that safety leadership positively affects safety behaviour directly and indirectly by sequentially mediating the headquarters and site safety systems. In addition, safety leadership moderates the relationship between the headquarters safety system and site safety systems. However, the moderating effect of safety leadership increases when the headquarters safety system level is low, while the moderating effect decreases when the headquarters safety system level is high. The result showed that the influence of safety leadership is more significant when the headquarters safety system is not established. Therefore, this study concludes that safety leadership is critical to improving the safety and health of small and medium-sized construction enterprises.

11409.abstract_en:
In this study, a dimensionless pressure-impulse diagram considering flexural and shear failure of protective wall was presented. The pressure-impulse diagram takes into account the maximum deflection and maximum shear slip of the protective wall, establishing damage criteria based on these factors. It visually represents the resulting pressure and impulse. The criteria for damage were determined by referencing standards from the U.S. Department of Defense for flexure and relevant literature for shear.&#xD;
To derive the pressure-impulse curve, the Single Degree of Freedom (SDOF) model was employed. This model considers mass, damping ratio, resistance, and other factors to calculate the behavior of the protective wall. It is commonly used in predicting explosive damage and during the design phase. However, the pressure-impulse curve has the disadvantage of requiring specialized knowledge due to the involvement of various variables and the need for numerical analysis.&#xD;
The dimensionless pressure-impulse curve assumed resistance to be complete yielding resistance. Shear resistance was assumed to have a constant resistance from an energy perspective and was validated through numerical analysis. Flexural resistance was presented using an already validated model in the same formulation as shear. The proposed dimensionless pressure-impulse curve was validated by categorizing cases into four based on protective wall design variables. It is judged that the presented dimensionless pressure-impulse curve can be used to assess the performance of protective wall.

11411.abstract_ko:
제주: 캄보디아 산업안전보건부의 안전의식과 안전분위기가 안전행동에 미치는 영향에 관한 연구&#xD;
&#xD;
        캄보디아 왕립 정부는 1993년에 설립된 이후, 산업 안전과 건강을 보장하기 위한 법과 규정을 시행함으로써 노동자 보호와 의료 서비스를 우선시해 왔습니다. 이러한 노력에도 불구하고, 캄보디아는 OSH에 대한 제한된 인적 자원, 제한된 법 집행, 그리고 부적절한 OSH 교육을 포함하여, 중대한 OSH 도전에 직면해 있습니다. 증가하는 노동력 규모와 낮은 문해력 수준은 이러한 안전 문제를 더욱 악화시킵니다.&#xD;
	캄보디아의 노동력 지위의 특성을 감안할 때 캄보디아는 여전히 시민의 교육 수준으로 인한 저품질 노동, 공장의 산업 안전 및 보건 관리 시스템이 매우 제한적이며 캄보디아에서 OSH의 한계를 야기하는 근로자와 직원의 안전하지 않은 운송 등 많은 과제에 직면해 있습니다. 본 연구는 OSH 기준을 시행하는 책임이 있는 산업안전보건부(DOSH)를 시작으로 작업장에서 사고를 예방하고 OSH 관행을 개선할 수 있는 요인을 파악하는 것을 목표로 합니다. 장교와 직원의 안전 인식과 작업장의 안전 풍토가 안전 행동에 어떤 영향을 미치는지 파악하고자 합니다.&#xD;
	안전의식과 안전분위기 안전행동에 미치는 영향을 실증적으로 밝히고자 설문조사를 통한 통계분석을 실시하였다. 안전의식의 하위변인 중 안전가치는 안전준수행동과 안전참여행동 모두에 유의한 정적 영향을 미쳤다. 안전분위기의 하위변인 중 경영가치는 안전준수행동에 유의한 영향을 미쳤고, 감독행동과 기대, 안전실천, 안전교육은 안전참여행동에 유의한 영향을 미쳤다. 또한, 감독행동과 기대(안전분위기의 하위변인)는 안전가치(안전인식의 하위변인)에 정의 영향을 미쳤고, 경영가치는 안전이해에 유의한 영향을 미쳤다. 안전가치(안전인식의 하위변인)와 안전행동의 관계에서 안전분위기의 5개 하위변인인 경영가치, 감독기대와 행동, 안전소통, 안전교육과 안전실천은 부분 매개효과를 보였다. 또한 본 연구는 안전이해와 안전행동의 관계에서 안전분위기의 매개효과를 탐색하였다. 그러나 안전이해는 안전분위기에 유의한 영향을 미치지 않아 안전인식과 안전행동의 관계를 부분 매개하는 데 그쳤다.&#xD;
	본 연구는 통계적 분석을 바탕으로 관계자와 직원의 안전행동을 예측하는 안전분위기 조성을 위한 실천적 제언을 제시하고 있습니다. 이러한 통찰은 캄보디아 사업장에서 사고를 예방하고 OSH 실천을 강화하기 위한 안전보건관리 전략을 수립하는 데 활용될 수 있을 것입니다.&#xD;
키워드: 캄보디아의 산업안전보건, 안전의식, 안전기후, 안전행동&#xD;

11411.abstract_en:
Title: A Study on the Effects of Safety Awareness and Safety Climate Influencing Safety Behavior in the Department of Occupational Safety and Health in Cambodia &#xD;
&#xD;
Since its establishment in 1993, the Royal Government of Cambodia has prioritized worker protection and healthcare services by implementing laws and regulations to ensure occupational safety and health (OSH). Despite these efforts, Cambodia faces significant OSH challenges, including limited human resources on OSH, limited law enforcement, and inadequate OSH education. The increasing workforce size and low literacy levels further exacerbate these safety issues. Given the characteristics of Cambodia’s labor force status, Cambodia is still faced with many challenges, such as low-quality labor due to the level of education of the citizens, the occupation safety and health management systems at factories are very limited, and the unsafe transportation of workers and employees which causing the limitations of the OSH in Cambodia, this study aims to identify factors that can prevent accidents and enhance OSH practices in the workplace, starting with the Department of Occupational Safety and Health (DOSH), which is responsible for enforcing OSH standards. It seeks to understand how the safety awareness of officers and staff and the safety climate of workplaces influence their safety behavior. Statistical analyses through surveys were conducted to empirically clarify the influence of safety awareness and safety climate on safety behavior among DOSH’s officers and personnel. Among the sub-variables of safety awareness, safety values had a significant positive impact on both safety compliance behavior and safety participation behavior. Among the sub-variables of the safety climate, management values significantly impacted safety compliance behavior, while supervisory action and expectations, safety practices, and safety training and education significantly impacted safety participation behavior. Additionally, supervisory action and expectations (sub- variables of the safety climate) positively impacted safety values (a sub-variable of safety awareness), while management values affected safety understanding. In the relationship between safety values (sub-variables of safety awareness) and safety behavior, five sub-variables of the safety climate—management values, supervisory expectations and actions, safety communication, safety training and education, and safety practices—showed a partial mediating effect. The study also explored the mediating effect of safety climate in the relationship between safety understanding and safety behavior. However, safety understanding did not significantly affect the safety climate, resulting in the safety climate only partially mediating the relationship between safety awareness and safety behavior. Based on statistical analysis, this study offers practical recommendations for fostering a safety climate that anticipates officers' and personnel’s safety behavior. These insights can be used to develop safety and health management strategies to prevent incidents and strengthen OSH practices in workplaces in Cambodia. &#xD;
&#xD;
Keywords: Cambodia’s Occupational Safety and Health, Safety Awareness, Safety climate, Safety behavior

11413.abstract_ko:
캄보디아 고무·두리안 농장 근로자의 작업관련 근골격계 질환(WMSD) 현장조사&#xD;
&#xD;
근골격계 질환(MSD)은 근육, 힘줄, 뼈 골격, 연골 및 신경과 같은 신체 부위와 관련된 건강 문제이다. 점진적으로 발생하는 업무 관련 근골격계 질환(WMSD)은 농부들 사이에서 흔하게 관찰되는 질병이다. 본  연구는 캄보디아의 고무 및 두리안 농장 노동자들 사이에서 WMSD의 인체공학적 위험 요소를 확인하고 유병률을 결정하는 것을 목표로 한다.&#xD;
본 연구는 결과의 정확성과 신뢰성을 보장하는 엄격한 방법론을 사용하여 수행되었다. 한국보건공단 가이드 (H-30-2008)의 설문지는 다양한 신체 부위에 대한 WMSD의 건강 영향을 평가하는 데 사용되었다. 고무 농장과 두리안 농장의 농부인 참가자들의 작업 자세를 RULA, REBA, OWAS와 같은 널리 인정되는 평가 도구를 사용하여 평가하였다. 농부들의 작업 자세는 녹화된 비디오와 스냅샷을 통해 세밀하게 분석하였으며, 작업 조건 및 방법 등을 분석하는 데에도 사용되었다.&#xD;
고무농장 노동자와 두리안 농장 노동자의 WMSD 유병률은 각각 88%와 92%로 나타났다. 고무농장 노동자의 증상 호소 부위는 허리가 71%, 두리안 농장 노동자의 경우 다리가 52%로 가장 많았습니다. 고무농장 노동자의 자세 분석 결과 RULA 평균 점수는 6.33으로, 더 세밀한 사업장 조사와 조치가 필요하다고 평가되었다. REBA 평균 점수는 6.16으로 중간 위험도이며, 이 역시 더 세밀한 사업장 조사와 조치가 필요하다는 것을 의미한다. OWAS 평균 점수는 2.33으로 근골격계를 손상시키는 자세는 사업장에서 곧 시정 조치가 필요합니다. 두리안 농장 노동자의 자세 분석: RULA 평균 점수는 6.5로 더 세밀한 사업장 조사와 조치가 필요하다. REBA 평균 점수는 7.25로 중간 위험도이며, 이는 더 세밀한 사업장 조사와 조치가 필요하다는 것을 의미한다. OWAS 평균 점수는 1.25로 나타났다. 조치가 필요하지 않으며 WMSD 시스템에 유해한 영향이 없는 정상적이고 자연스러운 자세로 평가되었다.&#xD;
본 연구는 캄보디아의 고무 및 두리안 농장 노동자들 사이에서 인체공학적 위험 요소를 성공적으로 식별하고 WMSD의 유병률을 결정했다. 이 노동자들 사이에서 발견된 WMSD의 높은 유병률은 그들의 산업 건강을 개선하기 위한 추가 연구와 개입의 필요성을 강조한다.

11413.abstract_en:
Title: Field survey on work-related musculoskeletal disorders (WMSDs)of workers engaged in rubber and durian farms in Cambodia&#xD;
Musculoskeletal disorders are health problems associated with the locomotion apparatus, such as muscle, tendons, bony skeleton, cartilage, and nerves. WMSDs are one of the most common occupational diseases. Work- related musculoskeletal disorders, which develop gradually, are most observed among farmers. This study aims to identify ergonomic risk factors associated with and determine the prevalence of WMSDs among rubber and durian farm workers in Cambodia.&#xD;
This study was conducted using a rigorous methodology, ensuring the accuracy and reliability of the results. The survey tool, a questionnaire from the KOSHA Guide (H-30-2008), was used to assess the health effects of WMSDs on various body parts. The participants, male and female farmers at rubber and durian farms, were evaluated using widely recognized assessments such as RULA, REBA, and OWAS. The posture of the farmers was meticulously analyzed through recorded videos and snapshots, providing a comprehensive understanding of their work conditions. &#xD;
The data showed that the prevalence of WMSDs among rubber and durian farm workers was 88% and 92%, respectively. At 71%, the waist was the most affected body part among rubber farm workers, and the legs, at 52%, were the most affected body part among durian farm workers. The rubber farm worker's postural analysis: RULA average score was 6.33 at the level, promoting that workplaces must investigate further and change soon. REBA average score is 6,16, which is a medium risk, which means the workplace needs to investigate further and change. OWAS average score is 2,33; the posture, which harms the musculoskeletal system, requires corrective action shortly in the workplace. The durian farm workers' postural analysis: RULA average score was 6.5 at the level, promoting that workplaces need to investigate further and change soon. REBA average score was 7,25, medium risk, which means the workplace needs to investigate further and change. The OWAS average score was 1.25. No action is required, a normal and natural posture with no harmful effects on the WMSD. &#xD;
This study successfully identified ergonomic risk factors and determined the prevalence of WMSDs among rubber and durian farm workers in Cambodia. The high prevalence of WMSDs found among these workers underscores the need for further research and interventions to improve their occupational health. Keywords: Musculoskeletal disorders, Farmers, Rubber, Durian

11415.abstract_en:
To develop and produce highly reliable products, collection and planning of market information, accurate reliability prediction, design, and procurement of raw materials with high reliability are required. In addition, in order to support this, many tasks such as reliability testing, reliability management in the manufacturing process, maintenance management in the use (operation) stage, analysis, feedback, and fault information collection should be carried out consistently.&#xD;
In particular, to improve the product reliability, it is important to secure reliability from the early stages of product development. Failure Mode and Effect Analysis (FMEA) is widely used as a method to increase the product reliability. Customer’s requirements for the products and systems are also evolving towards preferring safe products that can provide more reliability as well as functional convenience. &#xD;
In this paper, we will use the AIAG &amp; VDA FMEA Handbook on Impact Analysis (FMEA) with failure patterns, analyze the potential failure categories for systems and products, and evaluate whether the product will operate as intended during the maintenance phase. When unsatisfactory, we can re-analyze the FMEA technique which is one of the reliability methods to prevent the failures in advance through remedial action activities to propose a better method.&#xD;
FMEA analysis, one of the system failure analysis techniques, was used as a reliability evaluation technique to determine the impact of equipment and system failures. The FMEA is a qualitative analysis method to investigate how failures affect the products and systems. Nevertheless, this method does not provide accurate measurement methods, evaluation indicators or processes that have not been established.&#xD;
In this study, because the method of selecting targets for fault detection based on experience is not efficient, we suggest a more effective and realistic way to perform FMEA. As a result, the main purpose of this paper is to systematically accumulate the failure types based on the Failure Modes Table and to create a master FMEA standardized form to systematize the qualitative content in the selection of railway CBM (Condition Based Maintenance) and PHM (Prognostics and Health Management) targets. &#xD;

11417.abstract_ko:
캄보디아 고무 수확자 및 두리안 농부들의 직무 스트레스와 직무 만족도 평가&#xD;
&#xD;
세계화와 변화하는 직업 문화는 개발도상국, 특히 농업 부문에서 일과 관련된 스트레스를 증가시킨다. 비공식 부문으로 분류되는 농부들은 열악한 작업 환경, 직업 불안정, 낮은 수입 및 제한된 사회적 혜택으로 인해 상당한 스트레스를 겪고 있다. 특히 고무 채취와 두리안 농사에 종사하는 사람들은 신체적 및 생물학적 위험을 포함한 다양한 위험에 노출되어 있다. 이러한 작업 조건은 작업자가 물리적 위험 뿐만 아니라 불안 및 스트레스와 같은 심리적 위험에도 취약하게 만든다. 직무 스트레스와 만족도를 평가하는 것은 근로자의 생산성, 창의성 및 정신 건강을 보장하기 위해 중요하다. 본 연구는 농부들 사이에서 직무 스트레스와 직무 만족도를 중심으로 정신 건강 문제의 기본 측면을 더 잘 이해하기 위해 진행되었다.&#xD;
질적 데이터는 고무 및 두리안 농장에서 수집되었으며, 널리 인정받고 신뢰할 수 있는 한국직무스트레스척도를 사용하였다. 직무 스트레스와 만족도 간의 관계를 평가하기 위해 t-검정을 수행했으며, 교육 수준에 따른 이 관계를 조사하기 위해 Kruskal-Wallis H 검정을 사용하였다. 스트레스와 직무 만족도 간의 상관 관계를 측정하기 위해 Spearman 순위 상관 분석을 수행했으며, 농부의 경력, 역할 및 성별에 대해 직무만족도와 직무스트레스의 결과를 비교하였다. 모든 통계 분석은 SPSS 버전 26.0을 사용하여 수행되었다.&#xD;
본 연구를 위해 40명의 참가자를 모집했으며, 이 중 60%가 남성, 40%가 여성이었다. 고무 채취자의 평균 직무 스트레스 점수는 31.00±7.03, 두리안 농부의 평균 직무 스트레스 점수는 39.98±10.94로 평가되었다. 한편, 직무 만족도의 경우 고무 채취자의 평균 점수는 82.14±6.40이고 두리안 농부의 평균 점수는 71.84±10.29로 평가되었다. 통계 분석 결과 성별이나 근무 경력에 따른 직무 스트레스와 직무 만족도에 유의미한 차이가 없는 것으로 나타났다. 그러나 고무 채취자와 두리안 농부 간의 직무 만족도는 유의미한 차이가 있었으며(p&lt;0.05), 두 그룹 간의 직무 스트레스에도 유의미한 차이가 있었다(p&lt;0.05). 또한 직무 스트레스와 직무 만족도 간의 유의미한 음의 상관 관계를 발견했으며, 이는 직무 스트레스가 증가할수록 직무 만족도가 감소함을 의미한다. 이 상관 관계는 이전 연구의 결과와 일치하는 결과이다.&#xD;
 고무 수확기와 두리안 농가가 경험하는 직무 스트레스, 직무 만족 및 직무 스트레스 관련 요인을 파악하기 위해 캄보디아 라타나키리 주에서 양적 연구를 수행했다. 연구 결과, 두리안 농가는 직무 만족도가 높은 것으로 보고된 농가보다 더 높은 스트레스와 더 낮은 직무 만족을 경험하는 것으로 나타났다. 고무 수확기와 두리안 농가의 근로 조건을 개선하고 작업장 갈등을 완화하면 직무 스트레스를 줄이고 직무 만족도를 향상시킬 수 있다고 제안한다. 이러한 연구 결과는 농가 경영자에게 농가의 정신적 안녕감을 강화하고 생산성을 높이기 위한 기초 지식으로 작용할 것이다. 본 연구는 두 농가만을 대상으로 한 소수의 참여자를 대상으로 수행되었기 때문에 연구 결과를 일반화할 수 없다. 향후 연구에서는 더 많은 집단의 참여자를 대상으로 해야 할 것이다.

11417.abstract_en:
Assessment of job stress and job satisfaction among rubber harvesters and durian farmers in Cambodia: &#xD;
Globalization and evolving work cultures have increased work- related stress in developing countries, particularly in the agricultural sector. Farmers, categorized as an informal sector, face significant stress due to poor working conditions, job insecurity, low income, and limited social benefits. Specifically, those involved in rubber harvesting and durian farming are exposed to various risks, including physical and biological hazards. These challenging working conditions also make them susceptible to psychological risks such as anxiety and stress. Evaluating job stress and satisfaction is crucial to ensure workers' productivity, creativity, and mental well-being. This study is essential for better understanding the fundamental aspects of mental health issues, focusing on job stress and job satisfaction among farmers. &#xD;
The qualitative data was collected from rubber and durian farms using the widely recognized and reliable Korean Occupational Stress Scale. T- tests were conducted to assess the relationship between job stress and satisfaction, while the Kruskal-Wallis H Test was used to examine this relationship across different education levels. Spearman's Rank-Order Correlation analysis was conducted to measure the association between stress and job satisfaction compared to the work experience of farmers, roles, and genders. All statistical analyses were performed using SPSS version 26.0. &#xD;
For this study, 40 participants were recruited, with 60% male and 40% female. The study found that the average job stress score was 31.00±7.03 for rubber harvesters and 39.98±10.94 for durian farmers. Meanwhile, the average job satisfaction score was 82.14±6.40 for rubber harvesters and 71.84±10.29 for durian farmers. The results showed no significant difference in job stress and satisfaction between genders or years of work experience. However, job satisfaction was significantly different between rubber harvesters and durian farmers (p&lt;0.05), and there was also a significant difference in job stress between the two groups (p&lt;0.05). The study also found a significant negative correlation between job stress and job satisfaction, which means that as job stress increases, job satisfaction decreases. This correlation was consistent with the findings of previous studies. &#xD;
A quantitative study was conducted in Ratanakiri province, Cambodia, to assess the degree of job stress and job satisfaction experienced by rubber harvesters and durian farmers and the factors associated with job stress. The findings revealed that durian farmers experienced higher stress and lower job satisfaction than rubber harvesters, who reported greater job satisfaction. The study suggests that enhancing working conditions and mitigating workplace conflicts can reduce job stress and improve job satisfaction for rubber harvesters and durian farmers. These findings will serve as fundamental knowledge for farm owners to strengthen farmers' mental well- being and increase productivity. This study was conducted with a small number of participants on only two farms; therefore, the findings cannot be generalized. Future research should involve a larger group of participants.

11419.abstract_ko:
초록: 캄보디아 길거리 가게의 화재안전의식 및 제약요인 평가&#xD;
&#xD;
    현재 캄보디아는 1,326개의 의류 공장을 운영하며, 약 84만 명을 고용하고 있다. 2022년 공장 및 기업의 총 수는 약 17,000개 이며, 노동 인구는 약 150만 명에 달하며, 빠른 산업 성장이 나타나고 있다. 국가재난관리위원회(NCDM) 연례 보고서에 따르면, 캄보디아에서 2022년에 455건의 화재 사고가 발생했으며, 이는 2021년 505건에 비해 거의 50건 증가한 수치이다. 국가경찰 화재 및 구조 부서의 보고서에 따르면 프놈펜에서 발생한 화재 사건이 가정, 공장, 그리고 가판대를 크게 파손시켰으며, 화재의 원인으로는 전기 고장, 가스 폭발, 방치된 향 등이 포함되었다.&#xD;
&#xD;
    이 연구는 캄보디아 비공식 경제 부문에서의 화재 안전 인식을 평가하기 위해 정량 분석과 정책 지향적 분류 결과를 모두 활용하였다. 이를 위해 온라인 설문 조사를 사용했으며, 다양한 부분에서 추출한 100명의 응답자를 대상으로 분석하였다.&#xD;
&#xD;
    연구에 따르면, 거리 상인들은 법 준수(0.6)와 안전(0.69)에서 평균 이상으로 나타났으며, 교육(0.46)에서는 평균 이하로 나타났다. 주요 제약 요소는 재정(0.74), 시간(0.71), 지식(0.78)이었으며, 지식이 가장 중요한 제약 요소이다. 화재 안전 개선을 위해서는 더 나은 교육과 지식을 필요로 한다. 산업 단지 관리자에 대한 또 다른 연구에서는 화재 안전 실천(0.59)은 평균 이상이었지만, 법 준수(0.33)와 교육(0.48)은 평균 이하로 나타다. 주요 제약 요소는 재정(0.72), 시간(0.72), 인프라(0.92), 기술(0.87), 지식(0.80)이었으며, 인프라가 가장 큰 제약 요소였다. 주요 문제는 적절한 화재 안전 교육을 위한 인프라 부족이다. 정부 공무원의 화재 안전 행동에 관한 연구에서는 평균이 0.17로 평균 이하로 나타났다. 주요 제약 요소는 재정(0.65), 시간(0.68), 인프라(0.72), 기술(0.78)로, 기술적 제약이 가장 크게 나타났다. 화재 안전 실천을 개선하려면 적절한 교육이 필요하다.&#xD;
&#xD;
    연구 결과는 인적 요인이 다양한 관점에서 평가될 수 있지만, 본 연구에서 평가된 요소인 지식, 행동, 실천, 제약에 초점을 맞춘 구체적인 연구가 필요함을 시사할 수 있다. 이러한 결과를 바탕으로 가판대 소유자들이 직면한 문제를 해결하기 위한 가이드 도구를 개발하여 성과와 생산성을 향상시킬 수 있다. 이 연구의 결과는 추가 탐구와 확산을 촉진하기 위해 국내 또는 국제 세미나에서 발표될 예정이다.&#xD;

11419.abstract_en:
Assessment of Fire Safety Awareness and Constraints among Street Vendors in Cambodia&#xD;
&#xD;
   Currently, Cambodia hosts 1,326 factories in the garment sector, employing approximately 840,000 individuals. By 2022, the total number of factories and enterprises will reach 17,000, with a 1.5 million workforce reflecting rapid industrial growth. According to the National Committee for Disaster Management (NCDM) annual report, Cambodia experienced 455 fire incidents in 2022, an increase of almost 50 cases compared to 505 fires in 2021. In Phnom Penh, fire incidents have significantly damaged homes, factories, and stalls, as reported by the National Police's Fire and Rescue Department. The fires have been attributed to various causes, including electrical malfunctions, gas explosions, and unattended burning incense. The methodology section of this study utilizes both quantitative analysis and policy-oriented classification outcomes to assess awareness of fire safety in informal economic sectors in Cambodia. The primary method to accomplish this was an online questionnaire survey, which targeted a sample of 100 respondents drawn from various sectors. A study found street vendors scored above average in law regulation and compliance (0.6) and safety (0.69) but below average in training (0.46). The main constraints were financial (0.74), time (0.71), and knowledge (0.78), with knowledge being the most significant. Better training and expertise are needed for fire safety improvement. Another study on industrial park managers showed that fire safety practice (0.59) was above average, but law compliance (0.33) and training (0.48) were below average. The main constraints were financial (0.72), time (0.72), infrastructure (0.92), technical (0.87), and knowledge (0.80), with infrastructure being the highest. The main issue is inadequate infrastructure for proper fire safety training. A study on government officials' fire safety behaviors found a mean score of 0.17, indicating below-average performance. The main constraints were financial (0.65), time (0.68), infrastructure (0.72), and technical (0.78), with technical constraints being the highest. The main issue is the lack of technical support. Improving fire safety practices requires adequate training. The study's findings indicate that although human factors can be assessed from various perspectives, specific studies should focus on the elements evaluated in this research: knowledge, behavior, practice, and constraints. Based on these findings, guidance tools will be developed to address issues faced by stall owners, aiming to enhance their performance and productivity. The results of this research will be presented at national or international seminars to promote further exploration and dissemination. &#xD;
&#xD;
Key Words: Fire Safety Awareness, Fire Safety Constraints, Fire Safety Behaviors, Fire Prevention Policy, Safety Practice, Fire Safety.

11422.abstract_en:
Abstract&#xD;
Electrochemical CO2 Reduction based on Large-Area Liquid Metal Electrodes&#xD;
In this study, we presented methods for making a large-area liquid metal electrode to electrochemically reduce carbon dioxide emitted in large quantities at industrial sites. This study was inspired by research on electrochemically converting carbon dioxide gas into solid carbon using cerium containing liquid metal electrocatalyst, we attempted various methods to create an electrode that can convert larger amounts of carbon dioxide with long-term stability. First of all, electrodes made by coating liquid metal on a conductive substrate, copper and tungsten, have an increased interfacial tension as reduction potential applied, causing coalescence of the liquid metal and exposure of metal substrate to the electrolyte. Next, to overcome the phenomenon of liquid meal coalescence, PDMS was used as a matrix to limit unintended movement of liquid metal. So, we made micro-sized liquid metal droplets dispersed in PDMS matrix. As a result of an experiment with an liquid metal-PDMS composite, there was a trade-off between current density and composite producibility due to mixing with PDMS, a insulative material. Finally, we made an liquid metal-SiO2 composite by mixing SiO2 powder. As a result of the experiment, it was confirmed that the liquid metal electrode maintained its film form stably even while the reduction potential was applied more than 24 hours. Through the product analysis, the product was confirmed to be carbon.&#xD;
&#xD;
The results obtained through this study are expected to provide a fabrication method for large-area liquid metal electrodes suitable for working environments. If the system is supplied the electrical energy from renewable energy sources, the net carbon dioxide reduction rate can be increased. The carbonaceous material produced by the reaction can be used as an electrode material for solar cells, supercapacitors, or batteries, and is expected to contribute to reducing carbon dioxide emissions and creating economic feasibility.&#xD;

11423.abstract_ko:
제 목 : 신축성 페로브스카이트 태양전지를 위한 전극 제작&#xD;
&#xD;
본 연구에서는 전도성 고분자 중 하나인 PEDOT:PSS를 신축성 기판인 PDMS 위에 코팅하여 신축성 투명전극의 제작을 목표로 한다. 전극의 제작 방법을 확립하고 전극의 전도성을 향상하기 위해서 알코올 및 산 용매 처리를 통해서 최적의 용매 처리 방법을 확인한다. 특히 용매 중 메탄올의 경우 전처리 방법과 후처리 방법 이후 황산 용액 처리했을 때의 두 가지 조건에서 전극의 변화를 비교한다. 적정량의 메탄올 전처리를 한 전극이 후처리 한 경우보다 더 낮은 저항을 보였기 때문에 최적의 조건으로 판단하였다. 다층 코팅은 PEDOT:PSS 전극의 저항을 추가로 낮추기 위한 방법으로 사용되었다. 하지만 다층 코팅으로 인해 투과도가 감소해 광전자 소자의 적용에 어려움이 있다는 문제점 또한 있다. 결과적으로 layer 2의 PEDOT:PSS 필름을 투과도와 전도도의 측면에서 최적의 조건이라고 판단하였다. 최적의 조건의 전극은 100%까지 늘렸을 때 안정적으로 늘어나는 것을 확인하였다. 마지막으로 제작한 PEDOT:PSS 전극을 페로브스카이트 태양전지의 투명전극으로 활용하였고, 안정적인 J-V 그래프 및 Fill Factor와 1.65%의 효율을 확인하였다.

11423.abstract_en:
Fabrication of stretchable electrode for Perovskite Solar Cell&#xD;
&#xD;
This study suggests the fabrication process of PEDOT:PSS based stretchable transparent electrode. To improve the conductivity of the PEDOT:PSS electrode, alcohol and acid solvent treatments are used. The most effective alcohol treatment method, methanol, is compared by introducing two methods: “in-situ treatment” and “post treatment” with sulfuric acid treatment. The in-situ treatment at the optimal methanol is found to be slightly more effective than the post treatment in reducing the resistance of the PEDOT:PSS film. Forming multilayers of the PEDOT:PSS film further reduces the sheet resistance of the electrode. However, the multilayer structure also decreased the optical transmittance, which is undesirable in optoelectronic applications. As a result, two layers of the PEDOT:PSS film are selected as an optimal number of layers in terms of sheet resistance and transmittance. The PEDOT:PSS film coated on polydimethylsiloxane (PDMS) with optimal fabrication process demonstrates stable strain-dependent resistance up to 100% strain. Finally, the stretchable PEDOT:PSS electrode fabricated is used as the transparent electrode for a perovskite solar cell, exhibiting typical J－V characteristics and well Fill Factor with a power conversion efficiency of 1.65%.

11434.abstract_en:
Study on high-reliability silver-graphene particle composite material&#xD;
&#xD;
  In this study, in order to compensate for the shortcomings of the use of silver particle paste, which is used as a bonding electrode material for electronics and electric vehicles, wet graphene growth experiments were conducted to improve reliability by adsorbing on the particle surface, and the number of electronic parts is increasing. It is suitable for industries that require high reliability against physical and chemical shock. If we check the shortcomings of the silver paste currently used, the conductivity is far superior, but there are more disadvantages than expected. The migration phenomenon will be explained in detail below, but the bigger problem is that when it is pasted, conductivity and bonding strength are not proportional. As joint strength increases, conductivity decreases, making it difficult to secure electrical properties. As conductivity increases, bonding strength decreases, making it difficult to require bonding properties suitable for miniaturization of components. In this study, we aim to study these high value-added materials with high reliability characteristics that are easy to use in industry. For this study, silver particles, a conductive material widely used in industry, were used. The biggest drawback of silver particles is that when current is continuously applied, a short circuit occurs due to electron movement in the fine pattern, which is called a migration phenomenon. Efforts to make up for these shortcomings are still ongoing, and efforts have been made to replace them for a long time, but the use of silver particles has not been resolved to date because the electrical properties and sintering properties at low temperatures are excellent. Through this study, high-reliability particles were studied through the surface growth of graphene extracted from a carbon source on the surface of silver particles, and a high-strength, high-reliability paste using this was studied. Using a wet synthesis method, physical impact of the carbon source was applied to induce growth at the interface of the silver particle, and graphene of uniform thickness was grown on the particle by controlling the temperature and time. The carbon source was separated using centrifugation, washed, and dried by heat. It was possible to obtain pure particles through . Using particles that went through the pre-processing process, we studied a paste with high strength and high reliability using epoxy resin, a hardener, a thixotropic agent that increases the fluidity of the paste, and a dispersant that induces dispersion between the particles and the binder. Using these, we developed a high shear A paste with high strength value was designed. First, the growth and uniformity of graphene on the surface of the particles were verified according to conditions, and Void, shear strength, constant temperature and humidity reliability, and migration tests of the paste using nano-sized particles were conducted. As a result of the research, when a paste using silver-graphene composite particles was used, the migration phenomenon was reduced and the uniformity of the graphene particles was confirmed, and a highly reliable composite material with increased shear strength due to the mixing of epoxy in the binder was completed. . The paste-type composite material obtained through this study is expected to be widely used as a chip bonding material for high-impact electric vehicles and fine-patterned display electronic material electrodes. It is also hoped that using this material, we will be able to produce products with high performance by reducing electrical interference. Expect.

11442.abstract_ko:
제 목 : 천연가스 복합화력의 운영성과 결정요인 분석 : 인천 소재 발전소 사례를 중심으로 &#xD;
&#xD;
본 연구는 천연가스 복합화력 발전소 가스터빈 발전기의 운영실적 결정요인을 분 석하고 시사점을 제시하는 것을 목표로 한다. 연구대상은 인천에 위치한 Daily Start &amp; Stop(DSS) 발전기 2개 호기와 Weekly Start &amp;　Stop(WSS) 발전기 3개 호기이다. 천연가스 복합화력 발전기의 운영 특성을 기준으로 DSS 발전기와 WSS 발전기로 구 분하여 각각의 운영 실적에 대한 결정요인을 분석하고자 했다. 분석을 위해 각 발 전기의 최근 5년간의 월별 운영실적 자료가 사용되었으며 두 발전기의 등가기동횟 수와 등가기저운전시간을 종속변수로 선정했다. DSS 발전기 및 WSS 발전기의 운영 성과 결정요인 분석에 사용된 독립변수는 이용률, 전력예비율, 전력시장 공급능력, 천연가스 발전기 전력거래량, 신재생에너지 설비 용량 비율, 급전순위의 총 6개 이 다. 각 독립변수의 통계량은 전력통계정보시스템에서 취득했다. 분석 모형 추정을 위해 최소자승법(Ordinary Least Square)과 최소절대편차법(Least Absolute Deviation) 을 각각 적용하였다. 분석결과 추정계수는 대체로 유의수준 5%에서 통계 적으로 유의한 것으로 나타났다. 몇 가지 중요한 결과를 요약하면 다음과 같다. 기 동, 정지가 잦은 DSS 발전기의 등가기동횟수와 기동정지가 적고, 연속운전시간이 긴 WSS 발전기의 등가기저운전시간이 운전실적 결정요인 분석의 핵심이다. 분석결 과 발전기별 일부 차이는 있지만 대체로 이용률, 전력 예비율, 등가기저운전시간, 전력시장 공급능력, 천연가스 복합화력발전 전력거래량, 급전순위가 운영실적에 유 의한 결정요인으로 분석되었다. 이때 이용률의 경우 제곱항도 독립변수로 고려되었 는데, 종속변수와 역U자의 관계를 가지고 있는 것으로 나타났다. 전체 전력설비에 서 신재생에너지 설비용량 비율은 DSS 발전기와 WSS 발전기 모두에서 등가기동횟 수 및 등가기저운전시간 모두 유의한 결정요인으로 분석되어, 신재생에너지 비율증 가가 발전설비 운영에 상당한 영향을 끼치는 것을 알 수 있었다. 본 연구결과는 특 정 발전기의 운영 실적자료만 사용되었기 때문에 일반화에 주의할 필요가 있으나, 천연가스 복합화력 발전기의 대수리 도래시기 예측 및 연간 비용계획 수립에 중요 한 참고자료로 활용될 수 있다. &#xD;
&#xD;
주제어 : 천연가스 복합화력 운영실적, 최소자승법, 최소절대편차법, 대수리 주기, 등가기동횟수, 등가기저운전시간,

11442.abstract_en:
Title: Determinants of the Operational Performance of NG-fired Combined Cycle: The Case of Power Plants in Incheon&#xD;
&#xD;
This study aims to analyze the factors that determine the operating performance of gas turbine generators in NG combined cycle power plants. The study subjects are two Daily Start &amp; Stop (DSS) generators and three Weekly Start &amp; Stop (WSS) generators located in Incheon, South Korea. The operating characteristics of NG combined cycle generators were used as the basis for dividing the DSS generators and WSS generators into two categories and analyzing the factors that determine the operating performance of each category. For the analysis, monthly operating performance data of each generator for the past 5 years was used, and the equivalent starts and equivalent baseload hours of the two generators were selected as the dependent variables. The independent variables used for the analysis of operating performance and determining factors of DSS generators and WSS generators are a total of six: utilization rate, power reserve ratio, power supply capacity, power trading volume of LNG generators, renewable energy capacity ratio, and priority of dispatch rank. The statistical quantities of each independent variable were obtained from the Electric Power Statistics Information System (EPSIS). The ordinary least squares method and the least absolute deviation method were applied, respectively, for estimating the analysis model. As a result of the analysis, the estimated coefficients were generally statistically significant at the 5% significance level. The results of the analysis can be summarized as follows. The equivalent starts of DSS generators and the equivalent baseload hours of WSS generators are the key to analyzing operating performance. The utilization rate, reserve margin, equivalent operating time, power market supply capacity, LNG power trading volume, and priority dispatch are significant factors that determine operating performance. The proportion of renewable energy capacity in the entire power plant is a significant factor that determines both the equivalent starts and equivalent baseload hours of both DSS generators and WSS generators. The key factors in analyzing the operating performance of DSS generators, which frequently start and stop, are the equivalent stars and the equivalent baseload hours of WSS generators, which have fewer start-ups and stops and longer continuous operating times. The results of the analysis showed that, with some differences between generators, the following factors are significant determinants of power performance: utilization rate, power reserve ratio, power supply capacity, power trading volume of LNG generators, renewable energy capacity ratio, and priority of dispatch rank. In the case of utilization rate, the square term was also considered as an independent variable, and it had an inverse U-shaped relationship with the dependent variable. The ratio of renewable energy capacity to total power market was found to be a significant determinant of both equivalent starts and equivalent baseload hours for both DSS and WSS generators, suggesting that the increase in the proportion of renewable energy has a significant impact on the operation of power facilities. The results of this study should be interpreted with caution because they are based on the operating performance data of only two DSS generators and three WSS generators. Further research is needed to confirm the findings of this study with a larger sample size. This study can be used as an important reference for predicting the timing of outage repairs and formulating annual cost plans for NG combined cycle power plant &#xD;
&#xD;
key word: operational performance of NG-fired combined cycle, Ordinary Least Square, Least Absolute Deviation, predicting the timing of Outage, Equivalent Starts, Equivalent Baseload Hours

11445.abstract_en:
The demand for electricity is expected to continue growing due to various factors, including the transition to carbon neutrality and economic growth. South Korea and Japan are similar in several respects, including their status as island nations heavily reliant on foreign energy sources and their manufacturing-based industrial structures. Both countries have recently faced the challenge of providing reliable power to their manufacturing industries to promote economic growth. Therefore, this article aims to obtain implications after quantitatively analyzing the role of the South Korean and Japanese electric power sectors (EPSs) in the national economies. This study aims to identify differences between the two countries and derive actionable insights for decision-making and policy formulation. The analysis employs the Input-Output (IO) technique, utilizing the latest IO tables available in each country as the primary dataset. To examine the production-inducing effect of the EPS, a demand-side model is utilized. To address the sup-ply shortage effect of the EPS, a supply-side model is employed. Finally, to obtain the price effects of the EPS, a price-side model is employed. The two key findings are as follows. First, the production-inducing effect, value-added creation effect, and job creation effect resulting from a unit investment in the EPS were found to be 1.1 times, 1.1 times, and 1.6 times greater in Japan than in South Korea, respectively. These differences are attributed to the distinct operational approaches in the electricity sector between South Korea and Japan. Compared to Japan’s fully liberalized electricity market, South Korea’s electricity industry, which is largely dominated by public enterprises, exhibits relatively constrained production-inducing, value-added creation, and job creation effects. Second, South Korea experiences significantly high wage-inducing effects, supply shortage effects, and price-side effects, which are approximately 1.9 times, 1.4 times, and 1.1 times greater than those observed in Japan, respectively. These differences can be ascribed to South Korea’s public enterprise-focused high-wage structure and a high proportion of manufacturing in its economy. These quantitative results of this study can provide valuable reference material for future government decision-making and policy formation in the EPS. They shed light on the significant role and impact of the power sector in both countries, offering insights that can guide policy directions effectively.&#xD;
&#xD;
Keywords : electric power sector; economic effect; national economy; input-output technique; South Korea; Japan

11447.abstract_en:
Abstract&#xD;
&#xD;
Policy Research for Expanding the Supply of Transportation Biofuels: Focusing on AHP and CVM Techniques&#xD;
&#xD;
Sun-A Hong&#xD;
(Supervisor, Sung-Yoon Huh)&#xD;
Dept. of Energy Policy&#xD;
Graduate School of Energy and Environment&#xD;
Seoul National University of Science and Technology&#xD;
&#xD;
This dissertation comprehensively examines the direction and social acceptability of expanding biofuel supply for transportation in South Korea from two crucial perspectives: (1) expert opinions using the Analytic Hierarchy Process (AHP) and (2) public perception using the Contingent Valuation Method (CVM). By integrating these viewpoints, this study provides a holistic understanding of factors influencing the successful implementation of biofuel policies in the transportation sector.&#xD;
The first study employs AHP to explore factors related to biodiesel production and distribution. Experts were surveyed to allocate weights to various factors. Results show that ‘securing and developing raw materials’ (49.2%) and ‘commercialization of next-generation (hydrotreated) raw materials’ (22.8%) were deemed most important. This suggests that future biodiesel expansion policies should focus on these two factors.&#xD;
The second study uses CVM to investigate the public's willingness to pay (WTP) for biojet fuel. Of 559 respondents, 77% expressed willingness to pay at least 1 won extra, while 23% were unwilling to pay any additional amount. The average WTP was estimated at 10.7% above current airfares. Factors influencing WTP included flight frequency, age, and occupation, with younger age groups and those in more flexible occupations showing higher WTP.&#xD;
Biofuels are presented as a stepwise approach to achieving carbon neutrality in the transportation sector. This research emphasizes the necessity of introducing biofuels for environmental protection and energy security. The findings provide insights into social perceptions and acceptability of biofuels, offering important guidelines for government and industry in developing energy strategies and implementing policies.&#xD;
&#xD;
Keywords : AHP(Analytic Hierarchy Process), Biodiesel, RFS(Renewable Fuel Standard), SAF (Sustainable Aviation Fuel), CVM(Contingent Valuation Method)

11451.abstract_en:
A Study on Control Strategy Analysis and Performance Evaluation for Optimal Power Distribution of a New Structure Hybrid System Equipped with Multiple Motors&#xD;
&#xD;
TAs global carbon emission regulations tighten, there's a surge in technological research within the automotive industry to reduce carbon emissions. Consequently, there's a growing interest in electric and hybrid vehicles, with a particular focus on the combination of SUVs and hybrid technology.&#xD;
&#xD;
The European Commission, based on the 2019 Life Cycle Assessment (LCA), raises concerns about CO2 emissions from electric cars, especially considering CO2 emissions during electricity generation. This uncertainty challenges the regulatory compliance of electric cars, leading to increased attention on hybrid vehicles. Hybrid SUVs, however, face difficulties meeting emission regulations due to their high power characteristics, necessitating improvements in fuel efficiency.&#xD;
&#xD;
Various hybrid systems are being researched for efficiency, classified into P0 to P4 systems based on motor positions. P0 and P1 have a single-axis structure where the engine and motor share the same axis, providing advantages in absorbing kinetic energy during regenerative braking. P2 has a dual-axis structure, allowing independent control of the engine. P3, applied after the gearbox, offers high transmission efficiency. P4 has separate motor-driven axles, enabling torque vectoring but with drawbacks of increased motor weight and space requirements.&#xD;
&#xD;
Though research on vehicles simultaneously incorporating P1-P2-P4 systems is scarce, the potential advantages include enhanced energy recovery and efficient power distribution despite increased motor weight. Therefore, research has been conducted on the control of multi-motor power distribution in large SUV hybrid vehicles.&#xD;
&#xD;
This paper analyzes the configuration and characteristics of a vehicle with P1-P2-P4 systems, studying control strategies for optimal power distribution using three motors to improve fuel efficiency. A backward analysis model, developed using MATLAB Simulink, enables the analysis of the multi-motor hybrid system. Optimization methods for torque distribution among P1-P2-P4 motors were explored. To apply the backward analysis method to real vehicles, a method considering characteristics such as gear patterns, rotational inertia, and efficiency was devised. Hysteresis was applied during gear pattern application, and algorithms for determining HEV Mode-EV Mode and torque distribution strategy for the rear P4 motor were derived and studied.&#xD;
&#xD;
A forward analysis model, developed using MATLAB Simulink, validated the performance of the control map through simulation. The model, comprising mechanical, electrical, control, driver, and other components, improved simulation speed with a lumped analysis model exhibiting minimal dynamic behavior. The developed control map was applied to the analysis model for simulation, validating the performance of the control map. Through this, methods for multi-motor power distribution control in large SUV hybrid vehicles were proposed, and research results were obtained.

11453.abstract_ko:
제 목 : 실차 주행시험 기반 전기자동차 감속기의 내구도 분석 &#xD;
본 연구에서는 전기자동차 감속기를 장착한 차량의 내구성을 평가하고 개선하기 위한 최적의 알고리즘을 제시하며 연구의 주요 내용과 요약은 다음과 같다. &#xD;
&#xD;
첫째, 전통적인 내연기관 차량과는 다른 전기자동차 기술은 전력의 전달과 차량 의 운전 특성에 있어서 전혀 새로운 내용들을 요구하고 있다. 특히, 전기차 감속기 는 구동모터의 동력을 전달하는 역할을 하며, 다양한 운전 상황에서 안정적인 내구 성능을 확보해야 한다.&#xD;
&#xD;
둘째, 다양한 토크와 회전수에서의 전기차 감속기 내구성은 이 분야의 연구 중 핵심적인 주제 중 하나이다. 각종 도로 조건 및 운전 환경에서 발생하는 다양한 토 크 및 회전수에서의 내구성 특성을 이해하는 것은 전기자동차의 성능 향상과 장기 적인 신뢰성 보장에 중요한 역할을 한다. &#xD;
&#xD;
셋쩨, 전기자동차의 동력전달 특성중 하나인 낮은 소음진동의 내구유지를 위하여 신속하면서 신뢰도가 높은 실험 방법을 제안한다. 여기서 기존의 내연기관의 변속 기와 구조가 다른 감속기는 강력한 구동모터와 연결되어 내구 및 소음진동에 불리 할수 있어 새로운 설계 방법을 도입하여 내구성 및 소음 진동문제에 대한 효율적인 설계분석 방법을 제안한다. &#xD;
&#xD;
본 논문은 전기자동차 감속기의 내구성 문제를 다루는 것에 있어서 기존의 연구 와는 차별성을 가지며, 감속비별 토크와 회전수에서의 상대손상도에 대하여 심층적 이고 체계적인 분석을 통해 전기자동차 감속기 설계시 내구성과 성능을 향상시키는 방법을 효과적으로 전달하는 부분에 기대한다.

11453.abstract_en:
&#xD;
&#xD;
Abstract&#xD;
&#xD;
Analysis of the Durability of Electric Vehicle Reduction Gear by using Vehicle Driving Test Data&#xD;
&#xD;
Hong, Kill Dong&#xD;
(Supervisor Lim, Won Sik)&#xD;
Dept. of Automotive Engineering&#xD;
The Graduate School &#xD;
Seoul National University of Science and Technology&#xD;
&#xD;
  In this study, the optimal algorithm for evaluating and improving the durability of vehicles equipped with electric vehicle reducers is presented, and the main contents and summary of the study are as follows.&#xD;
&#xD;
  First, electric vehicle technology, which is different from traditional internal combustion engine vehicles, requires completely new contents in terms of power transmission and driving characteristics of the vehicle. In particular, the electric vehicle reducer plays a role in transmitting the power of the driving motor and must secure stable durability in various driving situations.&#xD;
&#xD;
  Second, durability of electric vehicle reducer at various torques and rotational speeds is one of the key topics in this field of research. Understanding the durability characteristics at various torques and rotational speeds generated in various road conditions and driving environments plays an important role in improving the performance of electric vehicles and ensuring long-term reliability.&#xD;
&#xD;
  Third, a quick and reliable experimental method is proposed to maintain the durability of low noise vibration, one of the power transmission characteristics of an electric vehicle. Here, a new design analysis method is proposed by introducing a new design method because the speed reducer, which has a different structure from the transmission of the existing internal combustion engine, is connected to a strong drive motor, which may be disadvantageous to durability and noise vibration.&#xD;
&#xD;
  This paper is different from previous studies in dealing with the durability problem of electric vehicle reducers, and it is expected to effectively convey how to improve durability and performance when designing electric vehicle reducers through in-depth and systematic analysis of torque and relative damage at each reduction ratio and rotational speed.

11456.abstract_en:
Currently, technologies such as self-driving cars and robots are being actively researched using various methods to detect objects in the driving environment. In the case of methods using only images, various techniques are studied using images surrounding self-driving cars as important information to recognize the surrounding environment. In the case of methods using only point clouds, various techniques are used to recognize the surrounding environment by using point clouds (point clouds) obtained through lidar around autonomous vehicles as important information. In addition, methods that use image data and point cloud data simultaneously are studied as a technique that can compensate for the disadvantages of using image data and point cloud data.&#xD;
Image data containing 2D information has r, g, and b values for each pixel value, and uses segmentation techniques using id values schematized in pixel units for each object in the image, or an object in the image for each object. It is processed using an object detection technique that detects the location of the boundary or center point of . In the case of the above methods, depth information is estimated through depth estimation because it does not have depth information, but since there is an error with the point cloud data with existing 3D information, there is no accurate and detailed depth information, making it difficult to accurately determine the distance between the autonomous vehicle and the object. There are drawbacks.&#xD;
 Point cloud data containing 3D information has x, y, and z values for each point, and using the information, all points in the point cloud data are collected in a specific section without any data preprocessing such as image projection or voxelization to create a designated point. A point-based method that recognizes objects by extracting the features of actually distributed points through the number of points. After dividing the input point group into a set of cubes of a certain size, the representative characteristics of each voxel are determined using the points included in each cube through a probabilistic method. Processed in a variety of ways, such as voxel-based, which extracts and bundles data, and projection-based, which projects a point cloud with 3D information onto a 2D image grid and performs object recognition with data processed into a multi-channel image based on various characteristics of the object. This can be done, and the same data set can be used to extract results based on various other criteria and interpret them in various ways. In the case of the above methods, the object size in 3D space is much smaller than the object size in 2D space, so the object in the 3D detector using a structure similar to the existing 2D detector using downsampling becomes smaller and more difficult to detect. Have.&#xD;
 In this paper, the goal is to improve object recognition performance by utilizing various techniques using two-dimensional image data and three-dimensional point cloud data. In addition, the goal is to compare the differences with existing models and improve object recognition performance by using and changing the model structure that is known to have good performance.

11461.abstract_en:
Micro-structuring of Carbon Nanotubes and Development as Functional Frameworks for Diverse MEMS Devices&#xD;
&#xD;
  Utilizing the CNT forests and lithographically patterned CNT microstructures in their as-grown forms may obviate the labor for harvesting (off the substrate) and subsequent post-treatment (e.g., solution/powder preparation) and may provide more functional frameworks with controlled 3D morphology, density, and aspect ratio. This can be achieved by optimizing the morphology of catalyst nanoparticles that are converted from the thin-film catalyst layer during the annealing step of the chemical vapor deposition (CVD)-based CNT growth process. Here I propose a artifitial intelligence (AI)-based optimization method for the control of catalyst nanoparticle morphology during the CVD process through thermal energy-driven Ostwald ripening and subsurface diffusion. I pay more attention to the micropatterned catalyst system which exhibits considerably different heat transfer characteristics depending on the micropattern geometry as compared to the non-patterned thin-film catalyst system. Additionally, I conduct estimation the nanoparticle morphology to optimize the CVD parameters for reliable growth of CNT forests on micropatterned catalyst systems with various geometries, based solely on preprocessed SEM images of the catalyst nanoparticles. As a result, a reliable and reproducible CNT growth – either to a forest or microstructure – are realized by taking the global optimum values, which can be utilized in several cutting-edge applications including  3D CNT microelectrode arrays and one-directionally aligned CNT thin films engineered from microscale CNT blade patterns.

11463.abstract_en:
According to the "Statistical Analysis of Traffic Accidents by Road Type" released by the Korea Traffic Safety Analysis System (TAAS), the number of intersections is only very small number compared to a single road, but the number of accidents that occurred is close to 50% of the total number of traffic accidents. The number of injuries and deaths from traffic accidents also accounts for a very large proportion of intersections at about 50% and 35%, respectively. Therefore, the need for safety improvements is being emphasized in intersections where the accident rate and injury rate are the highest. &#xD;
As autonomous driving technology advances, the previous intersection crossing strategies, which involved safely navigating through intersections with autonomous vehicles in the same traffic scenario through rule-based approaches, were meaningful. However, with the expectation that it will take a considerable transition period until all vehicles become autonomous, the current focus is on the interaction between autonomous vehicles and human drivers in the upcoming mixed traffic environments. This requires adaptive methods that take into account the driving characteristics of human drivers. Therefore, in this study, the focus is on developing strategies for autonomous vehicles to interact with human drivers or adapt to the driving characteristics of human drivers in mixed traffic environments. The proposed approach involves using vision sensors to perceive and gather information about vehicles approaching from blind spots, predicting the probability and future behavior of human drivers with uncertainties who may violate rules based on the received information and intersection map data. This aims to propose a uncontrolled intersection crossing strategy in mixed traffic environments.&#xD;
To validate the performance of the intersection crossing strategy proposed in this study, compared and verified the strategy based on rule-based decision-making following the first-come-first-served rule with a game theory-based decision-making strategy, which is considered to be most similar to the characteristics of human drivers. The proposed crossing strategy in this study demonstrated strong performance and results in terms of efficiency, safety, and ride comfort compared to other model-based decision-making strategies. Therefore, this study is expected to be useful in the development of future autonomous driving technology and strategies as a way to respond to uncertainty caused by human drivers and blind spots in mixed traffic environments between human drivers and autonomous vehicles that will soon face.

11465.abstract_ko:
제 목 : PEMFC 및 리튬-이온 배터리 기반 무인항공기용 파워팩 모듈의 열 해석을 통한 적정 작동 조건에 관한 연구&#xD;
&#xD;
  본 연구에서는 컨셉 디자인을 참고하여 PEM 연료전지 및 리튬-이온 배터리 기반 고정익 무인항공기용 40kW급 파워팩 모듈을 MATLAB/Simulink를 활용하여 모델링하였다.&#xD;
  파워팩 모듈은 PEM 연료전지 시스템, 리튬-이온 배터리 팩, 통합 열 관리 시스템, 출력 관리 시스템으로 구성되었다. PEM 연료전지 시스템은 PEM 연료전지 스택과 BoP(Balance of Plant)로 구성되었으며 압축기를 통하여 가압하는 폐쇄형 공기극 타입이다. 통합 열 관리 시스템은 무인항공기의 비출력 및 비에너지 성능을 감안하여 직렬 냉각 회로 형식을 채택하였다. 구현된 파워팩 모듈이 고정익 무인항공기 비행 상태와 외기 조건의 영향을 받을 수 있도록 외부 환경을 추가로 모델링하였다.&#xD;
  통합 열 해석은 통합 열 관리 시스템의 작동 변수와 비행 상태를 변경해가며 진행하였다. 주요 작동 변수는 냉각수의 질량 유량과 라디에이터로 이동하는 냉각수의 질량 유량을 조절하는 바이패스 밸브 개도량이다. 비행 상태는 순항 상태와 상승 상태, 2가지로 구분이 되었고 비행 고도 범위는 0~2000m다. 주요한 정량적 평가인자로 연료전지 스택과 배터리 팩의 온도가 사용되었고 통합 열 관리 시스템의 적정 작동 조건의 기준은 논문 및 제품 규격을 토대로 선정하여 열 관리 성능을 평가하였다. 결과는 각각의 작동 변수를 고정하여 선정한 정량적 평가인자를 분석하여 상황에 따른 파워팩 모듈의 열적 특성을 분석하였다. 이후 종합 분석에서 모든 작동 변수와 열 관리 성능을 고려한 적정 작동 조건을 도출하였다.&#xD;
  본 연구에서 도출된 간략한 결과는 다음과 같다. &#xD;
● 고도가 상승함에 따라 라디에이터의 냉각 효율이 증가한다.&#xD;
● 파워팩 효율을 고려한 냉각수 유량 및 바이패스 밸브 개도량의 최적값이 존재한다.&#xD;
● 통합 열 해석을 통해 파워팩 모듈의 열 관리 성능을 가시화하여 정성적 및 정량적 평가가 가능하다.&#xD;
● 전력 분배율을 제어하여 통합 열 관리 시스템의 적정 작동 조건을 확장시킬 수 있다.&#xD;
  본 논문은 고정익 무인항공기를 감안한 연료전지 및 배터리를 동력원으로 사용하는 하이브리드 시스템 모델링 및 통합 과정을 상세히 작성하였고 제시한 통합 열 해석 과정을 통해 열 관리 전략 수립에 기여할 것으로 기대된다.

11465.abstract_en:
Title : A Study on the Appropriate Operating Conditions through Thermal Analysis of Power Pack Module for UAVs based on PEMFC and Lithium-ion Battery&#xD;
&#xD;
 In this study, a 40kW-class power pack module for fixed-wing unmanned aerial vehicles based on PEM fuel cells and lithium-ion batteries was modeled by using MATLAB code as a modeling tool.&#xD;
 The power pack module consists of a PEM fuel cell system, lithium-ion battery pack, integrated thermal management system, and power management system. The fuel cell system consists of a PEM fuel cell stack and a BoP(Balance of plant) with high-pressure closed-cathode type using a compressor. The integrated thermal management system adopts a series cooling circuit method, considering specific energy and specific power of unmanned aerial vehicles. The external environment was additionally modeled so that the implemented power pack module could be affected by the fixed-wing unmanned aerial vehicle flight state and external air conditions.&#xD;
 The integrated thermal analysis was conducted by varying the operating variables of the integrated thermal management system and the flight states. The main operating variables are the mass flow rate of the coolant and the bypass valve opening, which controls the mass flow rate of coolant to the radiator. The flight state is divided into two states: cruise and climb, with the flight altitude range of 0 to 2000m. The temperature of the fuel cell stack and battery pack was used as the main quantitative evaluation factors, and the appropriate operating conditions of the integrated thermal management system were selected based on literatures and product specifications to evaluate thermal management performances. As a results, the thermal characteristics of the power pack module according to various scenarios were investigated by analyzing the quantitative evaluation factors selected by fixing each operating variable. Subsequently, through comprehensive analysis, appropriate operating conditions were derived considering all operating variables and thermal management performance. &#xD;
&#xD;
  The brief results obtained from this study are as follows:&#xD;
● As altitude increases, the cooling efficiency of the radiator increases.&#xD;
● There exists an optimal value for the coolant flow rate and the bypass valve opening considering the efficiency of the power pack.&#xD;
● Qualitative and quantitative evaluations are possible by visualizing the thermal management performance of the power pack module through integrated thermal analysis&#xD;
● By controlling the power distribution ratio, the appropriate operating conditions of the integrated thermal management system can be expanded.&#xD;
&#xD;
 This paper provide a detailed description of the modeling and integration process of a hybrid system using fuel cells and batteries as power sources for fixed-wing unmanned aerial vehicles. This paper is expected to contribute to the establishment of thermal management strategies through the integrated thermal analysis process presented.

11468.abstract_ko:
제 목 : 산업단지 열병합발전 연료전환의 환경편익 추정 : 특정 발전소 사례를 중심으로 &#xD;
산업단지 열병합발전은 열 또는 열과 전기를 동시에 생산함으로써 복합화력 등에 비하여 에너지 효율이 높고, 산업단지 열수용가(입주업체)들의 개별 보일러 설비를 대체하여 집중적으로 열을 생산·공급함으로써 온실가스 및 대기오염을 저감하는 효과가 크다. 그러나 산업단지 열병합발전은, 주로 LNG를 연료로 하는 지역냉난방 열병합발전과는 달리 대부분 유연탄을 주 연료로 사용하고 있으며, 상당수는 설비가 노후화되어 탄소중립의 국가적 당면과제에 부합하는 역할을 하기에는 한계가 있다. 이에, 상당수 산업단지 열병합발전 사업자들이 LNG로의 연료전환 또는 LNG 설비 신·증설을 검토하고 있다. 이와 같은 연료전환을 통해 산업단지 열병합발전사업자들은 온실가스, 대기오염물질, 미세먼지를 저감할 수 있다. 만일 산업단지 열병합발전사업자들이 연료 전환을 하지 않고 유연탄을 연료로 계속 사용할 경우 정부의 탈석탄 정책에 따라 기하급수적으로 늘어나는 배출권 비용 등을 감당하지 못하여 생존조차 장담하기 어려운 실정에 처하게 될 것이다. 따라서 LNG 연료전환은 산업단지 열병합사업자들에게 선택이 아닌 필수이자 생존의 전제조건이라 할 수 있다. 본 논문에서는 노후 유연탄 열병합발전소를 LNG 복합 열병합발전소로 연료 전환할 경우의 온실가스, 대기오염물질, 미세먼지 저감 편익을 분석한다. 이를 위해 기존 설비와 신규 설비의 구성, 오염물질 배출량 등을 비교·분석하여 연료전환으로 인한 환경개선 효과를 산정하고 오염물질 배출량 저감으로 인한 환경편익을 추정한다. 분석 결과 산업단지 열 수용가의 열수요를 충족하기 위 하여 터빈발전기 용량이 늘어남으로써 부득이하게 온실가스 배출 총량은 늘어 나지만 단위열량당 온실가스 배출량은 약 48%만큼 저감되는 것으로 나타났다. 이와 같이 산업단지 열병합발전소 연료전환은 높은 에너지효율에 더하여 단위열량당 온실가스 배출량을 대폭 저감할 수 있게 하는 바, 산업단지 열병합발전사업자들의 LNG 연료전환은 국가적인 차원에서 적극 추진하는 것이 바람직할 것이다. &#xD;
주제어: 열병합발전, 연료전환, 대기오염물질 저감, 온실가스 저감, 환경편익

11468.abstract_en:
Environmental Benefits of Fuel Transition for Cogeneration in Industrial Complex : The Case of a CHP Plant&#xD;
 By producing heat and electricity at the same time, cogeneration in industrial complexes has the effect of reducing greenhouse gases and air pollution by intensively producing and supplying heat by replacing individual boiler facilities of heat consumers in industrial complexes. Unlike regional cooling and heating cogeneration, which uses LNG as fuel, cogeneration in industrial complexes mostly uses bituminous coal as fuel, and many of them are aging and have limitations in meeting the national challenge of carbon neutrality. &#xD;
Many cogeneration operators in industrial complexes are considering converting fuel to LNG or establishing facilities. Such fuel conversion can not only reduce greenhouse gases, air pollutants, and fine dust, but it is also an option and a prerequisite for survival for cogeneration operators in industrial complexes, which is difficult to guarantee even survival because they cannot afford the exponentially increasing cost of emission permits in accordance with the government's decarbonization policy if bituminous coal continues to be used as fuel. &#xD;
This paper analyzes the benefits of reducing greenhouse gases, air pollutants, and fine dust in converting an old bituminous coal cogeneration plant into an LNG combined cogeneration plant. To this end, the composition of existing and new facilities, fuel use, and pollutant emissions are compared and analyzed to estimate the environmental improvement effect of fuel conversion and to calculate the environmental benefits of reducing pollutant emissions. As a result of the analysis, the total amount of greenhouse gas emissions increases by increasing the capacity of the turbine generator to meet the heat demand of the heat capacity of the industrial complex, but the amount of greenhouse gas emissions per unit heat is reduced by about 48%. As the conversion of cogeneration fuel in industrial complexes can significantly reduce greenhouse gas emissions per unit heat in addition to high energy efficiency, it would be desirable for industrial complex cogeneration operators to actively promote LNG fuel conversion at the national level.&#xD;
Keywords: cogeneration, fuel transition(conversion), air pollutant reduction, greenhouse gas reduction, environmental benefits

11469.abstract_ko:
제 목 : 한국의 에너지환경정책에 대한 2개의 소논문 : 천연가스 공급 부문의 국민경제적 역할 및 미이용 산림바이오매스로 생산된 전기에 대한 대중의 선호도 &#xD;
본 논문은 2개의 소논문으로 구성되어 있다. 첫 번째 소논문에서는 투입산 출분석이 적용되어 천연가스 공급 부문의 경제적 파급효과가 분석되었다. 두 번째 소논문에서는 조건부 가치측정법이 적용되어 미이용 산림바이오매스로 생산된 전기에 대한 대중의 선호도가 추정되었다. 첫 번째 소논문은 한국과 일본의 천연가스 공급 부문의 국민경제적 역할 비 교 분석을 통해 시사점을 도출하였다. 경제적 파급효과를 분석하기 위해 천연 가스 공급 부문을 외생화하였으며, 투입산출분석을 사용하였다. 본 논문에서는 수요유도형 모형, 공급유도형 모형, 레온티에프 가격모형을 사용하였다. 우선, 수요유도형 모형을 통해 천연가스 공급 부문의 생산유발효과, 부가가치 유발 효과, 임금유발효과, 취업유발효과가 분석되었다. 분석 결과는 다음과 같다. 한 국과 일본에서의 천연가스 공급 부문의 생산유발효과는 각각 1.7919 및 1.86142이다. 부가가치 유발효과는 한국이 0.20246, 일본은 0.51991으로 추정되 었다. 일본의 생산유발효과와 부가가치 유발효과는 한국의 그것에 비해 각각 1.7배, 2.6배에 달한다. 천연가스 공급 부문의 임금유발효과는 한국 및 일본에 서 각각 0.04674 및 0.01908로 전자가 후자의 2.4배이다. 마지막으로 천연가스 공급 부문의 취업유발효과는 한국 및 일본에서 각각 803.4명 및 1974.6명으로, 후자가 전자의 2.5배이다. 공급유도형 모형을 통한 한국과 일본 천연가스 공급 부문의 공급지장효과는 각각 1.62724 및 0.97915로 전자가 후자보다 1.7배 크 다. 마지막으로 레온티에프 가격모형을 통해 분석된 한국 및 일본에서 천연가 스 공급 부문의 10% 가격 상승이 국가 전체 물가 수준에 미치는 영향은 각각 0.10297% 및 0.03634%로 전자가 후자의 2.8배인 것으로 분석되었다. 두 번째 소논문에서는 화력 발전원으로 만들어진 전기 대신 미이용 산림바 이오매스로 만들어진 전기에 대해 소비자들이 추가적으로 지불하고자 하는 금 액, 즉 추가적인 지불의사액(WTP, willingness to pay)이 규명될 필요가 있다. 이를 위해 본 논문은 1,000가구를 대상으로 설문조사를 진행하였으며, 추가적 인 WTP을 구하는 데 경제학적 진술선호기법인 조건부 가치측정법을 적용하 였다. 그 결과, 기존의 전기 대신 미이용 산림바이오매스로 만들어진 전기에 대한 추가적인 WTP는 약 26.0원/kWh으로 추정되었다. 미이용 산림바이오매스 로 생산된 전기의 총 편익은 352.9원/kWh으로 미이용 산림바이오매스로 생산 된 전기를 최종 소비자에게 공급하는 비용인 177.2원/kWh보다 크다. 따라서, 미이용 산림바이오매스로 전기를 생산하여 공급하는 것은 사회적으로 이익이 된다. &#xD;
주제어 : 천연가스 공급, 투입산출분석, 수요유도형 모형, 공급유도형 모형, 레 온티에프 가격모형, 미이용 산림바이오매스, 조건부 가치측정법, 지불의사액

11469.abstract_en:
Title: Two Essays on Energy Economics and Policy: Role of Natural Gas Supply Sector in the National Economy, Public Preferences for the Electricity Generated from Unused Forest Biomass&#xD;
&#xD;
This dissertation contains two essays. In the first essay, this essay examines the role of the natural gas supply sector in the national economy by applying input-output (IO) analysis to South Korea and Japan, respectively. In the second essay, the contingent valuation (CV) method was employed to estimate the public's preferences for electricity produced from unused forest biomass.&#xD;
The first essay, the economic effects of the natural gas supply sectors of South Korea and Japan are analyzed by applying IO analysis. For this purpose, the natural gas supply sector was exogenized and IO analysis was used. Three models will be applied. They include the demand-, the supply-, and the price-side models. First, the production-inducing effect,  value-added creation effect, wage-inducing effect, and job creation effect in the natural gas supply sector were analyzed through a demand-side model. The analysis results are as follows. The production-induced effects of the natural gas supply sector in South Korea and Japan are 1.7919 and 1.86142, respectively. The value-added creation effects are estimated to be 0.20246 for South Korea and 0.51991 for Japan. The production-inducing effect and value-added creation effect of the Japanese natural supply sector are 1.7 and 2.6 times greater than that of the South Kroean natural supply sector, respectively. The wage-inducing effects of the natural gas supply sector in South Korea and Japan are 0.04674 and 0.01908, respectively, with the former being 2.4 times greater than the latter. Lastly, the job creation effects of the natural gas supply sector in South Korea and Japan are 803.4 and 1974.6, respectively, with the latter being 2.5 times greater than the former. The supply shortage effects in the South Korean and Japanese natural gas supply sectors through the supply-side model are 1.62724 and 0.97915, respectively, which is 1.7 times greater in the former than in the latter. Finally, the impact of a 10% price increase in the natural gas supply sector in South Korea and Japan, analyzed through the price-side model, on the overall national price level is estimated to be 0.10297% and 0.03634%, respectively, with the former being 2.8 times greater than the latter.&#xD;
In the second essay, it is necessary to identify the additional amount consumers are willing to pay for electricity made from unused forest biomass instead of electricity made from thermal power generation sources, that is, additional willingness to pay (WTP). For this purpose, this esassy conducted a survey targeting 1,000 households and applied the contingent valuation method, an economic stated preference approach, to determine the WTP. As a result, the additional WTP for electricity generated from unused forest biomass instead of conventional electricity was estimated to be about KRW 26.0 kWh. The total benefit of electricity produced from unused forest biomass is KRW 352.9 kWh, which is greater than the cost of supplying electricity produced from unused forest biomass to end consumers, which is KRW 177.2 kWh. Therefore, producing and supplying electricity from unused forest biomass is socially beneficial.&#xD;
&#xD;
Keywords: natural gas supply, input-output analysis, demand-side model, supply-side model, price-side model, unused forest biomass, contingent valuation, willingness to pay

11470.abstract_ko:
제 목 : 재생에너지 출력제한 완화를 위한 Power-to-Gas 시행에 대한 대중의 지불의사액&#xD;
&#xD;
정부는 전력계통의 불안정을 보완하고 전력망 부족으로 인해 발생하는 발전 제약 문제를 해결하기 위한 방안으로 섹터커플링의 도입을 고려하고 있다. 특 히 그 중에서도 정부는 잉여전력을 사용하여 수소를 생산하는 Power-to-Gas (P2G)를 도입하고자 한다. 본 연구는 조건부 가치측정법을 적용하여 정부의 P2G 사업에 대한 대중의 지불의사액(WTP, Willingness to pay)을 평가하고자 한다. 이를 위해 전국의 1,000가구를 대상으로 일대일 개별면접을 통한 설문조 사가 시행되었다. 이때 지불수단과 지불의사 유도방법으로는 각각 가구당 연 간 소득세 및 1.5경계 양분선택형이 채택되었다. 또한 1.5경계 및 단일경계 모 형이 적용되어, 두 모형의 추정 결과가 비교되었다. 0의 WTP를 처리하기 위 해 스파이크 모형도 적용되었다. 결과적으로, 단일경계 모형이 적용된 정부의 P2G 사업에 대한 가구당 연평균 WTP는 5,317원으로 추정되었으며 통계적으 로 유의했다. 그 사업에 대한 총 WTP는 연간 1,171억원으로 도출되었으며, 10 년간 발생한 총편익의 현재가치는 2021년 기준 총 9,265억원이다. 본 연구에서 도출한 총편익과 평가 대상 사업에 수반되는 비용을 비교하여 경제성 분석을 수행한 결과 편익/비용 비율은 1.99로 산정된다. 따라서 본 연구에서 평가한 P2G 도입 사업은 경제적 타당성을 확보하는 것으로 나타났다.&#xD;
&#xD;
주제어 : 출력제한, 섹터커플링, Power-to-Gas, 조건부 가치측정법, 지불의사액

11470.abstract_en:
Title: Public Willingness to Pay for Implementing Power-to-Gas for Reducing Energy Generation Curtailment&#xD;
&#xD;
The government is considering sector coupling as a solution to mitigate instability in the power system and address generation constraints due to power grid shortages. Specifically, it intends to adopt Power-to-Gas (P2G) technology to utilize surplus electricity for hydrogen production. This study aims to evaluate the public's willingness to pay (WTP) for the government's P2G initiative by applying the contingent valuation method. A survey was conducted through face-to-face individual interviews with 1,000 households nationwide, using annual household income tax as the payment vehicle and the 1.5-bound dichotomous choice as the elicitation method. Both the 1.5-bound and single-bound models were applied, and their estimation results were compared. The spike model was also used to address zero WTP values. The results indicate that the single-bound model estimated an average annual WTP of 5,317 KRW per household for the government's P2G project, which was statistically significant. The total WTP was estimated at 117.1 billion KRW annually, with the present value of the total benefits over ten years being 926.5 billion KRW (as of 2021). The benefit-cost ratio was calculated at 1.99 based on an economic analysis comparing the total benefits derived from this study to the costs associated with the project. Therefore, the project appears to be economically viable.&#xD;
&#xD;
Keywords: curtailment, sector coupling, Power-to-Gas, contingent valuation method, willingness to pay

11472.abstract_en:
This study focuses on the deployment of advanced metering infrastructure(AMI) and the activation of energy data services, which are emerging as key tasks for improving energy efficiency in the era of accelerating energy transition to achieve carbon neutrality goals. However, in Korea, the installation of AMI has not yet been carried out as planned, and the energy data service market is still in its early stages. Therefore, this study aims to evaluate the economic feasibility of related projects and seek ways to activate them by empirically analyzing consumer acceptance and willingness to pay (WTP) for the AMI deployment project and energy data services.&#xD;
Using the contingent valuation method (CVM), the consumer WTP for the AMI deployment project was estimated to be KRW 5,006 per household per month. This suggests that consumers have high expectations for energy efficiency improvement and cost reduction effects through the establishment of AMI infrastructure. Meanwhile, a cost-benefit analysis was conducted to evaluate the economic feasibility of the AMI deployment project, and the B/C ratio was found to be 1.90, confirming that the economic feasibility of the project is high. In the case of energy data services, a WTP of KRW 2,615 per month was estimated, confirming that consumers have a certain level of willingness to pay for advanced services beyond the current free service level. This suggests the growth potential of the energy data service market and the possibility of paid services in the future.&#xD;
However, there were significant differences in preferences and WTP for AMI deployment and energy data services according to consumer characteristics. While income level had a positive (+) effect on WTP, the number of preschool children or teenage children had a negative (-) effect. These results suggest that a tailored approach considering consumer characteristics is necessary in the process of promoting AMI projects and energy data services. For classes with relatively low WTP, such as low-income households or households with a high burden of child-rearing, support measures should be prepared from the perspective of energy welfare, while for classes with high potential demand, such as high-income households or 1-2 person households, strategies to provide differentiated premium services are required. This study hopes that the above analysis results and policy implications will be used as useful basic data for establishing strategies for promoting AMI projects and activating energy data services.

11478.abstract_en:
The Design of Low-power, Low-noise Amplifier with High Tolerance to Stimulation Artifacts and an Implantable Neurostimulator for Bidirectional Neural Interfaces&#xD;
&#xD;
 Bidirectional neural interfaces play an important role in the diagnosis and treatment of brain-related disorders, and active research is ongoing in this field. This bidirectional neural interface consists of a recording unit that records signals and a stimulator IC that uses the recording results as feedback to adjust stimulation parameters in real time to stimulate the nerve when necessary. This paper proposes a neurostimulator IC with two active charge balancing methods and a charge pump for power management. The recording section contains two amplifiers utilizing chopper modulation technology for local field potential (LFP) signal amplification and separate amplification to distinguish between LFP and action potential (AP) neural signals.&#xD;
 The neurostimulator IC consists of an output current driver, a current steering DAC, a cascode current mirror, a level shifter, two charge balancers, and a charge pump for power management. The nerve stimulator IC was designed using DB-hitek BCDMOS 180-nm process HV MOSFET and standard MOSFET appropriately. The proposed charge balancer uses a comparator, basic logic gate circuit, and D_latch to adjust the anode pulse width to control the residual potential within a safe range. Another charge balancer uses a common mode feedback (CMFB) circuit, commonly found in differential amplifiers, to improve balancing after the initial charge balancing operation. The stimulator requires a variety of external voltages (ground, 5V, 19V, 24V), but applies only a 5V external supply to efficiently generate the required internal voltage using the main and auxiliary charge pumps.&#xD;
 Designed using DB-hitek BCDMOS 180nm technology, the amplification IC consists of a low-noise amplifier (LNA) and a programmable gain amplifier (PGA). Both amplifiers incorporate a common mode cancellation loop (CMCL) circuit to eliminate artifacts created during nerve stimulation. The LNA first-stage structure of both amplifiers focuses on low noise by using an inverter-based current reuse technique, and the LNA second stage has a basic CS amplifier structure and has a wide output range. &#xD;
 The first amplifier focuses on bandwidth and gain control to amplify both LFP and AP signals, and is also designed with low noise. The proposed amplifier can eliminate artifacts up to 1 V, which is the same magnitude as the supply power, through CMCL when large common-mode artifacts enter through simple logic gate circuits and comparator. Additionally, CMCL is designed not to operate when common mode artifacts are not introduced. Power consumption at 1 V supply power is 2.6 μW and has a bandwidth of 0.7 Hz to 10.5 kHz when amplifying all signals, 0.7 Hz to 281 Hz when amplifying LFP signals, and 500 Hz to 10 kHz when amplifying AP signals. At this time, the mid-band gain of all bandwidths is 40dB. Additionally, it is designed to provide additional gains of 1, 2, 5, and 10 times through PGA. The first amplifier has 3.29 μVrms, 1.45 μVrms, and 2.89 μVrms input referred noise when amplifying LFP+AP, LFP, and AP, respectively, depending on the signal when CMCL operates. This amplifier has 2.00 μVrms, 0.9 μVrms, and 1.75 μVrms input referred noise when amplifying LFP+AP, LFP, and AP, respectively, when CMCL is not operating.&#xD;
 The second amplifier is a neural amplifier for LFP. In order to amplify the LFP neural signal with a relatively low frequency, it was designed with a focus on low power and low noise, and the chopper modulation technique was used to further reduce low frequency noise. In addition, a resistance of over 1 GΩ was achieved by using a negative capacitor circuit to address the phenomenon of low input impedance, which is a disadvantage of using a chopper circuit. Power consumption is 0.2 μW from a 1 V supply and the device has a 40 dB mid-band gain over a bandwidth of 0.5 Hz to 265 Hz. Additionally, it can eliminate common mode artifacts of the same magnitude as the supply power and has an input referred noise of 0.89 μVrms.&#xD;
 Finally, the proposed neurostimulator IC occupies a total area of 0.43 mm2  including all buffer circuits and 0.48 mm2 for the first amplifier and 0.26 mm2 for the second amplifier.

11484.abstract_en:
Title: Power Management Strategy for Decentralized DCMG System Using Transition Operations of DC-Bus Voltage&#xD;
&#xD;
This thesis presents a decentralized power flow control strategy (PFCS) that uses transition operation modes to improve the reliability and flexibility of DC microgrids (DCMGs). To ensure power balance and voltage management even in unpredictable circumstances, transition operating modes are presented as an effective means of communication between power units, removing the need for additional digital communication links (DCLs). The power unit that transmits information adjusts the DC-link voltage level during the transition operation modes, and the power unit that receives information constantly monitors the DC-link voltage value and the corresponding time interval. A power unit initiates the transition operation modes to notify all other power units in the DCMG system when uncertain conditions arise in that specific power unit. Both in grid-connected mode and islanded mode, the suggested PFCS can regulate the DC-link voltage at the nominal value under steady-state operation. Additionally, the suggested PFCS greatly improves the reliability of the decentralized DCMG system by effectively managing various uncertainties such as grid availability, wind power fluctuations, battery state-of-charge (SOC) levels, and electricity price fluctuations. Furthermore, to demonstrate the scalability of the DCMG system, an electric vehicle (EV) unit is incorporated into the DCMG system as an additional energy storage system (ESS). The EV units complement the existing battery unit and support DC-link voltage regulation when the SOC level of the battery unit is low. The effectiveness of the proposed PFCS is demonstrated through extensive simulation and experimental results under various scenarios.

11486.abstract_en:
As renewable energy installations proliferate, the need for grid enhancement to integrate the variable nature of renewable power generation becomes increasingly pronounced. This paradigm shift has spurred a significant uptick in research focused on direct current (DC)-based grid infrastructures. Among the various strands of this research, empirical studies on MVDC (Medium-Voltage Direct Current) distribution technology have been prominent. A pivotal aspect of this research involves the thorough examination of plausible grid contingencies, including line and inverter internal faults, necessitating the creation of robust simulation models. The DC systems present a unique challenge when juxtaposed against their alternating current (AC) counterparts, particularly in terms of fault current interruption due to the complexity associated with zero-crossing, thereby accentuating the importance of rapid and precise fault isolation in line systems for maintaining grid stability. Consequently, the formulation of algorithms adept at detecting, discerning, and safeguarding against such incidents is deemed imperative.&#xD;
&#xD;
This paper delineates the process of modeling an inverter using MATLAB/SIMULINK, encompassing a comprehensive discourse on various inverter control methodologies. Utilizing this inverter model, a ±35kV grade Multi-terminal MVDC system simulation is conducted, and fault models pertinent to both line and inverter internal disturbances within the DC framework are developed. The paper further delves into the analysis of fault data, employing Wavelet Transformation for data preprocessing. This preprocessed data is subsequently harnessed to detect and diagnose faults within the system and inverter internals, leveraging artificial intelligence algorithms. To curtail the propagation of faults, the system integrates current limiters (SFCL) and DC circuit breakers (DCCB), aiming to attenuate the spread of such faults.&#xD;
&#xD;
The implications of this research are manifold, particularly in the realm of MVDC system design. The algorithms proposed herein have demonstrated efficacy in diagnosing faults in DC line accidents and inverter internal malfunctions. Notably, fault detection remains viable even subsequent to the attenuation of fault currents, facilitated by the deployment of current limiters. The findings suggest that the proposed algorithmic approach could substantially expedite system recovery in instances of DC system and inverter internal faults. This study is poised to make significant contributions to further research in DC accidents and standards within MVDC systems.&#xD;

11487.abstract_en:
The global demand for renewable energy has been rapidly increasing, leading to the installation of more power electronic devices in existing power infrastructures. Particularly, with the growing interconnection of power grids between countries, the importance of High Voltage Direct Current (HVDC) technology has been highlighted, and the installation of multiple HVDC systems within power grids has been on the rise. In a Multi-infeed HVDC system, each HVDC system must operate independently to transmit specific power. However, due to the characteristics of converter equipment, control interference issues may arise between HVDC systems in the event of accidents. In particular, when accidents occur within HVDC systems, the affected HVDC system enters the Blocking phase and must maintain this phase in the case of severe accidents. In such situations, the bus voltage at the accident location is not restored, and a large fault current continues to flow into the AC system. Failure to control voltage restoration and fault current can affect the operation of other HVDC systems, and if this problem is not consistently addressed, it can lead to an imbalance in the entire power grid.&#xD;
  Therefore, this paper proposes the introduction of Series Braking Resistor (SeBR) equipment to resolve control interference issues between HVDC systems. Considering the need to maintain the Blocking phase when severe accidents occur within HVDC systems, a design is proposed that allows continuous insertion of SeBR. To achieve this continuous SeBR insertion, a two-stage operating algorithm is applied to design the SeBR and an SeBR with an added inductor element is designed to detect a decrease in power grid frequency.&#xD;
  To verify the performance of the proposed SeBR, the actual mainland-Jeju HVDC system in Korea is modeled, and the proposed SeBR is designed based on assumptions of the most severe accident scenarios. Based on this, a comparison is made between the proposed SeBR and the existing SeBR to validate the effectiveness of the proposed design.

11492.abstract_ko:
본 논문에서는 전력 변환 시스템의 효율 향상과 통합 구조의 이점을 극대화하기 위해 Integrated Charging Control Unit (ICCU)를 활용한 On-Board Charger (OBC) 및 Low DC-DC Converter (LDC) 통합 구조를 제안한다. 제안된 구조는 공통 레그를 사용하여 OBC와 LDC를 동시에 동작시켜 시스템 효율을 향상시키고 설계를 간소화하였다. 이를 통해 단일 장치에서 여러 기능을 수행할 수 있어 전체 시스템의 부품 수를 줄이고 제조 및 유지보수 비용을 절감할 수 있다. 또한, 통합 구조를 통해 공간 효율을 높이고 부품 수 감소로 인해 전체 시스템의 크기와 무게를 줄일 수 있었다.&#xD;
 특히, 공통 레그를 활용하여 OBC와 LDC가 동시에 동작하도록 설계함으로써 회로 구조를 단순화하고 스위치 수를 줄였다. 이러한 회로 간소화 및 부품 수 감소는 전력 변환 시 발생하는 손실을 최소화하고 시스템의 전체 효율을 향상시키는 데 기여한다. OBC와 LDC의 동시 동작 시 공통 레그를 사용하는 스위치에서 Zero Voltage Switching (ZVS) 에너지가 더 증가한 것을 확인하였으며, 전체 Root Mean Square (RMS) 전류가 감소하여 전체 시스템에서 도통 손실이 감소되었다. 이로 인해 통합 충전 시스템의 효율이 향상되었다.&#xD;
 또한, LDC 단독 모드에서 발생할 수 있는 이슈를 확인하고 소자의 보호를 위한 동작 및 손실을 최소화할 수 있는 동작 모드를 추가하여 시스템 효율을 더욱 향상시켰다. 본 논문에서는 제안된 ICCU 기반의 OBC-LDC 통합 구조의 동작 방법과 실험 결과를 제시함으로써 전기차용 전력 변환 시스템의 새로운 가능성을 모색한다.

11492.abstract_en:
This paper proposes an integrated structure of the On-Board Charger (OBC) and Low DC-DC Converter (LDC) utilizing the Integrated Charging Control Unit (ICCU) to maximize the efficiency of the power conversion system and the advantages of the integrated structure. The proposed structure improves system efficiency and simplifies design by operating OBC and LDC simultaneously using a common leg. This integration allows multiple functions to be performed within a single device, reducing the number of components in the entire system and lowering manufacturing and maintenance costs. Additionally, the integrated structure enhances space efficiency and reduces the overall size and weight of the system due to the reduction in the number of components.&#xD;
By designing the system to operate OBC and LDC simultaneously using the common leg, the circuit structure is simplified, and the number of switches is reduced. This simplification of the circuit and reduction in the number of components contribute to minimizing the losses that occur during power conversion, thereby improving the overall efficiency of the system. It was confirmed that using the common leg in the switches during the simultaneous operation of OBC and LDC increased Zero Voltage Switching (ZVS) energy, and the overall Root Mean Square (RMS) current was reduced, leading to decreased conduction losses in the entire system. As a result, the efficiency of the integrated charging system was enhanced.&#xD;
Furthermore, issues that could occur in the LDC standalone mode were identified, and operational modes that minimize component protection and losses were added, further improving system efficiency. This paper presents the operation method and experimental results of the proposed ICCU-based OBC-LDC integrated structure, exploring new possibilities for power conversion systems for electric vehicles.

11494.abstract_ko:
기술의 일반적인 추세는 장치 크기의 축소이며 무선 주파수(RF) 시스템 유사한 추세를 따른다. 이는 5G와 차세대 이동통신시스템이 주로 고주파수인 밀리미터파(mmWave) 주파수로 이동되기 때문이다. mmWave 주파수는 장치의 소형화를시킬 수 있을 뿐만 아니라, 보다 높은 통신 속도와 미활용 주파수 대역을 활용할 수있게 하여준다. 현재와 미래에 이러한 것들의 수요는 꾸준히 증가할 것으로 예상된다.&#xD;
배열 안테나는 RF시스템을 mmWave 주파수로의 전환을 실현하는 것 중 주요적인 기술이다. 파장에 따른 안테나 요소의 크기와 거리로 인하여 주파수가 하락할 수록 배열 안테나의 크기가 축소된다. 그리하여, 면적 변경 없이 안테나 수를 증가할 수 있어 대기 감쇠 증가로 인한 손실을 상쇄할 수 있다. 좀더 구체적으로 말하자면, 배열 안테나는 원거리에서 각각 안테나의 방사 패턴이 초점되어 수동적으로 고이득 주엽이 발생한다. 만일 배열 안테나에 재구성 기능을 포함할 수 있다면, 배열 안테나의 적용범위는 더욱 확장된다. 예를 들어 빔조향 또는 편파 제어의 형태로 방사 패턴을 변화할 수 있다. 이를 위하여는 전압이나 전류의 변화에 따라 전기적 특성이 제어되는 부품이나 재료를 추가할 필요가 있다. 몇 가지 사례로 p-i-n 다이오드, 버랙터 다이오드, 빔포머 집적회로, 액정 및 메타물질이 이에 해당한다. 이 논문에서는 S대역(2-4GHz)과 Ka대역(26.5-40GHz)에서 작동하는 재구성 가능한 두 가지 배열 안테나 설계를 제시한다. 이 두 설계 모두 저렴한 RF다이어드를 활용하며, 다층 인쇄 회로 기판(PCB)에 구현되어 상대적으로 저비용이며 얇은형태이다. 이는, 전력 분배기를 기반으로 재구성 가능한 급전 네트워크에서 보여주는 높은 통합성 덕분이다. 또한, Sub-Miniature version A (SMA) 커넥터의 형태로 간편한 인터페이스를 제공한다. &#xD;
S대역 배열 안테나는 편파 제어와 빔조향이라는 두 가지 재구성 기능이 있다. 각 기능은 p-i-n 다이오드와 버랙터 다이오드로 구현된다. 편파 제어는 안테나에서전류의 방향이 p-i-n 다이오드로 유도되며, 이는 수직 및 수평 방향에 대한 두 개의선형 편파를 발생한다. 빔조향은 입력 전력을 각 안테나에 균등하게 분배하는 급전 네트워크에서 구현된다. 빔조향에 필요한 안테나 간의 위상차를 생성하기 위하여 비선형 버랙터는 위상천이기 형태로 구조에 내장되어 있다. &#xD;
Ka대역 배열 안테나는 설계가 마이크로파에서 mmWave 주파수로 전환할 때 발생하는 문제에 대한 해답을 제공한다. 이 논문은 면적이 제한된 Ka대역에서 재구성 가능한 급전 네트워크를 설계할 수 있게 주요 기술 두 가지를 제안한다. 개발된 첫 번째 기술은 위상천이기와 버랙터 다이오드의 수를 25% 줄이는 Intermediate Phase Shifting라는 것이다. 이는 인접한 안테나 간에 위상천이기를 공용함으로써 하나의 위상천이기 단계를 생략하는 기술이다. 두 번째 기술은 Ka대역 급전 네트워크에 있는 버랙터 다이오드의 전압 제어로 인하여 발생하는 문제를 해결한다. 우선, 다른 설계는 lumped element소자를 흔히 활용하나 mmWave 주파수에서는 소자의 패키지 기생으로 인하여 효과적인 사용이 어렵다. 더불어, 위상천이기는 급전 네트워크를 통해 공통 전도 경로를 가지므로 각 위상천이기의 제어 전압이 동일하다. 이 논문에서는 lumped element 소자가 없이 각 위상천이기를 개별적으로 제어할 수 있는 방법을 제시한다. &#xD;
위 두 배열 안테나 모두, 버랙터 다이오드 기반 위상천이기로 구현된 전기적 빔조향 기능을 갖추고 있다. 버랙터 다이오드는 비선형이므로 제어가 까다롭다. 따라서 위상 변화를 특성화 하는 방법을 제시한다. 특성화된 위상 정보는 등식을 기반으로 전압의 계산을 가능하게 하여 예측적으로 버랙터 다이오드를 간편하게 제어할 수 있다.

11494.abstract_en:
The general trend in technology is the decreasing size of devices. This is also true for radio-frequency (RF) systems. For fifth-generation (5G) and future mobile networks, the principal reason is the push to high-frequency millimeter-wave (mmWave) frequencies. In addition to smaller devices, mmWave frequencies offer higher data rates and unoccupied frequency bands. The demand for these is constantly increasing and this trend is expected to continue. &#xD;
Antenna arrays have a key role in realizing this transition to mmWave frequencies. Their size decreases with frequency due to the size and distance of antennas being tied to wavelengths. Smaller size enables the addition of more antenna elements without an increase in footprint which counters the loss from increased atmospheric attenuation. More specifically, antenna arrays passively focus the radiation of each antenna element into a radiation pattern with a high-gain main beam at the far-field distance. &#xD;
Reconfigurability expands the applications of antenna arrays even further. It offers a way to alter the radiation pattern in the form of beam steering or polarization control, for example. This requires the addition of components or materials whose electrical characteristics are controlled with the alteration of voltage or current. Some examples of these are p-i-n diodes, varactors, beam former integrated circuits, liquid crystal, and metamaterials. &#xD;
This dissertation presents two reconfigurable antenna array designs operating in S-band (2 - 4 GHz) and Ka-band (26.5 - 40 GHz), respectively. Both designs are relatively low-cost and low-profile as they utilize affordable components and are implemented on multi-layer printed circuit boards (PCBs). These properties are achieved with a power divider based reconfigurable feed network which enables a high level of integration. They also offer simple interfacing in the form of an sub-miniature version A (SMA) connector. &#xD;
The S-band antenna array has two reconfigurable properties - polarization control and electrical beam steering. These are implemented with p-i-n diodes and varactors, respectively. The polarization control is implemented on the antennas where the direction of the current is guided with the p-i-n diodes. This generates two linear polarization modes to vertical and horizontal direction, respectively. The beam steering is implemented on the feed network that distributes input power equally to each antenna. Non-linear varactors are embedded to the structure in the form of phase shifters which generate a phase difference between antenna elements required for beam steering. &#xD;
The Ka-band antenna array provides insight into the challenges that arise when designs are transferred from microwave to mmWave frequencies. This dissertation provides two critical techniques which make it possible to create a reconfigurable feed network in Ka-band where available footprint is limited. The first technique developed is Intermediate Phase Shifting which reduces the number of phase shifters and varactors by 25%. This is achieved by sharing a phase shifter between adjacent antennas eliminating one phase shifter stage. The second technique addresses the challenge arising from the biasing of varactors in Ka-band feed networks. Firstly, lumped components are commonly used in this but they contain package parasitics that prevent their effective use in mmWave frequencies. Secondly, phase shifters have a common conduction path through the feed network meaning they are in the same voltage potential. This dissertation presents a method to control each phase shifter individually without any lumped components. &#xD;
Both antenna arrays have electrical beam steering, implemented with varactor based phase shifters. Varactors are non-linear components so their control is challenging. Therefore, a way to characterize their phase shift is presented. The characterized phase profile is based on analytical equations providing a straightforward method to control varactors predictably.

11503.abstract_ko:
클라우드 가상 현실(Cloud VR)은 콘텐츠 생성이 클라우드에서 발생하는 VR의 새로운 구현으로, VR 사용자가 일반적으로 테더링된 VR 시스템에 필요한 고사양 컴퓨터에 투자할 필요를 없앴습니다. 그러나 여전히 상당한 지연 시간 지연과 같은 심각한 문제에 직면하여 VR 게임을 할 때 큰 불편을 초래하고 심각한 건강 결과를 초래할 수 있습니다. 연구에 따르면 지연 시간은 사용자가 눈에서 보는 것과 경험하는 동작 사이의 불일치로 인해 시각적으로 유발된 멀미 또는 사이버 멀미의 주요 원인입니다. 뷰포트 시간 왜곡은 사용자가 실제와 인지하는 동작 사이의 불일치를 방지하기 위해 사용됩니다. 그러나 시간 왜곡을 사용하면 투영된 이미지 주변의 픽셀에 대한 정보가 누락되어 검은색 테두리가 생성될 수 있습니다. 실제 뷰포트보다 더 큰 이미지 영역을 렌더링하거나 과도하게 채우는 것은 렌더링을 위한 더 높은 계산 부하를 희생시키면서 문제를 해결할 수 있습니다.&#xD;
&#xD;
본 연구의 첫 번째 파트에서는 최대 300ms의 긴 대기 시간 환경에서 동적 오버필링 알고리즘을 제시하여 오버필링 문제를 해결했습니다. 최대 300ms의 고유 대기 시간으로 인해 Cloud VR에서 발생하는 블랙 보더 문제를 해결하기 위한 예측 알고리즘 설계를 제안했습니다. 이 아이디어는 정규 분포를 따르는 움직임 예측 오류를 활용하여 결과적으로 사용자의 고정 및 뷰포트 영역이 위치한 가장 가능성 있는 방향을 결정할 수 있습니다.&#xD;
&#xD;
연구의 두 번째 부분은 VR 헤드셋의 내장된 관성 센서만을 사용하여 현재 및 미래의 눈 시선을 예측하는 방법을 제시합니다. 눈 추적은 사용자가 고해상도를 응시하고 있는 영역만 낮은 해상도로 렌더링하여 계산 비용을 크게 줄이는 포비티드 렌더링을 가능하게 하기 때문에 특히 차세대 가상 현실(VR)에 대한 수요가 높은 기술입니다. 그러나 기존의 눈 추적 기술은 VR 헤드셋 내에서 눈 근처에 부착된 눈 단위 카메라 하드웨어를 필요로 합니다. 또한 감지된 눈 시선은 카메라 지연 시간, 이미지 처리의 필요성 및 VR 시스템의 기본 지연 시간 때문에 유한한 지연으로 실제 눈 시선을 따릅니다.&#xD;
&#xD;
저희는 머리 추적을 위해 VR 헤드셋에 이미 내장된 관성 센서만을 사용하여 사용자의 미래 눈 시선을 예측하는 눈 추적 솔루션을 제안했습니다. 이를 위해 저희는 세 가지 시계열 회귀 문제를 공식화하여 (1) 과거 머리 방향 데이터를 사용하여 현재 눈 시선, (2) 과거 머리 방향 및 눈 시선 데이터를 사용하여 미래 눈 시선, (3) 과거 머리 방향 데이터만을 사용하여 미래 눈 시선을 예측합니다. 저희는 기계 학습 모델을 사용하여 첫 번째와 두 번째 문제를 해결하고 마지막 문제에 대한 두 가지 솔루션, 즉 2단계 및 단일 단계 접근 방식을 개발합니다.

11503.abstract_en:
Cloud Virtual Reality (VR) is an emerging implementation of VR where content generation occurs in the cloud, eliminating the need for VR users to invest in high-end computers typically required in tethered VR systems. However, it still faces significant challenges, such as considerable latency delays, which can cause major inconvenience when playing VR games and have serious health consequences. Research has shown that latencies are the leading cause of visually induced motion sickness or cybersickness caused by a mismatch between what users see in their eyes and the movements they experience. Viewport time-warping is used to counter the inconsistency between real and perceived motion by the users. However, using time-warping can result in missing information on pixels around the projected image, creating black borders. Rendering a larger image area than the actual viewport or overfilling can solve the problem at the expense of higher computational loads for rendering.&#xD;
&#xD;
The first part of this study addresses the overfilling issue by presenting a dynamic overfilling algorithm in long-latency environments of up to 300ms. We proposed designs of predictive algorithms for combating the black border problem that occurs in Cloud VR due to inherent latency of up to 300 ms. The idea comes from exploiting the motion prediction errors that follow normal distributions, which consequently can determine the most probable orientation in which the fixation and viewport region of the users are located.&#xD;
&#xD;
The second part of the study presents a method for predicting current and future eye gaze by only using built-in inertial sensors of the VR headset. Eye tracking is a technology that is in high demand, especially for next-generation virtual reality (VR), because it enables foveated rendering, which significantly reduces computational costs by rendering only the area at which a user is gazing at a high resolution and the rest at a lower resolution. However, the conventional eye-tracking technique requires per-eye camera hardware attached near the eyes within a VR headset. Moreover, the detected eye gaze follows the actual eye gaze with a finite delay because of the camera latency, the need for image processing, and the VR system's native latency.&#xD;
&#xD;
We proposed an eye-tracking solution that predicts a user’s future eye gaze using only the inertial sensors that are already built into VR headsets for head tracking. To this end, we formulate three time-series regression problems to predict (1) the current eye gaze using past head orientation data, (2) the future eye gaze using past head orientation and eye gaze data, and (3) the future eye gaze using past head orientation data only. We solve the first and second problems using machine learning models and develop two solutions for the final problem: two-stage and single-stage approaches. The two-stage approach for the final problem relies on two machine learning models connected in series, one for the first problem and the other for the second problem. The single-stage approach uses a single model to predict the future eye gaze directly from past head orientation data. We evaluate the proposed solutions based on real eye-tracking traces captured from a VR headset for multiple test players, considering various combinations of machine-learning models.

11505.abstract_ko:
&#xD;
전력계통 안전성 확보를 위해 에너지저장장치(ESS)는 신재생에너지 보급률이 높은 최근 전력계통의 보안 문제를 해결하기 위한 중요한 방안으로 꼽힌다. 본 논문은 LiB와 슈퍼커패시터를 결합한 하이브리드 ESS(HESS)에 초점을 맞추었다. 주파수 조정(Frequency Regulator, FR)은 풍력발전기의 유효전력 변동과 부하변동에 따른 주파수 편차를 줄이는 것이며, 이는 본 논문에서 핵심 전략에 해당한다. FR를 위하여 본 논문에서는 HESS를 이용한 하이브리드 ESS 협력 운영 제어 전략을 제안하였다. 아울러 테스트용 마이크로그리드 시스템에 대해 MATLAB/SIMULINK를 이용한 시뮬레이션을 기반으로 운영 전략(Origin FR과 Slow FR)에 대한 비교 연구를 수행하였다.&#xD;
결과로부터, 원래 FR과 동일한 드루프 상수를 갖는 Slow FR 전략은 주파수 편차 평가를 위한 픽업 주파수로 인해 출력 전력이 더 낮다는 것을 알 수 있다. 출력이 낮기 때문에 원래 FR에 비해 슈퍼커패시터와 LiB의 SOC를 유지한다는 관점에서 느린 FR 전략이 더 효과적으로 판단되었다. Slow FR 전략에서는 에너지 계산을 기반으로 LiB와 SC를 보다 효율적으로 사용하므로 FR용 LiB의 수명 문제를 해결할 수 있다. 여러 기간에 걸쳐 Slow FR 전략은 Origin FR 모델보다 주파수를 더 좋고 더 원활하게 조정할 수 있었으며, ESS의 파라미터 및 제어 방식을 변경을 통해 최저 주파수 개발 및 안정적인 주파수를 확보할 수 있었다. &#xD;

11515.abstract_en:
Resource Adequacy Evaluation and Robust Frequency Control Design for Frequency Stability Improvement in Power Systems with High Renewable Energy Penetration &#xD;
&#xD;
Dwi Riana Aryani&#xD;
Supervisor: Professor Hwachang Song &#xD;
Dept. of Electrical and Information Engineering&#xD;
The Graduate School &#xD;
Seoul National University of Science and Technology &#xD;
&#xD;
This dissertation presents an evaluation of resource adequacy aimed at enhancing fre- quency stability in power systems with high renewable energy (RE) penetration. Addi- tionally, it proposes a robust frequency control scheme that integrates various frequency response (FR) resources, employing a one-step model predictive control (MPC) framework and a discrete-time disturbance observer (DT-DoB). The Jeju Island power system serves as the basis for developing both the system dynamics model and the proposed control strategy in this study. The assessment of resource adequacy for frequency stability post a contingency event is conducted using PSS/E. It is investigated whether the system can still maintain stability when the number of in-service synchronous generators is reduced, which means these generators are replaced by RE generators. It turns out, by adding other inertial sources such as flywheel synchronous condensers (FSCs), system stability can still be maintained even if only one synchronous generator is operating alongside high voltage direct currents (HVDCs) and FSCs. The dynamics model of the system, which can be stabilized under such a configuration, is replicated in MATLAB/Simulink. It is enhanced with additional frequency response (FR) resources to improve system stability, namely a battery energy storage system (BESS) and a virtual synchronous generator (VSG)-type grid forming converter to integrate RE to the system. In addition, a DT-DoB is devised to track variations in load and renewable energy (RE), while a lumped disturbance observer (DOB) is integrated to mitigate tracking errors. Both state estimation and DOBs are incorporated into the MPC-based controller. By leveraging the invariant ellipsoid property to relax terminal constraints, the controller can achieve feasible solutions despite various constraints. Moreover, the proposed frequency control strategy can address parameter uncertainties, thus ensuring stability across diverse system operating conditions.

11517.abstract_ko:
얼굴 형태 변형 공격은 얼굴 인식 시스템(FRS)에 심각한 위협이 되고 있습니다. 등록된 이미지와 신뢰할 수 있는 실시간 캡처를 사용한 얼굴 비형태 변형 방법이 제안되었으며, 이는 변형된 등록된 이미지를 탐지하기 위한 것입니다. 그러나 다양한 형태 변형 방법과 알려지지 않은 변형 매개변수로 인해 비형태 변형 방법의 적용이 어려운 상황입니다. &#xD;
본 논문에서는 딥러닝 비형태 변형 네트워크를 기반으로 한 강력한 얼굴 형태 변형 공격 탐지(FMAD) 방법을 제안합니다. 제안된 탐지 접근법은 얼굴 검증 단계에서 변형된 이미지와 변형되지 않은 이미지 간의 유사성 점수 변화의 차이에서 영감을 받아 다양한 변형 요인을 사용하여 실제 얼굴 이미지와 변형된 얼굴 이미지 간의 유사성 점수 변화 패턴을 학습합니다. 또한 StyleGAN과 pSp(pixel2style2pixel) 인코더를 기반으로 한 효과적인 깊은 비형태 변형 네트워크를 개발했습니다. 이 탐지 방법은 피고의 변형 및 실시간 이미지에서 여러 비형태 변형 요소로부터 비형태 변형된 이미지를 얻어와 ArcFace 네트워크의 특징 벡터 간 유사도 점수를 계산하며, 탐지 네트워크는 결과를 분류합니다. &#xD;
컬러 FERET 및 FRGCv2와 SYS-MAD 데이터셋에서 개발된 형태 변형 데이터셋을 사용한 다양한 실험 및 평가가 수행되었습니다. 형태 변형 공격에는 랜드마크 기반(WebMorph, OpenCV, FaceMorpher)과 딥러닝 기반(MIPGAN-I, MIPGAN-II, 그리고 제안된 pSp 기반 공격)이 포함되었습니다. 결과는 제안된 FMAD 방법이 테스트 얼굴 이미지를 변형된 이미지 또는 정당한(비변형된) 이미지로 고도로 정확하게 분류할 수 있음을 보여줍니다. 이 방법은 등위 오류율(EER)이 3% 미만이며 공격 제시 분류 오류율이 0.1%일 때 약 11%의 정당 제시 분류 오류율을 달성하여 이전 연구보다 우수한 성과를 거두었습니다.&#xD;

11517.abstract_en:
Face morphing attacks have become a serious threat to Face Recognition Systems (FRS). The face de-morphing method using a registered image and a trusted live capture has been proposed for detecting morphed registered images. However, the diversity of morphing methods and unknown morphing parameters make the application of de-morphing methods challenging.&#xD;
This thesis proposes a robust Face Morphing Attack Detection (FMAD) method based on deep learning de-morphing networks. Inspired by the differences in similarity score variations between morphed and non-morphed images during the face verification stage, the proposed detection approach learns the change patterns of similarity scores between live and de-morphed face images with different de-morphing factors. I have also developed an effective deep de-morphing network based on StyleGAN and the pSp (pixel2style2pixel) encoder. The detection method obtains de-morphed images from suspect and live images with multiple de-morphing factors and calculates similarity scores between the feature vectors from ArcFace network, and the detection network classifies the results.&#xD;
Various experiments and evaluations were conducted on morphing datasets developed from two popular databases, the Color FERET and FRGCv2, as well as the SYS-MAD dataset. The morphing attacks include landmark-based ones (WebMorph, OpenCV, FaceMorpher) and deep learning ones (MIPGAN-I, MIPGAN-II, and the proposed pSp-based attack). The results demonstrate that the proposed FMAD method can classify test face images as morphed or bona fide (non-morphed) with a high level of accuracy. It achieves an Equal Error Rate (EER) of less than 3% and a Bona Fide Presentation Classification Error Rate of approximately 11% at Attack Presentation Classification Error Rate of 0.1%, outperforming previous works.

11519.abstract_ko:
스마트 팩토리 자율 이동로봇을 위한 효율적인 UWB 거리측정 기반 위치추정 및 매핑&#xD;
Bach Sy Hung&#xD;
(지도교수 이수영)&#xD;
전기정보 공학과&#xD;
일반대학원&#xD;
서울과학기술대학교&#xD;
사물인터넷 (IoT)의 확장은 스마트 공장 개발에 상당한 발전을 가져왔다. 자율 이동로봇 (AMR)은 공장 자동화에 핵심적인 역할을 수행하지만, GPS가 없는 실내 환경에서 정확한 지도 작성 및 위치 확인에 어려움을 겪고 있다. 기존의 실내 위치추정 시스템 (IPS)은 높은 비용과 복잡한 공장 환경 때문에 실제 적용에 한계가 있다. 따라서 정확성과 경제성을 동시에 높일 수 있는 방법이 필요하다. 초광대역 (UWB) 기술은 다중 경로 현상을 최소화하고, 높은 정확도의 거리 측정이 가능하며, 합리적인 비용으로 측정 거리를 확장할 수 있다는 장점이 있다. AMR을 위한 정확한 지도 작성 및 위치 추정을 위해 UWB를 적용하는 새로운 방법을 개발하는 것은 유망한 연구 분야이며, 본 논문의 초점이다.&#xD;
본 논문의 주요 기여점은 다음과 같다:&#xD;
1) 제약 조건이 있는 최소 제곱 삼변측량 (CLST) 방법을 제안하여 복잡한 공장과 같은 비우호적인 환경에서의 기하학적 정밀도 저하 문제를 완화하고, 경로 추종 정확도를 향상시킨다.&#xD;
2) 잔차 (Residual) 기반 앵커 선택 (RAS) 알고리즘을 제안하여 비가시선 (NLOS) 현상을 해결하며, 정적 및 동적 환경에서 신뢰할 수 있는 위치 추정 방법을 제안한다.&#xD;
3) UWB 거리 측정을 통해 AMR의 위치를 추정하기 위한 전역 UWB 시스템 (GUS)을 제안한다. 고정밀 위치 추정을 위해 측정 과정에 기준선 (Baseline) 제약조건을 포함시킨 Baseline 제약 확장 칼만 필터(BC-EKF)를 제시한다.&#xD;
4) 삼변측량 UWB 태그 (TUT)를 사용한 동시 위치추정 및 매핑 (SLAM) 접근법을 통해 AMR의 위치추정과 천장의 알려지지 않은 위치에 장착된 UWB 센서들의 실시간 지도를 작성한다. 이를 위해 제안된 CLS-EKF SLAM 알고리즘은 초기 앵커 위치 추정에 있어서의 시간지연을 극복하면서 거리 및 방위 추정의 정확도를 향상시킬 수 있다.

11519.abstract_en:
Title: Effective Localization and Mapping for Autonomous Mobile Robots Based on Ultrawideband Ranging in Smart Factory.&#xD;
&#xD;
In recent years, with the explosion of the Internet of Things (IoT), developing smart factories has become more realistic and achieved much progress. For the factory to operate automatically from end to end, the autonomous mobile robot (AMR) is essential to connect discrete production stages in a smart factory. However, accurate mapping and localization remain the fundamental challenges with AMR, especially in indoor environments where the global positioning system (GPS)-denied areas. Numerous studies have addressed the indoor positioning system (IPS) problem, utilizing a variety of internal and external sensors or a combination of both. However, these approaches often exhibit drawbacks such as high costs or an inability to function effectively in challenging factory environments. Therefore, an optimal solution for IPS is essential that may be balancing both accuracy and cost-effectiveness. In response to these challenges, ultrawideband (UWB) technology offers several advantages, including minimizing the multipath phenomena, high-accuracy measurement, extended measuring distances, and cost-effectiveness. For these reasons, designing new methods that can apply UWB to solve the problem of accurate mapping and positioning for AMR implementation is an exciting endeavor, and it is the expanding goal of this dissertation. &#xD;
&#xD;
In recent years, with the explosion of the Internet of Things (IoT), developing smart factories has become more realistic and achieved much progress. For the factory to operate automatically from end to end, the autonomous mobile robot (AMR) is essential to connect discrete production stages in a smart factory. However, accurate mapping and localization remain the fundamental challenges with AMR, especially in indoor environments where the global positioning system (GPS)-denied areas. Numerous studies have addressed the indoor positioning system (IPS) problem, utilizing a variety of internal and external sensors or a combination of both. However, these approaches often exhibit drawbacks such as high costs or an inability to function effectively in challenging factory environments. Therefore, an optimal solution for IPS is essential that may be balancing both accuracy and cost-effectiveness. In response to these challenges, ultrawideband (UWB) technology offers several advantages, including minimizing the multipath phenomena, high-accuracy measurement, extended measuring distances, and cost-effectiveness. For these reasons, designing new methods that can apply UWB to solve the problem of accurate mapping and positioning for AMR implementation is an exciting endeavor, and it is the expanding goal of this dissertation.&#xD;
&#xD;
Firstly, to design the path planning of the AMR toward a specific target, it is imperative to determine the accurate position of the target. Trilateration-based solutions for IPS stand out as the most prevalent and widely adopted method due to their computational efficiency and straightforward implementation. However, the accuracy of trilateration diminishes significantly with an increase in the geometric dilution of precision (GDOP) value, especially in dense environments such as factories, where reducing GDOP is a challenging task. To address this challenge, we present a novel solution termed constrained least-squares trilateration (CLST) for IPS. This approach achieves high positioning performance with efficient computations even in high GDOP conditions. The efficacy of the proposed method is substantiated through simulations and experiments, demonstrating its robust positioning capabilities.&#xD;
&#xD;
Secondly, the non-line-of-sight (NLOS) phenomenon introduces a significant positive bias error in distance measurements, severely degrading the positioning performance of the IPS. Therefore, we propose a novel residual-based anchor selective (RAS) algorithm for IPS that maintains high accuracy even under NLOS conditions. The RAS algorithm relies solely on measured ranges from tags to anchors at each time instance to exclude NLOS measurements, ensuring reliable positioning in static and dynamic environments. The effectiveness of the proposed method is evaluated through simulations and experiments.&#xD;
&#xD;
Thirdly, to effectively control the AMR along the planned path, it is imperative to accurately update information about the AMR's pose, including its position and heading angle, in real time. Unlike target localization, where only required position information suffices, AMR localization requires additional critical details about the heading angle. Consequently, we introduce a high-accuracy localization system known as the global UWB system (GUS) for AMR, leveraging UWB distance measurements. Utilizing two UWB modules (tags) affixed to the AMR, this system enables simultaneous estimation of both position and heading angle. We propose a novel tightly coupled algorithm named the baseline constraint extended Kalman filter (BC-EKF). The baseline, representing the actual distance between the two tags, is used as a constraint in the measurement process. The relationship between the baseline and heading angle error is analyzed to ensure optimal tag deployment. The proposed localization method exhibits persistence even as the GDOP value increases. This attribute enhances the method's performance in confined workspaces with a limited number of fixed UWBs (anchors). Simulation and experimental results validate the robust localization performance of the proposed method.&#xD;
&#xD;
In the previous section, the localization methods assumed a predetermined knowledge of anchor positions. However, this assumption proves overly optimistic considering both measurement technology constraints and practical scenarios. Hence, we introduce a solution based on simultaneous localization and mapping (SLAM) to localize an AMR and construct a map of UWB sensors mounted at unknown positions on the ceiling (anchors). Delays in the initial positioning of anchors are common in UWB sensor-based SLAM due to the absence of bearing information. To address this delay issue, we propose a system consisting of three UWB sensors, referred to as the trilateration UWB tags (TUT), attached to the AMR. The TUT system enables simultaneous estimation of range and bearing for each anchor during the initial observation via three distance measurements. We introduce the constrained least-squares (CLS) algorithm to enhance the accuracy of range and bearing estimates. These estimates then serve as observational measurements for EKF-based SLAM, leading to the proposed CLS-EKF SLAM algorithm. The performance of the proposed algorithm is analyzed and demonstrated through simulations and experiments.

11521.abstract_ko:
무전원 무선 SAW 온도센서를 위한 소형 안테나 설계&#xD;
Sreang Naranut (스래앙 나라눗)&#xD;
(지도교수: 정재영 부교수)&#xD;
전기정보공학과&#xD;
일반대학원&#xD;
서울과학기술대학교&#xD;
&#xD;
전기 장비의 설치 과정이나 자연적인 노화 과정에서 발생하는 발열 문제는 시스템의 전체 성능에 상당한 위험을 초래한다. 높은 온도는 재료의 열화를 일으키고 효율성을 저하시키며 결국 시스템 고장으로 이어질 수 있다. 이러한 문제는 전기 장비에만 국한되지 않으며 데이터 센터, 산업 기계 및 재생 에너지 시스템 등 다른 분야에도 영향을 미친다. 이러한 응용 분야에서 과열은 운영 중단 및 비용이 많이 드는 다운타임을 초래할 수 있다. 따라서 지속적인 온도 모니터링 시스템의 구현이 중요하다. 이러한 장치는 온도 이상을 신속하게 식별하여 적시 유지 보수를 가능하게 하고 정전이나 기타 재앙적인 결과를 방지하는 데 도움을 준다. 이러한 모니터링 기술은 여러 산업에서 주요 인프라의 신뢰성, 효율성 및 내구성을 향상시켜 최적의 작동 온도를 유지한다.&#xD;
최근 무선 SAW 온도 센서는 산업 모니터링, 항공우주, 의료, 소비자 전자 제품 및 안전 분야 등 여러 산업에서 광범위하게 사용되고 있다. SAW 센서는 외부 전원 공급 없이도 뛰어난 감도, 내구성 및 어려운 조건에서도 작동할 수 있는 능력 덕분에 널리 사용된다. 이러한 장치는 소형화된 크기와 정밀한 실시간 데이터 제공 능력 덕분에 중요한 작업에 적합하다. 또한, 안정성과 신뢰성이 보장되어 높은 위험이 따르는 산업에서도 일관된 성능과 안전을 보장한다.&#xD;
이 연구는 SAW 센서 특성의 전송을 향상시키고 915 MHz 작동 주파수에서 무선 SAW 센서 시스템의 소형화를 달성하기 위해, 본 연구에서는 SAW 센서 인터로게이션 시스템의 핵심 구성 요소의 개발 및 실질적 검증을 보여준다. 크기가 각각 0.055λ와 0.015λ인 두 가지 유형의 소형 헬리컬 안테나, 원통형 헬리컬 안테나(CHA) 및 반구형 헬리컬 안테나(HSHA)가 제안되었다. 이러한 안테나는 무선 수동 온도 감지 응용 프로그램의 효과를 개선하기 위해 915 MHz에서 작동하도록 축소되었다. 제안된 안테나 설계는 일반 모드 원통형 및 반구형 헬리컬 안테나이다. 이러한 안테나는 902MHz에서 928 MHz까지의 ISM 대역에 맞게 특별히 제작되었다. 시뮬레이션 및 테스트 결과, 제안된 소형 안테나가 작동 대역에서 우수한 반사 손실 성능을 나타내며,&#xD;
CHA 모델에서는 30 MHz, HSHA 모델에서는 22 MHz의 작동 대역폭을 -10 dB에서 제공하는 것으로 나타났다. 이러한 안테나를 SAW 센서와 통합하여 30°C에서 90°C 까지의 온도 범위에서 성능을 검증하였다. 이번 테스트는 시스템의 성능에 온도가 미치는 영향을 확인하기 위해 수행되었으며, 특히 공진 주파수와 반환 손실, 안테나 시스템의 수신 전력 측면에서의 영향을 확인하였다.

11524.abstract_en:
Human beings are born with a variety of desires, and these desires have a considerable influence on individual behaviors and decisions. Desires appear in a variety of ways, including physiological, social, and psychological characteristics, leading humans to participate in behaviors to satisfy them.&#xD;
&#xD;
 Human desires, from a societal standpoint, can help to improve the quality of life for both individuals and communities. The unrestrained expansion of infinite desires, on the other hand, might lead to social concerns. The birth of Yang Dolly, the first cloned mammal, is an instructive example of somatic cell replication. While the capacity to replicate living beings created new opportunities in medical sectors such as personalized medicine, organ transplantation from cloned animals, and advances in genetic disease therapies, Dolly's cloning triggered a wide range of societal and ethical questions.&#xD;
&#xD;
 Our civilization controls these bad features through a variety of techniques. Social control manifests itself in the form of norms and frameworks, which are required to counteract and govern the unregulated spread of negative impulses.&#xD;
&#xD;
 Appetite, sexual desire, sleep, the need for prosperity, and the need for recognition are all common human drives. Researchers hope to illustrate the intrinsic characteristics of desires by conveying the endless nature of basic desires through the biological phenomena of proliferation. As a result, employing the picture of a hemisphere experiencing proliferation, this work figuratively reflects the biological proliferation of cellular division processes.&#xD;
&#xD;
 Using metaphorical visual representations, this study seeks to explain human impulses and social control.

11525.abstract_ko:
산업혁명 이후 오늘날에 이르러 인간은 기계생산 방식으로 재료를 쉽게 지배하여 가공할 수 있어서, 재료의 유기적 속성이나 본래 성향과 관계없는 형태로 만들어진 공산품이 보편화 되었다. &#xD;
 연구자는 이러한 점에 직면하여 기계적 공정이 요구하는 효율적이고 보편적 기준으로부터 벗어나고자 하였다. 공예가는 형태를 실물로 만드는 창의적인 작업의 과정을 통해 상상력의 한계를 확장하며 재료에 개입한다. &#xD;
 이를 위해서는 재료가 가진 고유의 특성, 즉 물성을 정확히 파악하고 이를 적절히 다루기 위한 연구와 시도가 선행되어야 연구자 고유의 조형언어를 습득할 수 있다고 판단하였다.&#xD;
본 연구의 목적은 다음과 같다. 현대예술에서 재료의 물질성은 표현방식에 따라 의도적으로 소거되기도 하고 조형언어로서 적극적으로 사용되기도 한다. 이러한 표현방식 중 연구자는 물성이 변화하는 순간으로부터 발생된 움직임을 포착하는 방법을 사용하고자 한다. 이를 통해 작업과정에서 물성이 변화한 흔적이 시각적으로 어떻게 인식되는지에 대하여 고찰하였다. &#xD;
작품연구 방법은 다음과 같이 진행하였다. 첫째, 표현매체로서 물성이 현대예술에서 어떤 의미로 변화되어 왔는지에 대해 고찰한다. 둘째, 일반적인 기(器)의 형태와 구조를 중심으로 상, 하부로 나누어 하나의 작품안에서 물성이 변화되는 과정을 시각적으로 구현하기 위해 가변적 구조를 고찰한다. &#xD;
본 연구를 통해 도자매체에서 물성은 동시대성을 포함하고 있음을 인지하였고 일반적인 기(器)의 형태를 변형, 왜곡함으로서 연구자의 작업을 통해 수용자에게 어떻게 인식되는지에 대해 고찰할 수 있었다. 연구자는 본 연구에서 물레성형으로 만 국한된 물성을 표현한 연구이지만 다양한 도자기법으로부터 파생된 가변적 구조를 통해 다양한 가능성을 제시할 수 있을 것으로 기대한다.

11525.abstract_en:
This study is a reflection on how moments lead to extended thinking about the media through actions. Since the Industrial Revolution, humans have been able to easily control and process materials through machine production methods. Industrial products made in a form unrelated to the organic properties or original tendencies of materials have become common. In the face of this, the researcher seeks to deviate from the efficient and universal standards required by mechanical processes. Craftsmen expand the limits of imagination and intervene in materials through creative work processes that transform shapes into real objects. At this time, researchers want to directly intervene in a material and at the same time show the properties of the material. As a result of countless implementations, I would like to express this with hands with intent and purpose.&#xD;
&#xD;
The reason why researcher began to use the physical properties of materials as a formative language for their works was the unconscious desire to materialize shapes. This is because researchers can acquire their own modeling language only when research and attempts to accurately grasp the unique characteristics of materials, namely physical properties, precede them.Here, researcher try to capture movements that occur from a certain moment when physical properties change. Through this, we examine how the traces of changes in physical properties are visually perceived during the work process. &#xD;
&#xD;
In modern art, the materiality of materials may be intentionally erased depending on how they are expressed in a formative language or actively used. This is possible because the material has basic properties as a substance and expresses them in any form.&#xD;
&#xD;
Ultimately, in this study, researcher want to express the process of physical properties changing around the shape of traditionally deformed and developed vessels in a variable structure with upper and lower parts combined.

11526.abstract_en:
This study is a ceramic sculpture that combines and expresses the physical properties of cloth, which is a fiber material. &#xD;
 In other words, by combining the physical properties of ceramic materials and the formability of cloth, it aims to create artistic works of various physical phenomena that appear through cloth.&#xD;
 The process of exploring the physical properties of cloth and ceramic media and combining the properties of two different materials can lead to an unexpected form of coincidence. This is a key role in the process of this study, and it is expected to play an extended role as a new sculpture.&#xD;
 Pottery is hard, but fragile and fragile, and this contradiction can be seen as a result of the process of integrating physical phenomena found in other materials as materials that inspire vision, consciousness, and thinking.&#xD;
 His study focuses on the physical properties of ceramics and fabrics, compares the physical phenomena between fabrics made of ceramic materials and actual fabrics, and explores the accidental form and the difference between the two materials. &#xD;
  I want to discover a new art language by combining physics phenomena and ceramic art. &#xD;
 Hese studies are expected to contribute to developing new artistic languages and forms and enriching cultural content and artistic value.

11527.abstract_ko:
제 목 : 외상 후 성장을 주제로 한 도자조형 연구&#xD;
-탈피 이미지를 중심으로-&#xD;
&#xD;
  인간의 내면 성장은 다양한 경험을 통해 이루어진다. 긍정적 경험과 부정적 경험을 모두 수용해야 온전한 내면 성장이 가능하다. 간혹 부정적 경험은 심리적 외상(Psychological Trauma)으로 이어질 수 있으며, 극복하지 못할 경우 외상 후 스트레스 장애(PTSD)로 발전하기도 한다. 장애로 발전되지 않기 위해서는 외상 후 성장이라는 과정이 필요하다. &#xD;
&#xD;
  외상 후 성장을 은유적으로 표현하기 위해, 연구자는 탈피라는 생물학적 현상을 이미지로 사용하고자 한다. 본 연구는 동물의 탈피 과정을 중심으로 외상 후 성장을 탐구하고 이를 도자 조형으로 표현하는 것을 목적으로 한다.&#xD;
&#xD;
  연구 방법은 다음과 같다. 첫째, 외상 후 성장에 대해 조사하고, 조형적 표현에 사용할 이미지를 탐구하였다. 둘째, 다양한 탈피의 종류와 특성을 조사하여 외상 후 성장을 조형적으로 표현하기에 적합한 탈피 이미지를 선정하였다. 셋째, 외상 후 성장과 탈피 이미지 간의 연관성을 탐구하고 원형 실린더 형태로 형상화하였다.&#xD;
&#xD;
  본 연구의 결과는 다음과 같다. 첫째, 탈피 과정을 이미지화하여 조형적으로 표현함으로써 행동을 이미지화할 수 있음을 확인하였다. 둘째, ‘탈피’라는 개념을 통해 외상 후 성장을 은유적이고 조형적으로 표현할 수 있음을 확인하였다. 셋째, 동일한 형태에서 다양한 행위의 결과를 통해 행위의 확장 가능성과 의미, 상징성을 강조할 수 있었다. 넷째, 손의 행위로 흙의 구멍, 찢어짐, 늘어남 등을 사용하여 심리적 극복과정을 형태적으로 전달할 수 있음을 확인하였다. 이는 도자 조형 연구의 새로운 방법론을 제시하며, 외상 후 성장을 시각적으로 표현함으로써 외상 후 스트레스를 극복하는 개인들에게 위로와 응원을 전달하는 역할을 할 수 있을 것으로 기대된다.

11527.abstract_en:
Inner growth in humans is achieved through a variety of experiences. True inner growth is possible only by embracing both positive and negative experiences. Negative experiences can occasionally lead to psychological trauma, which, if not overcome, may develop into Post-Traumatic Stress Disorder (PTSD). To prevent this development, a process known as post-traumatic growth is necessary.&#xD;
&#xD;
  To metaphorically represent post-traumatic growth, this study uses the biological phenomenon of molting. The aim of this study is to explore post-traumatic growth through the molting processes of animals and express it in ceramic art.&#xD;
&#xD;
  The research methods are as follows: First, the researcher investigated post-traumatic growth and explored images to be used in sculptural expression. Second, various types and characteristics of molting were examined to select suitable molting images for representing post-traumatic growth sculpturally. Third, the relationship between post-traumatic growth and molting images was explored and materialized into a cylindrical form.&#xD;
&#xD;
  The results of this study are as follows: First, it was confirmed that behavior can be visualized through sculptural representation by imaging the molting process. Second, the concept of "molting" could metaphorically and sculpturally express post-traumatic growth. Third, the results of various actions from the same form emphasized the potential for extension, meaning, and symbolism of these actions. Fourth, the acts of making holes, tearing, and stretching the clay with hands could convey the psychological overcoming process in a tangible form. This study proposes a new methodology in ceramic sculptural research and is expected to offer comfort and encouragement to individuals overcoming post-traumatic stress by visually expressing post-traumatic growth.

11530.abstract_en:
A Study on the Technique of Ceramic Expression with the Repulsion of Water and Oil &#xD;
The phenomenon of two objects pushing each other is called repulsion in physics, and representative examples are water and oil. Marbling and lithography are techniques that artistically utilize this repulsion effect. The marbling technique uses the properties of water and oil and involves dropping oil paint on water and letting the resulting pattern absorb onto the paper. Lithography, a flat plate process, uses the chemical action of the limestone surface to separate the water and oil layers to create an image. Accordingly, the researcher seeks to expand and express the repulsion phenomenon that occurs in a plane into a three-dimensional solid object. Using Ebru, one of the marbling techniques, and the lithography technique, drop oil mixed with high-fire pigments on the water in the tank to cause repulsion of water and oil. This study aims to explore the possibilities of ceramic expression technique by absorbing the moment of repulsion using absorbency, which is a physical property of ceramics.&#xD;
Research on the work was conducted in the following ways. First, experiments were performed on different types of oil to try to mix high-fire pigments with oil. Second, to analyze the diffusion power of pigments and oil according to the water area, the concentration and pattern of the mixture compared to the water area are tested. Third, experiments were conducted on several types of clay for ceramics and firing temperature to adsorb the mixed pigment using the absorbency of ceramic bodies. Fourth, a video was taken to record the repulsion phenomenon of water and oil.&#xD;
The results of this study are as follows. First, multiple printing was possible using the absorbency of ceramic bodies, and through numerous adsorptions through firing, overlapping patterns could be combined rather than just repeated. Second, the pattern formed using the water tank structure could be applied to both flat and three-dimensional objects, and the pattern could be expressed in various ways even with the same mixed pigment due to the contact point of the ceramics and the absorbency of ceramic bodies. Third, by adsorbing accidental patterns, the possibilities of ceramic decoration techniques were expanded, and it was possible to express them as works that capture a single moment and record traces in the flow of time.&#xD;
In the future, the goal is to break away from shapes limited to hexahedrons and apply them to curved surfaces and organic shapes, utilizing the advantages of the Ebru technique and lithography technique suggested in this study, and expanding to a ceramic expression technique that records and turns patterns into works of art.

11531.abstract_en:
A Study on Formative Ceramics Using the Principle of a Body of Revolution -Focusing on the Wheel Throwing Technique-&#xD;
This study was inspired by the widespread use of rotation-based mechanical technology that mankind has developed step by step, and the purpose is to produce ceramic sculptures based on the principle of a revolving body using the rotation of a potter's wheel.&#xD;
Today, revolution-based mechanical technology that quickly molds or refines clay and plaster using various potter's wheels is helpful in ceramics. The researcher sheds light on the theme of revolution and rotation axis elements of the potter's wheel used in creating a work of art. Breaking away from the conventional perception that sophisticated potter's wheel molding is merely a technique for quickly and efficiently producing consistent shapes, a new perspective, and approach is presented as a means of formative language expression.&#xD;
The study was conducted in the following manner. First, an axisymmetric geometric form is derived using the mathematical principles of revolving bodies. Second, clay molding is done by hand on a potter's wheel without using a separate mold during production. Third, by applying the principle of a revolving body, it is manufactured in a characteristic form that allows the direction of revolution to be guessed depending on whether there is a rotating axis.&#xD;
This study used the revolution of a potter's wheel to produce a ceramic sculpture that applied the principle of an rotating body. To this end, the entire production process from molding to completion was carried out on a revolving potter's wheel. As a result, the following results were derived. First, designing and producing a stable, symmetrical shape on a revolving potter's wheel was possible. Second, the types of geometric structures that can be derived by molding using hands and a potter's wheel with a rotation axis perpendicular to the ground were confirmed. Third, by limiting the form of the work to a structure using the principle of a rotating body, the researcher was able to break away from the customary method of forming objects and treat ‘revolution’ itself, which was previously recognized as a means in the field of ceramics, as a subject.&#xD;
By studying the definition and principles of symmetrical geometric, three-dimensional figures called bodies of rotation, an effective form that could emphasize revolution and the axis of revolution, which are critical elements of the work, was derived.&#xD;
Future research is expected to expand the possibility of deriving shapes so that one object can have axes of rotation in multiple directions and that richer formative expressions will be possible through works such as display methods that connect multiple units.

11534.abstract_en:
This study aims to express the harmonious integration of the external and internal aspects through ceramic sculpting, initiated by keywords derived from the imbalance between these two realms. Humans, as social beings, acquire cultural and social systems, establishing societal order. Within this context, individuals frequently experience conflicts between reason and emotion. Ideally, the rational, socially-oriented external aspect and the emotional, unique internal aspect should coexist in balance. However, societal demands for order, culture, and obligations often disrupt this balance, leading to negative emotions and psychological states such as loss of self and self-deprecation. Consequently, individuals must continually engage in self-reflection to achieve a harmonious balance and coexistence between the external and internal aspects.This research employs the structural characteristics of nets to represent these external and internal aspects. While nets serve to delineate regions, unlike walls, they do not completely segregate these areas. The systematic and repetitive structure of nets, with their perforations, facilitates the circulation of sensory elements like air and sound, allowing for simultaneous perception of the areas beyond. By leveraging these characteristics, this study aims to symbolize the two domains of a person—the external and internal aspects—through the structural properties of nets. The research progresses with a focus on the author's external and internal aspects as follows: First, the structural characteristics of nets and their visual features are examined. Second, methodologies for expressing an individual’s external and internal aspects are investigated. Third, the identified features are integrated with the structural characteristics of nets to manifest the author’s external aspect. Fourth, starting from the imbalance of the internal aspect, keywords are derived and materialized using the texture and color contrast of ceramics, as well as installation techniques.&#xD;
The following results were obtained: First, the characteristic of nets allowing simultaneous perception effectively conveys the sense of space and &#xD;
transparency, demonstrating its efficacy as a medium for representing the dual domains derived from an individual. Second, ceramic expression techniques were categorized into regular and irregular forms based on an analysis of the external and internal characteristics. This facilitated diverse visual and textural contrast effects within the medium of ceramics, without resorting to other media. Third, the themes and messages of the researcher’s work, originating from the imbalance between the external and internal aspects, are 'expression' and 'fracture.' Although these themes originate from the negative concept of imbalance, they embody the will to overcome it. By expressing these themes through visual art and ceramic works, the study proposes a positive harmony of the two domains through composition and installation research.

11535.abstract_ko:
제 목 : 다면체 유닛의 조합을 응용한 도자 조형 연구 &#xD;
 기하학적 형태는 모든 사물 형태의 기본이 되며 특히 점·선·면은 가장 기본적인 구성 요소들이다. 이들을 이해함으로서 3차원 도형들은 합리적이고 효율적으로 활용할 수 있으며 각 도형간의 결합에 따라 더 복잡한 구조로 발전시킬 수 있다. &#xD;
 본 연구에서는 기하도형과 사물 간의 관계를 고찰함에 따라 다면체에 대해 탐구하고 다면체의 기하학적 요소를 바탕으로 2차원, 3차원적 공간에서의 형태 변형을 통해 다면체 유닛을 개발하는 실험적 시도를 하였다. 특히 정형적 형태보다 비정형적 다면체를 통해 보다 넓은 형태의 가능성을 보여주고자 하였다. 그리고 개발된 입체 유닛들을 조합 방식에 따라 결합하여 기하학적 형태가 확장될 수 있는 단위집합체를 구성함으로서, 조형성 및 장식성을 표현하는 것을 연구 목적으로 한다. &#xD;
  연구 방법은 크게 평면유닛의 제작과정과 입체유닛의 제작과정으로 나뉘는데, 다음과 같다. 첫째, 효과적인 입체유닛을 도출하기 위해 가상공간에서 2D도형의 형태를 변형하여 경우의 수를 도출한다. 변형 방법은 다각형의 치수, 내각의 크기, 변의 곡률 변화를 통해 이루어진다. 둘째, 도출된 2D도형은 x축, y축, 사선 축의 방향에 따라 2-3가지 조합으로 결합한다. 그리고 각 도형은 z축 방향으로 돌출시켜 입체구조로 변환시킨다. 셋째, 각 다면체 유닛들을 조합하여 하나의 연속적인 단위체로 구성할 때, 시각적 긴장감을 극대화하기 위해 꼭짓점과 모서리의 배치를 고려하여 조합한다. &#xD;
 본 연구를 통한 결론은 다음과 같다. 첫째, 2D평면에서 변형하고 조합한 다각형 유 닛의 경우의 수를 통해 유닛의 너비와 높이 차이가 강조된 형태, 리듬감이 표현된 비 정형적 형태, 예측 불가하며 변칙적인 배열을 가진 형태 등 생동감 있는 조형성을 탐구할 수 있었다. 둘째, 개발한 다면체 유닛들을 조합함에 따라 기존의 기하학이거나 유기적인 형태를 포함한 양면적인 다면체 형태를 탐구할 수 있었다. 셋째, 다면체 유닛간의 조합 방식을 통해 단위체를 통한 전체적 구성과 세부적인 패턴을 모색할 수 있었으며, 시지각적 측면에서 가변이 가능한 형태 변화를 표현할 수 있었다. 이처럼 다면체 유닛은 조합 방식에 따라 유닛과 유닛 사이의 간극을 극대화하고 무한한 확장 가능성을 내포할 수 있으며 그 외에도 접합, 배치 등의 변수를 바탕으로 도자 조형 연구에 적합하다고 판단된다. 향후 유닛의 변형과 조합에 대한 더 심층적인 연구가 이루어진다면 도자 조형 뿐만 아니라 제품에도 활용될 수 있을 것이다.

11535.abstract_en:
Geometrical forms are the basis of all object forms, and in particular, points, lines, and planes are the most basic components. These three-dimensional shapes can be used rationally and efficiently and can be developed into more complex structures depending on the combination of each shape.&#xD;
 In this study, polyhedra are explored by examining the relationships between geometric shapes and objects. Based on the geometric elements of polyhedra, experimental attempts were made to develop polyhedral units by modifying their shapes in two-dimensional and three-dimensional spaces. In particular, the purpose of the study is to show the possibility of a wider range of forms through atypical polyhedra and to express formativeness and decoration by combining the developed three-dimensional units according to the combination method to form a unit assembly in which the geometric form can be expanded.&#xD;
 The research method is largely divided into the production process of two-dimensional and three-dimensional units, as follows. First, to derive an effective three-dimensional unit, the number of cases is derived by modifying the shape of the 2D figure in virtual space. The transformation method is achieved by changing the dimensions of the polygon, the size of the interior angles, and the curvature of the sides of the polygon. Second, the derived 2D shapes are combined into 2-3 combinations according to the directions of the x-axis, y-axis, and diagonal axis, and each shape is converted into a three-dimensional structure by extruding in the z-axis direction. Third, to maximize visual tension, each polyhedral unit is combined into one continuous unit, taking into account the arrangement of vertices and edges.&#xD;
 The conclusions from this study are as follows. First, vibrant formativeness could be explored through the number of polygonal units that transformed and combined the following planes: shapes that emphasize the difference in width and height of the unit, atypical form expressing a sense of rhythm, and forms with an unpredictable and anomalous arrangement. Second, by combining the developed polyhedral units, we were able to explore mesonic polyhedral forms that go beyond existing geometric or organic forms. Third, through the combination method of interacting between polyhedral units, it was possible to explore the overall composition and detailed patterns through the units, and from a visual and perceptual perspective, shape changes could be expressed through formativeness and variability.&#xD;
 In this way, polyhedral units can maximize the gap between units and imply infinite expansion possibilities depending on the combination method and are judged to be suitable for ceramic formative research due to variables such as joining and arrangement. Through in-depth research on the transformation and combination of units, it is expected that it can be used not only in ceramic sculpture but also in products.

11536.abstract_en:
The importance of leisure activities for improving the quality of life for the elderly is being emphasized as the era of aging progresses rapidly. According to the "Population Projections Reflecting the 2021 Future Population Estimates" by Statistics Korea, the elderly population aged 65 and older is projected to exceed &#xD;
 10 million by 2025. This represents a 30% increase from 8.07 million in 2020, indicating that Korea's aging population is advancing rapidly. Consequently, there is a growing interest in the silver market related to the quality of life for the elderly. In this aging era, the importance of leisure activities to improve the &#xD;
 quality of life for the elderly is greatly emphasized. The type of leisure activities undertaken in old age can significantly impact the quality of life, providing benefits such as physical health improvement, mental stability, alleviation of depression and loneliness, skill development and a sense of achievement, and &#xD;
economic stability. This study aimed to verify whether pottery activities as a leisure activity can bring positive effects to the elderly generation in the aging era. The study categorized the behaviors and psychological characteristics of participants with experience in pottery activities based on the characteristics of pottery activities and analyzed whether these characteristics, represented by six factors (concentration, patience, reflection, preparedness, exploration, spontaneity) and two mediators of activity satisfaction (emotional ventilation satisfaction, skill development satisfaction), influence the behavioral intention of leisure activity intention. To achieve the objectives of this study, among the various cultural and artistic activity types of leisure activities for the elderly, the study focused on pottery activities in Korea and Japan. It measured the factors influencing behavior and leisure activity intention derived from the characteristics of pottery activities through the subjective perceptions and attitudes of the survey subjects. Specifically, in Korea, the survey targeted elderly individuals over 60 years old who had participated in pottery activities at lifelong education centers, senior welfare centers, workshops, cultural centers, municipal cultural program classes, and one-day pottery experience centers in Seoul and Gyeonggi Province. In Japan, the survey targeted those in Tokyo and Ibaraki Prefecture, who had participated in pottery activities at public halls, workshops, regional learning centers, cultural centers, and one-day pottery experience centers. The analysis of the data collected through the survey revealed the following results: First, among Korean elderly, the factors of patience, preparedness, and spontaneity significantly influenced emotional ventilation satisfaction, with patience having the most substantial positive effect. Patience also significantly influenced skill development satisfaction. Pottery activity satisfaction positively affected the intention for continuous leisure activity, with emotional ventilation satisfaction having a relatively higher impact than skill development satisfaction. Second, for the Japanese elderly, patience and exploration factors positively influenced emotional ventilation satisfaction, while patience and reflection significantly impacted skill development satisfaction. Pottery activity satisfaction positively affected the intention for continuous leisure activity, with emotional ventilation satisfaction having a higher relative impact than skill development satisfaction. This study confirms the necessity of pottery activities for the elderly's leisure activities in the aging era and provides basic data for improving the quality of life of the elderly through efficient support policies and leisure activity programs. However, this study has the following limitations. The status and policy of elderly leisure activities were primarily organized based on data from central government agencies such as the Ministry of Culture, Sports and Tourism and the Ministry of Health and Welfare. The case analysis was limited to surveys conducted in the metropolitan areas of Korea and Japan. Consequently, data from local governments and social public institutions providing elderly leisure activities were not included, nor were cases from other Asian countries, including China. Additionally, this study focused on providing basic information on the behavioral intention of continuous leisure activity concerning pottery activities, lacking research on other types of leisure activities. Future research should overcome these limitations by studying the various types of leisure activities most demanded by the elderly in the areas of cultural experience and recreational activities, selecting and collecting more balanced samples and data. Moreover, to enhance the quality of life for the elderly, the ultimate goal and national task in the aging era, future research should consider comparing various types of leisure activities simultaneously to address and alleviate the problems of the aging society through diverse leisure activities.

11538.abstract_ko:
본 연구는 니트 구조가 지닌 조형적 특징을 바탕으로 하나의 유닛에 잠재한 다변성을 탐구하는 것이다. 니트에서 코(loop)라는 존재는 확장의 기점으로 일정 규칙을 따라 실을 엮어가며 사용하는 기법과 행위의 반복수에 따라 다른 패턴과 형상이 나오게 된다. 배열되며 확장되는 코의 존재는 조형 원리에서 유닛의 개념과 닮아있다. 유닛은 최소로 구성되는 단위의 형태를 칭하는 것으로, 서로 관계하지 않은 것을 관계 짓고 하나의 전체를 결합시킬 수 있는 요소를 내포하고 있다. 유닛을 연결하며 무한한 형상을 만들어 나갈 수 있고, 이 점은 코를 이어나가며 자유로운 형태를 만들어 나가는 니트와 유사성을 가진다. &#xD;
&#xD;
 본 연구에서는 니트 구조의 최소 단위인 코의 배열을 통한 확장성에 착안하여, 슬립캐스팅으로 도출된 도자 유닛에 니트 구조가 가지고 있는 조형적 특성을 바탕으로 유닛의 연결로 형태를 이루어 나가는 도자 조형을 제작한다. 서로 간 연결될 수 있는 구조를 연구하여 획일화된 복제 속에서 다변화된 형태의 변이가 가능한 형상을 찾아내는 것을 목적으로 한다. &#xD;
&#xD;
 연구는 다음과 같은 방법으로 진행하였다. 첫째, 니트 구조의 조형적 특징을 활용하여 기본 유닛을 디자인한다. 둘째, 유닛의 특성을 기반으로 규칙을 따르는 의도적 연결 법칙을 정의내린다. 셋째, 의도적 연결 법칙에 변칙적 요소를 부여한 즉흥적 연결 법칙을 정의내린다. 넷째, 정의내린 의도적 연결 법칙과 즉흥적 연결 법칙을 따라 각각 단계별 치수를 조절하며 형태를 구성한다. 다섯째, 성형 단계에서 도자 유닛 접합을 마무리하여 하나로 연결된 형상을 제작한다. &#xD;
&#xD;
 이를 통해 다음과 같은 결과를 얻을 수 있었다. 첫째, 니트 구조의 최소 단위인 코의 구조 형성 방식에서 모티브를 얻어 두 선이 꼬여있는 기본 유닛을 제작하였다. 꼬임의 형상은 교차한다는 특성이 있고 이에 유닛 연결 과정에서 방향 전환이 발생하는 확장 설계의 기반을 구축할 수 있었다. 둘째, 의도적 연결 법칙의 확장 설계 조건인 규격, 각도, 방향에 따라 접합면이 다르게 적용된다. 도출된 접합면의 형태에 따라 유닛을 연결하며 규칙 안에서 다양한 표현이 가능한 확장에 유용한 유닛임을 알 수 있었다. 셋째, 의도적 연결로 도출된 규칙적 배열의 작품에 유연한 이미지를 추가하기 위하여 변칙성을 부여한 연결 유닛, 변형 유닛을 통해 점차 유기적으로 풀려나가는 이미지를 도출하였다. 넷째, 개별 작품을 접합하여 하나로 연결하고 이를 엮고 쌓는 방식을 통해 각 작품 간의 구성적 관계성을 부여했다. 이를 통해 복합구조물을 제작할 수 있었으며, 이러한 조합의 구성을 통해 작품의 크기적 확장이 가능하였다. 다섯째, 슬립 캐스팅 기법의 복제성에 3D프린팅 기술을 접목함으로써, 정확한 치수를 기반으로 한 유닛을 제작할 수 있었다. 이를 통해 접합 과정에서 발생할 수 있는 변수를 최소화하여 연결의 정확도를 높일 수 있었다.&#xD;
&#xD;
본 연구를 통해 니트 구조가 지닌 확장 개념을 응용한 유닛을 디자인하여 구조 확장 설계를 정리하고, 확장 설계에 적용되는 단계별 조건의 변수 조절에 따라 유닛을 접합하여 표현되는 작품의 조형성을 알 수 있었다. &#xD;
향후 이번 작품 말미에 등장한 변형 유닛을 더욱 적극적으로 활용하여 규칙성 속에서 유연함을 더해 니트 구조가 가지는 더욱 유기적인 형상으로 확장해 나가기를 기대해 본다.

11538.abstract_en:
This research investigates the potential versatility of a single unit derived from the sculptural features of knitted structures. In knitting, loops serve as points of expansion, with yarn woven according to specific rules. Various patterns and shapes emerge based on the techniques employed and the number of repetitions. The arrangement and expansion of loops are akin to the concept of a unit in sculpture, which refers to a minimal form composed of a few components that can relate disparate elements and combine them into a cohesive whole. By connecting these units, infinite shapes can be created, much like in knitting, where free forms are generated through the connection of loops.&#xD;
&#xD;
In this study, based on the scalability through the arrangement of loops, the smallest unit of knitted structure, and based on the sculptural characteristics of knitted structure in ceramic units derived by slip casting, this study produces ceramic sculptures that form by connecting units. By examining how these structures can interconnect, this research aims to discover shapes that can be both varied and diversified within a framework of uniform replication.&#xD;
&#xD;
The research was conducted through a systematic process as follows. First, the basic units were designed, leveraging the sculptural characteristics of knitted structures. Second, an intentional connection rule was established, adhering to the inherent properties of these units. Third, an improvisational connection rule was introduced, incorporating anomalous elements into the intentional connection rule. Fourth, the form was constructed by adjusting the measurements at each step according to the defined intentional and improvisational connection rules. Finally, the ceramic units were fused together during the molding stage to create a unified shape.&#xD;
&#xD;
The following results were achieved through this process. First, a basic unit featuring two twisted lines was created, inspired by the formation of loops—the smallest units in knitted structures. The twist's intersecting shape facilitated an extended design where directional changes occur during unit connections. Second, varyingjoining surfaces were applied based on dimensions, angles, and directions, which are essential conditions for the extended design under the intentional connection rule. This unit proved useful for extensions, as it connects according to the shape of the derived joining surface and can be expressed in various ways within the established rules. Third, toadd a flexible image to the regular arrangement of works derived from the intentional connection, the connection unit and the deformation unit with anomalies were used to derive an image that gradually unravels organically. Fourth, by splicing individual works together, weaving, and stacking them, a structural relationship between each piece was established. This facilitated the creation of composite structures, allowing the works to expand in size. Fifth, combining the replicability of slip casting with 3D printing technology enabled the production of units with precise dimensions. This approach minimized variables during the joining process and enhanced connection accuracy.&#xD;
&#xD;
Through this study, it was possible to clarify the structural expansion design by creating a unit that applies the concept of expanding knitted structures. Furthermore, it aimed to understand the formability of the resulting work by joining these units, adjusting variables at each step of the expansion design process.&#xD;
In the future, we anticipate further utilizing the transforming unit that appeared at the end of this work to expand the knitted structure into more organic shapes, enhancing flexibility within its regularity.

11540.abstract_en:
A Study of Ceramic Sculptures Based on Internet Memes- Focused on ‘Carrot Meme’ - With the advancement of electronic communication devices, individual communication methods have become faster and more convenient, and many forms of dialogue have also been digitized. Similarly, the 'meme', which serves as the smallest unit of cultural transmission, has been reborn in the internet environment as the 'internet meme'. Internet memes, characterized by their 'rapid dissemination' , convey contemporary cultural elements more quickly and broadly than before. However, their potential for swift obsolescence can obscure their role as cultural transmitters.&#xD;
  &#xD;
 This study aims to express and convey contemporary social phenomena embedded within internet memes through ceramic sculpture. Additionally, it seeks to enhance the communicative power of internet memes by compensating for their potential for rapid obsolescence with the semi-permanent nature of the ceramic medium. Among the numerous internet memes, the 'Carrot Meme' was selected for its relevance to the research objectives, and the detailed subject was determined, followed by the creation of the artwork.&#xD;
&#xD;
 Through a review of various literature, a comprehensive understanding of the overall concepts and attributes of memes, including internet memes, was established. Additionally, the examination of related artworks allowed for the identification of various interpretative approaches to memes that differ from the researcher's expressive methods. &#xD;
  Before the creation of the artwork, the concept of 'shaking' inherent in the selected 'Carrot Meme' was redefined, and a study on the form expression through this concept was conducted in advance.&#xD;
&#xD;
 This study aimed to identify contemporary social phenomena embedded within 'internet memes', and the 'Carrot Meme' was selected to derive the research subject. By expressing the subject through the ceramic medium, the communicative power of internet memes was enhanced, and a study on sculptural expression was conducted simultaneously. Internet memes, which are constantly being created, replicated, and disseminated, are not merely trends but cultural elements that reflect the current era. The researcher will continue to uncover and convey social and cultural phenomena encapsulated within various memes, thereby realizing their value as another form of meme.

11541.abstract_ko:
제목 : 현실가상을 기반으로 한 설치 도자 조형 연구 &#xD;
&#xD;
본 연구는 컴퓨터로 구현되는 가상의 것들이 현실을 대체하려는 흐름에서 느낀 회의감과 현실에서 일어난 일련의 사건으로부터 시작되었다. 연구자는 가장 원초적인 재료인 흙으로 본 연구자의 세계관을 토대로 하는 가상의 존재들을 빚어내고, 실재하는 공간에 설치, 및 연출하는 방식으로 가상을 구현하는 현실가상이라는 새로운 개념을 제시하고자 한다. 이를 통해 목적하는 바는 현실가상은 가상현실에서 느낄 수 있는 비물질성의 공허함을 해소하고 현실가상을 재현하는 다양한 사례와 방식을 연구하여 세계관과 등장인물이 존재하는 본 연구자의 작품에 대한 특이성과 당위성을 마련하고자 함에 있다.&#xD;
 &#xD;
 현실가상에서 중요한 요소인 공간에 대한 이해가 필요하였고 기존 공간의 특성을 활용한 뱅크시의 작업과 기존의 공간을 무(無)의 공간에 재현해 내는 나라 요시토모의 작품을 분석하여 설치미술과 공간의 관계성에 대해 이해할 수 있었다. 또한 현실가상이라는 용어를 새롭게 정의하는 것에 앞서 가상현실의 개념과 철학적 논의에 대해 고찰하고 현실가상의 개념과 유사한 점이 있는 이형구, 뱅크시, 정연두와 같은 기존 동시대미술 사례를 비교 분석하여 본 연구의 당위성을 설명하고자 하였다.&#xD;
 &#xD;
 기존의 가상현실의 개념과 본 연구자가 만들어낸 현실가상은 가상을 구현하는 방식에 차이가 있다. 현실가상은 현실공간에 가상의 생명체들이 물질성을 띠며 존재하고 가상의 이야기와 현실의 이야기가 혼재한다. 존재하는 방식뿐만 아니라 내러티브에서도 현실과 가상이 혼재해 있는 것이다. 본 연구에서는 현실에서 일어난 사건을 기반으로 가상의 세계관을 구성하고 발단이 된 현실 사건과 가상의 세계관을 같은 시공간 에 두고 표현하는 방법에 대해 연구하였 고 본 연구자는 흙으로 빚은 존재들을 실제 공간 속에 녹아들게 하는 설치 방식으로 현실 속에 가상을 표현하고자 하였다. 실존 인물이 전시 공간 안에서 관객과 상호 작용는 방식의 퍼포먼스는 현실과 가상을 연결해주어 관객들이 자연스럽게 세계관을 이해하고 몰입할 수 있게 하였다. 본 연구자가 제시하는 현실가상의 개념과 표현방식을 통해 연구자의 세계관을 구체화시키고 더 나아가 개체의 유일성을 표현하는 재료로서 도자 매체의 가능성이 확장되는 것을 기대한다.

11541.abstract_en:
Installation Ceramic Art Study Based on Realized-Imagination&#xD;
&#xD;
This study begins with a sense of skepticism towards the trend of virtual entitie s created by computers replacing reality, and from a series of events that occur red in the real world. The researcher aims to propose a new concept called 're alized-imagination' by creating an imaginary being based on their universe usi ng clay, the most primal material, and installing and staging them in actual spac es to manifest virtuality. The objective is to alleviate the immateriality and emp tiness experienced in virtual reality, and by studying various examples and meth ods of reproducing realized-imagination, to establish the uniqueness and justific ation of the researcher's work, where a universe and characters exist. Understanding space, a key element in realized-imagination, was necessary. The researcher gained insights into the relationship between installation art and spac e by analyzing the works of Banksy, who utilizes the characteristics of existing spaces, and Yoshitomo Nara, who reproduces existing spaces in a blank space. Furthermore, prior to defining the term 'realized-imagination', a consideration o f the concept and philosophical discourse of virtual reality was undertaken, and a comparative analysis of contemporary art examples similar to the concept of r ealized-imagination, such as Lee Hyungkoo, Banksy, and Jung Yeondoo, was con ducted to explain the justification of this study.&#xD;
The concept of virtual reality and the realized-imagination created by the rese archer differ in the way virtuality is manifested. In realized-imagination, imagin ary beings exist materially in real spaces, and stories of both imagine and realit y are intertwined. Not only in their existence but also in their narratives, reality and imagine are intermingled. This study constructs a universe based on real-lif e events, placing the initiating real events and the universe in the same space- time continuum. The expression of imagine in reality was achieved through vari ous methods such as clay sculptures, space installations, and performances. Spac e installations and staging played a significant role with appropriate objects, mus﻿ic, and lighting. Performances served as a bridge connecting reality and imagin e, enabling the audience to naturally understand and immerse themselves in the universe.&#xD;
The researcher believes that the concept and expression methods of realized-im agination can concretize their universe and enhance audience immersion. Additi onally, the potential expansion of ceramic media as a material expressing the un iqueness of entities is anticipated.

11544.abstract_ko:
제 목 : 눈물 질병인자의 현장진단을 위한 플라즈모닉 면역분석법 개발&#xD;
&#xD;
눈물 바이오마커는 안질환 및 전신 질환의 비침습적 모니터링을 위한 많은 관심을 받고 있다. 다양한 분석적 접근 방식이 눈물 바이오마커의 현장 진단을 위해 개발되었음에도 불구하고, 임상 환경에서 사용할 수 있는 간단하고 신뢰할 수 있 는 분석 플랫폼의 수는 여전히 제한적이다. 본 연구에서는, 모델 눈물 바이오마커로서 면역글로불린 G를 검출하기 위해 Ag/chitosan 플라즈모닉 종이를 활용한 이중 신호 기반 효소 면역 분석법 (ELISA) 을 제안한다. 비색 및 표면증강 라만 산란 (SERS)의 이중 신호 메커니즘은 플라스모닉 종이에 고정된 Ag 나노 입자의 에칭에 기인한다. 이 에칭은 플라스모닉 종이 의 색상 변화와 라만 증강 감소를 유발한다. 최적화된 에칭 시스템은 추가적인 에칭 단계를 요구하지 않으면서 플라스모닉 기판에서 동시 면역 분석과 에칭을 수 행할 수 있는 가능성을 보여준다. 검출 한계는 생리적 눈물 농도보다 약 700배 낮은 농도로 달성되었으며, 눈물 유사 조건에서 선택적 검출이 가능했다. 또한, 이중 신호 판독은 중복되는 검출 범위의 결과를 비교하고, SERS 분석 이전에 비색 분석 결과로 사전 스크리닝을 가능하게 하여 정확성과 효율성을 향상시킨다. 이러한 접근법은 쉽고 신뢰할 수 있는 눈물 바이오마커 현장 진단 플랫폼으로써 유망하다고 생각된다.

11544.abstract_en:
Title: Plasmonic ELISA for Tear Biomarkers: Etching in Plasmonic Paper with Dual-Signal Readout&#xD;
&#xD;
Biomarkers in tears have garnered significant interest for their role in the non-invasive monitoring of ocular and systemic health conditions. Despite the development of various methods for the immediate analysis of these biomarkers, the clinical landscape still lacks a straightforward and dependable sensing technology. In this study, we present a novel plasmonic enzyme-linked immunosorbent assay (ELISA) technique, employing Ag/chitosan plasmonic paper that offers a dual-signal detection mechanism for immunoglobulin G as a model biomarker. The dual-signal mechanism, featuring colorimetric and surface-enhanced Raman scattering (SERS) outputs, is promoted by the etching of Ag nanoparticles affixed to the plasmonic paper, causing alterations in color and a decrease in Raman signal amplification. The established etching process enables the concurrent execution of immunoassays and etching on the plasmonic material, eliminating the need for separate etching procedures. We achieved sensitivity at levels up to 700 times lower than the typical immunoglobulin G concentrations found in tear fluid, and demonstrated selectivity in simulated tear fluid. The integration of dual-detection modes enhances both the accuracy and the efficiency of analysis by allowing for a pre-screening through colorimetric assessment before conducting SERS analysis. This approach holds promise as a versatile point-of-care sensing platform that can easily and reliably detect tear biomarkers.

11546.abstract_ko:
본 연구에서는 천연 항알레르기 물질인 플라보노이드계의 퀘르세틴을 이용하여 항알레르기 활성을 가지는 콘택트렌즈를 개발하고자 하였다. 항알레르기 활성을 가지는 최적의 로딩 및 방출 조건을 찾기 위해 hilafilcon B와 etafilcon A 재질의 하이드로겔 콘택트렌즈와 somofilcon A와 delefilcon A 재질의 실리콘 하이드로겔 콘택트렌즈를 사용하였다. 침지를 위한 로딩은 dimethylsulfoxide(DMSO)에 퀘르세틴을 녹인 stock solution을 Phosphate Buffer Saline(PBS)에 희석하여 50 µM, 100 µM 및 200 µM이 되도록 제조하였다. 건조된 상태의 콘태트렌즈를 30분, 1시간, 2시간, 4시간 및 8시간 동안 로딩시켜 최적의 로딩 시간을 찾고자 하였다. 한편 퀘르세틴이 로딩된 콘택트렌즈에서의 방출량은 실온과 각막 온도에서 각각 120시간까지의 누적 방출량으로 측정하였다.&#xD;
  콘택트렌즈의 종류에 관계없이 퀘르세틴 용액의 농도가 증가할수록 로딩되는 양도 증가하는 양상을 보임을 알 수 있었다. 재질에 따라 로딩양과 로딩 효율의 차이가 발생하였으며 4종류의 콘택트렌즈 중 고함수의 이온성인 etafilcon A의 로딩 효율이 가장 낮았으나 로딩 용액의 농도가 증가할 시 최대 로딩 효율이 70 %이상으로 나타났다. 퀘르세틴의 로딩 시간이 증가함에 따라 로딩양이 증가하는 양상을 확인하였고, 1시간과 8시간의 로딩 효율의 차이가 10 % 내외인 점과 로딩 시간이 길어질 때 퀘르세틴의 산화가 관찰된다는 점을 고려하여 200 µM에서 1시간 로딩 후 방출 양상을 확인하였다. 로딩 전과 후의 파라미터는 통계적으로 유의한 차이를 보이지 않았으나 somofilcon A의 경우 파라미터의 측정이 불가능할 정도의 변화가 나타나 방출 실험에서 제외하였다. 로딩 효율이 가장 낮은 etafilcon A와 파라미터의 변화가 일어난 somofilcon A를 제외한 hilafilcon B와 delefilcon A에서 퀘르세틴의 방출을 실온과 각막 온도에서 각각 확인하였다. Hilafilcon B를 실온과 각막온도에서 방출시 120시간 동안 누적 방출효율은 각각 13.0±1.0 %, 23.6±2.6 %로 나타났으며 delefilcon A를 실온과 각막온도에서 방출시 120시간 동안 누적 방출효율은 각각 18.5±0.6 %, 23.8±0.4 %로 나타났다. 두 렌즈에서 모두 방출 시작 후 24시간까지 증가하는 양상으로 퀘르세틴이 방출되어 침지법으로도 지속적인 방출이 가능함을 알 수 있었다. 방출 전(로딩 전)과 방출 후의 파라미터의 통계적으로 유의한 변화는 관찰되지 않았으나 식약처 허용오차 기준을 넘기는 경우가 적은 delefilcon A가 항알레르기 활성을 가지는 약물 전달 콘택트렌즈에 더 적합하다고 판단하였다.&#xD;
  선행연구에 따르면 15분 동안 퀘르세틴을 사용한 인간 제대혈 유래 비만세포에서 10 µM의 농도는 anti-IgE-stimulated histamine의 방출을 29±3 % 억제하는 것으로 나타났다. Hilafilcon B와 delefilcon A의 각막 온도에서의 최종 누적 방출량이 각각 35.61±3.57 µM , 32.34±0.65 µM로 확인되었으므로 항알레르기 작용을 가질 것으로 예상된다. 실온에서 손실되는 퀘르세틴의 양은 delefilcon A에서 더 많았으며 실온을 포함하여 유통 과정 중에 노출되는 온도는 영하부터 고온까지 다양하기에 추가적인 연구를 통하여 적절한 유통 조건의 확립이 필요할 것으로 생각된다.&#xD;
  본 연구에서는 천연 항알레르기 물질인 퀘르세틴을 함유한 콘택트렌즈를 개발하고자 하였고 재질에 따라 로딩양과 로딩 효율의 차이가 발생하였다. 플라보노이드 계열의 퀘르세틴을 함유한 콘택트렌즈로 항알레르기 활성이 가능할 것으로 생각되며 종합적으로 고려하였을 때 delefilcon A가 가장 적합한 재질임을 제안할 수 있겠다.

11546.abstract_en:
This study attempted to develop contact lenses with anti-allergic activity using quercetin, a flavonoid type natural anti-allergic substance. To find the loading and release conditions for anti-allergic effect, hydrogel contact lenses made of  hilafilcon B and etafilcon A, and silicone hydrogel contact lenses made of  somofilcon A and delefilcon A were used. Soaking solution was prepared by diluting the stock solution of quercetin dissolved in DMSO in PBS to 50 µM, 100 µM, and 200 µM. To find the optimal loading time by soaking dried contact lenses for 30 minutes, 1 hour, 2 hours, 4 hours, and 8 hours. Meanwhile, the release amount from quercetin-loaded contact lenses was measured as the cumulative release amount over 120 hours at room temperature and corneal temperature, respectively.&#xD;
  Regardless of the type of contact lenses, it was found that as the concentration of quercetin solution increased, the loading amount also increased. There were differences in loading amount and loading efficiency depending on the materials. Among the four types of contact lenses, etafilcon A, a high water content and ionic material, had the lowest loading efficiency, but when the concentration of the soaking solution increased, the maximum loading efficiency was over 70 %. As the soaking time of quercetin increases, the loading amount appears to increases. But considering that the difference in loading efficiency between 1 hour and 8 hours is about 10 % and that oxidation of quercetin is observed when the soaking time increases, the release experiment was confirmed after soaking at 200 µM for 1 hour. There was no statistically significant difference in the parameters before and after loading, but in the case of somofilcon A, changes occurred to the extent that parameter measurement was impossible, so it was excluded from the release experiment. Excluding etafilcon A, which had the lowest loading efficiency, and somofilcon A, which showed changes in parameters, hilafilcon B and delefilcon A were released at room temperature and corneal temperature. When hilafilcon B was released at room temperature and corneal temperature, the cumulative release efficiency over 120 hours was 13.0±1.0 %, 23.6±2.6 %, respectively. When delefilcon A was released at room temperature and corneal temperature, the cumulative release efficiency over 120 hours was 18.5±0.6 %, 23.8±0.4 % respectively. In both lenses, quercetin was released in an increasing pattern until 24 hours after the start of release, showing that continuous release was possible even with the soaking method. Although no statistically significant changes in parameters before release (before loading) and after release were observed. Delefilcon A, which rarely exceeded the tolerance of Korean Standards, was judged to be more suitable for a drug delivery contact lenses with anti-allergic activity.&#xD;
  According to a previous study, a concentration of 10 µM in human cord blood-derived mast cells using quercetin for 15 minutes was shown to inhibit the release of anti-IgE-stimulated histamine by 29±3 %. The final cumulative release amounts of hilafilcon B and delefilcon A at corneal temperature were confirmed to be 35.61±3.57 µM and 32.34±0.65 µM, respectively, and are expected to have anti-allergic effects. The amount of quercetin lost at room temperature was greater in delefilcon A, and the temperatures exposed during the distribution process, including room temperature, vary from sub-zero to high temperatures, so it is necessary to establish appropriate distribution conditions through additional research.&#xD;
  This study attempted to develop contact lenses containing quercetin, a natural anti-allergy substance, and differences in loading amount and loading efficiency occurred depending on the material. It is thought that anti-allergic activity is possible with contact lenses containing quercetin, a flavonoid type, and when comprehensively considered, it can be suggested that delefilcon A is the most suitable material.

11549.abstract_en:
Recently, semiconductor technology has been developed in the direction of continuously reducing and processing large amounts of data at a high speed. Complex and various structural defects occur in DRAM devices that are steadily decreasing, among which voids are one of the structural defects. As the device decreases and the aspect ratio increases, voids are generated in the middle before being buried during film deposition. The existing methods performed to remove the voids thus generated are not a perfect solution as the semiconductor device becomes finer.&#xD;
  In this study, in order to overcome these technical limitations, evaluation was conducted according to laser energy density conditions using 532 nm wavelengths of laser annealing technology Nd:YAG laser (neodymium-doped yttrium aluminum garnet; Nd:Y3Al5O12). The experimental method confirmed the basic heat treatment effect by checking sheet resistance and dopant profile after laser annealing on the ion implantation wafer used in RTA (rapid thermal annealing) technology to confirm the basic characteristics of laser annealing. After that, through the process of changing from amorphous-silicon film to polysilicon film according to laser annealing energy density conditions, the result of laser annealing effect progressing from the top of the wafer to the bottom was confirmed through transmission electron microscope (TEM).&#xD;
  The interface between the film changed from amorphous silicon film to polycrystalline silicon film by laser annealing and the amorphous silicon film unchanged is called the melting depth. In the process of changing to a polycrystalline silicon film, the heat treatment effect due to laser annealing was at a level that could be confirmed, but it was confirmed that the melting depth was not clear as it had a polycrystalline silicon crystal structure. After confirming the characteristics of the amorphous silicon film, the evaluation was subsequently performed using amorphous SiGe and single crystal SiGe epitaxial.&#xD;
  The characteristic of SiGe film is that the melting point of germanium (937K) is relatively lower than the melting point of silicon (1412K) due to the difference in melting point between silicon and germanium in laser energy. Due to the difference in melting point, germanium reacts before silicon during laser annealing, so that solid → liquid → solid is phase-changed and recrystallization proceeds, making it possible to simultaneously observe the structural change in the strip shape inside the wafer both horizontally and vertically. &#xD;
  The reason why the melting depth of the SiGe film with a single crystal structure can be clearly identified in a linear strip shape is that the difference between the area where the strain structure, which was maintained by laser annealing, is destroyed and the area where it is not is clearly observed by TEM. Based on these experiments, two types of film ULTO (ultra low temperature oxide) 10 nm/35 nm and TEOS (tetraethylorthosilicate) 50 nm/150 nm films were deposited on the top, and the role of the upper film was confirmed through laser annealing through TEM, and finally confirmed in the simulation pattern.&#xD;
&#xD;
  In this paper, the results were secured by conducting research necessary to use laser annealing as basic data on the need for various evaluations and evaluation methods that must be confirmed when applied to small and precise structures and films such as semiconductor devices.

11551.abstract_en:
Recently, the distance between buildings, such as the restaurant-dense area in Insa-dong, Seoul, or the fire in Uijeongbu apartment, has been getting closer, which can cause large-scale human and physical damage if the fire easily spreads to the adjacent building. Therefore, the government has selected urban densely populated areas as fire prevention zones and is implementing related building laws.&#xD;
&#xD;
  The Drentcher facility is a facility that blocks radiant heat from adjacent buildingthe in city's fire protection district through the formation of a water film or water curtain according to the building law.  The Drentcher facility has a different functional concept than the sprinkler facility installed inside the building.&#xD;
&#xD;
  Fire protection methods for adjacent buildings have been carried out in various ways. Most typically, a method of blocking radiant heat using a drencher facility is used in the fire prevention district. However, detailed guidelines or reguation for the installation of water curtain facilities to prevent the spread of fire have not been established. For this reason, the drencher facility is a building facility that can block large-scale fires leading to fires in adjacent buildings, but it is not designed and constructed according to the building law, and in practice, it is installed by fire fighting companies in accordance with the standards of the Fire Protection Act, which is a similar facility.&#xD;
&#xD;
  Therefore, in this study, we investigated the issue and the problems related to the current drencher facility. The issues of current installation regulation of the drencher facility are summarized as follows.&#xD;
Firstly, even though the current building laws and fire laws provide several regulation for installing drencher facilities, but there are no clear regulations on installation and construction.&#xD;
Secondly, there is no regulation on the installation location and performance standards of the Drentcher head or detector of the Drentcher facility, so there is a question of whether the Drentcher facility can perform its original function of detecting and spraying fires outside adjacent buildings.&#xD;
&#xD;
  In this study, professional opinions of related technologies were collected from experts in this field related to the Drentcher facility using the Delphi technique to derive the current status and problems of the Drentcher facility, and the importance of the problems derived through IPA (Importance Performance Analysis) was confirmed. Through IPA analysis, it was confirmed that the most important parameter to be studied was the head of the Drentcher facility. The fiire dynamics simulation (FDS) using numerical analysis software was also performed on the Drentcher head for indicators of the performance of the Drentcher head, such as the injection angle and injection water flow rate.&#xD;
&#xD;
  In conclusion, this study attempted to propose the installation standard for the most effective drencher head required to function while providing basic data for clear regulations and standards in terms of functionality and to improve the efficiency of the drencher facility function.

11552.abstract_en:
In semiconductor process technology, the ion implantation process is a technology that injects ions into the surface of a wafer and forms a constant electric field so that the ions inside the wafer become conductive, and is used to improve the electrical activation and characteristics of transistors.&#xD;
The classification of ion implantation equipment is determined by the size of the energy and ion beam, and depending on the use, it is divided into medium current ion implantation, high current ion implantation, and high energy ion implantation equipment. After ion implantation into a wafer, it is possible to check whether there is an abnormality in the process by measuring TW (thermal wave), Defect, and SIMS (secondary ion mass spectrometer).&#xD;
Xenon gas is used for the plasma flood gun (PFG) of ion implantation equipment, and PFG assembly (assambly) is a device for supplying negative (-) charges to an ion beam composed of positive (+) charges. It has a structure in which negative charges are attracted by the space charge of the ion beam through the PFG chamber, and electrons move toward the wafer to neutralize the charged-up ions in order to prevent the insulating film from bursting due to the charge-up phenomenon of ions from the insulating film on the surface of the wafer when ions are implanted.&#xD;
The gas used in the PFG of the ion implantation equipment is xenon, and xenon is a Group 18 inert gas, and the outermost electron is stably located, so it does not react with other atoms, so it is generally used as a plasma phase gun (PFG) gas.&#xD;
However, xenon is a rare gas that is extracted from the air and has not yet been produced in Korea, so it is dependent on foreign countries to import and use it. Stable supply and demand are not being achieved because the global situation is unstable both internally and externally. In particular, due to the war in Russia and Ukraine, supply and demand are more unstable and prices rise significantly, making it difficult to obtain a smooth supply if production is increased in semiconductor manufacturing. In addition, since xenon is 0.0000087% present in the air, it is expensive and if production increases due to demand for semiconductors worldwide, production may be difficult.&#xD;
Therefore, the need for an alternative gas of xenon used in the PFG of ion implantation equipment emerged, and argon gas was selected from Group 18 inert gas. Argon is the third most common material in air, and it is inexpensive, so it was judged that there would be no problem in terms of supply.&#xD;
In this study, a basic evaluation was conducted to identify the problems that could occur when xenon was replaced with argon, and the evaluation conditions were phosphorus, arsenic, germanium, fluorine, and carbon. Through ion implantation into the Bare wafer, the TW value, the number of Defects, and SIMS analysis, it was confirmed that xenon could be replaced with argon.&#xD;
The first experiment confirmed the TW value. When xenon was used and argon was used, it was confirmed that the TW value Delta value (difference between xenon TW value and argon TW value) was within ±2% of the management Spec (phosphorus 0.02%, arsenic 0.60%, germanium 0.72%, fluorine 0.19%, carbon 0.79%).&#xD;
In the second experiment, the number of defects on the surface of the Bare wafer was confirmed. When xenon was used and argon was used, the number of management specific defects larger than 0.19㎛ was measured to be 300 or less, and it was confirmed that it met the allowable management specific.&#xD;
As a third experiment, the concentration was confirmed through SIMS analysis in the Bare wafer. When using xenon and argon, the SIMS profile map was matched to confirm that there was no significant difference within the management spec ±3%.&#xD;
In this paper, through three experiments, through basic evaluation to use argon as a gas that can replace xenon in ion implantation equipment, the research results were secured that there is no problem in using it as a gas in PFG in the future.

11553.abstract_ko:
제 목 : 차세대 배전지능화시스템(ADMS) 구축 시 탄소배출비용을 고려한 공급지장비용 예측 연구(대한민국과 페루 사례를 중심으로)&#xD;
&#xD;
차세대 배전지능화시스템 (ADMS)은 무정전 배전계통을 목표로 하는 시스템으로, 고장 신속 복구, 부하관리, 분산 전원 안정 운영, 공급지장비용 절감 등을 통해 배전계통의 공급신뢰도를 높인다. 한국은 세계 최고 수준의 ADMS 기술을 보유하고 있으며, 국제개발 협력 사업을 통해 개발도상국에 ADMS 기술을 확산하고 있다. 그러나 개발도상국에서는 ADMS 도입에 대한 경제성 분석 관련 어려운 문제가 있다. 특히, 공급지장비용 산정에 대한 표준화가 부족하여 객관적인 분석이 어렵다. 본 연구에서는 탄소중립 체제에서 거시적인 관점의 대한민국과 페루의 공급지장비용을 분석하였다. 탄소중립 체제에서는 공급지장비용에 공급 지장 전력비용과 탄소배출비용을 모두 고려하는 것이 필요하다.&#xD;
본 연구는 개발도상국이 ADMS 도입 시 효과적으로 공급지장비용을 산정하고 시스템 적용에 대한 명확한 근거로써 제시될 수 있도록 하였다. 본 연구는 개발도상국이 ADMS 도입에 대한 경제성 분석을 위한 기초자료를 제공했다는 점에서 의의가 있다. 향후 개발도상국에서는 ADMS 도입 시 탄소배출비용을 고려한 공급지장비용을 산정하는 것이 필요하다. 이를 위해서는 정확한 전력 소비 및 공급지장전력량에 대한 데이터 추출이 중요할 것으로 보인다. 본 연구는 기존 공급지장비용 산정 시 탄소배출비용을 고려하지 않았던 점을 보완하여, 탄소중립 체제에서의 공급지장비용 산정 방법을 제시했다는 점에서 의의가 있다. 또한, 개발도상국이 ADMS 도입 시 효과적으로 공급지장비용을 산정할 수 있도록 했다는 점에서 의미가 있다. 대한민국과 페루의 공급 지장 전력량과 공급지장비용에서 탄소배출비용이 차지하는 비율을 분석한 연구 결과, 두 국가 모두 공급지장비용에서 탄소배출비용이 차지하는 비율은 낮게 나타났다. 대한민국의 경우 2014년부터 2022년까지 연평균 0.08%, 페루의 경우 0.05%로 나타났다. 대한민국의 공급지장비용에서 탄소배출비용이 차지하는 비율은 낮지만, 향후 탄소중립을 달성하기 위해서는 탄소배출비용이 포함된 공급지장비용을 고려한 투자가 필요하다. 이를 위해서는 정확한 공급지장비용 예측이 중요할 것으로 보인다. 향후 전력 소비 및 공급지장전력량에 대한 정확한 데이터 추출이 가능해진다면, 공급지장비용 예측의 정확도를 크게 향상시킬 수 있을 것이다.&#xD;
마지막으로 본 연구는 기존 공급지장비용 산정 시 탄소배출비용을 고려하지 않았던 점을 보완하여, 탄소중립 체제에서의 공급지장비용 산정 방법을 제시했다는 점에서 의의가 있다. 또한, 개발도상국에서 공급지장비용을 계산할 때 탄소중립 원칙을 포함하는 것이 필요하다는 점을 시사했다는 점에서 의미가 있다. 또한 ODA를 통해 개발도상국이 ADMS 도입 시 효과적으로 공급지장비용을 산정하고 시스템 적용에 대한 명확한 근거로써 제시될 수 있도록 하였다.

11553.abstract_en:
A Study on Predicting Supply Disruption Costs Considering Carbon Emission Costs in the Construction of Next-Generation Intelligent Distribution Systems &#xD;
(Focusing on the Cases of South Korea and Peru)&#xD;
&#xD;
The Advanced Distribution Management System (ADMS) is a system aimed at creating an uninterrupted power distribution network. It enhances the reliability of the distribution system through rapid fault recovery, load management, stable operation of distributed power sources, and reduction of supply disruption costs. South Korea holds some of the world’s leading ADMS technologies and is spreading this technology to developing countries through international development cooperation projects. However, in these countries, there are difficulties in conducting economic analyses for the adoption of ADMS, especially due to the lack of standardization in calculating supply disruption costs, which hinders objective analysis. This study has analyzed the supply disruption costs from a macro perspective within a carbon-neutral framework for both South Korea and Peru. The results show that carbon emission costs account for an average of 0.08% of South Korea's supply disruption costs and 0.05% for Peru. In a carbon-neutral regime, it is necessary to consider both supply disruption costs and carbon emission costs.&#xD;
This research is significant as it provides foundational data for the economic analysis of ADMS adoption in developing countries and can serve as clear evidence for the application of the system. In the future, it will be essential for these countries to include carbon emission costs when calculating supply disruption costs upon the introduction of ADMS. For this, accurate data extraction on power consumption and the amount of power supply disruption is crucial.&#xD;
The study contributes by proposing a method for calculating supply disruption costs within a carbon-neutral framework, addressing the previous oversight of not considering carbon emission costs. Moreover, it is meaningful as it enables developing countries to effectively calculate supply disruption costs when adopting ADMS. The study of the proportion of carbon emission costs in the supply disruption costs of South Korea and Peru revealed that both countries have a low percentage. From 2014 to 2022, the annual average in South Korea was 0.08%, and in Peru, it was 0.05%. Although the proportion of carbon emission costs in South Korea's supply disruption costs is low, investment considering the supply disruption costs will be necessary to achieve carbon neutrality. Accurate prediction of supply disruption costs will be important for this purpose. If accurate data extraction on power consumption and supply disruption becomes possible, it will greatly improve the accuracy of supply disruption cost predictions.&#xD;
Lastly, the study is significant because it has improved upon the existing method of calculating supply disruption costs by including carbon emission costs in a carbon-neutral system. It also implies the need to incorporate carbon neutrality principles when calculating supply disruption costs in developing countries.

11556.abstract_ko:
제 목 : 에너지 환경 변화에 따른 발전사들의 에너지 전환 방향 모색&#xD;
&#xD;
20세기 산업화의 물결로 인간의 삶은 풍요로워졌지만, 환경의 오염을 가속화 시키며 이상 기후로 인한 자연재해를 일으켰다. 세계 각국은 환경 문제 해결을 위해 탄소 배출 저감이 필요함을 인식하게 되었고, 탄소 배출량이 거의 없는 신재생 에너지원에 주목하며, 화석 연료에서 신재생 에너지원으로의 전환을 준비하기 시작했다. 작년에 갑작스럽게 촉발된 러시아-우크라이나 전쟁의 장기화 는 화석 연료의 수급 불안정으로 이어져 에너지 빈국들의 에너지 안보 위기를 심화시키며, 신재생 에너지원으로의 전환을 가속화시키는 계기가 되었다.&#xD;
세계 유수 기업들의「RE100」선언 및 동참 요구, 유럽 연합의 2026년 탄소 국경세 도입 합의는 탄소 배출량에 따라 경제적 부담이 가중되는 에너지 환경 으로 변화되고 있음을 보여주고 있으며, 이에 따라 국내 정부와 발전사들도 신재생에너지원으로의 전환을 서둘러야 하는 상황에 놓여 있다. 이런 상황에서 국내 정부와 발전사들의 에너지원 전환 추구 과정에서 올바른 방향을 찾고, 부족했던 부분들을 보완해 줄 수 있도록 신재생 에너지원으로의 전환을 성공적 으로 이뤄낸 국가와 기업들의 사례를 참조할 필요가 있다.&#xD;
본 논문은 현재 신재생 에너지원으로의 성공적인 전환을 통해 에너지 자립을 이뤄내고 있는 영국, 독일, 덴마크의 사례들을 통해 어떤 정책으로 인해 신재생 에너지원이 주요 발전원으로서 자리잡을 수 있었는지, 또 그러한 기반 위에 세계적인 신재생 에너지 발전사로 성장하게 된 기업이 어떻게 지금의 위치에 오르게 되었는지 살펴보았으며, 국내 에너지 전환 상황 및 정부의 국내 에너지 전환을 위한 신재생에너지 정책과 국내 발전사의 신재생에너지 전환 추진 과정 에서 겪게 되는 문제들도 같이 알아보았다.&#xD;
영국은 신재생 에너지 보급을 위한 발전차액(CFD) 지원 제도와 석탄 가격 규제 를 위한 가격하한제(CPF)를 기반으로 신재생에너지가 가격 경쟁력을 갖출 수 있도록 환경을 조성하였고, 독일은 신재생에너지 설비의 증설과 동시에 발전량 을 수용할 수 있는 전력망과 거래 시스템 구축을 통해 신재생에너지의 발전 비중을 높일 수 있게 만들었으며, 덴마크는 행정 간소화 절차인 원스탑 절차 (One-stop Shop)로 발전사업자들이 쉽고 빠르게 사업을 추진할 수 있도록 지원 하여 풍력이라는 신재생 에너지원이 가장 활성화 될 수 있었다.&#xD;
위에 언급한 국가들은 신재생 에너지원 전환이라는 큰 목표를 가지고 일관성 있는 정책들을 유지하여 에너지 자립이라는 결과물을 얻을 수 있었으며, 시민들 과의 수많은 소통을 통해서 신재생에너지 설비의 도입에 따른 갈등 해소 및 적극적인 참여를 이끌어낼 수 있었다. 정부도 의미있는 결과물을 이끌어 내기 위해서는 정권이 바뀌어도 일관성이 유지되도록 큰 틀의 정책적 기조를 확립 하고 지켜나가는 것 뿐 아니라 발전 사업자들과 함께 주민들과의 갈등을 적극적 으로 풀어내는 것이 우선되어야 하며, 그런 신뢰와 기반 위에서 정책적 지원 들이 이루어질 때 신재생 에너지원으로의 전환도 이루어질 수 있음을 알 수 있을 것이다.&#xD;
국내의 신재생에너지 보급 현황은 여전히 세계 평균과는 큰 차이를 보이고 있으며, 주변 아시아 국가인 중국이나 일본에도 미치지 못하는 아쉬운 모습을 보여주었고, 국내의 발전량과 발전설비 용량을 살펴보아도 여전히 석탄 화력의 비중이 신재생에너지원 전력 비중보다 현저히 높다는 사실을 알 수 있었다. 또한, 국내의 신재생에너지 지원 정책인 RPS제도와 금융정책인 신재생에너지 금융지원 및 보급지원 사업을 통해 보완할 점이 있음도 확인할 수 있었다. 국내의 한 발전 자회사 중 한 곳의 신재생에너지 발전 추진 사례를 통하여 신재생에너지 발전 추진시 발생되는 인·허가 처리 문제, 이해 관계 조율 문제, 투자의 위험성 해소 문제, 전력망 확충 부족에 의한 출력제어 문제, 중복투자 및 지역별 불균형 발전 문제에 대해 살펴 보았고, 결론에서는 이러한 문제점 들을 토대로 정부와 기업, 다양한 이해관계자들로 구성된 거버넌스의 구축과 체계적인 심사와 지원 절차 개편을 통한 금융지원 시스템 개선, 좀 더 다양한 신재생에너지원 설비의 도입 및 기술 개발의 추진이라는 세 가지 정책 제언을 통하여 발전사들의 에너지 전환 방향의 길을 모색해 보았다.&#xD;
&#xD;
주제어 : 탄소 배출, 에너지 안보, RE100, 발전차액 지원제도, 원스탑 절차, 에너지 자립, RPS, 거버넌스, 금융지원, 기술 개발, 에너지 전환

11556.abstract_en:
Title: Energy transition strategies of power generation companies in response to energy circumstance changes&#xD;
&#xD;
The wave of industrialization in the 20th century enriched human life, but it also accelerated environmental pollution and caused natural disasters due to abnormal weather. Countries around the world have recognized the need to reduce carbon emissions to solve environmental problems, are paying attention to renewable energy sources with almost no carbon emissions, and are beginning to prepare for the transition from fossil fuels to renewable energy sources. The prolongation of the Russia-Ukraine war, which suddenly broke out last year, led to instability in the supply and demand of fossil fuels, deepening the energy security crisis in energy-poor countries, and serving as an opportunity to accelerate the transition to renewable energy sources.&#xD;
The world's leading companies' declaration and request for participation in RE100 and the European Union's agreement to introduce a carbon border tax in 2026 show that the energy environment is changing to one in which economic burden increases depending on carbon emissions. Accordingly, the domestic government and power generation companies are also in a situation where they must hasten the transition to new and renewable energy sources.&#xD;
In this situation, it is necessary to refer to the cases of countries and companies that have successfully made the transition to renewable energy sources so that the domestic government and power generation companies can find the right direction and make up for the shortcomings in the process of pursuing energy source conversion.&#xD;
This paper examines the cases of the United Kingdom, Germany, and Denmark, which are currently achieving energy independence through a successful transition to renewable energy sources, and examines what policies have enabled renewable energy sources to establish themselves as a major power generation source. We also looked at how a company that grew into a global renewable energy power generation company based on that foundation reached its current position. We also looked into the domestic energy conversion situation, the government's new and renewable energy policy for domestic energy conversion, and the problems encountered in the process of promoting new and renewable energy conversion by domestic power companies.&#xD;
The UK has created an environment for new and renewable energy to be price competitive based on the feed-in tariff (CFD) support system for the supply of new and renewable energy and the price floor system (CPF) for regulating coal prices. Germany has made it possible to increase the proportion of new and renewable energy power generation by expanding new and renewable energy facilities and establishing a power grid and trading system that can accommodate the amount of power generation. In Denmark, renewable energy sources such as wind power were able to become the most active by supporting power generation companies to carry out their projects easily and quickly through the One-Stop Shop, an administrative simplification procedure.&#xD;
The countries mentioned above were able to achieve energy independence by maintaining consistent policies with the grand goal of switching to new and renewable energy sources. Through numerous communications with citizens, we were able to resolve conflicts and encourage active participation due to the introduction of new and renewable energy facilities.&#xD;
In order to produce meaningful results, the government must prioritize not only establishing and maintaining a broad policy framework so that consistency is maintained even when regimes change, but also actively resolving conflicts with residents together with power generation companies. When policy support is provided based on such trust and foundation, it will be seen that the transition to new and renewable energy sources can also be achieved.&#xD;
The current status of new and renewable energy supply in Korea still showed a significant difference from the world average, and it was disappointing that it did not reach the level of neighboring Asian countries such as China and Japan. Looking at the country's power generation and power generation facility capacity, it was found that the proportion of coal-fired power was still significantly higher than that of renewable energy sources.&#xD;
In addition, it was confirmed that there is room for improvement through the RPS system, a domestic new and renewable energy support policy, and the new and renewable energy financial support and distribution support project, which is a financial policy.&#xD;
Through the case of promoting new and renewable energy power generation at one of the domestic power generation subsidiaries, We looked into the issues of licensing and permitting that arise when promoting new and renewable energy generation, coordination of interests, resolution of investment risks, output control issues due to lack of power grid expansion, overlapping investment, and regional imbalanced development issues. In conclusion, based on these problems, We sought a path toward energy transition for power generation companies through three policy recommendations : the establishment of governance comprised of the government, businesses, and various stakeholders, improvement of the financial support system through systematic review and reorganization of support procedures, introduction of more diverse new and renewable energy source facilities, and promotion of technology development.&#xD;
&#xD;
Keywords: carbon emissions, energy security, RE100, feed-in tariff system, one-stop procedure, energy independence, RPS, governance, financial support, technology development, energy transition

11557.abstract_ko:
제 목 : 가스복합 발전기 공급능력 산정에 대한 계량적 분석 &#xD;
&#xD;
우리나라는 온실가스 감축 목표 달성을 위해 태양광, 풍력 등 신재생에너지 발전량 비중을 지속적으로 확대해 왔지만 날씨 등 외부 요인에 따라 발전량이 크게 변화하여 전력수급의 변동성이 심화되고 있다. 따라서 전력계통을 안정적으로 유지하기 위해 유연성 전원인 가스복합발전의 역할이 중요해지고 있다. 하지만 가스복합발전이 공급 균형을 유지하는 완충 장치 역할을 하기 위해서는 정확한 공급능력 산정이 필요하다. 2011년 9월 15일 정전사태 이후 정확한 공급능력 산정의 중요성이 대두되었고 전력거래소는 이를 개선하기 위해 실시간 발전기 공급능력 산정 시스템을 도입하였다. 기존 가스복합 발전기의 공급능력 산정 알고리즘은 제작사가 제공한 보정계 와 환산계수를 적용하여 대기온도 등 운전변수(독립변수)에 따른 발전기 출력을 예측하는 방식이 적용되어 사용되고 있다. 하지만 이는 개별 가스복합 발전기의 특성을 반영하지 못하고 모두 동일한 조건에서 계산되는 한계가 있다. 또한, 기존 제작사가 제공한 온도 범위는 최근 기후변화로 인한 여름철과 겨울철의 기온 변화를 반영하지 못한다. 본 연구는 발전기 운전정보 시스템의 데이터를 사용하여 대기온도, 열공급 등 운전변수들에 대한 회귀분석으로 유의성을 확인하였다. 가스터빈의 독립변수는 대기온도와 압력비, 증기터빈은 가스터빈 출력합과 열공급량, 복수기 진공도이며 회귀분석 결과는 모든 독립변수의 t-values가 1.96보다 높고 F-statistics(P-values)으로 판단할 때 상수항을 제외한 모든 추정계수가 0이라는 귀무가설이 유의 수준 1%에서 기각되어 통계적으로 유의미하다. 또한, 회귀모 형을 이용한 공급능력 산정은 실제 출력과 유사하게 추정하여 기존 알고리즘 보다 정확도가 개선되는 것으로 나타났다. 본 연구는 기존 발전기 공급능력 산정 알고리즘과 달리 회귀모형을 이용한 공급능력 산정이라는 새로운 방법을 제시하였다. 추정된 공급능력은 입찰 정확도를 높이고 긴급부하 조정에 활용되어 안정적인 계통운영에 기여할 것으로 기대된다. &#xD;
&#xD;
주제어 : 가스복합 발전기, 발전기 공급능력, 회귀모형, 최소자승법, 대기온도, 압력비, 열공급량, 진공도, 전력거래

11557.abstract_en:
Analysis on Supply Capability for Gas Combined-Cycle Power Generator&#xD;
&#xD;
South Korea has been consistently increasing the share of renewable energy sources, such as solar and wind power, to achieve its greenhouse gas reduction goals. However, the significant variability in power generation due to external factors like weather has led to heightened volatility in power supply. Consequently, the role of gas combined-cycle power generation as a flexible power source has become crucial for maintaining a stable power grid. To fulfill its role as a buffer to maintain supply equilibrium, accurate estimation of supply capability is essential. Recognizing the importance of precise supply capability calculations, the Korea Power Exchange introduced a real-time generator supply capability estimation system following the blackout incident on September 15, 2011. &#xD;
 The existing algorithm for estimating the supply capability of gas combined-cycle generators employ correction and conversion coefficients provided by manufacturers to predict generator output based on operational variables (independent variables) such as ambient temperature. However, these methods do not reflect the individual characteristics of each generator and are limited by their calculation under uniform conditions. Furthermore, the temperature range provided by manufacturers does not account for the temperature variations in summer and winter due to recent climate changes. &#xD;
 This study employed regression analysis utilizing data from the generator operation information system to confirm the significance of operational  variables, such as ambient temperature and heat supply. The independent variables for gas turbines are air temperature and pressure ratio, and for steam turbine, the sum of gas turbine output, heat supply quantity, and condenser vacuum degree. The regression analysis results are statistically significant as all demonstrated -values for all independent variable exceed 1.96 and the null hypothesis of all estimated coefficients being 0, except for the constant term, can be rejected at a significance level of 1%. Additionally, supply capability estimation using the regression model closely approximate the actual output, demonstrating improved accuracy compared to the existing algorithm. &#xD;
 This research introduces a new method for supply capability estimation using regression models, diverging from traditional approaches. The estimated capacity is expected to enhance bidding accuracy and contribute to stable grid operation by facilitating emergency load adjustments.&#xD;
&#xD;
Keywords: Gas Combined-Cycle Generator, Supply Capability, Regression Analysis, Least Squares Method, Ambient Temperature, Pressure Ratio, Heat Supply Quantity, Condenser Vacuum, Power Exchang

11562.abstract_ko:
본 연구는 식품 위생 교육 프로그램이 온라인 외식 배달 업체 종사자들의 식품 위생 지식, 식품 위생 태도, 식품 위생 관리 수행도에 미치는 효과를 분석·검증하기 위해 수행되었다(김병욱, 2015). 문헌 고찰을 통해, ‘식품 위생 지식’, ‘식품 위생 태도’, ‘식품 위생 관리 수행도’ 등의 개념과 의미, 특성, 구성 요인들을 고찰하였고, 고찰 내용을 토대로 8회차(1회차 당 90분, 1주 당 2회차, 총 4주 간 수행)의 교육 프로그램을 구성하고, 연구 모형, 연구 가설, 연구 절차, 분석 방법 등을 선정하였다(김병욱, 2015).&#xD;
본 연구의 교육 프로그램 효과 검증을 위한 실증 작업으로써, 연구 참여자 21명을 대상으로 사전, 사후 설문 조사를 실시하였고, 수집된 자료들을 SPSS Statistics 21.0 프로그램을 활용하여 일반적 특성에 대한 빈도 분석, 지식과 태도, 수행도에 대한 기술 통계량 분석, 사전·사후 변화의 차이의 유의성 검증을 위한 대응 표본 T-검정 및 상관 관계 분석을 수행하였다. 본 연구의 결과 및 시사점은 다음과 같다. &#xD;
첫째, 본 연구의 교육 프로그램이 참여자들의 식품 위생 지식에 미치는 효과를 분석한 결과, 식품 위생 지식 전체는 물론, 5개 영역(개인 위생 지식, 식품 취급 위생 지식, 조리 과정 위생 지식, 기구·기기 관리 위생 지식, 환경 위생 지식 등)에서 모두 사전보다 사후에 고르게 향상되었으며, 사전, 사후의 변화 차이는 유의한 것으로 검증되었다. 교육 프로그램이 참여자들의 식품 위생 지식 수준의 종합적 향상은 물론, 세부 영역별, 각 문항별 향상에도 두루 효과를 발휘한 것으로 파악되었다. &#xD;
둘째, 교육 프로그램 실시 이후 연구 참여자들의 식품 위생 태도의 평균점은 사전 3.2±0.33점에서 사후 4.0±0.34점으로 향상되었다. 이로써, 본 교육 프로그램은 식품 위생 지식과 함께, 식품 위생 태도에도 일관되게 유의한 효과를 나타내었다. 특히, 사전 조사에서 상대적으로 저조한 것으로 나타난 식품 위생 업무 관련 도전 의식과 정신적 원기 등을 더욱 높게 향상시켰는데, 이로부터 식품 위생과 관련하여 가장 중요한 덕목인 자발적, 능동적 태도와 의지를 함양하는 데 기여하였다. &#xD;
셋째, 교육 프로그램 실시 이후 참여자들의 식품 위생 수행도 전체는 물론, 5개의 세부 영역(개인 위생 수행도, 식품 취급 위생 수행도, 조리 과정 위생 수행도, 기구·기기 관리 위생 수행도, 환경 위생 수행도 등)도 모두 유의하게 향상되었다.&#xD;
넷째, 식품 위생 지식, 태도, 수행도 간의 상관 관계 분석을 수행한 결과, 태도와 수행도 간에는 부분적으로 유의한 상관 관계가 확인된 반면, 지식과 태도, 지식과 수행도 간에는 상관 관계가 나타나지 않았다. &#xD;
분석 및 검증 결과, 본 연구의 교육 프로그램의 수행 목표가 의미 있게 달성되고, 프로그램 실시의 당위성과 사회적 타당도가 충분히 입증되었다. 이처럼 의미 있는 결실을 본 프로그램을 통해 성취하면서 연구 참여자들에게도 직업적 역량 강화 및 자기 계발의 기회를 제공한 점이야말로 본 연구의 교육적, 실무적 가치이자 사회적 타당도, 공헌도라고 할 수 있을 것이다.&#xD;
이상의 결과를 토대로, 본 연구는 다음과 같이 제언한다. 식품산업 종사자들의 위생 관련 역량은 단순한 지식 습득이나 이론적 이해보다는 현장에서의 철저한 실천과 엄격한 준수 및 그를 존중하는 태도가 훨씬 중요하므로, 향후 식품 위생 교육은 올바른 지식을 자발적으로 실천하려는 태도와 의지를 배양하는 동시에, 실천과 수행의 능동성, 지속성 등을 촉진할 수 있는 방향으로 구성되고 진행되어야 할 것이다. 즉, 식품 위생 지식 전달에만 치중할 것이 아니라, 식품산업 종사자로서의 바람직한 태도와 의지, 실천력 등을 함양하고 강화할 수 있는 ‘태도 중심적’, ‘실천 중심적’ 식품 위생 교육을 정착시킬 수 있는 방안을 진지하게 모색하고 탐구할 필요가 있을 것이다. 이는 식품산업 발전에 일조할 수 있는 본 연구의 중요한 성과라고 할 것이다. 이러한 본 연구의 결과가 향후 식품산업 종사자를 대상으로, 지식, 태도, 수행 등이 상호 조화와 균형을 이루는 바람직한 식품 위생 교육을 정착시키는 과정에서 유효한 이론적, 실무적, 산업적 지침 및 기초 참고자료로 활용되기를 기대한다.

11562.abstract_en:
This study analyzed and verified the effect of a food hygiene education program on the food hygiene knowledge, food hygiene attitude, and food hygiene management performance of employees of online food delivery companies. As an empirical work to verify the effectiveness of this study's educational program, a pre and a post survey was conducted on 21 research participants, and the collected survey data was analyzed. Descriptive statistical analysis, paired sample T-test and correlation analysis were performed. &#xD;
First, as a result of analyzing the effect of this study's educational program on participants' food hygiene knowledge, it was found that not only overall food hygiene knowledge, but also five specific areas(personal hygiene knowledge, food handling hygiene knowledge, cooking process hygiene knowledge, and equipments/utensils management hygiene knowledge, environmental hygiene knowledge) were all improved evenly, and the difference in change between before and after was verified to be significant. It was found that the education program was effective in not only improving the participants' level of food hygiene knowledge comprehensively, but also making balanced improvements in each detailed area and each question.&#xD;
Second, after the implementation of the education program, the average score of the education participants' food hygiene attitude improved from 3.2±0.33 beforehand to 4.0±0.34 after. As a result, it was confirmed that this education program consistently had a significant effect not only on food hygiene knowledge but also on food hygiene attitudes. In particular, the sense of challenge and mental energy related to food hygiene work were further improved. From these, it is interpreted that this study meaningfully cultivate participants' voluntary, active attitude and will, which are the most important attitudes related to food hygiene.&#xD;
3rd, after the implementation of the education program, the overall food hygiene management performance of the education participants was evaluated, as well as five detailed areas(personal hygiene performance, food handling hygiene performance, cooking process hygiene performance, equipments/utensils management hygiene performance, and environmental hygiene performance). In all cases, significant improvement effects were confirmed. &#xD;
4th, as a result of conducting a correlation analysis between food hygiene knowledge, attitude, and performance, a partially significant correlation was confirmed between attitude and performance, while no correlation was found between knowledge and attitude, and between knowledge and performance. The fact that the correlation between knowledge and performance in the area related to food hygiene is weak or absent has also been confirmed through previous studies, and this study newly verified this result for online food delivery companies.&#xD;
Based on the above results, this study makes the following suggestions. Since the hygiene-related competency of food industry workers is much more important than simple knowledge acquisition or theoretical understanding, thorough practice, strict compliance, and a respectful attitude towards food hygiene are much more important. Therefore, future food hygiene education will cultivate the attitude and will to voluntarily put correct knowledge into practice. At the same time, it should be organized and progressed in a way that promotes the activity and sustainability of practice and performance. In other words, we should not only focus on conveying food hygiene knowledge, but also seriously look at ways to establish ‘attitude-oriented’ and ‘practice-oriented’ food hygiene education that can foster and strengthen desirable attitudes, will, and practical skills as food industry workers. I hope that the results of this study will be used as effective theoretical, practical, and industrial guidelines and basic reference materials in the process of establishing desirable food hygiene education in which knowledge, attitude, and performance are harmonious and balanced for food industry workers in the future.

11563.abstract_en:
Quality Characteristics and Antioxidant Activities of Nurungji Supplemented with Aronia Powder&#xD;
This study was conducted to provide basic data for expanding the consumption of rice processed food, specifically nurungji, by incorporating aronia powder as a functional ingredient. The suitability of nurungji with added aronia powder, which exhibits excellent antioxidant activity, was evaluated as a processed rice product.&#xD;
To accomplish this, nurungji samples were prepared with different levels of aronia powder addition (0%, 2%, 4%, 6%, 8%), and their antioxidant activity and quality characteristics were analyzed. aronia powder was added after rice cooking during the nurungji manufacturing process, and instant nurungji was prepared by heating at 200°C for 3 minutes. For the evaluation of antioxidant activity, total polyphenol and flavonoid contents were determined, and DPPH and ABTS radical scavenging assays were conducted. For the assessment of quality characteristics, nurungji samples were analyzed for weight, pH, moisture content, water-holding capacity, soluble solids, reducing sugar, and color and texture properties.&#xD;
As the amount of aronia powder added increased, weight, soluble solids, reducing sugar, DPPH and ABTS radical scavenging activity of nurungji also increased, while pH, moisture content, water-holding capacity, hardness decreased. In terms of color, both L-value and b-value decreased, and a-value is increased which can be attributed to the presence of anthocyanin in aronia powder. nurungji with 8% aronia powder addition exhibited the highest levels of total polyphenol and flavonoid contents, as well as the most potent DPPH and ABTS radical scavenging activity. In the sensory evaluation, nurungji with 2% aronia powder addition was considered the most desirable overall.

11564.abstract_en:
After preparing the rice, purple jerusalem aritichoke powder was added and mixed in proportions of 0%, 2%, 4%, 6%, and 8%, and then heated at 200°C for 3 minutes to prepare nurungji. Experiments were conducted on the weight, water-binding ability, pH, soluble solids, moisture content, reducing sugar, color, and hardness of the nurungji, and total polyphenols, DPPH, and ABTS radical scavenging abilities were measured to analyze antioxidant activity. The sensory evaluation of nurungji with purple jeruslem artichoke powder was conducted on 25 people, and the test items were evaluated on a 9-point scale for color, flavor, taste, texture, and overall preference.&#xD;
The nurungji with purple jerusalem artichoke powder added, soluble solids, reducing sugar, and weight increased as the amount added increased, while water binding ability, moisture content, pH, and hardness decreased as the amount added increased. &#xD;
The chromaticity of nurungji with purple jerusalem artichoke powder added, the L value decreased, and the a value increased, and b value also increased. As a result of analysis of total polyphenols, DPPH, and ABTS radical scavenging ability, it was confirmed that antioxidant activity increased as the amount of powder added increased.&#xD;
  In the sensory evaluation, the group with 4% purple jerusalem artichoke added had the highest score in terms of color, and there was no significant difference in flavor and taste. The texture was best in the group with 6% purple jerusalem aritichoke added, and the overall preference was highest in the group with 4% addition.

11565.abstract_ko:
제목 : 분쇄도에 따른 야관문 열수추출물의 특성&#xD;
&#xD;
 본 연구는 야관문의 열수 추출 시 효율을 높이기 위한 전처리 방법을 찾기 위해 야관문의 분쇄도를 건조물, 절단물, 거친 입자, 그리고 미세입자로 나누어 각 추출물의 특성 연구를 수행하였다. &#xD;
 분쇄 공정 전처리 조건으로는 건조한 건조물, 1~2cm로 절단한 절단물, 거친 입자 20mesh(850um), 그리고 미세입자 80mesh(180um)의 네 가지 조건을 설정하였으며, 준비한 야관문 샘플에 10배의 증류수를 가한 후 90±3℃에서 2시간±10분 조건에서 열수 추출하여 다양한 물리화학적 특성, 수율, 성분 함량 및 항산화 활성 등을 비교 분석하였다.&#xD;
 분쇄도에 따른 야관문 열수 추출물의 특성을 확인하기 위해 pH, 색도, 환원당을 측정하였으나, 각 추출물 간의 유의미한 변화가 없었다. 수율은 건조물, 절단물, 거친 입자, 미세입자 65.74%, 61.98%, 56.55%, 54.19%로 나타났으며, 부피, 수분함량과 같이 분쇄도가 높을수록 낮게 나타났다. 비중은 건조물, 절단물, 거친 입자, 미세입자가 1.02g/㎤, 1.0024g/㎤, 1.0035g/㎤, 1.0046g/㎤ 으로 나타났고, 가용성 고형분은 미세입자, 거친 입자, 절단물, 건조물이 1.53brix, 1.6brix, 1.8brix, 2.4brix로 분쇄도가 높을수록 높게 나타났다. &#xD;
 야관문에서 추출할 수 있는 파이토케미컬 중 일부인 총 폴리페놀은 건조물, 절단물, 거친입자, 그리고 미세입자가 각각 34.90mgGAE, 39.30mgGAE, 40.08mgGAE, 그리고 87.68mgGAE로 분쇄도가 증가함에 따라 증가하였고, 단위 부피 당 총폴리페놀은 건조물, 절단물, 거친입자, 그리고 미세입자가 각각 105.06ugGAE/mL, 115.60ugGAE/mL, 135.98ugGAE/mL, 그리고 295.57ugGAE/mL 로 분쇄도가 증가함에 따라 증가하였다. 플라보노이드는 건조물, 절단물, 거친입자, 그리고 미세입자가 각각 34.77mgCE, 33.62mgCE, 31.72mgCE, 그리고 38.29mgCE로 유의성이 없는 결과가 나왔다. 단위 부피 당 플라보노이드 농도는 건조물, 절단물, 거친입자, 그리고 미세입자가 각각 96.37ugCE/mL, 98.9 ugCE/mL, 102.34ugCE/mL, 129.08ugCE/mL 로 확인되어 분쇄도가 높아짐에 따라 농도도 높아지는 결과를 나타냈다. &#xD;
 DPPH와 ABTS로 항산화 활성을 측정한 결과 DPPH는 건조물, 절단물, 거친 입자, 그리고 미세입자가 각각 25.02%, 26.28%, 27.87%, 그리고 46.48% 순으로 높은 활성을 나타내었으며, ABTS는 건조물, 절단물, 거친 입자, 그리고 미세입자가 각각 53.06%, 56.27%, 59.32%, 그리고 90.07% 순으로 항산화 활성이 높아지는 변화를 나타냈다.&#xD;
 이들 결과를 종합해 볼 때 간단한 분쇄 공정을 사용한 전처리 추가하여 적은 비용으로 유용 성분을 높게 추출할 수 있었다.

11565.abstract_en:
Characteristics of Lespedeza cuneata Hot Water Extract according to Grinding Grade&#xD;
&#xD;
 This study was conducted to explore the optimal pretreatment method to increase efficiency when extracting Lespedeza cuneata hot water, and the characteristics of each extract were studied by dividing the grade of grinding of Lespedeza Cuneata into dry, cut, rough particles, and fine particles. &#xD;
 Pre-treatment conditions for the grinding process were divided into four categories, and the conditions are as follows. Dry, cut (1–2 cm), rough particles (20mesh), and fine particles (80mesh). After adding 10 times distilled water to the prepared Lespedeza Cuneata sample, it was extracted with hot water at 90±3℃ for 2 hours±10 minutes to compare and analyze various physicochemical properties, yield, active ingredient content, and antioxidant activitachy-PH, color, and reducing sugar were measured to confirm the characteristics of the Lespedeza Cuneata hot water extract according to the grinding grade, but there was no significant change between each extract.y. &#xD;
 The yield was 65.74%, 61.98%, 56.55%, and 54.19%, respectively, for dry, cut, rough, and fine particles. The higer grinding grade, the lower the yield, volume and moisture content were.&#xD;
 The specific gravity was 1.02, 1.0024, 1.0035, and 1.0046 for dry, cut, rough, and fine particles, respectively, and the soluble solids were 2.4brix, 1.8brix, 1.6brix, and 1.53brix, respectively. The higher the grinding grade, the higher the soluble solids were. &#xD;
 Total polyphenols, which are some of the phytochemicals that can be extracted from the night gate, increased as the grinding degree increased to 34.90mgGAE, 39.30mgGAE, 40.08mgGAE, and 87.68mgGAE for Dry, Cut, Rough, and Fine respectively. Total polyphenols per volume increased as grinding degree increased to 105.06ugGAE/mL, 115.60ugGAE/mL, 135.98ugGAE/mL, and 295.57ugGAE/mL for Dry, Cut, Rough and Fine respectively. Flavonoids in Dry, Cut, Rough, and Fine were 34.77mgCE, 33.62mgCE, 31.72mgCE, and 38.29mgCE, respectively, which are found to be insignificant results. Flavonoids per unit volume were confirmed to be 96.37ugCE/mL, 98.9ugCE/mL, 102.34ugCE/mL, and 129.08ugCE/mL for Dry, Cut, Rough, and Fine respectively, resulting in an increase in concentration as the grinding degree increases.&#xD;
 As a result of measuring antioxidant activity with DPPH and ABTS, DPPH was found to be 25.02%, 26.28%, 27.87%, 46.48% respectively, for dry, cut, rough particles, and fine particles, which is a significantly higher activity. Also, ABTS showed significant changes in antioxidant activity in the order of 53.06%, 56.27%, 59.32%, and 90.07% in dry, cut, rough particles, and fine particles.&#xD;
 Based on these results, a high level of ingredients can be extracted at a low cost by adding pretreatment using a simple grinding process.

11570.abstract_en:
Characterization and fabrication of core/shell particles with lecithin and pluronic &#xD;
In this study, the effects of the ethylene oxide (EO) content of pluronic (70 and 80% for pluronic F127 and F108, respectively) on the physicochemical properties of lecithin liposome/pluronic particles having a core/shell structure were evaluated, and the ability of these particles to load proteins was also evaluated. Up to a lecithin/pluronic ratio of 0.2, particles with a core/shell structure were formed irrespective of the ethylene oxide content of pluronic and their sizes ranged from 230 to 280 nm. Both of liposome/F108 and liposome/F127 particles were relatively stable to pH change when stored at 5°C but they were not stable to pH change when stored at above 5°C, indicating that the EO content of pluronic is not an important factor in determining the stability of liposome/pluronic particles. A model protein having a low isoelectric point (pI) was easily encapsulated into lipsome/pluronic particles. However, when adjusting the surface charge of liposomes to be positive for the encapsulation of a protein with a high pI, the formation of particles with a core/shell structure did not occur. &#xD;
Keywords: core/shell-structured particles; lecithin; liposomes; pluronic; protein encapsulation

11573.abstract_ko:
본 논문은 암호화된 네트워크 트래픽 분석의 필요성과 기존 연구의 한계를 기반으로 새로운 전처리 방법론을 제안하고 그 효과를 평가한다. 현대 디지털 환경에서 데이터 보안의 중요성이 증가함에 따라, 대다수의 네트워크 트래픽은 암호화되어 전송된다. 이러한 암호화된 트래픽은 사이버 공격에도 사용되며, 이는 기존의 네트워크 트래픽 분석 방법론, 예를 들어 시그니처 기반 분석이나 심층 패킷 분석법(DPI) 같은 전통적인 방법들의 한계를 드러나게 하였다. 이에 따라, 딥러닝 기반의 암호화 트래픽 분석 연구가 필요성을 가지게 되었다.&#xD;
기존 딥러닝 기반 네트워크 트래픽 분석 연구의 대부분은 주로 패킷 데이터의 GrayScale 이미지 변환에 의존하였다. 하지만 이 방법론은 암호화된 트래픽의 복잡한 특성을 충분히 포착하지 못하는 한계를 가지고 있다. 이러한 문제를 해결하기 위해, 본 논문에서는 엔트로피 값을 활용한 RGB 이미지 변환 방식을 제안한다. 이 방식은 R과 G 채널에 엔트로피 정보를 통합하고, B 채널에는 원래의 패킷 정보를 할당하여 암호화된 페이로드와 암호화되지 않은 헤더 부분을 시각적으로 구분할 수 있다. 이와 더불어, Hilbert Curve를 적용하여 데이터의 공간적 연속성을 유지하는 방법을 통해 네트워크 트래픽의 구조를 더욱 효과적으로 표현하여 딥러닝 모델이 패킷의 구조를 더욱 잘 유추할 수 있도록 한다.&#xD;
본 논문에서 제안하는 전처리 방법의 성능을 검증하기 위해, 기존 패킷 기반 암호화 네트워크 트래픽 분석 분야의 최신 연구와 비교 실험을 ISCX 2016 VPN-Non VPN 데이터 셋을 이용하여 수행하였다. 실험 결과, 본 연구의 방법론은 기존의 GrayScale 기반 방법에 비해 더 높은 성능을 달성하였다. 특히, 네트워크 트래픽의 Chat과 Email 레이블 분류에서 각각 26%포인트와 24%포인트의 F1-score 향상을 기록하였다. 이는 엔트로피 기반의 전처리 방법이 암호화된 네트워크 트래픽 분석의 정확도를 높이는 데 크게 기여할 수 있음을 시사한다.&#xD;
결론적으로, 본 논문은 암호화된 네트워크 트래픽 분석 분야에 새로운 방법론을 제시함으로써, 암호화 네트워크 트래픽 분석 분야의 기술적 발전에 중요한 기여를 하였다. 이 연구는 네트워크 보안의 효율성과 정확도를 향상시키는 데 중요한 발전으로 평가될 수 있다.

11574.abstract_en:
Since the introduction of Bitcoin, the first cryptocurrency, in October 2008, the demand for cryptocurrencies has continuously increased with the emergence of various digital assets known as altcoins. As of the first half of 2023, the average monthly trading volume on domestic exchanges in Korea has reached approximately 84.1225 trillion won [1]. However, cryptocurrencies have also been exploited for criminal activities, such as demanding payment in cryptocurrency for drug trafficking or illegal pornography, due to their anonymity. Last year alone, the volume of illegal cryptocurrency transactions involved in such crimes worldwide was $20.6 billion, equivalent to about 26 trillion won [2].&#xD;
To prevent the recurrence and mitigate the damage of these cryptocurrency-related crimes, it is essential to recover criminal proceeds. This involves restoring the defendant's cryptocurrency wallet and establishing methods for analyzing cryptocurrency wallet programs and recovering and verifying secret keys. However, existing research is insufficient in terms of forensic analysis of inactive systems for cryptocurrency wallet restoration and secret key recovery results for each wallet program. Moreover, the characteristics of the underlying environment in which cryptocurrency wallets operate have not been fully considered, leading to unclear distinctions in data collection scope.&#xD;
Therefore, this study proposes recovery and verification methods by analyzing the encryption and decryption mechanisms of secret keys in desktop wallets like Etherwall and Frame, and web browser wallets such as Metamask, Binance, and Kaikas. The recovery approach involves detailed descriptions of data collection and investigation methods for secret keys in cryptocurrency wallets based on desktop and web browsers. The study also develops secret key recovery tools for each target wallet and calculates the minimum number of verification attempts based on password length. This research is expected to significantly contribute not only to the technical aspects of cryptocurrency crime investigation but also to the legal framework related to the recovery of proceeds from cryptocurrency crimes.

11576.abstract_ko:
제 목: 인공위성 이미지를 활용한 도심 속 카메라 네트워크 보정&#xD;
&#xD;
카메라 보정은 카메라의 왜곡을 보정하고 카메라의 3차원 위치 정보를 파악하는 과정이다. 실내 환경에서는 체스보드를 활용하여 간단하게 보정을 할 수 있지만, 도심 환경에서는 체스보드를 활용하기 어려운 경우가 많다. 이는 설치된 환경이 복잡하고, 활용 가능한 이미지 수가 적으며, 도로 상황이 다양하기 때문이다. 이러한 어려움을 해결하기 위해 본 논문은 네 가지 아이디어를 도입한 도심 속 CCTV 카메라 네트워크를 보정하는 새로운 방법론을 제시한다. 위성 영상 이미지 활용: 위성 영상을 활용하여 오버랩이 적은 CCTV 카메라들 간 실제 크기의 절대 좌표 정보를 추정한다. 다양한 카메라 모델 도입: 다양한 카메라 모델을 도입하여 서로 다른 화각을 가진 CCTV 카메라가 적절한 모델을 갖도록 한다. OpenCV의 카메라 모델 뿐만이 아닌 FOV 왜곡 모델, unified camera model 등 다양한 카메라 모델이&#xD;
활용한다. 지형모델 도입: 언덕과 같은 도시 환경의 다양한 특성에 맞춰 지형지물 수식을 제안한다. 교차 검증 활용 및 모델 선택 지표 제안: 카메라 모델과 지형지물 모델의 과적합을 방지하기 위해 교차 검증 접근 방식을 활용한다. 이후 학습 및 검증 RMSE과 과적합률를 통해 가장 적절한 모델 조합을 선택하는 모델 선택 지표를 제안한다. 본 논문은 모델 선택 지표 검증을 위해 가상환경 실험 및 실제환경에 적용하였다. 가상환경은 ground truth로&#xD;
정해진 모델 조합을 활용한 후 이들을 이미지에 투영시킨 픽셀을 최적화에 사용될 관찰값으로 활용한다. 이후 제안한 시스템을 통해 카메라 모델과 지형모델을 조합을 최적화한 후 ground truth와 결과값을 비교한다. 실제환경의 장소는 한국전자통신연구원이며 총 4개의 CCTV 카메라와 도로마커를 보정한다. 기존에 한국전자통신연구원 측에서 제공된 보정 데이터를 통해 위치보정이 된 4개의 CCTV로 RMSE를 계산하면 평균값은 24.325이다. 본 논문이&#xD;
제안하는 시스템을 통해 평균 RMSE를 0.5 부터 21.817 까지 다양하게 최적화 및 정확도를 향상시켰다.

11581.abstract_ko:
제목: 얼굴 기반 나이 추정을 위한 상대 연령 위치 학습&#xD;
&#xD;
인간의 나이를 식별하는 것은 컴퓨터 비전에서 특히 중요한 생체 인식 특성으로, 단일 얼굴 이미지에서 나이를 추정하는 것은 상당한 어려움을 겪고 있습니다. 최근 몇 년간 나이 추정 프레임워크를 개선하기 위한 다양한 방법론이 등장했습니다. 그러나 이전의 주요 방법은 모든 연령의 얼굴 특성을 동등하게 취급하여 특정 연령 그룹에 포함된 풍부한 연령별 정보를 간과합니다. 또한, 어떠한 참조 데이터 없이 정확한 나이를 추정하는 것은 어려운 과제이며, 이 문제를 해결하는 한 가지 방법은 모든 상대 연령의 정보를 포함하는 특징 표현 맵을 생성하는 것입니다. 본 논문은 나이 추정 모델의 학습 과정을 보충하기 위한 상대 나이 위치 학습 개념을 소개합니다. 기능 재보정 모듈에서 영감을 받아 중요성에 따라 기능을 우선 순위로 지정하는 기능 재가중 모듈을 개발하여 제안된 나이 추정 방법의 기능 표현을 강화합니다. 제안된 재가중 모듈은 각 연령의 선택된 참조 기능을 얻고 이를 활용하여 입력 이미지의 기능을 연령 중요성에 따라 재가중합니다. 이로써 재보정된 특징은 상대 나이 위치 예측을 위해 평가됩니다. 또한, 나이 추정의 일반화 성능을 향상하기 위해 입력 이미지의 나이와 성별을 동시에 예측하는 멀티태스크 학습 네트워크를 생성하기 위해 성별 예측 헤드가 추가됩니다. 광범위한 실험을 통해 제안된 접근 방식이 AgeDB, AFAD, CACD 와 같은 얼굴 나이 추정을 위한 세 가지 어려운 벤치마크 데이터셋에서 다른 최신 나이 추정 방법보다 뛰어난 성능을 보여주었습니다.

11581.abstract_en:
Title: Relative Age Position Learning for Face-based Age Estimation &#xD;
&#xD;
Identification of human age stands as a significant biometric trait, particularly in computer vision, where estimating age from a single facial image poses a considerable challenge. Recent years have seen various methodologies aimed at refining age estimation frameworks. However, previous leading methods treat facial characteristics across all ages equally, disregarding potential rich age-specific information contained within certain age groups. Moreover, the estimation of a precise age without any reference data is a difficult task and one way to address this problem is to create a feature representation map that contains information of all relative ages. This paper introduces the concept of relative age position learning to supplement the learning process for age estimation models. Drawing inspiration from feature re-calibration modules that prioritize features based on their importance, a novel age-based re-weighting module is developed to enhance the feature representation in the proposed age estimation method. The proposed re-weighting module obtains the features of selected references for each age and further exploits them to re-weight the features of input images based on the age significance. The resulting re- calibrated features are then assessed for relative age position prediction. In addition, to achieve a better generalization performance in age estimation, a gender prediction head is added to create a multi-task learning network that simultaneously predicts the ages and genders of input images. Through extensive experiments, it is showed that proposed approach outperforms other state-of-the-art age estimation methods on three challenging benchmark datasets for facial age estimation such as AgeDB, AFAD, and CACD.

11582.abstract_ko:
표정 인식 (Facial Expression Recognition, FER) 이란 인간의 얼굴에 묘사된 표정을 기반으로 감정을 분류하는 것을 목표로 하는 컴퓨터 비전 작업으로 최근 개인 맞춤형 사업 및 콘텐츠의 발전으로 인해 활발한 연구가 진행되고 있는분야이다. 하지만 FER 모델을 연구하기 위해 만들어진 FER 데이터 세트들은 주석자의 주관성과 모호한 이미지들로 인해 본질적으로 데이터 자체에 노이즈가 존재한다. 그렇기에 본 논문에서는 노이즈 데이터 세트에 있는 노이즈 문제점을 해결하기 위한 Noise Suppression Variance Loss(NSV Loss) 를 제안한다.&#xD;
NSV Loss 는 기존 Cross Entropy Loss 를 대체하여 사용할 수 있는 손실 함수로 예측값 벡터의 분산을 활용하여 노이즈 데이터일 가능성이 큰 데이터는 손실 가중치를 낮추어 학습을 억제하고, 어려워하는 데이터는 손실 가중치를 높여 더 집중해서 학습할 수 있게 만들어 준다. &#xD;
제안하는 손실 함수의 성능을 알아보기 위해 기존 Cross Entropy Loss 와의 광범위한 비교 실험을 수행하여 노이즈를 억제하고 각 감정에 대해 더 잘 학습함을 보이며, 아주 단순한 네트워크 구조를 가지고 평가한 본 논문 모델의 성능이 복잡한 구조를 가지는 최신 대형 FER 모델들과 비교해도 경쟁력 있는 성능이라는 것을 확인한다. 또한 NSV Loss 는 기존의 FER 노이즈를 해결하려는 연구들과 다르게 여러 분기의 네트워크를 사용하지 않아도 되고, 학습 중인 레이블을 다시 설정하지 않으며, 모델의 구조를 변경하지 않고도 적용할 수 있으므로 적응성이 뛰어나다는 것을 보일 것이다. 마지막으로 FER 데이터 세트가 아닌 일반 Noise label 이미지 데이터 세트에서도 성능 향상을 보임으로써 제안하는 손실 함수의 일반화 능력과 분류하는 클래스 수가 늘어나도 노이즈를 잘 억제하며 학습할 수 있음을 보일 것이다.

11582.abstract_en:
Facial Expression Recognition(FER) is a computer vision task aimed at classifying emotions based on facial expressions. Due to recent advancements in personalized services, FER has gained significant research interest. However, FER datasets often contain noise from annotator subjectivity and ambiguous images. To address this, we propose the Noise Suppression Variance Loss(NSV Loss).&#xD;
NSV Loss, which can replace the conventional Cross Entropy Loss, utilizes the variance of predicted value vectors to assign lower loss weights to potentially noisy data and higher weights to hard data, improving learning focus.&#xD;
Our extensive comparative experiments show that NSV Loss effectively suppresses noise and enhances emotion classification performance. Despite its simple network architecture, our model performs competitively with state-of-the-art FER models with more complex structures.&#xD;
Unlike other FER noise reduction methods, NSV Loss does not require multiple network branches, re-labeling during training, or modifications to the model architecture, demonstrating its adaptability.&#xD;
Additionally, NSV Loss improves performance on general noisy image datasets, indicating its generalization capability and effectiveness in handling noise across various classification tasks.

11583.abstract_ko:
제 목 : 표정 인지 및 모션 생성 모델을 활용하여 감정을 인식하고 사람과 상호작용하는 로봇 시스템&#xD;
&#xD;
본 논문에서는 3D 모션 생성 모델을 활용하여 사람의 감정을 이해하고 상호작용하는 로봇 시스템을 소개한다. 최근 Vision Transformer(VIT) 모델이 나오면서 Facial Expression Recognition(FER) 분야에서 많은 발전과 성능 향상이 있었다. 이 중 POSTER++는 여타 다른 VIT 모델들처럼 준수한 성능을 가졌으면서도 8.4G FLOPs, 43.7M Params로 매우 가벼운 모델이다. 이러한 이유로 본 논문에서는 VIT 모델 중 POSTER++를 사용하여 감정을 인지하도록 한다.&#xD;
또한, 3D 모션 생성 기술을 통해 로봇 시스템에 적용하여 구동하는 연구를 진행했다. Diffusion Model의 발전으로 최근 3D 모션 생성 분야에서도 이를 활용하는 연구가 보이기 시작했다. 특히 FLAME은 Denoising Diffusion Probabilistic Model(DDPM)을 최초로 활용한 모델로, 행동 묘사 텍스트를 통해 3D 모션을 생성한다. 여기서 생성된 Root Joint의 위치와 각 관절의 Quaternion을 통해 모든 관절의 위치를 얻음으로써 Forward &amp; Inverse Kinematics 해석으로 각 로봇 관절의 회전 각도를 계산할 수 있다.&#xD;
따라서 본 논문에서는 5 자유도 양팔 휴머노이드 로봇인 HUMIC을 기반으로 POSTER++를 활용하여 사람의 얼굴을 인지, 이에 알맞은 반응 모션을 FLAME으로 생성하여 표현하는 Human-Robot Interaction(HRI) 로봇 시스템을 제안한다. 제안하는 시스템에서는 우선 RGB-D 카메라를 통해 사람의 얼굴을 포착하고, 가장 가까운 사람을 타겟으로 Face Tracking을 한다. 이후 표정을 보고 이에 알맞은 감정을 인지하면 구글의 Generation Model인 Gemini AI가 그 사람의 감정에 알맞은 반응 텍스트를 생성하여 출력하고, 이를 통해 FLAME으로부터 모션 데이터를 얻는다. 마지막으로 출력된 Root Joint의 위치와 각 관절의 Quaternion으로 Forward Kinematics(FK), Inverse Kinematics(IK) 계산을 거치고, 이때 얻은 각 관절의 회전 각도를 입력하면 시뮬레이션 상에서 HUMIC이 알맞은 모션을 취한다. 본 논문에서는 사람과 상호작용하는 시나리오에 초점을 두고 진행했기 때문에 HUMIC의 머리와 양팔만을 사용했으며, 시뮬레이션을 통해 실제 환경에서 적용 가능한지를 우선 파악하였다. 또한, 해당 시나리오에서 사람의 감정을 인지하여 다른 반응을 보이는 것을 확인할 수 있었다.

11585.abstract_ko:
포이스닝 공격 탐지를 위한 블록체인 기반 안전한 IIoT 아키텍처 &#xD;
&#xD;
오늘날, 산업 사물 인터넷 (IIoT) 은 기하급수적으로 발전해 왔으며 지능적 연결, 상호 연결 모니터링, 실시간 데이터 처리 및 데이터의 자율 처리를 요구함으로써 결과 품질과 신뢰성을 향상시켰다. 반면, IoT 시스템은 IIoT 를 사용하여 기밀성, 가용성, 무결성 및 신뢰성을 제공하며 기술 및 통신 조사에 따르면 2030년까지 IoT 애플리케이션에서 관련 IoT 디바이스의 총 양은 290 억을 초과할 것으로 예상된다. 또한, 글로벌 데이터는 2025년까지 61% 증가한 175제타바이트로 데이터 센터에서와 정확히 동일한 양의 데이터가 클라우드 데이터에 유지될 것이다. 그러나 이기종 산업용 IoT 에서는 다자간 대화형 데이터 처리가 필요한 경우가 많다. 정보 보안 분야에서는 다른 파트너와 관계를 맺는 모든 당사자의 안전 및 생산성 요구 모두가 중요한 문제가 되고 있다. IoT 는 제조 인프라에 사용될 때 보안, 프라이버시 보호, 디바이스 및 데이터 인증, 데이터 전송, 낮은 지연 시간, 중앙 집중화, 신뢰성 및 확장성을 포함한 연결 장치의 수와 복잡성이 기하급수적으로 증가함에 따라 현대 네트워크 아키텍처에서 해결해야 할 여러 가지 문제를 제시한다. 또한, IoT에서는 보안 기술이 부족하고 IoT 디바이스의 이질성 때문에 보안 및 프라이버시가 공격 탐지의 필수적인 문제이다. 공격에 의한 피해는 빠르게 증가하고 있으며 사람, 조직, 공공 기관 및 정부의 피해 범위도 점점 더 커지고 있다. 상황의 중요성은 점점 증가하고 있으며 동시에 여러 사용자를 대상으로 네트워크 66를 통해 공격을 수행하는 지능형 공격으로 발전하고 있다.&#xD;
본 논문에서는 블록체인, Federated Learning, Digital Twin 등의 인텔리전스 기술을 활용하여 포이스닝 공격 탐지를 위한 블록체인 기반 안전한 IIoT 아키텍처 제안하였다. 제안된 아키텍처는 디바이스 계층, 에지 계층, 안개 계층, 클라우드 계층 등 4개의 계층으로 구성된다. Federated Learning 은 개인 정보 보호에 필요한 부정적인 영향을 완화하고 학습, 처리 데이터, 정확성, 안정성, 낮은 지연 시간을 보장하기 위해 개인정보 보호를 제공하는 에지 계층에서 사용된다. 블록체인 기술은 안개 계층에서 데이터 인증 및 검증을 보장하고, IIoT 네트워크에서 높은 보안, 개인 정보 보호 및 성능을 위해 규칙과 규정에 의해 PoAh 합의 알고리즘에 의해 검증된다. 또한, 아키텍처의 Digital Twin 은 IIoT 애플리케이션의 가상 표현을 제공하고 물리적 환경과 가상 환경 사이의 간격을 채운다. 제안된 아키텍처의 마지막 핵심 구성 요소 및 모듈의 에지 계층에서 Digital Twin 사용된다. Digital Twin 는 Federated Learning 훈련 결과의 정확성을 검증하기 위해 각 부서에서 생성된 IIoT 애플리케이션 데이터의 Digital Twin 으로 가상 모델이다. 보안과 개인 정보 보호를 위한 중요한 솔루션이다.&#xD;
본 논문에서는 제안된 아키텍처를 이론적, 정량적 분석과 함께 수행 및 평가하고 정량적, 보안 분석에서 기존 연구를 효율적으로 비교한다. 평가 결과는 제안된 아키텍처와 연구보다 IIoT 환경뿐만 아니라 기존 방법보다 더 나은 보안을 제공한다.

11591.abstract_en:
Title: Effective Logging and Monitoring Scheme in Heterogeneous Cloud Environments &#xD;
&#xD;
As data is becoming more and more important, Internet of Things (IoT) devices are widely used to collect information and process data from various industries such as finance, autonomous driving, and smart factories. To ad- dress the limited computational power of IoT devices in processing real-time data, both edge computing, which utilizes nearby computers with greater com- putation capabilities, and cloud computing with even more processing power, are widely adopted solutions. As these systems have heterogeneous software and hardware configurations, it can be challenging to understand the behav- ior of the application from the perspective of different resources. This paper proposes an efficient logging and monitoring system in large-scale, heteroge- neous environments for IoT and edge applications. To do this, the proposed scheme first collects system resource usage data from each compute node us- ing the operating system’s native system analysis tool. Then, it consolidates the system resource usage information from multiple nodes into an integrated database which creates a comprehensive view of the system. Finally, this scheme provides global system resource information in terms of specific jobs and nodes, providing a comprehensive understanding of complex heteroge- neous hardware/software stacks. In evaluation, using IoT and Edge workloads in heterogeneous systems, demonstrates the efficiency of logging and monitor- ing schemes. The average network usage for Windows and Linux is 0.12KB and 1.29KB per second, respectively, resulting in minimal network overhead. In addition, the proposed scheme shows negligible overhead in terms of both runtime (up to 0.73%) and storage (0.0474%).

11593.abstract_en:
Title: Accurate Information Type Classification for Software Issue Discussions with Random Oversampling&#xD;
&#xD;
Issue Tracking Systems (ITS) plays a crucial role in software development, offering invaluable insights into issue management. Within an ITS, software developers engage in discussions regarding reported issues, contributing to a rich repository of information. Recent studies analyzed such issue discussions and identified information types of issue comments that appeared in the discussions. Automatic classification of the information types can help developers to more easily understand and locate required information. However, existing techniques often fall short in accuracy. In this study, we propose a novel approach aimed at significantly improving the accuracy of classifying information types within issue comments. The key to increase classification performance is employing random oversampling, to address imbalances among training instances associated with different information types. By integrating random oversampling into our methodology, we trained a classifier using logistic regression with hyperparameter tuning, resulting in an impressive average F1-score of 0.95. This achievement notably surpasses the comparably low F1-score of 0.53 obtained by existing techniques. Furthermore, we explored two additional critical aspects of our technique to comprehensively evaluate its potential for performance enhancement. Firstly, we expanded upon an existing issue comment dataset by incorporating an additional 4,098 instances, effectively almost doubling the dataset's size. This augmentation not only enriches the dataset but also facilitates a more robust training process. Additionally, we conducted a meticulous analysis of hyperparameter influence on classification performance. Our study highlights the importance of choosing optimal hyperparameter values for peak performance. We offer a strong method for classifying information types in issue tracking systems, using techniques like random oversampling, dataset expansion, and hyperparameter optimization.

11599.abstract_en:
In this paper, I inquire about the relationship between painting and its creator. Rather than viewing the relationship between the creator and painting in terms of subject and object, active and passive dichotomies, I perceive it as a reciprocity between the other and myself. The other is someone different from 'me', an unfamiliar and uncontrollable presence. I accept the painting as an incomprehensible other and strive to listen to the will inherent in the painting. The will of the painting is revealed when the painter and the painting establish a horizontal relationship.&#xD;
&#xD;
Methods for approaching a horizontal relationship with the painting could be discovered through the working process. Instead of devising solutions for the purpose, old habits, and changing attitudes became the means. Rather than forcibly unifying them, I tried to accept them as they were and follow the needs of the painting surface as appropriate. The following three methods will describe how I approach to bend or momentarily bypass my will in order to listen to the narrative that the surface tells.&#xD;
&#xD;
The first method focuses on spontaneity and the nature of the surface. It discusses the process of creating without a plan and dealing with the scars and marks that emerge on the surface. In particular, I examined methods chosen to exert less control over the canvas. While revealing the process of painting, I also explored the state of being caught in between or stuck, and even intentionally adopting such attitudes while progressing towards completion.&#xD;
&#xD;
In addition, I examined the significance of "sound" in my work and its relationship with the process. I discuss methodologies for listening to the sounds generated while painting, their meanings, and their visual correlation with the painting. Sound serves as an indicator of physical resistance and an invisible interlocutor that gauges the encounter with the painting. The encounter with the sounds emanating from the surface enables one to become a “listener" oneself. Furthermore, “becoming a listener" becomes my ethical attitude towards painting.&#xD;
&#xD;
Lastly, I experimented with the possibility of the painting having its own logic and autonomy as I delved into the inherent time within the painting. To do this, I utilized a symmetrical structure. Symmetry here doesn't denote visual sameness but rather a symmetry of relationality that is aimed at a "time of dwelling" which generates its own narrative. The process of a choice leading to another choice on the surface unfolds autonomously.&#xD;
&#xD;
In conclusion, the act of painting for me is about learning how to establish a horizontal relationship with the surface. Painting does not exist in isolation but is situated within countless relationships. It is busy, sensitive, and intimately connected between artworks, various layers of perspectives, and within the limitations of the creator's body and mind. My challenge is to sustain this relationality with an intimate and respectful attitude toward the painting.

11601.abstract_ko:
제 목 : 가상적 감각을 영매하는 조각 &#xD;
&#xD;
강렬한 사건은 현재를 비틀며 등장한다. 나는 그 틈으로 정체를 알 수 없는 존재를 추적한다. 가상의 파편은 물리적 공간에서 단서로 자리한다. &#xD;
&#xD;
본문에서 산발적으로 이어져온 실험을 분류했다. 여기에 2015년부터 2023년까지 진행 한 설치 작업, 조형 연습, 조각 및 애니메이션을 포함한다. 작업을 연대기 순으로 따라 가되 크게 네 가지 주제로 나누어 서술한다. &#xD;
1장 ‘입체 작업의 시작’에서는 2015년〈Spiral〉, 2018년〈De-Spiral〉을 간단히 언급하면서 입체 작업을 시작하게 된 동기를 살펴본다. 또 2019년〈만곡부〉연작을 통해 비정형적 형태가 나에게 늘 이끌리는 관심사임을 확인한다. &#xD;
&#xD;
2장 ‘신체 행위와 질료의 관계 탐구’에서는 선행 작업에 부재했던 태도를 점검 한다. 먼저 조각〈Untitled(Rip In)〉는‘내가 유기적 형태에 이끌리는 이유’를 질문 하며 시작했다. 당시〈만곡부〉연작의 조형 방식에서는 드러나지 않은, 재료와 신체 행위 사이 관계를 인식했다. 신체가 즉각적으로 반응할 수 있는 스펀지를 선택하고 뜯어 들어가며 익숙한 신체 감각을 새롭게 전환했다. 한편 《Half-Awake》Project는 ‘죽음 이후의 신체’를 마주했던 최초의 물질적 경험을 들춘다. 공간 안에서 흙의 다양한 상태를 다루고 인간 형상을 교차한다. &#xD;
&#xD;
3장 ‘덩어리지는 물질’에서는 선행 작업의 연장선에서 재료 실험을 전개했다. 이 시기를 조각에 구체적으로 다가가기 위한 준비 과정으로 회고한다.〈둥둥 랜 드〉는 놀이하듯이 파편적 형태를 만드는 작업이다.〈Skin Palette〉연작에서는 조각 표면에 드러난 재료의 불협화음과 이질감에 주목하면서, 흐르는 액체 성질의 재료 를 실험했다. 〈Untitled(Mid〉는 형상을 발굴하는 방법으로 스펀지 캐스팅 기법을 시도했다. &#xD;
&#xD;
4장 ‘비가시 공간으로서의 몸’에서는 애니메이션 〈장기가 떨어지는 듯한 미스 터리한 감각〉을 계기로 내러티브(Narrative)가 작업에 끼친 영향에 주목한다. 이 시 기는 물리적 조각과 가상적 디지털 제작 경험이 공존하면서, 자신의 태도를 조각가 보다 채집가로 구체화한 시점이기도 하다. 채집가로서 가지는 동력을 고찰한다. 이어서〈신체 변이 조각〉연작에서는 조각의 물질성, 질량에 구체적으로 접근한다. 고정된 형상 사이에서 비가시적 얽힘을 만든다. 질량을 가진 몸, 인식에 따라 많은 변수가 작동하는‘신체 이미지', 신체의 괴물성까지 관심을 확장한다. &#xD;
&#xD;
스스로 던진 질문은 창작의지를 일으킨다. 답은 상이하나 질문은 서로 결속된다. 그렇게 나의 작품은 파편적이며 작업은 연쇄적이다. 본문에서는 선행 연구가 뒤따른 연구에 준 영향을 밝힌다. 작업의 전개 양상 및 형식을 중심으로 이야기하되 뒤따르는 놓친 부분을 반성적으로 서술하고자 한다. 파편들이 무엇을 중심으로 흘러가고 있는지 갈무리하며, 채집가로서 마주하게 될 세계를 상상한다.

11601.abstract_en:
Sculpture That Evokes A Virtual Sense&#xD;
&#xD;
Intense events twist the present. Through the gap, I track the unknown. Virtual fragments are placed in physical space as clues.&#xD;
&#xD;
 In the text, I have categorized my sporadic experiments. It includes installations, sculptural exercises, sculptures, and animations made between 2015 and 2023. The work is presented in chronological order, and divided into four main themes. &#xD;
 Chapter 1, "The Beginning of Three-Dimensional Work”, explores my motivation behind my three-dimensional work, briefly mentioning 2015's〈Spiral〉and 2018's〈De-Spiral〉. I also confirm my interest in atypical forms through 2019's〈Curved Part〉.&#xD;
&#xD;
 Chapter 2, "Exploring the Relationship Between Physical Actions and Materials”, focuses on attitudes that were absent from my previous work. The sculpture 〈Untitled(Rip In)〉began with the question of 'why I am drawn to organic forms'. and recognized the relationship between materials and bodily action, which was not evident in the sculptural approach of the 〈Curved Part〉 series. I chose a sponge that my body could respond to immediately and ripped it apart, transforming familiar bodily sensations into something new. Meanwhile, 《Half-Awake》project recalls the first material experience of facing the 'body after death'.  It deals with the various states of soil in space and intersects with the human form.&#xD;
 &#xD;
Chapter 3, "Clumping Matter”, develops material experiments as an extension of the previous work. 〈Dungdung Land〉evokes fragmentary forms created in a playful manner; 〈Skin Palette〉experiments with flowing, liquid materials, focusing on the heterogeneity of the sculptural surface; and 〈Untitled (Mid)〉attempts to use sponge casting as a way to excavate shapes. &#xD;
&#xD;
 Chapter 4, “The Body as Invisible Space”, focuses on the influence of narrative on the artist's work, triggered by the animation 〈The Mysterious Sensation of Falling Organs〉. At this point, physical sculpture and virtual digital production experiences coexist. This coincides with a point in time when I crystallized my attitude as more of a forager than a sculptor. I look at the power of being a forager.&#xD;
 〈The Body Mutant Sculptures〉series approaches the materiality and mass of sculpture specifically. Creates an invisible entanglement between fixed fragments. I extend my interest to the body with mass, the 'body image' where many variables are at play depending on perception, and the monstrosity of the body.&#xD;
&#xD;
 Self-asked questions spark creativity. The answers are different, but the questions bind together. As such, my work is fragmentary and my work is serialized. In the text, focus on the development and form of the work, but reflectively describe the missing parts that follow. In subsequent experiments, I reveal the influence of previous research on subsequent research. Reflect on what the fragments revolve around and imagine the world I would encounter as a forager.

11602.abstract_ko:
제 목 : 문 크리스탈 파워 메이크업!&#xD;
&#xD;
 &#xD;
 본 논문의 제목 ‘문 크리스탈 파워 메이크업!’은 ‘미소녀 전사 세일러문’의 주인공인 일반 여학생인 세일러문이 미소녀 전사로 변신하는 주문이다. 이 만화 속 주문은 나를 환상적인 파스텔 세계로 안내하는 주문이자 내가 살고 싶은 동경의 세계를 의미한다.&#xD;
&#xD;
 논문은 성별에 따라 부과되는 일련의 미적 관습에 대한 의문과 함께, 남성이지만 여성적 기호를 선호하는 나의 취향으로 인해 발생한 작업의 동기를 소개하는 것으로 시작한다. 그리고 나의 상상을 반영한 다양한 자화상의 전개와 나와 같은 취향이 불러일으키는 사회적 소통 혹은 갈등의 양상이 어떻게 작품으로 형성되는지 그 과정을 되짚어본다. &#xD;
 그리고 첫 개인전이었던 『고멘네 우니쨩 우니쨩 고멘네』에 대해 소개하면서, 내가 좋아하는 공주, 미소녀 그림들이 아키하바라에서 어떤 방식으로 소비되는지, 그리고 그 방식을 보고 느낀 나의 죄의식을 칸투어 드로잉을 활용해 어떻게 작품화하였는지 서술하였다. 마지막으로 자화상과 미소녀 캐릭터를 합친 새로운 캐릭터‘ffome’를 소개하고 작품을 만드는 이유와 소망을 밝히며 글을 마친다.

11602.abstract_en:
Moon Crystal Power, Make up!&#xD;
&#xD;
 The title of this thesis, "Moon Crystal Power Make up!" is a spell used by Sailor Moon, a main character in the Japanese animation called “Pretty Warrior Sailor Moon”, when she transforms from an ordinary schoolgirl in to a pretty magical warrior. This spell not only serves as a guiding spell leading me into a fantastical pastel world but also embodies the idealized realm I aspire to inhabit.&#xD;
&#xD;
The thesis begins by introducing a set of questions about the aesthetic conventions imposed by gender, as well as the motivation for artwork arising from my preference that prefers feminine symbols despite being male. It then delves into the unfolding of various self-portraits reflecting my imagination, exploring how societal communication or conflicts arising from preferences like mine become the artwork. And it reflects on the process of art creation shaped by the connections or conflicts with society arising from these unconventional preferences. &#xD;
Through my first solo exhibition, 『Gomenne Unichan Unichan Gomenne』, I described how the princess and pretty girl illustrations I like are consumed in Akihabara, and how I turned my feelings of guilt after seeing this consumption into artworks using contour drawing. Lastly, I introduce a new character, 'ffome', which combines my self-portrait with a pretty girl character, and conclude the writing by explaining the reasons and hopes behind creating these artworks.

11605.abstract_ko:
이 글은 2017년부터 2024년 상반기까지 진행해온 그림을 토대로 포착한 순간을 화 면으로 옮기는 창작과정을 서술한다. 작업의 소재인 배회하며 포착된 ‘가려운 순간’에 대해 이야기하고, 이 인상이 어떻게 화면으로 옮겨지는지를 설명한다. 이를 통해 ‘가려운 순간’을 바라보는 것과 그것을 화면으로 옮기는 과정을 구체적으로 보여준다. &#xD;
&#xD;
 그림의 소재는 일상적인 풍경을 방해하는 불쾌하지만 위협적이지 않은 순간이다. 이 순간은 계속 눈으로 포착되고, 나는 이같이 반복적으로 눈으로 포착된 인상을 촉각적인 가려움에 연결지어 ‘가려운 순간’이라 설명한다. 이‘가려운 순간’은 같은 대상을 포착하기도 하고, 비슷한 형상을 이어가며 포착하기도 한다. &#xD;
&#xD;
 가려운 인상은 기억을 통해 화면으로 옮겨진다. 기억을 화면으로 옮기는 과정에는 온전히 기억되지 않는 빈자리가 생기게 되는데, 그 빈자리는 그리면서 생긴 표현과 떠오른 또 다른 기억으로 채워진다. 나는 이 과정을 ‘그리는 재미로 빠진다’라고 설명한다. 이를 통해 원래 순간을 알아볼 수 없을 정도로 멀어지기도 하지만, 결국 에는 그 순간을 지시하는 형상으로 돌아온다. 화면은 이 과정을 반복하며 완성된다. 이 반복된 과정을 통해 완성된 화면은 목격한 실제 순간에서 화면만의 ‘가려운 세계’로 넘어간다.&#xD;
&#xD;
 가려운 세계는 하나의 화면에서 멈추지 않고 다른 화면으로 이어가며 확장된다. 글에서는 이 이어짐을 '작은 죽음', '이어가는 마디', '익숙한 위반'으로 분류한다. ‘작은 죽음’에서는 작업실에서 반복적으로 목격한 죽은 벌레에서 시작해, 주변의 작은 동물의 죽음을 목격하며 가려운 시선이 넓어지는 과정을 서술한다. ‘이어가는 마디’에서는 가지치기된 나무의 절단면을 그린 동그란 모양에서 비둘기의 잘린 다리로 이어지는 화면을 보여준다. ‘익숙한 위반’은 노상방뇨를 목격한 것으로 시작해 행인의 신체로 확장한 시선을 살펴본다. 이를 통해 노상방뇨와 같은 불쾌한 순간이 행인 간의 움직임의 차이로 섬세해진 시선의 변화를 살펴본다. 세 분류를 통해 다양한 방향으로 확장되는 작업의 흐름을 보여주고 이를 통해 나의 그리기 방법을 따라가 볼 수 있는 이정표를 제시한다.

11605.abstract_en:
This dissertation explores the creative process of moving the captured moment tothe screen based on the paintings that have been drawn from 2017 to the firsthalf of 2024. It describes about the 'tickling moment' captured while wandering,the subject of the work, and how this impression is transferred to the screen.Through this, it shows in detail the process of looking at the 'tickling moment'and transferring it to the screen.&#xD;
&#xD;
The subject matter of the paintings depicts unsettling yet benign moments that disrupt the everyday landscape. This moment is continuously captured by the eyes, and I characterize these recurring impressions as 'tickling moments', likening them to tactile itches. They capture either the same object or recurring shapespersistently.&#xD;
&#xD;
The itchy impression is transferred to the screen through memory. During this process, gaps in memory arise, which are filled by the artistic expression generated during drawing and other recalled memories. I refer to this iterative process as 'falling into the joy of drawing'. Through this method, the original moment may become less recognizable initially, but in the end, they return to the shape that instructs the moment. The screen is completed by repeating this process. Through this repeated process, the completed screen moves from the actual moment of sighting to the 'itchy world' of the screen itself.&#xD;
&#xD;
The 'itchy world' expands through connections to subsequent screen. This linkage is categorized in the dissertation as 'small death', 'continuing node', and 'familiar violation'. In 'Small Death', it describes the process of widening one's itchy gaze by witnessing the death of small animals around it, starting with a dead worm that was repeatedly witnessed in the studio. In 'Continuing Node', it shows screens from a round shape drawn with a cut surface of a pruned tree to the cut leg of a pigeon.‘Familiar Violation’begins with witnessing on-road urination and examines the gaze extended to the body of a passerby. Through this, we look at the changes in gaze that have become delicate due to the difference in movement between passers-by in unpleasant moments such as on-road urination. Through the three categories, it shows the flow of work that expands in various directions and presents a milestone to follow my drawing process.

11606.abstract_ko:
무의식의 언어에서 출발한 이미지를 다양한 매체와 은유적 방식으로 공간에 표현하는 조형적 실험을 주제로 살펴본다. &#xD;
&#xD;
I. 짧은 글을 쓰는 이유에서는 작업의 시발점에 관해 서술한다. 짧은 글쓰기가 시작된 원인과 수수께끼 같은 감정의 표현 방법을 우회적으로 드러내는 경로를 되짚어 본다.&#xD;
&#xD;
II. 압축과 치환에서는 작업의 재료들과 제작 과정에 관해 서술한다. 1. 직관이 발생하는 시간에서는 작업을 할 때 내리는 선택과 결정이 어떤 방식으로 형성되는지 살펴본다. 삶을 구성하고 있는 환경과 사물들이 작업에 흡수되는 과정을 드러낸다. 2. Solid에서는 작업에서 사용하는 조각적 재료에 관해 탐구한다. 고체의 형태로서 모양이 만들어지는 경험에 관해 말한다. 3. Airy에서는 작업의 근원이 그림이라고 여기는 원인 및 다양한 매체를 경유하며 경계를 없애가는 과정을 공기의 성질에 빗대어 탐색한다. 작업이 공간에서 상호작용 하는 방식을 모색한다. &#xD;
&#xD;
III. 환상과 일상에서는 작업에 임할 때 내가 갖는 태도에 관해 서술한다. 작업을 하는 시간이 의미하는 것과 창작의 유희적 이유 및 동기를 모색한다. 나를 구성하고 있는 주변 환경과 사물, 감각의 흐름을 추적한다.

11606.abstract_en:
I explore formative experiments that resonates images originating from unconscious language through various media and metaphorical methods in space. &#xD;
&#xD;
I. The Reason for Writing Short Writing describes the starting point of the work. I reflect on the cause of the short writing and the detours I take to express my enigmatic emotions. &#xD;
&#xD;
II. Compression and Substitution explains the materials of the work and the process of creating it. 1. The moment Intuition Arises, I explore how the decisions are formed during the creation process. It reveals how the environment and objects that make up life are absorbed in the work. 2. Solid delves into the sculptural and carving materials used in work. It discusses the experience of shaping forms in a solid state. 3. Airy, I investigate the reasons why the foundation of the work is considered painting, and how the process of traversing various media and removing boundaries is akin to the properties of air. It seeks to understand how the work interacts with space. &#xD;
&#xD;
III. Daydreaming and Everyday Life describes the attitude I have when engaging in the work. It explores the meaning of the time spent creating, as well as the playful reasons and motivations for creation. It traces the flow of the environment, objects, and sensations the constitute me.

11607.abstract_ko:
제 목 응시와 접촉의 표면&#xD;
&#xD;
무엇인가를 알아차리고 그에 대해 반응하는 과정은 응시와 접촉으로 이뤄지며, 작업을 하는 과정도 마찬가지다. 본문은 2020년부터 현재까지 이어져 온 시/촉각적 경험에 대한 생각과 실험들에 대해 정리한다. 작업이 변화해 온 과정에 따라 시간 순으로 전개하되, 시도했던 매체적 실험과 다루고자 했던 개념을 구분해 서술한다.&#xD;
&#xD;
I. 과민 Hypersensitive에서는 현재까지 이어져 온 작업의 기저에 있었던 개인적 경험에 대해 언급하면서 보이지 않는 대상에 대해 고민하기 시작한 시점을 되짚어본다. 외부의 자극에 신체가 반응하는 방식과 온도에 대해 설명하고, 작업의 주된 축으로 작용하는 개념인 ‘외부 세상과 신체가 가지는 관계성’을 정리한다.&#xD;
&#xD;
II.  표면의 물성은 회화적 조건에 대한 의문과 물성에 대한 고민을 바탕으로 매체적 실험을 전개한 과정을 서술한다. 주된 재료로써 알갱이를 사용하게 된 배경을 밝히며, 점-선-면으로 이어지는 고민의 흐름을 따라 각 요소가 작업에서 어떻게 작동하는지에 대해 이야기한다. 재료의 물성이 작업 과정에 개입하는 방식이나 화면의 지지체가 전면적으로 드러나는 상황, 지지체가 없는 화면에 대해 고민한 과정을 드러낸다.&#xD;
&#xD;
III. 촉각적 행위에서는 보이지 않는 대상과 신체의 관계성에서 확장된 생각을 중심으로, 회화에서 실재성을 확인하고자 했던 시도를 서술한다. 드로잉과 &lt;실뜨기&gt;를 설명하며 의식하지 않은 제스처에 대한 고민과 화면을 만드는 순간의 행위성에 대해 이야기한다. 또한 실제 물건들을 화면에 찍는 방식을 통해 그림의 도구이자, 보이지 않는 대상인 사물에 대해 고민한 과정을 기술한다.&#xD;
&#xD;
IV. 감각의 방식에서는 감상의 측면에서 회화 매체가 가지는 한계를 살펴보고 그에 대한 대안으로 ‘만질 수 있는 그림’을 제시한다. 그리고 그에 앞선 실험으로 ‘먹을 수 있는 형태의 드로잉’을 진행하며, 시각이 아닌 다른 신체 감각으로 경험하는 작업에 대한 가능성을 모색한다. 이후 지금까지 모아온 작업적 단서를 되짚어보며 앞으로의 방향성을 가늠해본다.

11607.abstract_en:
Surfaces of Gaze and Contact&#xD;
&#xD;
The process of perceiving something and reacting to it involves gaze and contact, much like the process of creating an artistic work. This thesis aims to organize thoughts and experiments on visual-tactile experiences from 2020 to the present. It chronologically unfolds the evolution and the progress of the work while distinguishing between media experiments attempted and concepts addressed.&#xD;
&#xD;
I. ‘Hypersensitive' reflects on personal experiences that underlie my ongoing work and traces back to the point of questioning invisible subjects. This chapter describes bodily responses to external stimuli and considerations of temperature, summarizing the relationship between 'the external world and the body,' an overarching concept in the work.&#xD;
&#xD;
II. ‘Surface Properties' poses an inquiry on the painterly conditions and properties. In addition, the chapter introduces the experiments of the mediums that stem from the query of physicality and materiality of a medium. This chapter describes how ‘particles’ have been the most prominent material of the artwork and how my ideas on painting unfold throughout the three visual elements: point-line-plane. The chapter also explores how the medium's materiality intervenes in the artwork's creation, the situations where the support structure of the screen is fully exposed, and the reflections on screens without support.&#xD;
&#xD;
III. ‘Tactile Actions' expands ideas on the relationship between invisible subjects and the body, focusing on efforts to verify the substantiality of painting. This chapter describes drawing and &lt;String figure&gt;, discussing unconscious gestures and the performativity in the moment of creating a screen. It also contemplates how invisible things can be perceived as a tool of drawing and how this conclusion was achieved through imprinting objects on a screen.&#xD;
&#xD;
IV. ‘Sensory Modes' examines the limitations of painting as a medium from an aesthetic perspective and proposes ‘touchable drawings’ as an alternative. This chapter explores the possibility of experiencing work through senses other than vision. It additionally reviews accumulated clues from my past work to gauge future directions.&#xD;

11611.abstract_ko:
제 목 : ‘#미술계_내_성폭력’ 운동의 페미니즘 미술 전략으로 서 장소의 정치: ‘루이즈더우먼’을 중심으로&#xD;
본 연구자는 ‘#미술계_내_성폭력’ 운동의 현장을 목격한 당사자로서 ‘#미술계_내_성폭력’ 운동을 한국 페미니즘 미술의 변곡점으로 파악하고, ‘#미술계_내_성폭력’ 운동 중에서도 ‘안전할 수 있는 장소’로서 ‘네트 워크’를 구축한 ‘루이즈더우먼(Louise the Women)’을 분석하였다. 여기서 는 ‘#미술계_내_성폭력’ 운동을 ‘여기에도 안전한 장소는 없다.’라는 자 기 인식에 기반한 구체적 미술계 여성의 ‘안전과 생존에 대한 요청’이 반영 된 ‘장소의 정치’로 분석한다. 이러한 관점에 따라 ‘여성예술인연대(AWA, Association of Women Artists)’, ‘사일런트메가폰(Silentmegaphone)’, ‘노뉴워 크(No New Work)’, ‘루이즈더우먼’ 등 다양한 주체의 사례를 다루면서 이 운동의 ‘장소의 정치’를 살펴보고, ‘#미술계_내_성폭력’ 운동의 지형도를 제시하고자 한다. ‘#미술계_내_성폭력’ 운동은 이 운동이 가지는 의미에 비해 미술사로 서 연구된 자료가 현저히 적다. 그 원인으로 학계에서 ‘페미니즘 행동주의’ 를 배제해 왔다는 점과, 그동안 미술 운동을 ‘운동’ 대 ‘문화’라는 이분 법 안에서 바라보았다는 점을 들 수 있다. 이러한 한계점을 극복하고 ‘페미 니즘 행동주의’를 포함한 ‘페미니즘 미술’을 재검토하는 계기로서 ‘#미 술계_내_성폭력’ 운동으로서 페미니즘 미술을 연구하고자 하였다. 본 연구에서 ‘장소의 정치’는 물리적 공간의 확보뿐만 아니라 ‘관계 맺을 수 있는 대상으로서, 그것이 거기 있다는 느낌’을 드러내는 존재의 가 시화를 포함한다. 또한 이는 2018년 혜화역에서 발생한 ‘불법촬영 편파수사 규탄시위’, ‘강남역 화장실 살인사건 추모 운동’과 연결된다. 여성 예술인 들은 ‘#미술계_내_성폭력’ 운동의 과정에서 몸의 주권과 통제권, 성원권을 주장하는 성명문 등을 통해 미술계에서 ‘주인이 있는 장소’로서 몸을 가시 화하였고, 전시 등을 통해 물리적인 여성의 장소를 가시화하였다. 뿐만 아니라 페미니스트 예술가로 존재하며 미술계에 자리를 확보하고, ‘네트워크’를 구 축하는 등 마르크 오제(Marc Augé)가 언급했던 ‘비장소’로서 여성의 장소를 확보하기도 했다. 이러한 점에서 ‘#미술계_내_성폭력’ 운동을 ‘장소의 정 치’로 파악하였으며, 본 연구는 다양한 ‘장소의 정치’ 중에서도 ‘안전할 수 있는 장소’로서 ‘네트워크’를 구축한 ‘루이즈더우먼’에 주목하였다. ‘루이즈더우먼’의 ‘장소의 정치’는 (1)‘안전할 수 있는 장소’로서 ‘네트워크’라는 ‘장소 만들기’를 시도한 차원과 (2)‘루이즈더우먼’이 만든 네트워크라는 장소 안에서 발생하는 ‘장소의 정치’의 차원으로 구분해 볼 수 있다. 이들은 ‘여성의 안전과 생존을 지원’한다는 목표를 기반으로 이러한 실천을 하고 있었으며, 이 안전은 성범죄로부터의 안전, 정치적 입장 표명으로 인한 배제로부터의 안전, 정신적 신체적 자산의 소진으로부터의 안 전을 의미했다. 이는 2018년 혜화역에서 발생한 ‘불법촬영 편파수사 규탄시 위’, ‘강남역 화장실 살인사건 추모 운동’과 안전에 대한 감각을 공유하는 것으로 파악된다. 본 연구에서는 이러한 활동을 통해 (1)창작과 여성주의의 선순환, (2)여성 중심의 새로운 예술인 커뮤니티 모델 제시, (3)‘돌봄’을 실천하는 연대 장치 구축, (4)지속 가능한 페미니즘 미술을 위한 전략: 예술 기업가정신이라는 ‘루이즈더우먼’의 네 가지 실천 전략을 발견할 수 있었다. 이어서 루이즈더 우먼의 두 가지를 한계를 발견하였다. 첫째로, 멤버십 제도로 운영되는 루이즈 더우먼이 구축한 안전이 장소 밖의 미술계라는 공동체와 충분히 공유되고 있 는지 지적한다. 둘째로, ‘루이즈더우먼’이 신자유주의를 수용한 측면을 한계 점으로 주목함과 동시에 그러한 선택의 경로를 추적하여, 여성 작가들이 경험 하는 ‘이중 부담’과 그에 따른 안전한 선택에 대해 살펴보았다. 결과적으로 이 연구는 ‘운동’ 대 ‘문화’라는 이분법과 ‘페미니즘 행동주의’를 배제하는 관점을 넘어서 페미니즘 미술의 지평을 확장하고, 다 양한 페미니즘 미술 분석의 도구를 제시할 수 있었다. 또한 그동안 미술사 학 술장에서 구축해 왔던 페미니즘 미술사에 대해 검토하는 계기를 만들었다는 점에서 의미가 있다. 무엇보다 미술계에서 페미니즘 미술에서 중요한 주제 ‘여성의 몸’이라는 주제가 어떻게 장소라는 문제와 연결될 수 있는지, ‘여 성의 몸’이라는 주제가 어디까지 확장될 수 있는지 생각해 보게 했다는 점에 서 유의미하다. 또한 신자유주의 사회 속 이중 부담을 느끼는 여성의 현실이 나, ‘여성 전용 장소’의 발생 계기와 관련하여 타 분야에서 참고할 수 있는 해석의 단초를 제공했다. &#xD;
키워드: ‘#미술계_내_성폭력’, ‘#○○계_내_성폭력’, 미술 운동, 미술사, 미투 운동, 장소의 정치, 페미니즘 미술, 페미니즘 지리학, 페미니즘 행동주의, ‘페미니즘 리부트’

11611.abstract_en:
The Politics of Place as a Feminist Art Strategy of “#Sexual Violence_in_Art World” Movement: Focused on “Louise the Women”&#xD;
The researcher witnessed the “#Sexual Violence_in_Art World” movement during a time of personal social awareness. This study identifies the movement as a turning point in Korean feminist art. More precisely, the analysis of “Louise the Women” focuses on its establishment of a “network” as a “safe place.” The “#Sexual Violence_in_Art World” movement examined the “politics of place,” reflecting the “request for women’s safety and survival” from the perspective of a female individual within the art domain. This analysis is grounded in the self-awareness that “there is no safe place here either.” From this perspective, it delves into the movement of “politics of place” by exploring various cases such as the “Association of Women Artists,” “Silentmegaphone,” “No New Work,” and “Louise the Women.” Its objective is to illustrate the geographical landscape of the “#Sexual Violence_in_Art World” movement. Despite its significance, there has been a notable lack of academic research on the “#Sexual Violence_in_Art World” movement. This gap can be attributed to academia’s historical exclusion of “feminist activism” and the dichotomy of viewing art movements as “movement” versus “culture.” This study seeks to overcome these limitations and reevaluate feminist art through the lens of the “#Sexual Violence_in_Art World” movement as a catalyst for reevaluating both feminist art and feminist activism. In this study, the “politics of place” include securing physical space and visualizing existence, which reveal “the feeling that it is there as an object that can be related to others.” These practices can be attributed to the “Protests to Condemn the Biased Investigation of Illegal Filming” and the “Gangnam Station Post-It Note Protest” at Hyehwa Station in 2018. The female artists affirm sovereignty over their bodies, asserting their right to control and membership within the “#Sexual Violence_in_Art World” movement, envisioning their bodies as “places with owners” in exhibitions, and visualizing a physical place for women. In addition, feminist artists secured a place in the art world and established a place for women that might be considered a “non-place,” as Marc Augé mentioned, by establishing a “network.” In this regard, the “#Sexual Violence_in_Art World” movement was identified as “politics of place,” and this study focuses on the impact of “Louise the Women” in creating a “network” that served as a “safe place” for various “politics of place.” The notion of “politics of place” in the context of “Louise the Women” can be distinguished into two aspects: (1) an attempt to “create a place” referred to as a “network” as a “safe place”; and (2) the second being “politics of place” that occurs within the “network” created by “Louise the Women.” Their practice is centered around the desired goal of supporting “women’s safety and survival,” encompassing protection against sexual offenses, exclusion resulting from political stances, and exhaustion from mental and physical assertion. The “#Sexual Violence_in_Art World” movement is regarded as a movement that shares a sense of safety, as indicated by the “Protests to Condemn the Biased Investigation of Illegal Filming” held at Hyehwa Station in 2018 and the “Gangnam Station Post-it Note Protest.” This study identified four practical strategies for “Louise the Women” through its activities: (1) establishing a virtuous cycle of creation and feminist perspectives; (2) proposing a new female-centered art community model; (3) constructing solidarity methods for “care”; and (4) implementing strategies for sustainable feminist art: the Arts Entrepreneurship. Furthermore, it acknowledged two limitations of “Louise the Women.” Firstly, it raises the question of whether “Louise the Women,” operating through its membership, sufficiently shares the safety it establishes with the art world beyond that particular community. Secondly, it tracks the path of this decision, noting the aspects of accommodating neoliberalism and examining safe choices experienced by female artists as “double burdens.” Ultimately, this study expands the horizons of feminist art beyond the dichotomy of “movement” versus “culture” and the omission of feminist activism. It also provides a variety of analytical methods for examining feminist art. Additionally, it holds significance as it provides an opportunity to review the establishment of feminism in the academic field of art history. Primarily, it prompts contemplation regarding the connection between the significant concept of the “female body” in feminist art and the notion of “place,” as well as the extent to which the theme of the “female body” might be expanded. Additionally, it provides indications for interpretation that other disciplines can use to understand the existence of women facing double burdens in neoliberal societies and the catalyst for the emergence of “women-only space.”&#xD;
Keywords: “#Sexual Violence_in_Art World”, “#Sexual Violence_in_○○ World”, Art movement, Feminist Art, Feminist Art History, #MeToo Movement, Politics of Place, Feminism Geography, Feminist Activism, “Feminism Reboot”

11614.abstract_ko:
한글은 쓰기방향과 글자체의 구조에 따라 가독성이 달라지기 때문에, 한글 디자이너는 쓰기방향을 고려하여 글자체를 설계한다. 연구자는 글자체의 구조와 쓰기방향의 관계에 대해서 파악하기 위해 ‘쓰기방향 전환기 본문용 활자체’의 글줄 형태를 분석했다. 이번 연구를 통해서 연구자는 한글 글자체가 가로쓰기에 적합하게 개량되어 글줄의 형태가 달라졌음을 주장할 근거를 마련했으며, 한글 글자체의 글줄흐름을 분석하기 위한 기준으로서 글자체의 세 가지 형태 요인을 제안할 수 있었다. &#xD;
연구자는 쓰기방향의 전환이 글줄흐름에 미친 영향을 분석하고 글줄흐름에 변화를 주는 글자체의 구성 요소를 파악하고자 했다. 연구 범위는 한글의 쓰기방향 전환기에 활용된 본문용 활자체로 제한했다. 2장에서는 선행연구를 통해 한글의 쓰기방향의 전환 요인과 가로쓰기에 적합하게 개량한 글자체의 형태를 확인했다. 원도활자시대에는 인쇄 기술의 발전과 함께 글자체를 개발하고 활용하기까지의 과정이 획기적으로 단축되었다. 또한 당시의 시대적 배경으로 한글의 쓰기방향이 급격히 전환되면서 가로쓰기에 적합한 글자체가 개발되기 시작했다. 3장에서는 선행 연구의 주장과 문헌을 근거로 글줄흐름의 개념과 유형을 검토하고, 쓰기방향 전환기 글줄흐름의 양상을 확인했다. 해당 장에서 연구자는 글줄흐름을 ‘단어 및 문장을 따라 흐르는 줄기의 형상’으로 정의했다. 그리고 이용제의 《타이포그래피 용어정리》에서 발췌한 내용을 바탕으로 글줄흐름의 유형(외곽선정렬 글줄흐름, 기둥선정렬 글줄흐름, 무게중심선정렬)과 사례를 서술했다. 그 후에는 글줄흐름의 형태요인으로서 세 가지를 선정하여 글줄흐름과의 관계를 서술했다. 본 연구에서는 글줄흐름의 형태요인으로 무게중심축과 기준선, 낱글자의 비례와 윤곽, 글자틀과 공간배분을 제안했다. 글자체의 무게중심축과 기준선은 글줄흐름선의 위치에 영향을 미치고, 낱글자의 비례와 윤곽은 글줄흐름의 윤곽을 구성한다. 마지막으로 글자틀과 공간배분은 글줄흐름의 결구에 영향을 준다. 4장에서는 박경서체, 국정교과서체, 동아출판사체의 관계를 파악하고, 글줄흐름의 형태요인 세 가지를 기준으로 분석한 결과를 서술했다. 박경서체는 기둥선을 기준으로 정렬되며, 낱글자의 높낮이가 다르기 때문에 가로방향으로 쓰면 글줄이 흔들렸다. 이러한 문제를 해결하기 위해서 국정교과서체와 동아출판사체의 구조는 가로쓰기에 적합한 형태로 개량되었다. 국정교과서체와 동아출판사체는 무게중심축이 글자틀 가운데에 형성되도록, 낱글자의 비례를 유지하고 속공간을 조정했다. &#xD;
결론적으로 한글 글자체는 가로쓰기에 적합하게 변형되었으며, 무게중심축을 기준으로 낱글자를 정렬하면서 글줄흐름이 가로방향을 따라 안정적으로 형성되었다. 연구를 통해, 쓰기방향 전환기에 개발된 본문용 활자체는 무게중심축이 가로방향으로 흐르는 글줄흐름을 가졌음을 논증했고 분석대상(박경서체, 국정교과서체, 동아출판사체)은 각 쓰기방향에 적합한 글줄흐름을 고려하여 개발되었음을 확인했다.

11614.abstract_en:
Since the readability of Hangul (Alphabet system used for writing the Korean language) varies depending on the direction of writing and the structure of the typeface, Hangul designers design typefaces with consideration of the direction of writing. This study aims to examine the line form of the ‘Typefaces of the transition period of direction of writing’, thereby to understand the relationship between the structure of the typeface and the direction of writing. The findings of this study could provide the basic evidence for the improvements in Hangul typeface which made it suitable for horizontal writing and changes in the shape of the line, and propose three morphological factors of the typeface as a standard for analysis of the flow of writing lines of the Hangul typeface. &#xD;
In this study, it is aimed to investigate the impact of changes in direction of writing on flow of writing lines and the components of typefaces that change flow of writing lines. The inclusion scope of the study was limited to the typeface used for body text during the transition period of direction of writing of Hangul. In Chapter 2, based on previous research, the factors that led to the transition of writing direction of Hangul and the form of the typeface improved for horizontal writing were examined. During the Wondo (typeface original drawing) type era, the process of developing and utilizing typefaces was dramatically shortened with the advancement of printing technology. In addition, as the direction of writing in Hangul changed rapidly due to the historical background of the time, typefaces suitable for horizontal writing began to be developed. In Chapter 3, the concept and types of flow of writing lines were reviewed based on arguments and literature from previous studies and the pattern of flow of writing lines during the transition period of direction of writing was identified. In the chapter, the flow of writing lines was defined as ‘the form of the stem that flows along words and sentences.’ In addition, based on excerpts from ‘Glossary of Typographic Terms’ by Lee Yong-je, the types and examples of flow of writing lines (outline flow of writing lines, column line alignment flow of writing lines, center of gravity alignment) were described. Three factors selected as form factors of flow of writing lines and its relationships with flow of writing lines were described. In this study, the center of gravity and baseline, proportion and outline of letters, letter frame, and space allocation were proposed as form factors for flow of writing lines. The center of gravity and baseline of the typeface was found to affect the position of the flow of writing lines, while the proportions and outlines of the letters constitute the outline of the flow of writing lines and the letter frame and space allocation affect the flow of writing lines. In Chapter 4, the relationship between Park Kyung-seo Typeface, National Curriculum Typeface, and Typeface of Dong-A Publisher was examined, and the results of the analysis based on the three form factors of the flow of writing lines were described. It is shown that Park Kyung-seo Typeface is arranged based on column lines, and due to the different heights of the letters, the writing lines were uneven when written horizontally. In order to solve this problem, the structures of the National Curriculum Typeface and Typeface of Dong-A Publisher were modified to be suitable for horizontal writing. The proportion of the letters was maintained and the inner space was adjusted for the center of gravity to be placed in the middle of the letter frame.&#xD;
In conclusion, it is found that Hangul typefaces were modified to be suitable for horizontal writing, and with alignments of the letters based on the center of gravity axis, the flow of writing lines was stably formed along the horizontal direction. Through this study, it was demonstrated that the typeface for body text developed during the transition period of direction of writing had flow of writing lines with the center of gravity flowing horizontally. It was also found that the subject typeface (Park Kyung-seo Typeface, National Curriculum Typeface, and Typeface of Dong-A Publisher) were developed considering the flow of writing lines suitable for each direction of writing.

11618.abstract_ko:
제 목 : 반려동물의 죽음으로 인한 슬픔을 위로하는 그림책 『다시 만날 때까지, 안녕』 제작 연구&#xD;
&#xD;
 본 논문은 반려동물의 죽음으로 인한 슬픔을 위로하는 그림책 연구이다. 본 연구자는 그림책 제작을 위해 그림책과 사후세계, 위로에 대한 이론 연구 및 사례 연구를 진행하였고, 반려동물의 죽음으로 슬퍼하는 독자를 위로하고자 『다시 만날 때까지, 안녕』 그림책을 제작했다. &#xD;
&#xD;
 그림책은 우리의 삶 속에서 생성되고 사회 내에서 공유되는 매체로 남녀노소 모두가 그림책을 통해 소통할 수 있다는 점에서 꾸준한 연구가 필요하다. 지금까지 죽음을 주제로 한 연구들은 주로 유아를 대상으로 한 교육적, 개념적 측면에 관한 연구들이 주로 진행되어 왔다. 그러나 현재 반려동물의 죽음을 소재로 한 그림책 연구는 많지 않은 상황이다. &#xD;
&#xD;
 반려동물의 죽음은 사람들이 살면서 경험하는 다양한 상실 중 하나로, 반려동물은 보호자에게 가족과도 같고 산책 또는 여행 등 일상 활동을 공유하며 유대감을 쌓아 서로의 삶에 밀접한 영향을 끼치기도 한다. 하지만 생명을 가진 존재는 언제나 죽음을 맞이하게 되며, 반려동물의 경우 대부분 사람보다 수명이 짧아 보호자가 반려동물의 죽음을 목격하고 우울감 슬픔 등을 느끼는 펫로스 증후군을 겪을 수 있다. &#xD;
&#xD;
 이때 그림책은 독자의 내면에 감정적 영향을 주고 타인의 삶과 가치관을 체험할 수 있는 매체로, 반려동물의 죽음에 대한 작가의 개인적 시선과 가치관이 담긴 그림책이 독자의 감정, 가치관에 영향을 주고 사회적 공감과 이해를 얻는 매체로 기능할 수 있다. 따라서 본 논문은 그림책 『다시 만날 때까지, 안녕』 속 주인공 검은 고양이가 사후세계에서 새로운 친구들을 만나고 삶을 살게 되는 과정을 묘사하여 반려동물의 죽음으로 인한 슬픔을 위로하는 매체로서 그림책의 필요성을 확인하는 것에 목적이 있다.&#xD;
&#xD;
&#xD;
 본 연구자는 그림책 제작을 위한 작품 연구로 그림책 줄거리, 등장인물 자료 조사 및 캐릭터 스케치, 스토리보드 및 더미북 제작, 일러스트레이션 표현 연구 과정 서술, 그림책을 제작하였으며 그림책과 삽화의 일부를 전시하였다. 마지막으로 작품 분석을 통해 그림책이 반려동물의 죽음으로 인한 슬픔을 위로하는 매체로서 기능을 하는지 확인하였다. &#xD;
&#xD;
 본 연구자는 『다시 만날 때까지, 안녕』을 통해 다른 그림책 작가들이 반려동물의 죽음을 위로할 수 있는 다양한 그림책을 연구하고 제작하길 소망한다. 또한 개, 고양이뿐만 아니라 다양한 종류의 반려동물을 키우는 가구가 반려동물의 상실을 경험했을 때 위로받을 수 있는 그림책의 범위가 넓어지길 희망하는 마음으로 이 그림책을 제안하고자 한다.

11618.abstract_en:
A study on the Production of the Picture Book 『Until we meet again, goodbye』 to Comfort the Sadness caused by the Death of a Pet&#xD;
&#xD;
This paper is a picture book study that comforts the sadness caused by the death of a pet. I conducted a theoretical study and case study on picture books, the afterlife, and comforting for the production of picture books, and produced a picture book titled 『Until we meet again, goodbye』 to console readers who are saddened by the death of a pet.&#xD;
&#xD;
Picture books are media created in our lives and shared in society, and continuous research is needed in that both men and women of all ages can communicate through picture books. Until now, studies on the subject of death have been mainly conducted on educational and conceptual aspects targeting infants. However, there are not many picture book studies on the subject of the death of a pet.&#xD;
&#xD;
The death of a pet is one of the various losses that people experience in their lives, and pets are like family to their guardians, share daily activities such as walking or traveling, and build bonds to each other, which closely affect each other's lives. However, beings with life always die, and most pets have a shorter life expectancy than humans, so their guardians can witness the death of their pets and suffer from pet loss syndrome which includes depression and sadness.&#xD;
&#xD;
At this time, picture books have an emotional impact on the reader's inner world and can experience other people's lives and values, and picture books containing the artist's personal gaze and values on the death of a pet can function as a medium to affect the reader's emotions and values and gain social empathy and understanding. Therefore, this paper aims to confirm the necessity of picture books as a medium to comfort the sadness caused by the death of a pet by describing the process of the black cat, the main character in the picture book 『Until we meet again, goodbye』 meeting new friends and living a life in the afterlife.

11620.abstract_en:
A Study on Expandability of Transmedia Storytelling&#xD;
- Focusing on the Comparative Analysis of Online Games and eSport Games -&#xD;
&#xD;
Contents using Transmedia Storytelling that have emerged along with the convergence paradigm are being created periodically. Among the cases of Transmedia Storytelling in various formats such as movies, novels, and games. Storytelling using Gameability that presupposes user participation is more efficient. In this respect, a comparative analysis study was conducted through cases in which Transmedia storytelling is used to expand Online Games and eSports Games. The purpose of this study is to examine the Transmedia storytelling structure that appears in Online Games and eSports Games, and to confirm the expansion of Transmedia storytelling based on the worldview and character.&#xD;
Through the games Warcraft, Dota2, Overwatch, League of Legends, Halo, and Battleground, the three types of Transmedia Storytelling proposed by Maria-Laure Ryan for the analysis of the story world expansion structure, the tangible analysis based on the three types of Transmedia Storytelling: "Center of the branch Type", "Sea anemone Type", "Track Switching Type" and " Story fusion Type" presented by Han Hye-won and Nam Seung-hee in the study of the storytelling structure of Transmedia contents was combined to create a more comprehensive analysis framework, and the above game cases were compared and analyzed according to the analysis framework. Therefore, we tried to explore the expansion of Transmedia storytelling in the future games.

11623.abstract_ko:
제 목 : 자연어추론의 사전 처리방식을 적용한 멀티 모달 텍스트 요약&#xD;
 본 연구에서는 다양한 매체로부터 제공되는 텍스트에서 중요한 의미를 추출하여 간결하게 표현하는 자연어처리(Natural Language Processing) 분야 중 하나인 텍스트 요약에 관한 연구를 진행하였다. 일반적인 텍스트 요약은 메인 도메인에 해당하는 텍스트만을 이용한 요약이 그 주를 이루었지만 요즘은 이미지 음성 영상 등의 다양한 차원의 양식을 각각의 임베딩을 통해 얻은 텍스트 정보와 이미지의 시각적 정보를 함께 활용하는 방법으로 발전되었다. 이러한 시각 정보를 활용한 텍스트 요약 연구가 많은 관심을 받으며 좋은 성과를 내고 있지만 제공되는 이미지의 개수가 텍스트에 비해 부족하고 그 품질 또한 좋지 못한 경우가 많다 이런 이유로 이미지 결합방법 연구와 함께 메인 도메인인 텍스트에 대한 핵심 의미를 파악하는 것이 더 중요해졌다.&#xD;
 본 연구에서는 텍스트의 핵심의미 파악을 위해 텍스트 원문의 자연어추론 방식을 사전 처리함으로써 텍스트들 간의 유사도가 높은 문장들을 미리 추출하여 새로운 요약 원문으로 재구성하는 방법을 제안했다. 높은 유사 관계에 있는 문장으로 재구성함으로써 이미지에서 정보를 많이 얻지 못하더라도 텍스트 자체의 핵심 문구를 통해 유사도가 낮은 문장과 단어를 사전에 걸려냄으로써 요약 태스크의 노이즈를 줄이는 효과를 얻고, 뿐만 아니라 텍스트의 사전 처리를 통해 유실될 수 있는 주요 텍스트 문장을 이미지와 유사 관계가 높은 텍스트를 추출하여 결합하여 요약 성능의 효과를 높였다. 본 연구에서 제안한 자연어추론 사전 처리 방식을 적용한 요약 성능이 사전 처리방식을 적용하지 않은 요약에 비해  ROUGE-1 점수가 10% 향상되었다. 또한 문장 수반관계를 충분히 활용할 수 있는 20개 이상의 문장으로 구성된 리뷰에서는 타 요약모델에 비해 높은 점수를 얻기도 했다. 그러나 원문 텍스트의 개수가 너무 적어 문장 수반관계가 전혀 없는 경우에는 텍스트 자연어추론 사전 처리의 &#xD;
효과는 없었다 텍스트 개수와 요약문 길이 등의 제한된 조건에서 제안 모델의 요약 성능이 높아지는 것을 알 수 있다.&#xD;
 본 연구를 통해 메인 도메인 품질의 중요성을 이해하게 되었으며, 문장의 개수 등 텍스트 조건에 따른 자연어추론 사전 처리방식의 차등적 적용과 조건에 따른 다른 정제방법의 결합 연구와 생성 요약문의 성능평가 방법에 대한 ROUGE 평가지표 외  LLM(대규모 언어모델)  기반의 챗GPT 등의 교차 비교에 대한 추가 연구뿐만 아니라 매우 긴 문장의 자연어추론 사전 처리방식에 특화된 앙상블 모델링 연구도 추후 진행될 것으로 기대한다.

11623.abstract_en:
Multimodal Text Summarization applying natural language inference &#xD;
&#xD;
 In this study, Entailment-based multimodal text summary is proposed. In this study, Research on text summary is conducted, a field of natural language processing that extracts important meaning from text provided in various media and expresses it concisely. General text summary is mainly a summary using only the text corresponding to the main domain, but these days, various formats such as accompanying images, audio, and video are used to summarize text information, images, videos, etc. through each embedding. However, the number of different forms offered is still not large and quality also has an impact. In general text summarization using images and text, it is possible to collect highly related text data that cannot be obtained from images by constructing new text data with high similarity to key phrases of the main source text. Text with high similarity between texts is also selected. and Pre-selection can reduce the noise of the summary operation. In addition, by extracting text with a high degree of similarity between the image and the original text, it was possible to achieve the effect of combining key sentences through images even if key sentences were omitted from the newly constructed data set due to sentence implication relationships. &#xD;
 In various areas, key words or phrases included in the text have the greatest impact on summarization performance, so summary studies using sentences obtained &#xD;
from newly constructed datasets and images through elaborate refinement of the text has been shown to improve summarization performance by more than 10%. In addition, we expect that through this study, we will be able to understand the importance of core domain quality as well as modeling in summary, and conduct additional research combining multiple domains using various refinement methods.

11627.abstract_ko:
제 목 : 딥러닝 기법을 적용한 기술등급 예측 학습모델&#xD;
&#xD;
기술금융은 중소기업이 기술혁신 과정에서 필요한 자금을 보유한 기술을 평가하여 은행에서 자금을 지원하는 행위를 말하고, 은행은 기술평가를 평가 전문기관에 의뢰하거나, 은행 자체적으로 수행한 기술평가에 근거하여 자금을 지원하고 있다. 기술금융은 2014년에 도입되어 2023년 기준 은행의 대출 잔액은 304.5조 원으로 양적인 성장을 기록하였으나, 양적인 성장에만 치우쳐 데이터 비정합성, 기술평가 질적 저하 등의 부작용이 발생하였다. 정부는 기술금융의 질적 성장을 도모하고, 기술평가의 공정성, 객관성, 신뢰성을 확보하기 위해 기술금융 가이드라인을 제정하였으며, 2021년부터 적용하여 기술평가의 등급 판정 기준 강화, 신속한 금융 지원 등을 위해 인공지능 도입도 계획하고 있다. 본 연구는 딥러닝 기법을 적용한 기술등급 예측 학습모델로, 기술금융 가이드라인을 기반으로 중소기업 1,035개 업체를 선별하여 기술평가 및 데이터 수집, 다중공선성 분석, 피어슨 상관 계수 분석, 정규화 변환, 딥러닝 학습모델 훈련의 5단계로 연구를 진행하였다.&#xD;
 본 연구는 기술평가 데이터와 기술평가 서브 데이터들의 다중공선성을 분석하여 TOL은 자본조달능력이 0.890으로 가장 높고, 종업원수가 0.426으로 가장 낮은 1에 가까운 계수를 분석하였다. VIF는 종업원 수가 2.348로 가장 높고, 자본조달능력이 1.124로 가장 낮아 10 미만이면서 1에 가까운 계수를 분석하였다. Durbin-Watson은 1.842로 확인되어 긍정적인 영향을 미치는 상관관계로 분석하였다. 기술평가 데이터 중에서 기술등급과 상관 계수는 D01이 0.269로 가장 낮고, D02가 0.590으로 가장 높게 분석하였다. 기술평가 서브 데이터 중에서 기술등급과 상관 계수는 D10이 0.274로 가장 낮고, D15이 0.482로 가장 높게 분석하였다. 기술평가 데이터와 기술평가 서브 데이터의 각 특성에서 평균을 빼고, 표준편차로 나누어 특성들의 분포를 평균 0, 표준편차가 1이 되도록 정규화 방식에 의해 변환하여 분석하였다.&#xD;
 본 연구는 기술평가 데이터 + 기술평가 서브 데이터, 기술평가 데이터, 기술평가 서브 데이터를 사용하여 TensorFlow, Linear Regression, Ridge Regression, XGB Regressor의 딥러닝 학습모델에 epochs 1000을 적용하여 훈련하였고, RMSE, R2의 성능을 확인하였다. RMSE는 기술평가 데이터 + 기술평가 서브 데이터를 사용한 경우에 TensorFlow가 0.239, 기술평가 데이터를 사용한 경우에 TensorFlow가 0.439, 기술평가 서브 데이터를 사용한 경우에 TensorFlow가 0.446으로 0에 가까워 TensorFlow 학습모델의 성능이 가장 좋은 것으로 확인하였다. R2은 기술평가 데이터 + 기술평가 서브 데이터를 사용한 경우에 TensorFlow가 0.787, 기술평가 데이터를 사용한 경우에 TensorFlow, Linear Regression이 0.606, 기술평가 서브 데이터를 사용한 경우에 XGB Regressor가 0.612로 1에 가까워 TensorFlow, Linear Regression, XGB Regressor 학습모델의 성능이 좋은 것으로 확인하였다. 딥러닝 학습모델 성능 중에서 RMSE와 R2을 종합적으로 고려할 경우에 TensorFlow 학습모델 성능이 뛰어나고, 가장 적은 epochs로 안정화가 가능한 가장 좋은 학습모델로 확인하였다.&#xD;
 본 연구는 기술평가 데이터 + 기술평가 서브 데이터, 기술평가 데이터, 기술평가 서브 데이터를 사용한 경우 모두 딥러닝 학습모델 훈련을 통해 성능을 검증하여 기술등급 예측이 가능하다는 것을 확인하였고, 딥러닝 기법 중에서 TensorFlow 학습모델이 가장 좋은 성능을 보여 기술등급 예측에 신뢰성과 안정성이 가장 뛰어난 것으로 확인하였으며, 기술등급을 상, 중, 하로 구분하여 정확도를 비교하여 확인한 결과 기술평가 데이터 + 기술평가 서브 데이터를 사용한 경우에 TensorFlow 학습모델의 89.39% 정확도를 확인하였다. 본 연구 결과를 기반으로 실무에서 기술평가 수행 시 딥러닝 학습모델을 적용하여 기술등급 예측을 위한 방향성으로, 재평가 수행 시 기술평가 데이터와 기술평가 서브 데이터가 결합된 학습모델을 우선적으로 적용하여 기술등급 예측이 가능하고, 신규평가 수행 시 더욱 성능이 강화된 딥러닝 학습모델이 연구된다면 기술등급 예측 학습모델에 단계적으로 적용이 가능하다는 것을 기대할 수 있다.

11627.abstract_en:
A Technology Grade Prediction Learning Model applying Deep Learning Techniques&#xD;
&#xD;
 Kim, Tae Rip&#xD;
 (Supervisor Kilhung Lee)&#xD;
 Dept. of Bigdata AI Management Information&#xD;
 The Graduate School of Industry and Engineering&#xD;
 Seoul National University of Science and Technology&#xD;
&#xD;
 Technology finance refers to the act of SMEs evaluating technology with the necessary funds in the process of technological innovation and providing funds from banks, and banks request technical evaluation to an evaluation agency or conduct it on their own to provide funds based on technology evaluation. Technology finance was introduced in 2014 and as of 2023, the bank's loan balance recorded quantitative growth of 304.5 trillion won, but it was biased only by quantitative growth, resulting in side effects such as data inconsistency and poor quality of technology evaluation. The government has established technology finance guidelines to promote the qualitative growth of technology finance and to secure fairness, objectivity, and reliability in technology evaluation, and plans to introduce artificial intelligence to strengthen the criteria for determining the grade of technology evaluation and to provide rapid financial support. This study is a technology grade prediction learning model applying deep learning techniques, and based on technology finance guidelines, 1,035 SMEs were selected to conduct research in five stages: technology evaluation and data collection, multicollinearity analysis, Pearson correlation coefficient analysis, normalization transformation, and deep learning learning model training.&#xD;
 This study analyzed the multicollinearity of technology evaluation data and technology evaluation sub-data, and analyzed the coefficient close to 1 for TOL, with the highest capital raising capacity at 0.890, and the lowest number of employees at 0.426. VIF analyzed the coefficient with the highest number of employees at 2.348, and the lowest capital raising capacity at 1.124, which was less than 10 and close to 1. Durbin-Watson analyzed 1.842 as a correlation with a positive effect. Among the technology evaluation data, D01 was the lowest at 0.269, and D02 was the highest at 0.590. Among the technology evaluation sub-data, D10 was the lowest at 0.274, and D15 was the highest at 0.482. The distribution of characteristics was converted by the normalization method so that the average and standard deviation were 1 by subtracting the average from each characteristic of the technology evaluation data and the technology evaluation sub-data.&#xD;
 The performance of RMSE and R2 was confirmed in this study by applying epochs 1000 to the learning models of TensorFlow, Linear Regression, Ridge Regression, and XGB Regression using technology evaluation data + technology evaluation subdata. The RMSE confirmed that TensorFlow was 0.239 when the technology evaluation data + technology evaluation subdata was used, TensorFlow was 0.439 when the technology evaluation subdata was used, and TensorFlow was 0.446 when the technology evaluation subdata was used, indicating that the performance of the TensorFlow learning model was the best. For R2, TensorFlow was 0.787 when the technology evaluation data + technology evaluation subdata was used, TensorFlow and Linear Regression were 0.606 when the technology evaluation subdata was used, and XGB Regression was 0.612 when the technology evaluation subdata was used, indicating that the performance of the TensorFlow, Linear Regression, and XGB Regression learning models was good. Among the deep learning learning model performances, when RMSE and R2 are comprehensively considered, the TensorFlow learning model performance is excellent and it is identified as the best learning model that can be stabilized with the least epochs.

11628.abstract_ko:
제 목 : 고혈압 환자를 위한 ChatGPT기반 챗봇 구현 방안 비교 연구: Fine-tuning모델과 RAG모델 비교를 중심으로 &#xD;
&#xD;
최근 대한고혈압학회는 고혈압 진단을 받은 사람의 수가 2002년 약 300만 명에서 2020년 1,260만 명으로 4배 이상 급증했다고 밝혔다. 특히 젊은 세대에 서 고혈압에 대한 인지율과 치료율이 현저히 낮아 장기적으로 심각한 합병증 으로 이어질 위험이 높다. 따라서 만성질환인 고혈압 환자의 생활 습관 관리 의 중요성이 그 어느 때보다 강조되고 있다. &#xD;
우리나라 앱 사용률 1위인 카카오톡은 메신저 기능과 함께 다양한 챗봇 서 비스를 제공하여 사용자들에게 친숙하고 편리한 경험을 제공하고 있다. 이에 본 연구는 고혈압 환자들이 일상에서 자신의 생활 습관을 효과적이고 쉽게 관 리할 수 있도록 챗봇을 통한 방법을 모색하고자 하였다. &#xD;
2022년 11월에 출현한 ChatGPT는 자연어 처리 및 이해 능력을 가진 거대 언어 모델(Large Language Model, LLM)로, 다양한 분야에서의 활용 가능성을 제시했다. 그러나 ChatGPT를 의료 서비스에 바로 적용하는 데는 잘못된 정보 를 생성하는 환각 현상(Hallucination)이라는 큰 장애물이 존재한다. 이는 신뢰 성 있는 정보 제공이 중요한 의료계에 심각한 문제를 야기할 수 있다.&#xD;
 본 연구에서는 이러한 문제를 해결하기 위해 ChatGPT의 환각 현상을 최소 화할 수 있는 Fine-tuning 모델과 RAG(Retrieval-Augmented Generation) 모델 을 구현하고, 실제 환자의 질문에 대한 두 모델의 응답을 비교 분석하였다. 이 를 위해 OpenAI의 Fine-tuning API와 Langchain 오픈소스 프레임워크를 사용 했다. 각 모델의 응답은 GPT-4와 전문가 평가를 통해 일관성, 관련성, 정확성 의 세 가지 평가지표로 평가되었다. &#xD;
평가 결과, Fine-tuning 모델은 GPT-4 평가에서 평균 3.83점, 전문가 평가에 서 평균 3.66점을 기록하였다. 반면, RAG 모델은 GPT-4 평가에서 평균 4.72 점, 전문가 평가에서 4.55점을 기록하여 모든 평가지표에서 Fine-tuning 모델 보다 높은 성능을 보였다. 이는 RAG 모델이 외부 지식 베이스를 참조하여 데 이터를 제공함으로써 환각 현상의 위험을 줄이고, 고혈압 환자에게 정확하고 신뢰할 수 있는 정보를 제공할 수 있기 때문이다. Fine-tuning 모델은 전자 건강 기록(EMR) 관리, 의료 문서 작성 및 요약, 자 주 묻는 질문(FAQ) 응답 등 구조화된 데이터 기반의 반복적인 작업과 빠른 응 답이 요구되는 상황에서 더 나은 성능을 발휘하는 것으로 나타났다. &#xD;
연구 결과, RAG 모델은 복잡한 질문이나 최신 정보의 정확성이 중요한 상 황에서 유용하며, Fine-tuning 모델은 정형화된 데이터 관리와 신속한 응답이 필요한 영역에서 강점을 지니는 것으로 확인되었다. &#xD;
이처럼 두 모델의 성능은 특정 도메인이나 응용 분야 및 목표에 따라 달라질 수 있으므로, 각 도메인의 특성과 사용 및 연구 목표에 맞는 모델을 신중하게 선택하는 것이 중요하다.

11628.abstract_en:
&#xD;
Abstract&#xD;
&#xD;
  The Korean Society of Hypertension recently announced that the number of people diagnosed with hypertension has surged more than fourfold, from approximately 3 million in 2002 to 12.6 million in 2020. In particular, the awareness and treatment rates of hypertension are significantly lower among younger generations, increasing the risk of severe complications in the long term. Therefore, the importance of lifestyle management for patients with hypertension, a chronic disease, is emphasized more than ever.&#xD;
 KakaoTalk, the most widely used app in South Korea, offers various chatbot services along with its messaging function, providing users with a familiar and convenient experience. Hence, this study aims to explore ways to help hypertension patients effectively and easily manage their lifestyles through a chatbot.&#xD;
  ChatGPT, which emerged in November 2022, is a large language model (LLM) with natural language processing and understanding capabilities, showing potential for use in various fields. However, a major obstacle to applying ChatGPT directly to medical services is the phenomenon of hallucination, where incorrect information is generated. This poses a serious issue in the medical field, where reliable information provision is crucial.&#xD;
 To address this issue, this study implemented a fine-tuning model and a RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) model to minimize the hallucination phenomenon of ChatGPT, and compared and analyzed the responses of the two models to actual patient queries. OpenAI's fine-tuning API and the Langchain open-source framework were used for this purpose. The responses of each model were evaluated using three assessment criteria: answer fidelity, answer relevance, and context relevance, through GPT-4 and expert evaluations.&#xD;
  The evaluation results showed that the fine-tuning model scored an average of 3.83 points in the GPT-4 evaluation and an average of 3.66 points in the expert evaluation. In contrast, the RAG model scored an average of 4.72 points in the GPT-4 evaluation and 4.55 points in the expert evaluation, outperforming the fine-tuning model in all assessment criteria. This indicates that the RAG model can reduce the risk of hallucination by referencing an external knowledge base and provide accurate and reliable information to hypertension patients.&#xD;
  The fine-tuning model was found to perform better in repetitive tasks based on structured data and situations requiring quick responses, such as electronic health record (EMR) management, medical document creation and summarization, and answering frequently asked questions (FAQs).&#xD;
  The study results indicate that the RAG model is useful in situations where the accuracy of complex questions or the latest information is important, while the fine-tuning model has strengths in areas requiring structured data management and rapid responses. Thus, the performance of the two models may vary depending on the specific domain or application area and goals. It is crucial to carefully select the model that suits the characteristics of each domain and the purpose of use and research.&#xD;

11629.abstract_en:
In the modern society, various organizations such as companies, government agencies, and educational institutions provide information, communicate, and conduct various online transactions through web services. As time passes, the importance of web services is increasing, and the stability and security of web servers are becoming more important issues.&#xD;
 However, due to the vast amount and complexity of log data, traditional manual analysis methods are time-consuming and inefficient. To solve this problem, artificial intelligence (AI) technology has recently begun to be applied to log data analysis.&#xD;
 In this paper, one web server, one log collection/analysis server, and one security vulnerability attack server were constructed to analyze the log data generated from the web server, and the normalized log was transmitted to the log collection/analysis server to analyze the collected log. The logs stored in the log collection/analysis server are then subjected to AI analysis, and the completed logs are displayed on the administrator's web page for the administrator to see. Through this, the time spent on analyzing and identifying the status of the log was shortened to facilitate log analysis.&#xD;
 The purpose of this study is to evaluate the effectiveness of the system through specific design and implementation methods of the developed system, and experimental verification using real log data, and to automatically extract useful information from web log data, identify and alert potential risks such as security threats, thereby helping web service providers to respond quickly. &#xD;
 Future research tasks require developing automated response mechanisms to automatically block traffic when threats are detected in real time or to isolate suspicious activities to respond to dangerous situations. These research tasks aim to deepen and expand based on the results of the current research, which could ultimately lead to the development of a safer and more effective cybersecurity system.

11631.abstract_en:
This study predicts stock prices by analyzing news on individual stock prices from Yahoo Finance (finance.yahoo.com) and CNN (edition.cnn.com). As analysis case companies, we wanted to crawl news articles about Tesla and Apple companies and use them to predict stock prices. First, news articles related to Tesla and Apple from the above two websites are stored in the database, the news information of the day is divided into positive, neutral, and negative, and the sentiment analysis results are used according to each news to determine the rate of change in the closing price before and after the news is reported. I wanted to look at the relationship with . While existing studies focused on predicting indices rather than individual companies and analyzed the relationship with the closing price on the day the news was reported, this study calculated the amount of change between today's closing price and the next day's closing price in the case of news after the market closes. So, we wanted to see the direct effect of the news. In addition, domestic studies conducted sentiment analysis using BERT, but this paper sought to compare the effectiveness of FinBERT, which is more specialized in the financial field, by measuring its effectiveness. In other words, we wanted to examine how the stock price prediction rates using the news sentiment analysis results of BERT, which learned a large amount of data among BERT models, and FinBERT, a model that pre-trained the financial domain, differed.&#xD;
  For this study, recent news articles from April 2023 to May 2023 on Yahoo Finance's (finance.yahoo.com) stock bulletin board, and news articles about individual stocks Tesla and Apple from 2010 to 2023 on CNN. crawled. To make the comparison more diverse, CNN added news articles from the remaining big tech companies, Google, Amazon, Microsoft, Meta, and NVIDIA, from 2020 to 2024. In the database, we classified before, during, and after the stock market by taking into account daylight saving time for each year in the United States, and used the stock price data collection library (yfinance) to calculate and store the closing price change. For sentiment analysis based on the collected news, BERT model, which is the basic model and trained with the largest corpus, and FinBERT, a model pre-trained in the financial domain, were used to average the number of positive, neutral, and negative news and the sentiment analysis score to label them. . The labeled emotional analysis score was made into a continuous variable with the average positive score of the day being between 1 and 2, the neutral score being between 0 and 1, and the negative score being -1 and 0. A total of four variables, that is, the number of positive, neutral, and negative news and emotional score as a result of emotional analysis, were used as independent variables, and the rate of change in stock price after news announcement was used as a dependent variable.&#xD;
  The research results are as follows. First, as a result of Tesla's BERT and FinBERT sentiment analysis, BERT showed similar values with a classification of positive 571, neutral 1462, and negative 586, and FinBERT was classified as positive 361, neutral 1611, and negative 651. As a result of regression analysis using FinBERT rather than BERT, the number of positive news showed a higher t value and a significant p value. Second, in the case of BERT and FinBERT, there was no statistically significant difference, but the results of regression analysis showed that the decline was significant as the number of negative news increased, and the number of positive or neutral news did not appear to have a significant effect. In the case of the sentiment analysis score, it was not significant, but the higher the value, the lower the stock price, showing that there were limitations in predicting stock prices using the sentiment analysis score. Considering the above results, it can be seen that investors are probably more influenced by the number of news stories than the content of the news, and that they react more sensitively to negative news than to positive news.

11632.abstract_ko:
제 목 : LDA 토픽모델링을 활용한 전기차의 소비자 리뷰 비교 분석 &#xD;
&#xD;
여러 제조사의 다양한 전기차 모델이 출시되고 있어 소비자의 선택 폭이 넓 어지고 있다. 어떤 전기차를 구매해야 할지 결정해야 할 때 쉽게 접할 수 있 는 정보 중 하나가 소비자 리뷰이다. 소비자 리뷰를 분석하여 제품의 장점 및 개선점 파악하고 이를 개선하여 조금 더 나은 제품을 만들 수 있다. 또한, 긍 정적인 소비자의 리뷰를 통해 더 많은 판매가 이루어지게 할 수 있다. 본 연 구는 에드먼즈닷컴[23]의 테슬라와 현대차, 포드의 소비자 리뷰를 이용하여 전 기차에 대한 소비자의 생각이 어떻게 다른지 LDA 토픽모델링을 통해 분석하 였다. 제조사별 만족, 불만족, 중립 집단 간 토픽을 분석하여 집단 간 가장 많 이 나타난 단어들의 특성을 비교 분석한다. 소비자 리뷰 데이터는 테슬라는 2019년부터 2023년까지 모델 S, 모델 Y, 모 델 X, 모델 3를 대상으로 한다. 현대차의 경우 2019년부터 2023년까지의 코나 전기차와 2022년부터 2024년까지의 아이오닉 5, 2023년부터 2024년까지의 아 이오닉 6 모델을 대상으로 한다. 포드의 경우 2021년부터 2024년까지 머스탱 마하 E 모델을 대상으로 분석하였다. 연구 결과 전기차 구매자는 공통으로 충전 시간, 주행거리, 충전 비용, 세금 공제에 관심을 가지며, 빠른 속도로 주행 시 주행거리 감소, 낮은 온도에서의 배터리 성능 감소에 불만을 가지는 것으로 나타났다. 테슬라의 경우 넓은 실내 공간, 편안한 승차감, 슈퍼차저 네트워크의 편리 성, 오토파일럿, 빠른 속도에 만족하지만 애플 카플레이와 호환이 되지 않는 점과 앱을 통한 서비스 예약의 불편함과 이로 인해 서비스가 오래 걸리는 것 에 불만족한 리뷰가 있었다. 현대차의 경우 인테리어, 넓은 좌석, 주행거리, 적 은 소음, 경제성 등에 만족한 리뷰가 있었다. 그러나 코나 차량 일부에서 배터 리 결함이 있어 새 배터리를 구하는데 소요되는 긴 시간과 그에 따른 서비스 불만족, 아이오닉 차종에서의 후면 와이퍼 없음과 고속도로 주행 시 차량 진 동에 불만족한 리뷰가 있었다. 포드의 경우 외관 디자인과 편한 승차감, 오디 오 시스템, 적은 충전 비용, 세금 공제 및 인센티브에 만족하지만, 작은 화물 공간, 앱과의 호환성으로 인한 불편함, 열악한 충전 네트워크, 일부 차량에서 주행 중 갑작스러운 차량 정지, 서비스에 불만족한 리뷰가 있었다. 종합하여 살펴보면 전기차의 기능적 측면 이외에도 전기차의 편의적 측면이나 AS, 배터 리 성능, 충전 네트워크 등의 고객 서비스는 개선되어야 할 사항으로 보인다.

11632.abstract_en:
Title : Comparative Analysis of Consumer Reviews of Electric Vehicles&#xD;
Using LDA Topic Modeling&#xD;
&#xD;
As various electric vehicle models are being released from various manufacturers, the range of choices for consumers is expanding. When purchasing an electric car, one of the easily accessible pieces of information when deciding which electric car to buy is consumer reviews. By analyzing consumer reviews, you can identify the product's strengths and points of improvement and improve them to create a better product. Additionally, positive consumer reviews can lead to more sales. This study used LDA topic modeling to analyze how consumers' opinions on electric vehicles differ using consumer reviews of Tesla, Hyundai, and Ford from Edmunds.com [23]. By analyzing the topics between satisfaction, dissatisfaction, and neutral groups by manufacturer, we compare and analyze the characteristics of the words that appear most frequently between groups.&#xD;
Consumer review data covers Tesla Model S, Model Y, Model X, and Model 3 from 2019 to 2023. In the case of Hyundai Motor Company, the target models are the Kona electric vehicle from 2019 to 2023, the IONIQ 5 from 2022 to 2024, and the IONIQ 6 from 2023 to 2024. In the case of Ford, the analysis was conducted on the Mustang Mach E model from 2021 to 2024.&#xD;
The results of the study showed that electric vehicle buyers are generally interested in charging time, driving distance, charging cost, and tax deductions, and due to the characteristics of electric vehicles, they are dissatisfied with a decrease in driving range when driving at high speeds and a decrease in battery performance in cold temperatures.&#xD;
In the case of Tesla, we are satisfied with the spacious interior space, comfortable ride, convenience of the Supercharger network, Autopilot, and fast speed, but it is not compatible with Apple CarPlay, the inconvenience of reserving service through the app, and the service takes a long time due to this. There were some dissatisfied reviews. In the case of Hyundai cars, there were satisfactory reviews regarding the interior, spacious seats, mileage, low noise, and economic efficiency. However, some Kona vehicles had battery defects, so there were reviews that were dissatisfied with the long time it took to get a new battery, the resulting service dissatisfaction, the absence of a rear wiper in the Ioniq model, and the vehicle vibration when driving on the highway. In the case of Ford, we are satisfied with the exterior design, comfortable ride, audio system, low charging costs, tax credits and incentives, but small cargo space, inconvenience due to app compatibility, poor charging network, and sudden stopping while driving in some vehicles. , there were reviews that were dissatisfied with the service. In summary, in addition to the functional aspects of the car, the convenience aspect of the car, customer service such as after-sales service, battery performance, and charging network are seen as areas that need to be improved.

11636.abstract_en:
To achieve the deposition of dielectric films with high dielectric constant in nanofabrication processes, an optimal process is essential. Traditionally, dielectric films are crystallized through a vacuum-breaking step followed by high-temperature post-treatment. However, the vacuum-breaking step introduces impurities, making it challenging to fabricate high-quality thin films due to issues such as leakage current. To mitigate these issues, Atomic Layer Annealing (ALA) was incorporated into Plasma-Enhanced Atomic Layer Deposition (PEALD), allowing crystallization to proceed within a single chamber. Utilizing plasma process conditions enables control over various thin film properties, such as crystallinity and density.&#xD;
  In the ALA process, contrary to the 3 second oxidation process, a 30 second long plasma exposure allows sufficient time for ions within the plasma to collide with the thin film. By using ALA, crystallization at low temperatures was induced through plasma ion collisions, thereby achieving high capacitance values. Additionally, ALA reduced oxygen vacancies within the thin film, minimizing pathways for charge movement and thereby controlling leakage current. Changes in thin film properties were investigated by adjusting variables in ALA process conditions such as gas type, pressure, and power. The process gases used were Ar and O2, and both Only Ar ALA and Only O2 ALA were conducted to examine their respective effects on the thin films. The Only Ar ALA resulted in up to a 40% increase in capacitance compared to without ALA (w/o ALA), but leakage current increased to 1 x 10-1 The Only O2 ALA demonstrated approximately a 10% increase in capacitance compared to w/o ALA, with an improvement in leakage current performance by about 1 order of magnitude at voltages above 1 V.&#xD;
  It was confirmed that Ar exerts a physical effect on the thin film, while O2 exerts a chemical effect. The optimal partial pressure ratio of Ar to O2 for achieving high performance was determined. Changes in thin film properties were also observed through adjustments in pressure and power during the plasma process. Both low and high-pressure conditions with ALA application showed an increase in capacitance. Notably, at low pressure, as power increased, the capacitance value rose from 26 nF/mm² to 47.5 nF/mm². Leakage current results at voltages below 1 V were similar to those without ALA but were controlled by about 1 order of magnitude at voltages above 1 V. These findings highlight the critical role of ALA in enhancing the electrical properties of dielectric films, providing a pathway for improved performance in nanofabrication processes.

11641.abstract_en:
Title: Study on Performance Improvement of Schottky Barrier Diode in CMOS Schottky barrier diodes (SBDs) are widely applied in RF circuits due to their advantageous properties at high-frequency. These diodes exhibit a very fast reverse recovery time, transitioning quickly from the ON to OFF state, and have low capacitance due to the negligible depletion region. Moreover, they have a low turn-on voltage ranging between 0.2 to 0.3 V. Recent advances in CMOS processes have led to the development of SBDs with high cut-off frequencies approximately 2 THz with poly-gate separated Schottky barrier diodes (PGS SBDs). However, a significant drawback of these diodes is their large leakage current, which can limit their applications requiring  reverse  bias  operations,  such  as  detectors,  rectifiers,  ESD protection, and frequency multipliers. &#xD;
This study proposes a novel poly-gate separated Schottky barrier diode structure in CMOS. The proposed structure is based on the existing poly-gate separated Schottky barrier diode, yet the floating poly-gate separator is biased through contacts. The proposed structure is fabricated in a 130-nm logic CMOS without any process modification. When a positive gate-to-cathode voltage (VG &gt; 0) is applied (Case-1) , the major carrier in the n-well accumulates under the poly-gate separator. This accumulation occurs due to an electric field formed from the poly-gate to the n-well. This accumulation enhances the transportation of major carriers from the anode to the cathode, resulting in a decrease in the series resistance (Rs) and an increase in the cut-off frequency (ft). Conversely, when a negative gate-to-cathode voltage (VG &lt; 0) is applied (Case-2), a depletion region is expended. It occurs between the Schottky junction and the n+ region. This depletion region effectively reduces the leakage current, which primarily occurs at the edge of the Schottky junction. To verify the operation principles, DC simulations are conducted using Silvaco TCAD. The simulation results confirmed an increase in forward current in Case-1 and a decrease in leakage current in Case-2. The current density distribution in the DC simulation confirmed that majority carriers in  the n-well accumulate beneath the poly-gate separator in Case-1, while the depletion region is formed in Case-2. DC simulation results indicate that the forward current density increases &#xD;
 from 1.7 to 3.4 mA/μm2, representing an approximate increase of 100.0% as VG​ increases from -1 V to 1 V when VD ​= 1 V. Conversely, the leakage current density decreases from 1.3 to 0.6 μA/μm2 when VD ​= -1 V, which corresponds to an approximate decrease of 53.9% as VG​decreases from 1 V to –1 V. DC measurements results indicate that the forward current density increases from 1.0 to 1.4 mA/μm2 (Case-1), representing an approximate increase of 40.0% as VG​ increases from -1 V to 1 V when VD = 1 V. Conversely, the leakage current density decreases from 23.5 to 2.1 μA/μm2 when VD ​= -1 V (Case-2), which corresponds to an approximate decrease of 91.1% as VG​ decreases from 1 V to –1 V. The forward current density for the floating poly-gate and for VG = 1 V is 1.3 and 1.4 mA/μm2, respectively. The leakage current density of for the floating poly-gate and for VG = 1 V is 9.8 to 2.1 μA/μm2, respectively. The forward current density increases by approximately 7.7%, and the leakage current density decreases by 78.6% compared to the floating poly-gate. RF measurements are conducted to extract a series resistance (Rs), zero-bias junction capacitance (Cj0), and cut-off frequency (ft). The Rs is measured to be 20.3 Ω at VG = 1 V, which is 17.5% lower than 24.6 Ω for the floating poly-gate. The Cj0 is measured to be 9.0 fF at VG =1 V, which is 1.1% higher than 8.9 fF for the floating poly-gate. The fabricated device achieves ft of 0.87 THz at VG = 1 V. It is 19.2% higher than 0.73 THz for the floating poly-gate. In conclusion, the biased poly-gate separated Schottky barrier diode structure in CMOS technology can improve either the cut-off frequency or reduce the leakage current, depending on the bias applied to the poly-gate separator. The proposed structure can be fabricated in CMOS technology without any process modifications, which enables integration with both analog and digital circuits. This novel structure demonstrates advancements in RF characteristics or leakage current performance, making it highly suitable for integration into advanced CMOS technologies for various electronic and terahertz applications.

11644.abstract_en:
As the airtightness and insulation performance of buildings are being strengthened internationally, the nursery room, where infants and toddlers spend most of the day, is a space that requires airtightness more than other rooms. In particular, infants and children are classified as socially underprivileged, so they need to be protected more than anyone else in terms of their physical environment, so the space they stay in must be improved to be stable and comfortable.&#xD;
 In order to improve the physical environment for the socially vulnerable, the country enacted the Act on Guaranteeing the Promotion of Convenience for the Disabled, the Elderly, and Pregnant Women in April 1996, and in 2017, the Barrier-Free Living Environment Certification System was established according to guidelines. After operation, it was legislated in July 2018 and efforts are being made to make it convenient for everyone to use the facility.&#xD;
 For nursery rooms in kindergartens and daycare centers that have been certified as a barrier-free living environment with an excellent rating or higher, blow doors are used to seal leakage areas such as windows and doors facing the outside air, children's bathroom doors, vents, diffusers, and indoor units, and then sequentially remove them. The effective leakage area for each element was measured.&#xD;
 Using the ENERGYPLUS simulation program, we created a model based on measured values ​​and attempted to investigate changes in heating and cooling energy requirements depending on the shape of the door facing the nursery hallway and the door to the children's bathroom. In addition, by comparing and analyzing heating and cooling energy requirements, a plan to improve the internal environment of the childcare room was presented.&#xD;
 Therefore, in this study, we measured the effective area of ​​each leakage element in a BF-certified nursery and compared and analyzed the cooling and heating energy requirements according to the shape of the nursery hallway entrance door and infant bathroom entrance door through the ENERGYPLUS simulation program to improve the airtightness performance in the nursery room. A plan was presented. Based on the results of this actual measurement, it is expected that it can be used as basic data for future research on airtightness performance improvement for kindergartens and daycare centers.

11645.abstract_ko:
제 목 : 기본설계단계에서 효율적인 시공성 검토를 위한 하이테크 MEP BIM의 시공상세정보(LOI4C) 자동입력 로직개발 &#xD;
&#xD;
국내 건설 현장 중 하이테크 공사는 다양한 공사 계약 방식이 존재한다. 설계 와 시공을 하나의 조직에서 동시에 진행하지 않고 설계와 시공이 명확하게 구분 된 공사 계약 방식에 일반적인 하이테크 공사를 기준으로 설계를 진행하는 설계 사에서는 실제 현장에 동일하게 적용되는 기본설계 BIM 모델링 단계에서는 단순 시공 이격거리 확보 등 모델링 형상에 대한 최소한에 시공적인 부분만을 검토하고 있다. 공사 시작과 동시에 투입된 시공 BIM 인력은 AFD 단계에서 설계사에서 출도하는 BIM 도면에 대해서는 즉각적인 시공성 검토를 진행하지 못하여 하이테크 공사 특성상 돌관 공사가 불가피하게 진행되는 짧은 공기임에도 사전 검토를 진행하지 못 해 도면출도와 동시에 즉각적인 시공이 필요한 시기에 불필요한 공백기가 발생하고, 기본설계 AFD단계에서 지체된 시간을 만회하기 위하여 과도한 시공 BIM 인력 투입으로 매달 수십억 원 정도의 계획 대비 초과 비용이 발생하고 있다. 이러한 문제로 효율적인 시공성 검토를 진행하기 위해서는 설계사 BIM 모델링과 동시에 시공성 검토가 동시에 진행되어야 한다. 설계사에 BIM 모델링과 동시에 필수 시공상세정보를 자동 입력하기 위해서는 구체적인 공사 방법과 고려해야 할 사항이 제시되어 있는 시방서와 자체 기술 표준 등을 기준으로 검토 분석하여 효율적인 건물 시공을 위한 필수 시공상세정보에 대한 사전 정의가 반드시 필요하다. 이와 같이 효율적인 시공성 검토를 위해 기본설계단계(AFD) 출도 전에 시방서와 자체 기술 표준 그리고 법적 사항 등 실제 현장 공사에 고려해야 할 사항들이 정확하게 명시되어 있는 자료 등을 분석하여 BIM에 연동하기 위해 자동 입력 정리한 로직을 LOI4C(Level of Information for Construcion)로 정의하게 되었다. 시공사에 입장에서 자재 발주, 제작, 물량산출과 같이 기본설계단계(AFD)에서 효율적인 시공성 검토를 위한 작업만 진행해도 공사 기간 단축에 가장 중요한 조기 착수를 통한 공사 기간 단축이 가능할 것으로 판단하였다. 또한 사전 로직 정의 후 모델링을 진행하는 설계사에 시공사에서 검토한 필수 시공상세정보 자동화 매 개변수 데이터 값을 기본설계 단계에서 협의를 통해 공유한다면 불필요한 설계 질의서가 최소화되고 이미 검증된 데이터를 검증하는 불필요한 설계사 이중 검토 등이 감소하여 업무적인 부담이 줄어들고. 시공사에서는 시공 BIM 적정 인원으로 프로젝트마다 계획에 맞게 효율적인 시공성 검토 가능 및 공사 공백기가 최소화 될 것으로 기대한다. 본 연구를 통해 제안 된 로직을 활용하여 하이테크 건설프로젝트에 기본설계단계(AFD)에서 시공에 필요한 정보를 사전 로직 구성하고 BIM을 통해 기본적인 설계 매개변수만을 입력하여도 사전 정의한 시공 필수상세정보(LOI4C)가 BIM과 연동되어 자동 입력된다면 시공 공백기를 줄이고 검토 단계에서 이중작업 및 수백장의 시방서를 일일이 찾아보며 검토하는 불필요한 프로세스와 이를 검토하기 위한 과도한 시공 BIM 인력을 축소하고, 사업을 의뢰한 발주자에 신뢰성을 확보하며, 더 나 아가 프로젝트 종료 후 최종으로 제출하는 마지막 As-Built 도면에 대해서도 BIM 도면 품질 향상 및 계획 대비 공사 조기 착수와 향후 BIM을 통한 건물 유지관리에 효율적으로 적용이 될 수 있도록 기대한다.

11645.abstract_en:
Development of Automated Input Logic of High-Tech MEP BIM Construction Information (LOI4C) for Efficient Constructability Review at the &#xD;
AFD Stage&#xD;
&#xD;
Kim, Dong Hwi)&#xD;
(Supervisor Kim, Sean Hay)&#xD;
Dept. of Built Environment and Building Service Eng.&#xD;
Graduate School of Housing&#xD;
Seoul National University of Science and Technology&#xD;
&#xD;
There are various construction contract methods for high-tech construction among domestic construction sites. Designers who do not conduct design and construction simultaneously in one organization, but design based on high-tech construction, which is a construction contract method in which design and construction are clearly separated, are examining only the minimal constructive parts of the modeling shape, such as securing a simple construction separation distance, in the basic design BIM modeling stage, which is applied equally to the actual site.&#xD;
&#xD;
The construction BIM personnel who were put in at the start of the construction failed to immediately review the BIM drawings issued by the designer at the AFD stage. Due to the nature of the high-tech construction, it failed to conduct a preliminary review even though it was a short air where the stone pipe construction was inevitably carried out.&#xD;
&#xD;
Due to this problem, the designer BIM modeling and the construction feasibility review must be conducted simultaneously in order to conduct an efficient construction review. In order to automatically input essential construction details to the designer at the same time as BIM modeling, it is essential to define the essential construction details for efficient building construction by reviewing and analyzing them based on specifications and self-technical standards that present specific construction methods and considerations.&#xD;
&#xD;
For such an efficient construction review, LOI4C (Level of Information for Construction) was defined as automatically input to link to BIM by analyzing data that accurately specifies specifications, self-technical standards, and legal matters to be considered for actual site construction before the launch of the Basic Design Stage (AFD).&#xD;
&#xD;
From the perspective of the contractor, it was determined that it would be possible to shorten the construction period through early start-up, which is the most important factor in shortening the construction period, by only carrying out work for efficient construction feasibility review at the basic design stage, such as material ordering, production, and volume calculation. In addition, if the data values of the required construction details automation parameters reviewed by the contractor are shared through consultation at the basic design stage, unnecessary design questions will be minimized and unnecessary double reviews of designers that verify already verified data will be reduced, reducing the burden on work. The contractor expects that the possibility of efficient construction feasibility review and construction gap period will be minimized for each project due to the appropriate number of people for construction BIM.&#xD;
&#xD;
Using the logic proposed in this study, it is expected that the necessary information for construction is pre-logic in high-tech construction projects at the basic design stage (AFD) and that the pre-defined construction essential information (LOI4C) is automatically entered in conjunction with BIM by inputting only basic design parameters. It is expected to reduce the construction gap and reduce the unnecessary process of daily search and review of dual work and hundreds of specifications in the review stage, reduce excessive construction BIM personnel to review them, secure reliability to the person who requested the project, and furthermore, the final As-Built drawing submitted after the completion of the project will be efficiently applied to the improvement of the quality of BIM drawings, early start of construction in preparation for planning, and the maintenance of buildings through BIM in the future.

11647.abstract_ko:
현대 사회의 건축 기술 발전과 도시의 인구 밀집화로 인해 고층 건물이 증가하고 있으며, 건물의 고층화 됨에 따라 내부의 공기 유동에 대한 문제가 대두되고 있다.&#xD;
건물 내부에 일어나는 공기 유동의 주요 원인은 외기온도와 실내온도의 차이로 인해 나타나는 연돌효과와 외부 바람에 의한 풍압, 공조 장치에 의한 가압에 의해 발생하게 된다.&#xD;
연돌효과로 인한 민원과 피해가 지속적으로 발생하게 되면서 내부 유동에 대한 문제가 인식되고 있고, 이를 해결하기 위한 고층건축물의 건축심의 단계에서 문제 해결을 위한 연구와 프로젝트가 진행되고 있지만 연돌효과에 대한 건축적인 영향만을 고려하여 기계장치와 건물 외부 요인을 배제한 채 검토 및 대안책을 제시하고 있고, 소방 심의 단계에서는 피난계단과 부속실 제연설비 가동에 대한 분석을 위해 건물의 일부 부분만 분석이 이루어지고 있다.&#xD;
그러나 실제 건축물에 일어나는 유동 현상과 유사하게 분석이 이루어지기 위해서는 연돌효과와 더불어 분석 대상 건축물의 외부 풍압 및 공조 장치에 의한 가압을 고려한 내부 유동 분석이 필요한 것으로 사료된다.&#xD;
&#xD;
따라서 본 연구에서는 연돌효과와 외부 바람에 의해 외벽 면에 작용하는 풍압, 공조장치에 의한 기계적 가압이 건물 내부에 일어나는 공기 유동에 미치는 영향에 대해 분석하고, 세 가지 현상이 동시에 작용했을 때 건물 내부에 작용하는 영향과 연간 영향 분포를 분석하고자 하여, 네트워크 시뮬레이션인 CONTAM W를 활용하여 내부 유동 영향 분석과 CFD 프로그램인 STAR-CCM+를 활용하여 풍압계수를 도출하였으며, 각 유동 가중 요소 적용에 따른 건물 내부 공기 유동을 분석한 결과는 다음과 같다.&#xD;
&#xD;
1. 연돌효과: 압력 차는 각 실의 개구부에서 동일한 패턴으로 나타나며, 계절에 따라 연돌효과 또는 역 연돌효과에 의해 공기 유동이 발생한다. &#xD;
&#xD;
2. 외부바람: 연돌효과 시뮬레이션에 비해 겨울철 최대 압력 차 값이 감소하는 것으로 나타났다. 이는 고도가 높아질수록 풍속이 빨라지는 Wind Profile을 적용하여 고층부로 올라갈수록 외벽 면에 작용하는 풍압계수가 커져, 겨울철 고층에서 공기가 내부에서 외부로 유출되는 것과 반대로 외부 바람은 외부에서 내부로 유동에 영향을 미치기 때문에 압력 차가 감소 된 것으로 사료된다.&#xD;
3. 공조장치: Zone 별 설계된 풍량에 따라 공기 유동의 양상이 변화되는 것으로 확인되었다. 연돌효과와 외부 바람을 고려한 시뮬레이션 대비 18층 인근에서 형성되었던 중성대가 여름철에는 기존 대비 상부로, 겨울철에는 기존 대비 하부로 이동하였으며, 이는 공조 장치에 의한 가압으로 압력 차 곡선이 수직 이동한 것으로 나타났다.&#xD;
&#xD;
4. 복합검토: 공조 장치를 고려한 시뮬레이션과 거의 유사한 패턴을 나타내었으며, 풍압계수의 영향으로 공기 유출에 방해가 생겨 공조 장치에 의한 내부유동 영향에 비해 조금 감소된 압력 차를 나타냈다.&#xD;
&#xD;
5. 연간 영향 분포 : 비상용 엘리베이터와 전실 출입문에 미치는 각 요소의 영향을 비례적으로 나타내었을 때 최하층의 경우, 연중 연돌효과의 영향이 가장 큰 것으로 나타났으며, 중간층의 경우, 중성대가 형성되어 연돌효과와 외부 바람에 의한 영향이 크지 않아 연중 기계장치에 의한 가압의 영향이 가장 큰 것으로 나타났다. 최상층의 경우 연돌효과가 발생하는 겨울철(11월~4월) 기계적 가압의 영향이 가장 큰 것으로 나타났으며, 여름철(5월~10월) 역 연돌효과에 의해 기계적 가압의 영향은 감소되고 연돌효과와 외부 바람에 의한 영향이 커지는 것으로 나타났다. &#xD;
&#xD;
본 연구결과를 통해 건물 설계 시 공기 내부 유동 분석에 연돌효과와 외부 바람에 의한 영향과 더불어 공조 장치에 의한 기계적 가압을 고려한 내부 유동 분석의 필요성이 인식되어 차후 고층 건축물에서 공기 유동으로 인한 피해가 최소화되기를 기대한다.

11647.abstract_en:
This study identified factors related to the internal flow characteristics of high-rise buildings according to wind pressure factor &amp; mechanical pressurization and analyzed their annual effects.&#xD;
The rapid advancement of architectural technology and urban population density in modern society has led to an increase in tall buildings. With the rise in building heights, issues related to internal air flow have become significant. The primary causes of air flow within buildings include the stack effect due to the temperature difference between the outside air and the indoor environment, wind pressure, and mechanical pressurization by HVAC equipment.&#xD;
Complaints and damages caused by the stack effect are ongoing, leading to increased awareness of internal air flow issues. While studies and projects aimed at resolving these problems are conducted during the architectural review stage of high-rise buildings, these reviews often focus only on the architectural impacts of the stack effect, neglecting mechanical equipment and external factors. In the fire safety review stage, analysis typically covers only parts of the building, such as the activation of smoke control systems in emergency stairs and anterooms.&#xD;
To accurately simulate the air flow phenomena occurring in real buildings, it is essential to consider the stack effect, external wind pressure, and mechanical pressurization from HVAC systems. This study aims to analyze the impact of these three factors on internal air flow and their combined effects throughout the year. The analysis uses the CONTAM W network simulation to assess internal air flow and the STAR-CCM+ CFD program to derive wind pressure coefficients. The results of applying these factors to the internal air flow of a building are as follows:&#xD;
&#xD;
1. Stack Effect: The pressure difference exhibits a consistent pattern across room openings, with air flow occurring due to the stack effect or reverse stack effect depending on the season.&#xD;
&#xD;
2. Wind Pressure: Simulations incorporating external wind pressure show a reduction in maximum pressure values in winter compared to those considering only the stack effect. This is attributed to increased wind speed at higher altitudes (wind profile), which affects the wind pressure coefficient on exterior walls. As a result, air flow from inside to outside at high altitudes in winter is countered by external wind pushing air from outside to inside, slightly reducing the pressure difference.&#xD;
&#xD;
3. Mechanical Pressurization: Simulations considering mechanical pressurization show variations in air flow patterns based on the designed air volume for each zone. Compared to simulations considering only the stack effect and wind pressure, the neutral plane formed near the 18th floor shifts upwards in summer and downwards in winter. This indicates a vertical shift in the pressure difference curve due to mechanical pressurization.&#xD;
&#xD;
4. Combined Analysis: The internal air flow pattern in combined analyses closely resembles that of the mechanical pressurization simulation. However, the influence of wind pressure coefficients creates a slight reduction in the pressure difference compared to the effect of mechanical pressurization alone.&#xD;
&#xD;
5. Annual Pressure Distribution: To analyze the weighted impact of factors causing internal air flow in the building, the proportional effects of each factor on major shafts, such as emergency elevators and vestibule doors, were examined. It was found that in the lowest floors, the stack effect had the most significant influence throughout the year. In the middle floors, where the neutral plane is formed, the stack effect and external wind had minimal impact, making mechanical pressurization the dominant influence year-round. In the uppermost floors, during winter (November to April), the stack effect increased the impact of mechanical pressurization, whereas in summer (May to October), the influence of mechanical pressurization decreased due to the reverse stack effect, and the impact of the stack effect and external wind increased.&#xD;
&#xD;
Through the results of this study, it is expected that the damage caused by air flow in high-rise buildings will be minimized by recognizing the necessity of internal flow analysis considering mechanical pressure by air conditioners as well as the linkage effect and external wind effect on air flow analysis when designing buildings.

11648.abstract_ko:
제 목 : 건설공사장 주변 교육시설 소음 예측 기준의 비교분석에 관한 연구&#xD;
  교육시설 소음 예측 기준은 교육환경평가 소음 예측 기준 학교 교지경계 65 dB(A) 이하, 학교 건축물 외벽 55 dB(A) 이하, 학교보건법 소음 예측 기준 창호 개방 조건에서 교사 내 소음레벨 55 dB(A) 이하, 녹색건축인증 비주거 건축물 소음 예측 기준 「공동주택 소음측정기준」 창호가 닫힌 조건 45 dB(A) 미만으로 규정하고 있다. 특히, 건설공사장을 대상으로 하는 교육환경평가에서는 학교 건축물 외벽에서 예측된 소음레벨을 학교보건법 창호 개방 조건에서의 소음레벨을 적용하여 과도한 저감대책을 수립하고 있다. &#xD;
  과도한 저감대책으로 인해 방음벽 관련 안전사고 및 환경문제를 예방하고 학교 학습 환경의 저하 등의 부작용을 최소화하여 학생들이 쾌적하게 조성된 교육환경에서 학습할 수 있도록 지원해야 한다.&#xD;
  본 연구에서는 경기도에 위치한 교육환경평가 대상 사업지 및 교육시설을 대상으로 하였으며, 교육환경평가 기준 학교 건축물 외벽 소음도 예측을 위해 실외음장해석 프로그램인 Cadna-A를 사용하였다. 또한, 학교보건법, 녹색건축인증 비주거 건축물 기준 실내소음도 예측을 위해 총합투과손실, 창호의 음향감소계수를 적용하여 예측하였다. 소음 예측 기준을 만족하는 높이의 가설방음벽 공사비를 비교분석 하였다. &#xD;
  도로교통으로 인한 교사 내·외부 소음측정결과, 개방된 창호의 소음저감 효과는 6.7~16.9 dB(A)로 조사되었다.&#xD;
  본 연구를 통해 얻은 교육시설 소음 예측 결과와 가설방음벽 공사비 차이, 도로교통으로 인한 교사 내·외부 소음측정결과를 바탕으로 교육시설 소음 예측 기준을 교사 내 환경 기준 유지 관리를 위한 학교보건법 창호 개방 조건으로 기준 제정의 기초자료로 활용될 것으로 사료된다.&#xD;
  차이 나는 가설방음벽 공사비는 교육시설 차음성능 개선 또는 정부의 소음·진동종합계획에 동참하여 공사장 소음·진동 저감기술 개발 보급유도에 기여할 수 있다.

11648.abstract_en:
A Study on the Comparative Analysis of Noise Prediction Criteria for Educational Facilities near Construction Site&#xD;
&#xD;
Lee, Ho Seong&#xD;
(Supervisor Kim, Yong Il)&#xD;
Dept. of Built Environment and Building Service Eng.&#xD;
Graduate School of Housing and Urban Planning&#xD;
Seoul National University of Science and Technology&#xD;
&#xD;
  The noise prediction criteria for educational facilities are as follows: within the school premises boundary, noise levels should not exceed 65 dB(A) according to the educational environment assessment noise prediction criteria for the exterior walls of school buildings, noise levels should be below 55 dB(A) according to the School Health Act noise prediction criteria, noise levels inside classrooms with windows open should not exceed 55 dB(A) and for non-residential buildings certified as green buildings, noise levels should be below 45 dB(A) with windows closed according to the "Apartment Noise Measurement Standards." Particularly in educational environment assessments targeting construction sites, the predicted noise levels at the exterior walls of school buildings are used, and excessive mitigation measures are developed by applying the noise levels under the window-open conditions specified by the School Health Act.&#xD;
&#xD;
  Excessive mitigation measures should be avoided to prevent safety accidents and environmental issues related to sound barriers and to minimize side effects such as the deterioration of the school learning environment, thereby supporting students in learning within a pleasantly maintained educational environment.&#xD;
&#xD;
  In this study, educational environment assessment target areas and facilities located in Gyeonggi Province were targeted. To predict noise levels on the exterior walls of school buildings according to the educational environment assessment criteria, the outdoor noise analysis program Cadna-A was used. &#xD;
  Additionally, for predicting indoor noise levels according to the School Health Act and the criteria for non-residential buildings certified as green buildings, total sound transmission loss and sound reduction coefficients of windows were applied. Furthermore, a comparative analysis of the construction costs of temporary noise barriers meeting the height requirements of noise prediction criteria was conducted.&#xD;
&#xD;
  The noise reduction effect of open windows was investigated to be between 6.7 and 16.9 dB(A) based on measurements of internal and external noise levels due to road traffic.&#xD;
&#xD;
  The noise prediction results obtained in this study, along with the difference in construction costs of temporary noise barriers and the measurements of internal and external noise levels caused by road traffic, are expected to serve as foundational data for establishing noise prediction standards for educational facilities based on the window-opening conditions specified by the School Health Act, aimed at maintaining environmental standards for teachers' working environments.&#xD;
&#xD;
  The difference in cost resulting from the construction of temporary noise barriers can contribute to enhancing the sound insulation performance of educational facilities or promoting the development and dissemination of noise and vibration reduction technologies at construction sites by participating in the government's comprehensive noise and vibration plan.

11649.abstract_en:
title : Economic Analysis of Renewable Energy Systems in High-End Residential Facilities &#xD;
In high-end residential facilities, renewable energy systems are being actively introduced due to factors such as electricity rate progression and relaxation of building standards through eco-friendly certification. However, there is a lack of analysis on the economic effects of applying renewable energy systems to high-end residential facilities. Through this study, we aim to provide basic information for homeowners and designers to apply renewable energy to high-end residential facilities.&#xD;
We selected a virtual building for high-end residential facilities and combined the applicable renewable energy sources, solar and geothermal energy, into four cases. We then selected the capacity for each case and calculated the energy consumption for each case using the ECO2 program. We compared and analyzed the calculated energy consumption and conducted an economic feasibility analysis through a life-cycle cost (LCC) analysis.  The analysis period was set to 15 years, which is the full replacement cycle for major equipment. The initial investment cost and maintenance cost were calculated and used for economic feasibility analysis. The results are as follows&#xD;
&#xD;
1) The energy consumption analysis results for each case showed that Case 3 had the lowest energy consumption, and compared to the hypothetical building without renewable energy, it resulted in a 41.3% reduction.&#xD;
&#xD;
2)  The initial investment cost was calculated by adding the equipment construction cost, the subsidy, and the cost of selling the additional area allowed by the green certification for each case. Case 1 had the lowest initial investment cost, which was calculated to be -157,341,690won.&#xD;
&#xD;
3) The maintenance costs were estimated based on the repair and replacement cycles of the main components of the solar and geothermal systems. Case 1 had the lowest maintenance cost at 39,734,759 won, and it was found that solar power has fewer main components compared to geothermal systems, making it more cost-effective in terms of maintenance.&#xD;
&#xD;
4) The energy cost was calculated using the energy consumption amount calculated through the ECO2 program. The calculation revealed that Case 3 had the most cost-effective energy expenditure at 569,098,455 won.&#xD;
&#xD;
5) The total life-cycle cost calculation revealed that Case 1 was the most economically viable option at 573,512,624 won, and it was confirmed that approximately 41% of the energy cost of the hypothetical building without renewable energy was saved when compared to the energy cost of the hypothetical building without renewable energy. Based on the results of the study, it was found that the application of renewable energy to high-end housing is economically effective, and among the applicable renewable energy sources, solar energy was determined to have the most efficient economic feasibility.&#xD;

11650.abstract_ko:
겨울철 공동주택의 표면 결로는 세대 내 표면온도가 주변 공기의 노점온도보다 낮을 경우 발생하게 되며, 여기서 세대 내 표면온도는 주변 환경조건에 따라 다르게 분포한다. 국내 공동주택은 대규모화에 따라 고층 건축물이 늘어나고 있는 추세이며, 이러한 고층 건축물의 경우 고층부로 갈수록 열약한 환경조건에 노출되어 있다. 이는 세대 내 표면온도가 낮아질 수 있는 중요한 요인 중 하나이며, 환경인자에 따라 표면결로 발생율이 높아질 수 있다. 고층 건축물의 실외 환경인자의 경우 발생하는 기후조건에 따라 다양한 분포를 나타낸다. 여기서 외기온도의 경우 고도가 높아짐에 따라 낮아지는 경향을 보이며, 풍속의 경우는 고도가 높아짐에 따라 고층부에서 높은 풍속에 노출되어 실외표면열전달계수가 상승하게 된다. 실내 우각부의 경우 기류속도 저하 등으로 인해 다소 낮은 표면열전달계수를 나타내게 되어 외피의 열손실은 가중되므로, 결로방지 성능에 불리해지게 된다 [8], [10]. 현재 국내 결로방지 성능평가는 「공동주택 결로 방지를 위한 설계기준」에서 명시하는 실내외 온습도조건을 사용하고 있으며, 풍속에 영향을 받는 실내외 표면열전달계수의 경우 「건축물 에너지절약 설계기준」에서 명시하는 값을 사용하고 있다. 하지만 실제 겨울철에 발생하는 환경인자인 낮은 외기온도와 실내외 표면열전달계수는 세대 내 표면온도 저하에 미치는 중요한 요인으로 이를 고려한 분석을 통해 영향을 확인할 필요가 있다 판단된다.&#xD;
본 연구에서는 서울지역의 기후조건과 고층 건축물의 실내외 환경인자를 고려한 세대 내 표면온도 분석을 실시하였으며, 겨울철 기상자료를 활용하여 실제로 발생하는 외기온도와 풍속 조사를 하고, 겨울철 발생 가능한 고층 건축물의 실내외 환경인자를 입력한 시뮬레이션 수행을 통해 세대 내 표면온도에 미치는 영향을 확인하고자 한다. 또한 환경인자에 따른 세대 내 표면온도 저하를 방지하는 개선안을 제시하여 공동주택의 품질 향상을 도모하고자 한다. &#xD;
  &#xD;
(1) 서울지역 기후 분포 조사결과, 외기온도의 경우 11월에서 최저온도 –7.1℃, 12월 최저온도 –14.7℃, 1월 최저온도 –1.2℃로 나타나, 서울지역 최저온도는 국토교통부 고시 제 2016-835호「공동주택 결로방지를 위한 설계기준」에서 명시하는 지역Ⅱ 기준인 –15℃와 유사한 값을 나타내어, -15℃를 기준으로 고층 건축물의 높이에 따른 외기온도를 산출하였으며, 10층, 20층, 30층, 40층의 위치에서 -15.29℃, -15.49℃, -15.68℃, -15.88℃로 나타나, 지역Ⅱ 설계기준인 -15.00℃ 대비 1.9%, 3.3%, 4.5%, 5.9% 감소하는 것으로 나타났다.&#xD;
&#xD;
(2) 기상청 자료를 통해 겨울철 풍속 분포를 조사하였으며, 풍속분포는 최저 0.1 m/s, 평균 2.4 m/s, 최대 8.1 m/s의 분포로 나타났으며, 「건축물의 에너지절약 설계기준」에서 명시하는 실외표면열전달계수인 23.26 W/m2·K은 풍속 3.7 m/s와 유사한 표면열전달계수를 갖는 점을 고려해 3.7 m/s를 초과하는 날을 기상자료를 통해 확인한 결과, 겨울철 88일 중 48일이 3.7 m/s를 초과하는 것으로 나타나 겨울철의 54.5%의 비중으로 서울지역 겨울철 풍속 분포를 확인하였다.&#xD;
&#xD;
(3) 겨울철 실제로 발생하는 풍속 자료를 활용하여 고층 건축물에 대하여 층별 실외표면열전달계수를 산출하였으며, 평균풍속인 2.4 m/s가 발생하는 날의 경우 건축물 10층, 20층, 30층, 40층의 위치에서 실외표면열전달계수는 24.52 W/m2·K, 27.40 W/m2·K. 29.56 W/m2·K, 31.36 W/m2·K로 설계기준인 23.26 W/m2·K 대비 5.4%, 17.8%, 27.0%, 34.8% 증가하였으며, 고도에 따른 실외표면열전달계수에 의한 세대 내 표면온도에 미치는 영향을 확인할 필요가 있다 판단된다.&#xD;
&#xD;
(4) 겨울철 고층 건축물에서 발생 가능한 환경인자를 입력한 시뮬레이션 분석결과,  세대 내 표면온도는 최저 15.17℃로 나타났으며, 국내 결로방지 성능평가 시 적용되고 있는 환경인자를 입력한 시뮬레이션 결과와 비교하였을 때, 세대 내 표면온도 차는 최대 1.12℃로 나타나 6.88% 감소하는 것으로 확인되어 고층 건축물의 실내외 환경인자에 따른 영향을 확인하였다.&#xD;
&#xD;
(5) 시뮬레이션 분석을 통한 세대 내 표면온도를 활용하여 결로방지 성능을 온도차이비율(TDR)을 통해 검토하였으며, 외벽-내벽 접합부인 A지점의 온도차이비율(TDR) 분포는 상부세대 0.18~0.21, 하부세대 0.19-0.21로 나타났으며, 외벽-외벽 접합부인 B지점의 온도차이비율(TDR) 분포는 상부세대 0.12~0.13, 하부세대 0.21~0.24로 모든 지점에서 지역Ⅱ의 벽체접합부 기준(0.26)을 만족하는 것으로 분석되었으나, B지점의 경우 다른지점에 비해 낮은 표면온도를 나타내 지역Ⅱ의 벽체접합부 기준과 가장 근접한 값을 나타내었으며, 환경인자에 따른 온도차이비율(TDR)의 차이는 최대 0.03으로 나타났다. 여기서 결로방지 성능은 온도차이비율(TDR) 0.01 차이로 만족여부가 달라질 수 있는 부분으로 세대 내 표면온도 저하를 방지할 필요가 있다 사료된다.&#xD;
&#xD;
(6) 고층 건축물의 실내외 환경인자에 따른 영향을 확인하고 세대 내 표면온도 저하를 방지하는 개선안을 수립하였으며, 개선방안으로는 국내 결로방지 성능평가 시 적용되고 있는 환경인자를 입력한 시뮬레이션 결과를 기준으로 온도차이비율(TDR) 0.21에 만족하는 결로방지재 두께를 검토하였으며, 결로방지재 두께를 기존 10 mm에서 최대 15 mm 까지 적용 하였을 때 세대 내 표면온도가 최대 0.84℃ 상승하여 고층 건축물의 모든 위치에서 온도차이비율(TDR) 0.21이하를 만족하는 것으로 나타나 세대 내 표면온도 저하를 방지하는 개선방안을 제시하였다.&#xD;
&#xD;
  본 연구에서는 서울지역의 겨울철 풍속 및 외기온도 기상자료를 통해 고층 건축물의 실내외 환경인자를 시뮬레이션에 적용하여 세대 내 표면온도에 미치는 영향을 확인하고 세대 내 표면온도 저하를 방지하는 개선안을 제시하였으며, 겨울철 고층 건축물에서 실제로 발생할 수 있는 환경조건을 고려한 분석을 통해 적절한 결로방지재 두께를 선정을 하여, 세대 내 표면온도 저하를 방지하고 쾌적한 환경을 형성하여 공동주택의 품질을 향상하고자 한다. &#xD;

11650.abstract_en:
In this study, the surface temperature within residential units was analyzed considering the climate conditions of the Seoul area and the indoor and outdoor environmental factors of high-rise buildings. Using winter weather data, actual outdoor temperatures and wind speeds were investigated, and simulations incorporating possible indoor and outdoor environmental factors of high-rise buildings during winter were performed to assess their impact on surface temperatures within the units. Additionally, improvement measures to prevent the decrease in surface temperature within the units due to environmental factors were proposed to enhance the quality of buildings.&#xD;
&#xD;
(1) The climate distribution survey in Seoul showed that the lowest temperatures were -7.1℃ in November, -14.7℃ in December, and -1.2℃ in January. The lowest temperature in Seoul is similar to the regional II standard of -15℃ specified in the Ministry of Land, Infrastructure and Transport Notice No. 2016-835, "Design Standards for Preventing Condensation in Apartment Buildings." Based on the -15℃ standard, the outdoor temperatures at different heights of high-rise buildings were calculated, showing -15.29℃ at the 10th floor, -15.49℃ at the 20th floor, -15.68℃ at the 30th floor, and -15.88℃ at the 40th floor. These values represent decreases of 1.9%, 3.3%, 4.5%, and 5.9% compared to the regional II design standard of -15.00℃.&#xD;
&#xD;
(2) Winter wind speed distribution was investigated using data from the Korea Meteorological Administration, showing a range from a minimum of 0.1 m/s to an average of 2.4 m/s and a maximum of 8.1 m/s. Considering that the outdoor surface heat transfer coefficient specified in the "Energy-Saving Design Standards for Buildings" is 23.26 W/m2·K, which is similar to the surface heat transfer coefficient at a wind speed of 3.7 m/s, it was found that out of 88 winter days, 48 days exceeded 3.7 m/s. This accounts for 54.5% of the winter period, confirming the distribution of wind speeds in Seoul during winter.&#xD;
&#xD;
(3) Using actual winter wind speed data, the external surface heat transfer coefficients for different floors of high-rise buildings were calculated. On days with an average wind speed of 2.4 m/s, the external surface heat transfer coefficients were 24.52 W/m2·K at the 10th floor, 27.40 W/m2·K at the 20th floor, 29.56 W/m2·K at the 30th floor, and 31.36 W/m2·K at the 40th floor. These values represent increases of 5.4%, 17.8%, 27.0%, and 34.8% compared to the design standard of 23.26 W/m2·K. It is necessary to confirm the impact of the external surface heat transfer coefficient at different heights on the surface temperature inside the units.&#xD;
&#xD;
(4) The simulation analysis, incorporating possible environmental factors for high-rise buildings during winter, showed that the lowest surface temperature within the units was 15.17℃. Compared to the simulation results using the environmental factors applied in domestic condensation prevention performance evaluations, the difference in surface temperature within the units was up to 1.12℃, representing a decrease of 6.88%. This confirmed the impact of indoor and outdoor environmental factors on high-rise buildings.&#xD;
&#xD;
(5) Using the surface temperatures inside the units obtained from the simulation analysis, the performance of condensation prevention was reviewed through the Temperature Difference Ratio (TDR). The TDR distribution at point A, which is the external wall-internal wall junction, ranged from 0.18 to 0.21 for the upper units and from 0.19 to 0.21 for the lower units. The TDR distribution at point B, which is the external wall-external wall junction, ranged from 0.12 to 0.13 for the upper units and from 0.21 to 0.24 for the lower units. All points met the regional II standard of 0.26 for wall junctions. However, at point B, the surface temperature was lower compared to other points, showing the value closest to the regional II wall junction standard. The difference in TDR due to environmental factors was found to be a maximum of 0.03. Here, the performance of condensation prevention could vary with a TDR difference of 0.01, indicating the need to prevent the decrease in surface temperature inside the units.&#xD;
&#xD;
(6) The impact of indoor and outdoor environmental factors on high-rise buildings was confirmed, and an improvement plan to prevent the decrease in surface temperature inside the units was established. The improvement plan involved reviewing the thickness of condensation prevention materials that meet the TDR standard of 0.21, based on simulation results applying the environmental factors used in domestic condensation prevention performance evaluations. By increasing the thickness of the condensation prevention material from the existing 10 mm to a maximum of 15 mm, the surface temperature inside the units rose by up to 0.84℃, satisfying the TDR standard of 0.21 or lower at all locations in the high-rise buildings, thereby preventing the decrease in surface temperature inside the units.&#xD;
&#xD;
This study used winter wind speed and outdoor temperature data from the Seoul area to simulate the indoor and outdoor environmental factors of high-rise buildings, assessing their impact on unit surface temperatures. Measures to prevent a decline in surface temperatures within units were proposed based on this analysis. By evaluating the actual environmental conditions that high-rise buildings may experience during winter, the appropriate thickness of anti-condensation materials was determined. This aims to prevent a decrease in surface temperatures within units, ensuring a comfortable living environment and enhancing the quality of high-rise buildings.&#xD;

11651.abstract_en:
In this study, an experimental analysis was conducted to analyze the wind velocity reduced by the measuring instrument in a duct air supply system and to correct the measured wind velocity to its actual value.&#xD;
&#xD;
 Air conditioning plays a crucial role in providing a comfortable indoor environment within building mechanical systems. Accurate transmission of heat and air to desired locations requires meticulous design and installation based on load calculations. Testing, Adjusting, and Balancing (TAB) procedures are essential not only for verifying designs and improving installations but also for the ongoing maintenance of facilities. Wind velocity measurement in the air distribution system is fundamental and a critical task in TAB.&#xD;
&#xD;
 Various methods are employed to measure wind velocity, ranging from using precise equipment to utilizing different measurement instruments like pitot tubes, hood-type anemometers, and anemometers. Generally, traversing a pitot tube within the duct to measure wind velocity at multiple points and averaging the readings is considered the most accurate method.&#xD;
&#xD;
 Our research was initiated based on the prediction that vein-type anemometers introduce wind velocity errors due to resistance generated by rotating blades. Hence, a simple experimental setup comprising a fan and duct was used, dividing the experiment into two cases. Case 1 involved measuring wind velocity in the duct with no resistance in the air supply using an average pitot tube, while Case 2 measured wind velocity using a vein-type anemometer. The wind velocities in both cases were compared and analyzed.&#xD;
&#xD;
 The summarized results of this study are as follows:&#xD;
&#xD;
 The wind velocity measured by the vein-type anemometer in Case 2 decreased by 27.6% compared to the wind velocity measured by the average pitot tube in Case 1. Varied fan speeds were tested, and a consistent 27.6% reduction in wind velocity was observed across all speeds.&#xD;
&#xD;
 Regression analysis in independent experiments for Case 1 and Case 2 identified the relationship between points A and B', allowing for the determination of a correction coefficient (K). This coefficient facilitated the correction of wind velocity values measured in Case 2 to align with the wind velocity in Case 1.&#xD;
&#xD;
 Our experiment revealed a 27.6% difference in wind velocity values between Case 1 and Case 2. It's essential to note that this numerical value is specific to this experiment. Considering this, awareness of the potential significant errors while using vein-type anemometers to measure wind velocity in practical applications can significantly aid professional tasks. Future research should encompass diverse scenarios to further explore and utilize data for practical wind velocity measurements.

11659.abstract_en:
Recently the usage of plastics has been reviewed due to the seriousness of environmental pollution. Plastic products, especially packaging containers and PET bottles, are facing specific regulations such as recycling policies and usage reduction. As a result relevant companies are preparing for environmental regulations by using recycled plastic materials and reducing product weight. These changes require novel manufacturing technologies in the product development process. Therefore scientific and systematic research on the molding technology of polymeric materials is required.&#xD;
  The delivery of product development in recent years has been faster than in the past. The conventional plastic shaping process is mainly based on trial and error. For environmental regulations and new product development, more efficient research methods are needed. In this study the molding process of plastic bottles and packaging containers was studied by computer simulations using commercially available simulation programs that are easy to access in the field and in companies. The molding simulation was performed with the actual product shape. Through various simulation attempts, an simulation method similar to the actual process was presented. It was also confirmed that the simulation results showed similar values to the experimental results.&#xD;
  This research results can be utilized computer simulations of plastic shaping processes that heat the initial products to make them flexible, such as blow molding and thermoforming processe in the manufacturing field. In the end this study can contribute to the development of plastic shaping technology that protects the environment.

11660.abstract_en:
The Lightweighting of products is critical to conserving resources, saving energy and reducing pollutant emissions. In order to replace existing high specific gravity metal materials, the use of polymer composite materials has become the main method for lightweight products. Foam injection molding technology introduces a foam structure inside the polymer material, which can make the product lighter and reduce material consumption. Furthermore, it helps enhance material properties such as specific strength, elastic modulus, fatigue life, and thermal stability. Simultaneously, it offers advantages in providing insulation, absorption, shock absorption, and other functional characteristics. Among various foaming processes, foaming injection molding is a flexible, efficient, and environmentally friendly foaming technology that allows for the direct shaping of intricately designed plastic foamed products. Foam injection molding can be used for a wide range of plastic product applications, including automotive, IT and consumer electronics. However, foam injection molding generally suffers from poor mechanical properties and surface appearance.&#xD;
 Among the methods of foam injection molding, the physical foaming method of injecting gas directly into the resin has been actively researched to date, but the chemical foaming method of forming gas by chemically reacting the blowing agent mixed with the resin is still underdeveloped.&#xD;
 In this study, foam injection molding was performed using ABS resin and a chemical blowing agent. And observe the formation of cells (bubbles) inside the specimen. In addition, the weight and mechanical properties of the specimen were investigated according to the injection molding conditions. Computer simulation was performed to compare the results.

11661.abstract_ko:
사출성형은 균일한 품질의 제품을 대량으로 생산할 수 있다는 장점으로 인해 오늘날 널리 활용되고 있는 고분자 성형 공정이다. 최근 플라스틱 제품의 기능성에 더하여 심 미적인 측면에 대한 소비자의 관심이 증가하고 있다. 성형품의 표면에 금속성 광택을 부여하여 플라스틱 이상의 외관을 구현하는 것은 이러한 소비자의 요구를 충족하기 위 한 노력의 일환이다. &#xD;
 제품 표면에 금속성 광택을 부여하기 위해 일반적으로 금속 입자를 혼합한 용액을 도 포하거나 전기적 방식으로 입자를 증착하는 도금(plating) 공정이 활용된다. 그러나 도금 공정은 사출 성형된 제품을 후처리하는 방식이므로 생산 비용이 증가하며 도금 용제를 세척하는 과정에서 환경이 오염된다는 문제가 있다. 이에 비해 2차원 형상의 금속 첨가 제를 혼합하여 사출성형하는 방식은 후처리 공정을 생략할 수 있어 생산비용이 절감되 고 환경 오염을 방지할 수 있다는 장점이 있다. 그러나 성형 과정에서 2차원 형상 첨가 제의 배향에 따라 다양한 표면 불량이 발생할 수 있어 이를 제어하기 위한 연구가 필요 하다. &#xD;
 본 연구에서는 알루미늄 플레이크(이하 Al flake)를 혼합한 수지를 사용한 사출성형에 서 돌출 및 함몰 형상으로 나타나는 Al flake의 배향과 성형품의 표면 불량을 분석하였 다. 사출성형 실험을 통해 Al flake의 크기와 함량, 돌출된 두께와 함몰된 깊이에 따른 표면 불량의 정도를 광택도로 나타내고 절단면의 Al flake 배향을 관찰하였다. 사출성형 해석 소프트웨어인 Moldex3D를 활용하여 성형품의 외관과 Al flake의 배향을 예측하고 해석 결과와 실험 결과를 비교하였다.

11661.abstract_en:
Injection molding is widely used manufacturing process today due to its ability to produce products of uniform quality in large quantities. Recently, there has been a growing interest in aesthetics of plastic products as well as their functionality. Adding a metallic gloss to the surface of plastic parts is one way to meet this consumer demand.&#xD;
 To achieve metallic gloss on the surface of product, plating process is typically used, which involves applying solutions of mixed metal particles or electrically depositing the particles. However, the plating process is costly, time-consuming, and causes environmental pollution. In contrast, injection molding by mixing resin with metal additives in two-dimensional shapes has the advantage of reducing production costs and preventing environmental pollution. However, surface defects induced by the orientation of 2-D shaped additives can occur during the molding process.&#xD;
 In this paper, the orientation of Aluminum flake in injection molding has been studied. Surface defects in specimen with protrusion and indentation are studied together. Surface defeats according to the flake size and content, protruded thickness and indented depth are studied and quantified by gloss unit. the orientation of Aluminum flake on the cross section of specimen was analyzed. Moldex3D, CAE software for injection molding, was used to predict the surface appearance of the molded articles and the orientation of Aluminum flakes.  Simulation results were compared with experimental results.

11668.abstract_en:
Chemically strengthened glass has been extensively utilized across various industries such as electronics, display, construction, and automotive, owing to its exceptional resistance to external impacts. This type of glass is produced through a chemical strengthening process applied to the original glass substrate. The process involves immersing the base glass in molten KNO3 salt at temperatures around 450℃ for several hours. Consequently, the smaller Na+ ions present on the glass surface are substituted with larger K+ ions, creating a compressive stress due to an ion radius gradient.&#xD;
  Despite its high durability and impact resistance, chemically strengthened glass is difficult to cut or machine using conventional methods. Typically, glass is cut by propagating the intial cracks generated near the surface into the depth direction by an impact. However, the compressive stress layer on chemically strengthened glass tends to hamper the crack propagation, making the cut difficult. As a result, it's common practice to pre-cut chemically strengthened glass to size before the chemical strengthening process, which substantially reduces manufacturing efficiency and flexibility. Therefore, there's a need to develop cutting methods tailored for chemically strengthened glass.&#xD;
  In this study, a CO2 laser and a blue diode laser were employed to locally alleviate the surface's compressive stress and thus enable conventional cutting of chemically strengthened glass. The CO2 laser surface treatment involved applying a paste containing Na+ ions along the cutting line and heating it with the laser, relaxing the compressive stress through reverse ion exchange. The use of the blue diode laser allowed for etching the glass surface and reversing the presence of K+ ions with Na+ ions simultaneously by the laser back wet etching process (LIBWE). Chemically strengthened glass treated with these methods could be cut conventionally using the scribe-and-break method, which indicates that the relaxation of surface compressive stress were successfully achieved.&#xD;
  The methods developed in this study offer flexibility in tool path generation and cost-effectiveness because they employ relatively inexpensive lasers for the treatments. Furthermore, these methods show potential for the mechanical micro-machining of chemically strengthened glass which require localized relief of the surface compressive stress.

11671.abstract_ko:
제 목 : 인지 무선 네트워크의 자원 할당을 위한 Graph Neural Network 기반 Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning 연구 &#xD;
&#xD;
5G 무선 네트워크의 발전으로 사용자들에게 고속의 데이터 전송과 대용량 멀티미디어 서비스와 같이 다양한 서비스를 제공할 수 있게 되었다. 하지만 이러한 서비스의 발전에 따라 무선 네트워크 트래픽 또한 자연스럽게 증가하게 되었고, 이는 무선 주파수 자원 부족에 대한 우려를 야기하게 되었다. 이 문제에 대한 해결책으로, 사용되지 않는 주파수 대역인 Spectrum Hole 또는 White Space를 탐지하고 활용할 수 있는 Cognitive Radio Network가 고려되고 있다. 이 네트워크의 Unlicensed User는 특정 스펙트럼에 대한 사용 권한은 없으나, 활용 가능한 스펙트럼을 감지하고 재사용할 수 있으며, 이 중 Underlay Cognitive Radio Network는 Licensed User와 Unlicensed User가 동일한 스펙트럼을 공유하는 것이 허용되는 접근 방식이다. 이 네트워크는 전체적인 무선 네트워크 스펙트럼의 효율성을 향상시킬 수 있으나, Licensed User의 서비스 품질에 미치는 영향을 최소화해야 하기에 Unlicensed User가 Licensed User에 게 미치는 간섭을 엄격히 관리해야 한다. 하지만 셀룰러 셀 내에 다수의 Cognitive Radio Network가 존재하는 환경에서 모든 사용자의 이동성과 제약 조건을 고려하여 자원을 할당하는 것에는 큰 어려움이 따른다. 본 연구에서는 이러한 문제를 극복하기 위해 복잡한 네트워크 환경을 그래프로 표현하고, Graph Neural Network와 Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning을 사용하여 사용자에게 최적의 자원을 할당하는 시스템을 제안한다. 이 시스템은 네트워크 의 복잡도를 낮추기 위하여 통신 링크를 노드로, 간섭 링크를 에지로 표현하였다. 또한, 노드 및 에지의 특징으로 Channel State Information이 아닌 거리 기반 특징을 중점적으로 활용하였다. 이러한 그래프는 Graph Neural Network 의 입력으로 사용되어 네트워크의 공간적 특성을 추출하고, 각 에이전트는 추출된 데이터를 활용하여 제약 조건을 만족시키면서 각 사용자에게 최적의 채 널 및 전력을 할당할 수 있음을 확인하였다. 특히, 다른 알고리즘들과의 비교 를 통해 제안하는 알고리즘이 더 우수한 성능을 제공할 수 있음을 확인하였다.&#xD;

11671.abstract_en:
A Study on Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning Based on Graph Neural Network for Resource Allocation in Cognitive Radio Network&#xD;
&#xD;
  The development of 5G wireless networks has enabled the provision of various services to users, such as high-speed data transmission and large-capacity multimedia services. However, the advancement of these services has naturally led to an increase in wireless network traffic, which has caused concerns about the shortage of wireless frequency resources. As a solution to this problem, the Cognitive Radio Network, which can detect and utilize unused frequency bands known as Spectrum Holes or White Spaces, is being considered. Unlicensed Users in this network do not have permissions to specific spectrum, but they can detect and reuse available spectrum. Among them, the Underlay Cognitive Radio Network is an approach that permits both Licensed Users and Unlicensed Users to share the same Licensed spectrum. This network can enhance the overall efficiency of the wireless network spectrum. But, to minimize the impact on the service quality of Licensed Users, it is necessary to strictly manage the interference caused by Unlicensed Users to Licensed Users. However, in an environment with multiple Cognitive Radio Networks within a Cellular cell, it is challenging to allocate resources while considering the mobility and constraints of all users. In this study, to overcome these problems, we represent the complex network environment as a graph and propose a system that allocates optimal resources to users using Graph Neural Networks and Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning. To reduce the complexity of the network, this system represents communication links as nodes and interference links as edges. Additionally, the focus was on utilizing distance based characteristics rather than Channel State Information(CSI) for the features of nodes and edges. This graph is utilized as an input for the Graph Neural Network to extract the spatial characteristics of the network. It has been checked that each agent can use the extracted data to allocate the optimal channel and power to each user, while still satisfying the constraints. In particular, it was confirmed through comparison with other algorithms that the proposed algorithm can provide better performance.&#xD;

11672.abstract_en:
Domestic IPTV service has shown explosive subscriber growth since its launch in 2009, reaching approximately 20 million subscribers as of 2022. However, in the United States, CATV operators are experiencing a cord-cutting phenomenon in which subscribers are rapidly switching to OTT. On the other hand, the cordcutting phenomenon faced by US CATV operators does not occur in domestic IPTV. Rather, despite fierc competition with global OTT, the average annual subscriber growth rate over the past five years has been maintained at 8.6%. The first reason for this is that OTT provides a video streaming service similar to IPTV, but IPTV has unique technical features such as real-time broadcasting, VOD service, and interactive service that differentiate it from OTT. In addition, the production and transmission of IPTV's own content, the provision of additional services such as bundled discount benefits, N-Screen, and mobile environment support are believed to be factors affecting the continued increase in IPTV service subscribers. The second subdivision is the diversification of subscription age. This is due to the increase in the number of single-person households, increased demand for TV viewing within the same household, support for IPTV mobile services, and the spread of second TVs, increasing the number of TV viewers per household from the traditional middle-aged and older generation to 1 person per age group of subscribers. 1 The number of subscribers in the form of TV is steadily increasing. It can be assumed that the demand resulting from the diversification of age groups and household separation is the reason for the increase in IPTV subscribers. Accordingly, in order to respond, IPTV operators have been making efforts to expand young people in their 20s into new IPTV subscribers since 2018, such as providing low-cost IPTV products and mobile IPTV support, but the IPTV service subscription rate among people in their 20s is the lowest. This also means that the perception of IPTV service acceptance and willingness to subscribe may vary depending on age. However, there is a &#xD;
lack of empirical research on how IPTV services and technology affect subscription intention. Therefore, an empirical analysis was conducted based on the UTAUT-2 theory to determine the perception of IPTV's technical features and services among subscribers of various ages that influence service subscription. Based on previous research and surveys, subscription to IPTV service can be seen as a voluntary acceptance of information technology. Therefore, the research model was based on Technology Acceptance Theory 2 and the platform usability, convenience of service use, content competitiveness, social reputation, and price satisfaction were determined by subscribing to the service. It was assumed that it would affect intention. In addition, the hypothesis was set that the impact of these five independent variables on intention to join &#xD;
would vary depending on age. For empirical analysis, this study conducted a survey of 452 members of the general public, and the response data of 431 of them were statistically analyzed using SPSS 27 to derive the results. The analysis results of this study are as follows. &#xD;
ⅰ) First, the main factors that affect the intention to subscribe to IPTV services are platform usability and price satisfaction. In other words, being able to use real-time TV broadcasting, VOD, and interactive services simultaneously with one IPTV is a major factor for customers to subscribe to IPTV. In addition, IPTV, led by telecommunication companies, is being distributed as an additional service with a policy of charging very low usage fees to customers who use existing wired and wireless calls and Internet services, and to their subscribers who sign contracts. In this way, it was confirmed that customers' high satisfaction with the price of IPTV service fees compared to other media services was the biggest factor in subscribing to IPTV services. &#xD;
ii) Second, it was confirmed that the influence of content competitiveness and price satisfaction on the intention to subscribe to IPTV service has a moderating effect that varies depending on age. In other words, the various real-time channels owned by IPTV and the vast amount of accumulated VOD content show a positive moderating effect on the intention to subscribe to the service as the control variable age increases. This is the fact that the various broadcasting channels and VOD content owned by IPTV show a strengthening effect that has a greater influence on subscription intention due to the interaction between age and content competitiveness as age increases. However, it was confirmed that price satisfaction has a negative moderating effect on the intention to subscribe to services as age increases, and that it has a greater moderating effect on the intention to subscribe than content competitiveness. This confirmed that when price satisfaction affects the intention to subscribe, as the control variable of age increases, the effect of price satisfaction on the intention to subscribe has the effect of mitigating. To interpret this differently, it can be interpreted that the initial service subscription and maintenance costs have a relatively greater impact on the intention to subscribe in younger age groups such as those in their 20s, and have a relatively smaller impact on the intention to subscribe as age increases. The implications of these results are as follows. &#xD;
ⅲ) Ultimately, in order to continue to develop IPTV and secure subscribers, the usability of the IPTV platform must be further maximized. This means that IPTV must be expanded and developed as a media multi-platform that integrates services such as OTT and Netflix in addition to the existing platform that can simultaneously support real-time multi-channel broadcasting, VOD services, and interactive services. As a result, there is a need to evolve into a service provision model that allows customers to selectively use services such as OTT or Netflix by subscribing to IPTV. Additionally, there is a need to lower the price satisfaction felt by subscribers. In particular, it has been confirmed that price satisfaction has a negative impact on the intention to subscribe to services depending on age, so there is a need to increase price satisfaction in a more drastic way for younger generations such as those in their 20s. &#xD;
iv) IPTV's content competitiveness lies in the provision of various real-time channel and extensive VOD content. This has a positive (+) effect on the intention to join as age increases. Therefore, the policy of consistently providing diverse and extensive content to customers is very effective in securing subscribers. However, in addition to the vast quantitative content competitiveness, qualitative content competitiveness is also needed. Global OTTs such as Netflix have recently been securing young subscribers, mainly those in their 20s, through a strategy of producing and distributing their own content, and this is a model for strengthening the competitiveness of qualitative content that has already been &#xD;
proven in the market. IPTV has also recently been attempting a qualitative content growth strategy by producing and distributing its own original content. It is believed that IPTV's ability to produce and supply unique content that can provide unique attractions can be an alternative that can maintain a competitive edge in the competitive environment with new media such as OTT and increase subscribers, especially among younger generations such as those in their 20s

11674.abstract_ko:
비대면 사회로의 전환은 편리함과 효율성을 제공하며, 키오스크의 사용을 증대하게 하였다. 이러한 키오스크 시스템은 공공장소에서 정보 제공, 서비스 제공, 결제 등의 다양한 메뉴 기능을 제공하며, 비대면 환경에서 중요한 역할을 하게 되었다. 그러나, 다양한 메뉴 선택 기능을 갖춘 키오스크는 디지털 문맹자들에게 혼란을 초래하며, 이들은 키오스크 사용에 어려움을 느껴 이를 피하려는 경향을 나타내며, 키오스크 시스템 보급 및 확장에 제약이 되고 있다.&#xD;
따라서, 본 연구에서는 디지털 문맹자 선별기반의 스마트 키오스크 시스템을 구현하는 것을 연구목표로 하였다. &#xD;
본 연구에서 디지털 문맹자 선별기반의 스마트 키오스크 시스템을 구현하기 위하여, 카메라 2대를 이용하여, 얼굴 인식, 감정 인식과 눈 움직임을 추적하였으며, 타이머를 이용하여, 선택 버튼을 누를 때까지의 대기 시간을 측정하는 것을 제안하였다.&#xD;
인터넷에서 수집한 5,000장의 얼굴 사진 데이터셋에서 DeepFace 기술을 이용하여, 제안한 시스템은 50세 이상의 대상에 대하여, 나이 인식 결과 95.5%, 50세 이상의 대상에서 화남 감정 인식 결과 79.74%, 놀람 감정 인식 결과 67.9%를 보이는 것을 실험으로 확인하였다. 또한, 카메라 2대 중 1대를 이용하여, 눈 움직임을 추적하였으며, 눈 움직임으로, F패턴과 Z패턴을 분류하였고, 다른 눈 움직임을 보이는 사용자를 디지털 문맹자로 판단하도록 하였다. 또한, 선택 버튼을 누를 때까지의 대기 시간을 측정하여 45초 이상인 경우를 디지털 문맹자로 판단하도록 하였으며, 나이인식, 화남, 놀람에 대한 인식율 순위 그리고 눈 움직임과 대기 시간을 이용하여, 디지털 문맹자 판단의 우선순위로 하여, 디지털 문맹자 선별기반의 스마트 키오스크 시스템을 실제로 구현하였다. 끝으로, 제안하는 스마트 키오스크 시스템은 디지털 문맹자로 판단한 사용자에게 메뉴 선택방식을 뒷사람에게 창피함을 느끼게 하는 음성안내 방식보다는 객관식 선택 방식으로 유도하는 것을 제시해 보았다. &#xD;
본 연구에서 제안한 키오스크 시스템은 공공장소에서 정보 제공, 서비스 제공, 결제 등의 다양한 메뉴 기능을 제공할 뿐만 아니라, 그 역할을 더욱 확장시켜 나가며, 더욱 더 비대면 환경에서 중요한 역할을 하게 할 것으로 기대된다.

11674.abstract_en:
The shift to a contactless society has led to an increase in the use of kiosks, which offer convenience and efficiency. These kiosk systems offer a variety of &#xD;
 menu functions in public spaces to provide information, deliver services, make payments, and more, and play an important role in the contactless environment. However, kiosks with multiple menu choices can be confusing for digitally illiterate people, who tend to avoid them due to their difficulty in using them, thus limiting the penetration and expansion of kiosk systems. &#xD;
Therefore, this study aims to implement a smart kiosk system based on digital illiteracy screening. In order to implement a smart kiosk system based on digital illiteracy screening, we proposed to use two cameras to track face recognition, emotion recognition, and eye movement, and a timer to measure the waiting time until the selection button is pressed. In an experiment using DeepFace technology on a dataset of 5,000 face photos collected from the Internet, the proposed system achieved an accuracy rate of 95.5% for age recognition, 79.74% for angry emotion recognition, and 67.9% for surprise emotion recognition for subjects over 50 years old. In addition, eye movements were tracked using one of the two cameras to classify F and Z patterns. Users with different eye movements were judged to be digitally illiterate. We measured the waiting time until the selection button is pressed and judged the user as digitally illiterate if it is more than 45 seconds, and prioritized the judgment of digitally illiterate people by considering the recognition rate ranking of age recognition, anger, and surprise, eye movements, and waiting time comprehensively, and implemented a smart kiosk system based on digitally illiterate screening.&#xD;
Finally, the proposed smart kiosk system proposed to guide users who are judged to be digitally illiterate to select menus by multiple-choice selection method instead of voice guidance method, which may cause embarrassment to others behind them. The kiosk system proposed in this study not only provides various menu functions such as information provision, service provision, and payment in public places, but also expands its role and is expected to play an important role in non-face-to-face environments.

11675.abstract_ko:
최근 코로나-19와 메르스 같은 치명적인 전염병의 대유행은 전 세계적으로 큰 영향을 미치며 공공장소와 실내 환경에서의 위생 관리의 중요성을 재조명하였고, 전염병 확산 방지를 위한 새로운 기술의 필요성이 강조되었다. 본 논문에서는 우리 주변의 조명 인프라를 활용하여 405 nm 파장의 청색광을 이용한 살균 능력을 가지면서도 인체 유해성을 최소화한 인간친화형 선택적 청색광 구동 디바이스의 구현에 관한 연구를 진행하였다. 디바이스는 청색광 발광부, 전원/제어부, 디바이스 하우징부로 구성되어 각 부분의 요소 기술을 제시하고 구현 및 분석하였다.&#xD;
발광부에서는 살균용 청색광 스펙트럼과 조명용 백색광 스펙트럼을 선택적으로 구현할 수 있는 Mixed LED Module을 구현하여 살균 및 조명 기능을 통합할 수 있는 기술적 기반을 마련하였다. 디바이스 하우징과 결합하여 살균력 시험을 진행한 결과, 황색포도상구균에 대해 99.9%의 높은 살균력을 보였으며, 폐렴균, 녹농균, 대장균에서는 각각 약 7%의 살균 효과를 확인하였다. 전원/제어부는 KS C 7653 기준의 고품질 특성을 바탕으로 전력 품질 저하에 따른 블링킹 문제를 해결하고 청색광의 안정적인 운용을 가능하게 하였다. 또한, 청색광의 선택적 표출 제어 기술을 통해 인체에 유해한 영향을 최소화하면서도 높은 살균 효과를 유지할 수 있음을 실험적으로 입증하여 다양한 환경에서도 청색광 디바이스의 신뢰성을 확보하였다. 디바이스 하우징부에서는 실내외의 기존 인프라와 호환 가능한 청색광 적응형 디바이스 하우징을 설계하고 그 특성을 분석하였다. 실내용 하우징은 기존의 조명 인프라와 호환됨과 동시에 청색광의 레벨링 제어 시에도 안정적인 배광 특성을 보였다. 실외용 하우징은 Gore-tex 필터를 적용하여 가혹한 환경에서도 청색광의 살균 효과를 유지할 수 있도록 설계되었으며, 고온 고습 환경에서도 IP66의 방수 및 방진 성능을 보여 안정적인 동작 특성을 입증하였다. 마지막으로, 구현된 청색광 디바이스의 성능을 평가하고 확장성을 검토하기 위해 테스트베드를 구축하고 작동 특성을 테스트하였다.&#xD;
본 연구는 청색광을 활용한 살균 기술을 통해 병원균의 확산을 효과적으로 차단하고, 사용자에게 안전하고 위생적인 환경을 제공할 수 있는 새로운 위생 환경 솔루션을 제시하였다. 연구 결과는 공공장소와 실내 환경에서 전염병 예방 및 확산 방지에 중요한 기여를 할 수 있을 것으로 기대된다.

11675.abstract_en:
With the increasing incidence of global outbreaks of deadly pandemics such as SARS, MERS, and COVID-19, the importance of hygiene management in public places and indoor environments has been brought to the forefront, along with the need for new technologies to prevent the spread of such infectious diseases. This study explores the development of a human-centric selective blue light driving device utilizing 405 nm-wavelength blue light for sterilization, while minimizing human toxicity and leveraging existing lighting infrastructure. The device consists of a blue light emission unit, a power/control unit, and a device housing unit. Each presenting, implementing, and analyzing key technologies. In the emission unit, a mixed LED module capable of selectively implementing bactericidal blue light and white light spectra for illumination has been developed to provide a technical foundation for integrating sterilization and illumination &#xD;
functions. Combined with the device housing, sterilization tests have shown a high sterilization efficiency of 99.9% against Staphylococcus aureus (ATCC 6538) and approximately 7% against Klebsiella pneumoniae (ATCC 4352), Pseudomonas aeruginosa (ATCC 15442), and Escherichia coli (ATCC 25922). The power/control unit is based on the high-quality characteristics of KS C 7653 standards. Flickering issues due to power degradation have been resolved to enable stable operation of the blue light. Additionally, the selective emission control technology for blue light was experimentally validated to minimize &#xD;
harmful effects on humans while maintaining high sterilization efficacy. Thus, the device’s reliability across various environments is assured.  The device housing unit is designed to be compatible with existing indoor and outdoor infrastructure. The indoor housing is compatible with existing lighting infrastructure and maintains stable light distribution characteristics even during blue light leveling control. The outdoor housing, incorporated with Gore-Tex &#xD;
filters, is designed to maintain the bactericidal effect of blue light under harsh conditions, demonstrating IP66-rated waterproof and dustproof performance and stable operation in high-temperature and high-humidity environments. Finally, to evaluate the performance and scalability of the implemented blue light device, a testbed was established, and operational characteristics were tested. This study presents a new hygiene solution using blue light-based sterilization technology, effectively inhibiting the spread of pathogens and providing a safe and hygienic environment for users. The results indicate that this technology can significantly contribute to the prevention and management of infectious diseases in public places and indoor environments.

11678.abstract_ko:
원만한 사회생활에 필수적인 대인관계 스킬 향상을 위해 다양한 의사소통 능력 훈련 프로그램이 제시되고 있으며, 그중에서도 실생활 적용 가능성이 높다고 평가되는 역할극이 주목받고 있다. 하지만 기존 역할극 프로그램은 실제 현장을 온전히 구현하기 어려우며 참여자들이 자기개방을 힘들어할 수 있다는 한계가 있어, 이에 대한 대안으로 메타버스를 활용한 역할극이 고려되고 있지만, 즐거움을 목적으로 하는 기존 메타버스 플랫폼에서의 역할극으로는 의사소통 훈련 효과를 극대화하기 어렵다고 판단된다. 이에 본 연구는 의사소통 능력 향상을 목적으로 참여자들이 더욱 현실감 있는 환경에서 의사소통 능력 훈련을 할 수 있는 메타버스 역할극 플랫폼 컨셉을 제안하고자 한다. &#xD;
&#xD;
  먼저 문헌 연구를 통해 의사소통 능력을 향상하기 위한 기법들을 알아보고, 훈련 프로그램 참여자 인터뷰를 실시하여 기존 의사소통 훈련 경험의 장단점을 살펴보았다. 이어서 메타버스에서의 역할극에 대한 선행연구 및 참여 경험자 인터뷰 조사를 통해 훈련 환경으로써 메타버스 활용 가능성을 고찰하고, 원활한 메타버스 역할극을 지원하는 플랫폼 디자인 요소를 사례조사를 통해 파악하였다. 마지막으로 앞선 연구를 바탕으로 다음과 같은 메타버스 역할극 플랫폼 컨셉과 디자인 고려 사항을 제안하여 이를 적용한 디자인 사례를 제작하였고 사용자 평가를 진행하였다.&#xD;
&#xD;
  본 연구는 의사소통 능력을 향상하는 데 도움이 되는 상담 기법에 기반한 메타버스 역할극 플랫폼을 제안한다. 이를 위해 네 가지 디자인 고려 사항을 제시하였다. 첫째, 의사소통 문제 상황의 현장을 조성한다. 둘째, 아바타를 이용한 ‘역할교대’ 기법을 적용하여 타인의 입장에 몰입하여 상대방을 이해할 수 있도록 한다. 셋째, AI 기반의 즉각적인 대화 코칭을 제공하여 의사소통 학습효과를 높인다. 넷째, 사전 연습과 본 훈련으로 이원화된 모드를 지원하여 메타버스 역할극 적응을 돕는다. &#xD;
&#xD;
  본 연구를 통해 의사소통 능력 향상을 위하여 메타버스에서 역할극 플랫폼 컨셉을 제시하였고, 이를 구체화하기 위해 플랫폼 디자인 사례를 제작하여 의사소통 능력 향상 가능성을 사용자 평가를 통해 확인하였다. 이에 본 연구 결과는 대인관계가 어려운 사람들이 효과적인 의사소통 능력 훈련을 할 수 있도록 도와주고, 이를 위한 디자인 모색에 기여할 것으로 기대한다.

11678.abstract_en:
As various communication skill training programs emerge to enhance interpersonal skills essential for a harmonious social life, the spotlight falls on role play, recognized for its high applicability to real-life scenarios. However, existing role-play programs grapple with limitations, presenting challenges in fully simulating authentic situations and hindering participant openness. As an alternative, the exploration of role-playing within the metaverse is considered. Yet, it is posited that maximizing the efficacy of communication training through role-playing on existing metaverse platforms primarily designed for entertainment remains a challenging endeavor. In response, this study proposes the concept of a metaverse role-playing platform — a environment where participants can cultivate and enhance their communication skills in a more realistic context.&#xD;
&#xD;
  The research methodology unfolds in a structured manner. Initially, communication skill enhancement techniques are investigated through literature research, complemented by interviews with participants from diverse training programs to scrutinize the merits and demerits of existing experiences. Subsequently, the study delves into the potential of utilizing metaverse role-play as a training environment. Insights are drawn from prior research on metaverse role-playing and interviews with seasoned participants, leading to the identification of platform design elements crucial for facilitating smooth metaverse role-playing, as elucidated through comprehensive case studies. Building upon this foundation, the thesis proses the concept for the metaverse role-playing platform. Four key design considerations are presented, laying the groundwork for the development of a platform design case that meticulously applies these considerations. This platform design case becomes the subject of a user evaluation.&#xD;
&#xD;
The primary goal of this study is to design a metaverse role-playing platform grounded in counseling techniques for communication skill improvement. The four design considerations proposed encompass the creation of scenarios depicting communication problem situations, the application of the 'role alternation' technique using avatars to foster empathy and understanding, the provision of AI-based immediate conversation coaching for an enhanced learning effect, and the incorporation of a dual mode supporting pre-practice and main training, facilitating seamless adaptation to metaverse role-play.&#xD;
&#xD;
 A role-playing platform concept was presented in Metaverse by applying counseling techniques that help improve communication skills, and a platform design case was created to confirm the possibility of improving communication skills through user evaluation. The anticipated outcomes of this study extend to offering practical communication skill training for individuals grappling with interpersonal challenges and contributing to the exploration of designs that augment the effectiveness of communication skill development in the metaverse context.

11679.abstract_ko:
제 목 : 게임형 메타버스 플랫폼의 확장적 콘텐츠 창작 환경 디자인 연구 &#xD;
웹 3.0 환경에서 사용자들은 스스로 콘텐츠를 생산하고 소비하는 모습을 보이는데, 특히 게임형 메타버스에서 콘텐츠 창작활동이 활발하게 이루어지고 있다. 게임형 메타버스에서 사용자는 자유롭게 콘텐츠를 생성할 수 있으나, 이러한 자유로운 창작 환경에 불편함과 부담감을 느끼는 사용자들도 있다. 본 연구에서는 사용자들의 편의와 즐거움이 극대화된 콘텐츠 창작 환경을 제공하기 위한 방안을 제안하고자 한다. 문헌조사를 통해 게임형 메타버스의 창작 경험에 관한 선행연구를 살펴보고, 현재 서비스하고 있는 게임형 메타버스 사례들을 대상으로 메타버스의 구성 요소와 창작 환경을 분석하였다. 이어서 게임형 메타버스에서 창작활동을 경험한 사람들을 대상으로 설문조사와 심층 인터뷰를 진행하여 새로운 창작 환경에 대한 니즈를 파악하였다. 사용자 조사를 토대로 게임형 메타버스의 창작 환경 디자인에 대한 다음과 같은 니즈 인사이트를 도출하였다. 첫째, 메타버스에서 콘텐츠를 창작할 때 크리에이터들의 높아지는 창작 목표에 따라 제공되는 창작 기능의 변화가 필요하다. 둘째, 창작 과정에서 크리에이터들의 상호 교류 활동이 부족하여 창작물 교류 과정에서 다양한 즐거움을 느끼기 어렵다. 이에 창작활동 전반에서 상호 교류 가능성을 높이는 창작 환경이 조성되어야 할 것으로 파악되었다. 셋째, 즐거운 창작활동을 위해서는 창작을 지속할 수 있도록 도와주는 동기 요인을 제공하여야 한다. 이러한 니즈 파악을 바탕으로 본 연구에서는 더 쉽고 재미있는 창작활동을 지원하는 확장성 있는 메타버스 창작 환경 컨셉을 제안한다. 제안하는 컨셉 모형은 상호 영향을 주는 3개의 영역인 창작 방법의 확장, 상호 교류의 확장, 창작 동기의 확장 영역으로 이루어진다. 컨셉에 따른 확장적 창작활동의 플로우를 제시하고 각 컨셉 단계에 따른 게임형 메타버스 플랫폼 화면 예시를 제시하였다. &#xD;
사용자 창작 경험에 대한 연구 필요성은 높아지고 있으나 보다 즐겁고 편리한 창작 환경이나 창작 도구의 방향성에 대한 연구는 많이 이루어지고 있지 않다. 본 연구에서 제안하는 확장적 창작 환경 컨셉 구현을 통해 사용자는 다른 크리에이터들과 함께 창작하면서 점진적, 단계적으로 창작활동의 폭을 넓혀 더욱 높은 수준의 창작 역량과 즐거움을 경험할 수 있을 것으로 기대한다.

11679.abstract_en:
Title : Designing the Extended Content Creation Environment of the Game-type Metaverse Platform&#xD;
In the Web 3.0 environment, users produce and consume content on their own, especially in the game-type metaverse. In the game-type metaverse, users can freely create content, but some users feel uncomfortable and burdened by this freely creating environment. This study aims to propose a method to provide a content creating environment that maximizes the convenience and enjoyment of users. After looking at previous studies on the creating experience of the game-type metaverse through literature research, the creating components and environment of the metaverse were analyzed for the case of the game-type metaverse currently in service. Subsequently, a survey and in-depth interview were conducted for people who have experienced creating in the game-type metaverse to identify the needs for a new creating environment. Based on the user survey, the following needs insights for the creating environment design of the game-type metaverse were derived. First, when creating content in the metaverse, it is necessary to change the function provided according to the increasing creating goals of creators. Second, it is difficult to feel various pleasures in the process of creating due to the lack of mutual exchange activities of creators in the creating process. Accordingly, it was found that a creating environment that increases the possibility of mutual exchange in the overall creating activities should be created. Third, for pleasant creating activities, it is necessary to provide motivation factors that help create continuously. Based on these needs, this study proposes a extended metaverse﻿ creating environment concept that supports easier and more fun creating activities. The proposed concept model consists of three areas that influence each other: expansion of creating methods, expansion of mutual exchange, and expansion of creating motivation. The system structure diagram of the ectended creating environment according to the concept was presented, and an example of the screen of a game-type metaverse platform according to each concept was presented.&#xD;
Although the need for research on user creating experiences on game-type metaverse is increasing, there is not much research on a more enjoyable and convenient creating environment or the direction of creating tools. Through the implementation of the extended creating environment concept proposed in this study, it is expected that users will be able to experience a higher level of creating capabilities and enjoyment by gradually and step-by-step expanding their creating activities while creating with other creators.

11681.abstract_ko:
제 목 : 질문 유도 기법을 적용한 유아 인터랙티브 동화 콘텐 츠 디자인 연구 &#xD;
&#xD;
유아기는 창의력이 폭발적으로 성장하는 시기로 2세, 3세에서 시작하여 6세의 시기에 호기심이 증폭되는데 이 시기를 ‘질문기’라고도 한다. 유아의 자발적인 질문은 유아의 교육과 발달적 측면에서 긍정적인 영향을 미치며, 창의력 증진에도 도움이 된다. 유아의 창의력을 자극하는 많은 방법들이 존재하는데 그 중에서도 동화는 오래전부터 상상력 자극과 언어발달을 촉진하는 등 창의력과 깊은 관련성 을 보이고 있다. 이러한 동화는 인터랙티브의 높은 상호작용성으로 더욱 흥미롭게 거듭난다. 이에 본 논문에서는 질문 유도 기법을 적용한 인터랙티브 동화 콘텐츠 컨셉을 제시하였다. 이를 위해 먼저 문헌 연구를 통하여 동화의 특성과 구조에 대 해 알아보았다. 이어서 유아 인터랙티브 동화 콘텐츠의 현황을 파악하여 이야기 전달 방법의 모습이 확장되고 있음을 확인하고, 기존사례와 선행연구를 조사하였 다. 조사를 통해 인터랙티브 콘텐츠의 높은 상호작용성이 유아에게 긍정적인 영향 을 주고 있으나, 지금까지는 다양한 인터랙션으로 동화의 내용을 일방적으로 제공 하고 있었다. 따라서 스토리로 인해 생긴 호기심을 바탕으로 스스로 생각을 표현 하게 해주는 동화의 긍정적인 측면을 부각시킬 수 있는 인터랙션 방안이 필요하 다는 인사이트를 도출했다. 이어서 질문하기와 창의성의 관련성을 확인하고, 유아 의 질문 유형을 알아본 후 선행연구 조사를 통하여 스토리텔링 상황에서 적용할 수 있는 질문 유도 기법 네 가지 ‘질문을 많이 하는 ‘역할’이 필요하다.’, ‘유아의 호기심을 유발할 수 있는 환경을 제공한다.’, ‘유아가 질문을 할 수 있도록 하는 분위기를 조성한다,’, ‘질문을 통해 정보를 얻어 문제상황을 해결 하게 한다’를 도출하였다. 도출한 질문 유도 기법 디자인 적용의 이해를 돕기 위 해 디자인 적용 사례를 제시하였다. 각 질문 유도 기법은 서사물의 구조인 ‘이야 기’와 ‘담화’를 인터랙티브 동화에 맞게 정리하였고, ‘동화 이야기’와 이야 기를 표현해주는 ‘스토리텔러’ 동화 이야기 표현의 실체가 되는 ‘인터랙티브 매체’로 나누어 적용하였다. 본 연구에서 제안된 질문 유도 방안과 디자인 적용 사례가 동화 콘텐츠 디자인의 모색에 기여하고 유아들의 질문 유도를 통한 창의 성 발달에 도움이 될 수 있을 것으로 기대된다.

11686.abstract_ko:
OTT는 Over The Top의 약자로 전통적인 방송 서비스들과는 다르게 셋톱박스 없이 인터넷을 통해 다양한 콘텐츠를 제공하는 서비스를 일컫는다. 인터넷을 기반으로 하기에 이용자들은 인터넷이 연결된 환경이라면 언제 어디서든 여러 디바이스를 통해 OTT에 접근할 수 있다는 특징을 가진다. OTT는 영화, 드라마, 예능과 같이 기존의 TV프로그램은 물론이고 오리지널 콘텐츠, 스포츠 중계 등 다방면의 콘텐츠를 제공하고 있는데 이용자들은 자신이 원하는 콘텐츠를 시청하기 위해 개별 구독 혹은 구매를 자유롭게 하며 서비스를 활용하고 있다. &#xD;
 오프라인 활동에 제약이 있었던 팬데믹 기간에 온라인을 통해 이용자들이 여가를 보내게 되면서 OTT의 이용률이 지속적으로 상승했고 현재 국내에서는 넷플릭스(Netflix), 디즈니플러스(Disney+), 쿠팡플레이(Coupangplay) 등의 해외 플랫폼과 티빙(Tving), 웨이브(Wavve), 왓챠(Watcha)와 같은 국내 플랫폼들이 등장해 사업을 함께 영위하고 있다. 이처럼 짧은 기간 동안 급격한 성장세를 보인 OTT는 방송산업의 구조와 이용자들의 미디어 이용행태 변화에도 큰 영향을 미치고 있다. &#xD;
&#xD;
 OTT와 같은 신유형 미디어가 등장했을 때 이용자들은 기존의 미디어를 대체하거나 보완하는 형태로 이용할 수 있다. 또한 연령, 성별 등 집단별로도 미디어의 이용에 차이가 존재하기 때문에 이용자의 습관과 인식을 파악하는 것이 중요하다. 특히 OTT의 경우 방송과 통신이 결합된 새로운 형태의 미디어이며 해외 사업자들이 국내에서 큰 영향력을 보이고 있다는 특징이 있어 정책 방향을 수립하는 데 어려움을 겪고 있다. 하지만 OTT의 파급력이 커짐에 따라 새로운 진흥 및 규제 정책들이 잇따라 진행될 것으로 전망되어 OTT의 이용 확산 형태를 파악하여 올바른 정책 방향을 수립하는 것이 필요한 시점이다. &#xD;
 하지만 기존 OTT 연구들은 단년도에 한해 이루어진 횡단연구(Cross-sectional study)에 그쳐있어 국내에서 OTT가 어떻게 이용되며 확산하고 있는지를 알아보는 데 한계가 존재했다. 따라서 본 연구에서는 혁신적 미디어인 OTT의 성장 과정과 함께 이용자의 특성과 혁신성향이 OTT 이용에 미치는 종단적인 변화를 탐색하는 데 목표를 가진다. &#xD;
 선행연구를 종합한 결과 OTT 이용에 영향을 미치는 요인은 서비스적 측면과 이용자 측면으로 구분할 수 있었는데 본 연구에서는 이용자 측면의 요인에 집중해 성별, 연령, 학력, 가구소득, 가구원 수와 같은 일반적인 인구사회학적 특성과 혁신성을 통해 집단 간 OTT 이용에 대한 차이를 확인했다. 이용자의 혁신성은 기존의 단일개념에서 벗어나 기능적(functional), 쾌락적(hedonic), 사회적(social), 인지적(cognitive)으로 세분화하여 살펴보았는데 그 이유는 혁신성을 하나의 개념으로 한정한다면 미디어의 특성이 반영된 다양한 이용 동기에 대해 파악하기 어렵기 때문이다. 따라서 본 연구에서는 이용자의 혁신성향이 다년간 OTT 이용변화에 어떤 영향을 미치는지 밝히며 이용자들이 OTT를 어떻게 활용하고 있는지 보다 자세히 파악하고자 했다.&#xD;
&#xD;
 연구를 위해 한국미디어패널조사(Korea Media Panel Survey, KMPS) 자료 중 OTT 관련 문항이 등장한 2019년부터 2022년까지 4개년도 자료를 사용했다. 2019년부터 2022년까지 총 4년간 연속 응답한 9,009명에서 표본에 오류가 있거나 주요 변수인 혁신성향을 측정하는 문항에 모두 동일 답변을 한 불성실한 응답자 746명을 제외해 최종적으로 8,263명을 연구대상으로 한다. &#xD;
&#xD;
 응답자의 OTT 이용빈도, 인구사회학적 특성, 혁신성향 관련 변수를 활용해 잠재성장모형 분석을 진행한 주요 결과는 다음과 같다. &#xD;
 첫째, OTT 서비스 이용은 측정기간 동안 꾸준히 증가하고 있는 양상을 보인다. 측정 주기가 지날수록 변화의 정도와 속도도 함께 증가하고 있다. 하지만 이용빈도에 대한 공분산은 모두 부적인 상관관계를 보이고 있어 초기에 OTT 이용빈도가 낮았던 이용자들의 OTT 이용량이 시간이 지날수록 더 많이 늘었음을 알 수 있다. &#xD;
 둘째, 인구사회학적 특성 측면에서 개인적 요소로는 남성, 젊은 세대, 고학력 집단에서 초기 OTT 이용이 활발했다. 가구적 요소로는 가구소득이 높을수록 가구원 수가 적을수록 초기 OTT 이용빈도가 높았다. 다만, 성장의 범위와 속도에는 연령대, 학력, 가구원 수만 통계적으로 유의미한 영향을 미치고 있었다. 즉, 이용자들의 개인적 특성 간 OTT 이용행태에는 차이가 존재했고 이용 초기와 후기에도 각각 다른 요인들이 영향을 주고 있음을 확인했다.&#xD;
 셋째, 다차원적 혁신성향 중에서는 기능적 혁신성향과 쾌락적 혁신성향이 OTT 이용빈도 초기치에 영향을 미치는 것으로 나타났다. 기능적 혁신성향이 낮을수록 쾌락적 혁신성향이 높을수록 초기 OTT 이용률이 높았고 쾌락적 혁신성향의 경우 시간 흐름에 따른 성장 폭은 컸지만 속도는 줄어들고 있다는 결과를 얻어 이용자들이 OTT를 엔터테인먼트적 매체로 활용하며 성장이 확산하는 것으로 파악했다.&#xD;
&#xD;
 본 연구는 미디어 소비 패턴을 혁신하며 성장하고 있는 OTT의 변화 과정을 구체적으로 파악하며 기존 미디어 연구의 범위를 확장했다는데 의의가 있다. 또한, 연구에서 도출된 결과는 향후에도 OTT 산업의 활성화가 지속되고 더 많은 이용자들이 OTT를 효과적으로 사용할 수 있도록 접근성을 개선하는 정책방안을 마련하는데 기초자료로 활용될 수 있을 것으로 기대한다.

11686.abstract_en:
‘OTT’ stands for ‘Over The Top’, referring to a service that delivers various content over the Internet without a set-top box, unlike traditional broadcasting services. As it is internet-based, users can access OTT anytime, anywhere through multiple devices, given they have an Internet connection. OTT offers a wide range of content, including original content and sports broadcasts, as well as existing TV programs such as movies, dramas, and variety shows. Users can freely subscribe or purchase individual content to tailor their viewing experience.&#xD;
 During the pandemic, when offline activities were restricted, the utilization rate of OTT had consistently risen as users turned to online platforms for leisure. Currently, international platforms such as Netflix, Disney+, and Coupangplay, and domestic platforms like Tving, Wavve, and Watcha co-exist in the domestic market. The rapid growth of OTT in such a short period has had a significant impact on the structure of the broadcasting industry and changes in the media usage behavior of users.&#xD;
&#xD;
 When new types of media like OTT emerge, users have the option to either replace or supplement traditional media. Additionally, there are differences in media usage among individual groups such as age and gender. Therefore, it is paramount to understand the habits and perceptions of users. In particular, OTT is a new form of media combining broadcasting and telecommunications. International operators have a significant influence on the domestic OTT market, making it difficult to establish policy directions. However, as the ripple effect of OTT expands, new promotion and regulatory policies are anticipated to be implemented one after another. And so, it is now a crucial moment to establish appropriate policy direction by identifying the spread pattern of OTT use.&#xD;
 However, existing OTT studies have been confined to cross-sectional studies conducted only for a single year, which has limitations when it comes to understanding how OTT is being used and spreading in Korea. Therefore, this study aims to explore the longitudinal changes in OTT usage by user characteristics and innovation propensity with the growth process of OTT, an innovative media.&#xD;
 Based on the synthesis of previous studies, factors affecting OTT usage have been categorized into service and user aspects. In this study, focusing on the user aspects, we identified differences in OTT usage between groups through general demographic characteristics such as gender, age, education, household income, and the number of household members, as well as innovativeness. We subdivided users' innovativeness into functional, hedonic, social, and cognitive categories, rather than using a single concept. If innovativeness was limited to a single concept, it is difficult to understand the various motivations for using OTTs that reflect the characteristics of the media. Therefore, we sought to understand how users' innovativeness has affected the changes in OTT usage over the years and how users utilize OTTs in more detail.&#xD;
&#xD;
 For the research, we took data from the Korea Media Panel Survey(KMPS) for four years from 2019 to 2022 when OTT related questions appeared. From the 9,009 respondents who responded for four consecutive years from 2019 to 2022, we excluded 746 dishonest respondents who answered the same response to questions of Innovation Propensity, the main variable, due to sampling errors, leaving us with 8,263 respondents.&#xD;
&#xD;
 The major findings from the latent growth model analysis using variables related to respondents' frequency of OTT use, demographic characteristics, and innovation propensity are as follows. &#xD;
Firstly, the usage of OTT services demonstrates a steady increase over the measurement period. The magnitude and speed of the change increase with each passing measurement cycle. However, the covariances for usage frequency are all negatively correlated, suggesting that those who initially used OTT less frequently increased their usage of OTT over time. &#xD;
Secondly, on an individual level in terms of demographic characteristics, early OTT usage was more active among males, in younger generations, and in higher-educated groups. On a household level, OTT usage was more frequent with higher household income and fewer numbers of household members. However, only age group, education, and the number of household members had statistically significant effects on the scope and speed of growth. In other words, we found that there were differences in OTT usage behavior among users' personal characteristics and that different factors influenced both early and late usage. Thirdly, among the multidimensional innovativeness, functional innovativeness and hedonic innovativeness were found to influence the initial frequency of OTT use. The initial OTT usage rate was higher in the group which has the lower functional innovativeness and the higher hedonic innovativeness. And in the case of hedonic innovativeness, the growth was large but decreasing over time, suggesting that the growth is diffuse as users utilize OTT as an entertainment medium.&#xD;
&#xD;
 The significance of this study is that it expands the scope of existing media research by specifically identifying the transition process of OTTs innovating media consumption patterns. Additionally, the results of this study are expected to be used as a basis for preparing policy measures to improve accessibility so that the OTT industry can continue to be revitalized, and more users can use OTT effectively in the future.

11688.abstract_en:
A study on dynamic changes and policy feedback in the personal information protection policy network and their impact on policy outcomes, with a focus on the enactment and amendment of the personal information protection act &#xD;
&#xD;
The current Personal Information Protection Act (hereinafter referred to as the Act) has undergone fundamental changes in almost every aspect compared to the law enacted in 2011. These changes encompass the law's purpose, the scope of application, the nature and functions of supervisory bodies, the use of personal information, and the content and level of sanctions for privacy violations. The purpose of this study is to identify the causes of these fundamental changes in the Act. To achieve this, the research questions are formulated as follows:&#xD;
&#xD;
1. What environmental factors primarily influenced the characteristics of policy networks over time, and what patterns of change occurred?&#xD;
2. How did policies introduced during a specific phase influence subsequent policy outcomes through what paths and mechanisms?&#xD;
3. What influence did the characteristics of policy networks over time have on policy outcomes?&#xD;
&#xD;
This study divided the research period into four phases: Enacting of the Act phase (2008.3~2011.3), Strengthening personal information protection phase (2014.1~2015.7), Exploring the utilization of personal information phase (2016.7~2020.2), and Harmonizing protection and utilization of the personal information phase (2020.8~2023.3). The characteristics of policy networks during each period and their impact on policy outcomes were analyzed using a dynamic policy network model, reflecting theoretical discussions on policy environment, issues, outcomes, and policy feedback, to enhance explanatory power.&#xD;
&#xD;
During the Enacting Phase (2008.3~2011.3), the policy network had a collaborative nature. It involved relatively few actors due to government organization restructuring in 2008, with the main issue being the establishment of the Personal Information Protection Commission. Interactions among actors were characterized by cooperation rather than conflict, resulting in policy succession (integration).&#xD;
&#xD;
The Strengthening Phase (2014.1~2015.7) maintained a collaborative nature despite a significant impact from a large-scale personal information leakage incident in early 2014. Policy feedback led to the entry of the Personal Information Protection Commission as a new actor, making interactions more complex. The main issues were the harmonization of privacy-related laws and strengthening sanctions. Interaction occurred primarily among key ministries, and the policy outcomes type was classified as maintaining existing policies to improve operational deficiencies.&#xD;
&#xD;
The Exploring Phase (2016.7~2020.2) revealed the characteristics of an issue network influenced by the global environmental factor of the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) in May 2018. The network saw the entry of various actors from the industry, leading to conflicting interactions. Policy outcomes involved authoritative coordination within the government and network governance coordination between government and private actors, resulting in policy innovation.&#xD;
&#xD;
The Harmonizing Phase (2020.8~2023.3) maintained its nature as an issue network. Technological and economic factors, particularly those represented by big data and artificial intelligence, had the greatest impact. The establishment of the Personal Information Protection Commission as the central administrative agency weakened the roles of existing government agencies, and the entry of actors, such as data-centric companies, increased due to data de-regulations. While the influence of the industry expanded, the influence of citizen groups decreased, resulting in a relative imbalance of power and resources among actors. Policy discussions primarily revolved around issues raised by the industry, with the policy outcomes type considered as policy succession.&#xD;
&#xD;
This study identified three trends of change related to policy network components from 2008 to 2023. Firstly, environmental factors influencing the personal information policy network initially had political aspects but recently were significantly impacted by technological and economic factors, including global environmental factors related to digital technology and big tech companies. Secondly, the period from the enactment of the Act in 2011 to the Strengthening Phase in July 2015 showed a pronounced learning effect in policy feedback. In contrast, the period after the Exploring Phase showed a stronger resource efficiency aspect. Thirdly, dynamic changes in policy networks due to technological innovation were central, and policy feedback effects complemented each other. Core issues related to personal information shifted from basic legal principles and information subject rights to social and economic regulations.&#xD;
&#xD;
In conclusion, the changes in the Act were primarily due to the evolving characteristics of the policy network over time, coupled with the simultaneous influence of policy feedback effects. Changes in network characteristics were rooted in changes in the policy environment, with technological and economic factors taking a leading role. This study, covering the relatively long period from 2008 to 2023, demonstrated the ability to explain cases of the enactment and amendment of the Act using a dynamic policy network model that incorporates policy feedback theories.&#xD;
&#xD;
This research's theoretical contribution lies in presenting extensive policy data on the process of dynamic changes in the Act, derived mainly from the researcher's direct participation experience in policy processes and extensive in-depth interviews. The policy implications of this study include the need for a gradual and progressive approach in fields with increasing diversity of actors and issue complexity, the expansion of policy network boundaries to allow diverse actors to participate in the policy process, and the strengthening of organizational capabilities of key members, such as the Personal Information Protection Commission and its staff.&#xD;
&#xD;
Since this study focused on a single case of the enactment and amendment process of the Act from 2008 to 2023, it is challenging to generalize to other policy processes. Additionally, as a qualitative case study, it cannot completely eliminate the subjectivity of the researcher. Therefore, this aspect requires supplementation through quantitative research and other means.&#xD;
&#xD;
&#xD;
Keywords : personal information protection act, personal information protection commission, policy network model, policy feedback, policy environment, digital technology, big data.

11691.abstract_en:
Research on Visualization Methods of Architectural Mass Facades using Artificial Intelligence&#xD;
&#xD;
This research, titled "Research on Visualization Methods of Architectural Mass Facades using Artificial Intelligence," explores innovative approaches in the increasingly important field of architectural visualization. Moving beyond traditional static methods, this research proposes the use of artificial intelligence technology to automatically generate building facade designs. This enables designers to quickly and efficiently explore various design concepts, enhancing communication among stakeholders. The study focuses on the integration of the 'Dell-E' AI image creation service with the 'SketchUP' 3D modeling program, also exploring the potential for integration with AI-based architectural analysis services.&#xD;
The research analyzes current trends in architectural visualization and simulation systems and evaluates the applicability of various AI image generation services. It also tests the practicality and efficiency of the proposed system by applying AI-generated images to 3D models created in 'SketchUP'. This process offers architects new design ideas and inspiration, presenting AI's potential to provide creative and diverse design options.&#xD;
This research presents a new paradigm in architectural design, enhancing efficiency and creativity through the use of AI in architectural visualization. It is anticipated to impact not only the field of architecture but also a wide range of creative industries. Continuous advancements in AI technology are expected to bring more innovative solutions to the future of architectural visualization and design processes.&#xD;
Furthermore, the study explores the potential impact of AI advancements on architectural visualization, aiming to bring transformative changes to traditional design methods. AI-generated diverse building facade designs can be visualized quickly, allowing architects to rapidly test design ideas and find optimal solutions.&#xD;
This approach improves the time and cost efficiency of the design process while also enriching the creative aspect. The paper offers significant insights into how AI-utilized architectural visualization can shape the future of architecture and transform design processes.

11693.abstract_en:
Development of Green Remodeling Target Model for Non-residential Buildings&#xD;
&#xD;
 The Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change (IPCC) has emphasized the need to reduce energy consumption in existing buildings as a crucial step towards achieving carbon neutrality. It has highlighted the issues associated with energy consumption during construction processes. To address these challenges, methods to reduce the energy usage of existing buildings and extend their lifespan, thereby minimizing energy consumption in new construction processes, are becoming increasingly vital. Consequently, the significance of green remodeling in the building sector is growing.&#xD;
In South Korea, initiatives to promote green remodeling of buildings have been underway since 2014, including offering interest support on construction costs. By 2022, this initiative led to the successful green remodeling of 7,214 residential buildings (99.96%), but only 3 non-residential buildings (0.04%) participated. The low participation rate in non-residential buildings is attributed to regulatory issues, specifically the requirement to prove a 20% reduction in energy consumption post-remodeling through energy simulation. This requirement places an excessive financial burden on building owners due to the high costs of energy simulation (between 5 to 10 million KRW) and involves risks related to redesign if the energy reduction target is not met, along with time delays due to complex approval processes.&#xD;
This study aims to develop a model that automatically selects candidates for green remodeling based on the analysis of building management information held by the government, without the need for energy simulations. For this purpose, energy consumption data from 4,128 public buildings were analyzed. Additionally, the study examined the characteristics of 397 buildings through energy simulations to identify those capable of achieving a 20% reduction in energy consumption. The findings revealed that small-scale buildings with a total floor area of less than 500 square meters, which are excluded from energy-saving design standards, showed a higher rate of achieving the energy reduction target.&#xD;
Among small-scale buildings with a total floor area of less than 500 m², 80.7% (239 out of 296) achieved the energy reduction target. A binary logistic regression analysis revealed that buildings under 500 m² are more than 1.9 times as likely to meet the energy reduction target compared to larger buildings. Furthermore, out of 79 buildings consuming more energy than the 1st-grade building energy efficiency standard (primary energy consumption over 260 kWh/m²·y), 94.9% (75 buildings) achieved the energy reduction goal. The regression analysis showed that buildings with higher energy consumption than the 1st-grade efficiency are over 6.3 times more likely to achieve the energy reduction target compared to those with lower consumption.&#xD;
Therefore, the study proposes a second-priority selection model for green remodeling, targeting buildings that meet both criteria: a total floor area under 500 m² and primary energy consumption exceeding 260 kWh/m²·y. Out of the 397 buildings analyzed, 72 fit this second-priority model, and 71 of them (98.6%) achieved the energy reduction target. The binary logistic regression analysis indicated that the likelihood (odds ratio) of achieving the energy reduction goal with this second-priority model is over 28.03 times higher compared to other buildings.&#xD;
Another factor is the preference of owners of substandard buildings for demolition or general remodeling over green remodeling. Considering the shorter lifespan of Korean buildings compared to those in developed countries, and the high number of buildings (36,790 in 2022) receiving remodeling permits, there's a substantial demand for green remodeling in substandard buildings.&#xD;
However, green remodeling stakeholders have consistently faced challenges due to a lack of information about substandard buildings in need of such remodeling. To address this, the study suggests a method to provide businesses with information on buildings deemed substandard based on expert inspections under the Building Management Law. It also proposes a method to predict the type of deficiencies eligible for green remodeling interest support based on the building's completion date. The prediction model for substandard buildings was analyzed by categorizing buildings based on their completion dates: before August 1973, between September 1973 and December 2000, between January 2001 and June 2008, between July 2008 and August 2013, and after September 2013. The analysis indicated that buildings completed before December 2000 had the highest rate of deficiencies.&#xD;
To predict that buildings completed before December 2000 are more deficient than those constructed later, a binary logistic regression analysis was conducted. The analysis showed that the odds ratio was highest for insulation performance at more than 7.4 times, followed by electrical facilities at over 2.6 times, and structural safety at over 2.2 times. Cooling, heating, and ventilation facilities had the lowest odds ratio at over 1.5 times. &#xD;
Therefore, buildings that meet both the criteria of the second-priority model (total floor area under 500 m² and primary energy consumption exceeding 260 kWh/m²·y) and the deficiency prediction model (completed before December 2000) were proposed as the first-priority model. Among the 397 buildings analyzed for energy simulation, 2.5% (10 buildings) satisfied the criteria of the first-priority model and achieved the energy reduction target by 100%.&#xD;
The academic value and uniqueness of this study lie in the development of a digital logic by applying the data mining technique of binary logistic regression analysis to predict the achievement of energy reduction targets and deficiencies in buildings, using only government data. This approach involved the analysis of a significantly larger number of energy simulation results than other studies and the examination of 15,118 building management inspection results conducted by experts such as architects and construction engineers.&#xD;
The practical value of this study is in utilizing government data analysis to select candidates for green remodeling and providing this information to building owners and green remodeling businesses, thereby encouraging voluntary participation in green remodeling. This approach is expected to reduce the financial burden on building owners due to energy simulations, mitigate redesign risks, and shorten the duration of certification processes.&#xD;
Lastly, the methods and diverse statistical data obtained from this research are expected to serve as foundational information for deciding the design and construction methods for the green remodeling of aged buildings. This contribution is anticipated to aid in the reduction of greenhouse gas emissions from existing buildings, thereby contributing to the prevention of global warming.

11695.abstract_en:
This study was conducted to identify problems with the relatively high construction accident rate despite the efforts of national related ministries and construction companies compared to other industries and advanced countries, and to devise effective countermeasures accordingly.&#xD;
Prior to the study, prior research was reviewed to understand the impact of major disasters at industrial sites on construction companies, and among the various alternatives, research was conducted sequentially to achieve the purpose of reducing construction industrial accidents by applying the direct construction method of the original survey and improving some of the systems related to industrial accidents.&#xD;
First, the impact of construction industrial accidents and direct construction systems was analyzed by listening to experts' opinions through seminars,&#xD;
Second, the results were derived using a PLS-SEM model analysis program to  quantitatively analyze the impact of construction site management by direct construction methods.&#xD;
In addition, thirdly, in terms of expert opinions and impact relationship analysis,  this researcher participated directly as the field director and analyzed the data of field cases in which the direct construction method was applied on a pilot basis as the head of the business division at the headquarters.&#xD;
In summary, based on expert opinions, analysis of the impact of direct construction methods, and data through Case Study, improvement plans were presented for systems and education currently implemented in the country related to industrial accident reduction factors to achieve industrial accident reduction goals more effectively.&#xD;
Accordingly, in order to achieve the effect of reducing the construction industry  accident rate through effective operation based on the direct construction system  of the original contractor, the government agencies and related ministries will  support the initial cost of applying the direct construction method and the burden of operating costs of construction companies.

11697.abstract_en:
To prevent the collapse of structures during a fire, the main structural components of buildings must be fire-resistant. Therefore, domestic building codes mandate that structural components of buildings above a certain size must be made fire-resistant, including timber used as a substitute for steel &#xD;
and concrete. This study aims to analyze the combustion characteristics and charring properties of three types of domestic timber commonly used in wooden &#xD;
buildings. This analysis was conducted using the Cone Calorimeter test according to the KS F ISO 5660-1. First of all, the analysis of combustion characteristics revealed that the heat release rate was highest in Korean pine at 241.61 kW/m2, followed by Pine at 198.68 kW/m2 and Larch at 194.93 kW/m2. The total heat release was highest in Pine at 62.21 MJ/m2, followed by Korean pine at 45.51 MJ/m2, and Larch at 31.78 MJ/m2. Thus, larch is considered the most favorable for use as a structural material.Second, the analysis of charring temperatures showed that the ignition temperature was highest for Larch at approximately 300 ℃, followed by Korean pine at approximately 240 ℃, and Pine at approximately 210 ℃. This suggests that Larch is the most resistant to high external temperatures among the three types.Third, the analysis of charring thickness indicated that the charring was most active in Korean pine,followed by Pine, and then Larch, suggesting that Larch has the best insulation performance among the three types. The results of this study indicate that Larch(Group A) is the most suitable wood for use as a structural material. These findings can serve as reference materials for future studies on the basic properties of domestic timber and fire-resistant design standards for wooden structures.

11699.abstract_en:
The Analysis and Improvement Method of Criteria Issues for Defect &#xD;
Judgments Based on the Litigation Decisions of Apartment Housing&#xD;
&#xD;
According to the 2022 Census of Population and Housing, 78.7% of Korea's housing stock consists of apartment buildings, and 64% of households live in &#xD;
apartments. As a result, there is increasing interest in improving the living conditions and quality of apartment buildings, and defect disputes are on the rise. The Defect Review and Dispute Settlement Committee of the Ministry of Land, Infrastructure and Transport handles about 4,300 defect disputes annually. However, some defect diagnosis companies and law firms specializing in defect litigation encourage conflicts between developers and residents by recommending compensation. In particular, in the case of defect lawsuits for apartment buildings, different judges at different levels of courts make different judgments on the same defect, and the lack of clear standards for judging defects has exacerbated the conflict.&#xD;
The purpose of this study is to analyze the problem of the standards of defect determination for each defect by analyzing the judgments that have been issued on the reasons why the repair costs have been reduced or excluded, as opposed to the claimant's claim for damages, for four defects that are frequently cited in defect litigation in apartment buildings: construction joints in the floor, the insufficient thickness of cement liquid waterproofing, insufficient strength of tile adhesion, and failure to finish the bottom of the sink, and to analyze according to which rules or methods the court's judgment on the repair costs has been reduced or excluded. The problem of different defect judgments for the same defect by different levels of courts is as follows: ① In the case of construction joints defects, most courts tend to judge that the filling repair method should be applied to cracks of less than 0.3mm. However, various engineers and &#xD;
academics have suggested that cracks of less than 0.3mm on the exterior walls of apartment houses with waterproof keys are also appropriate to use &#xD;
the surface treatment method, so this needs to be improved. ② For defects with insufficient cement liquid waterproofing thickness, it is necessary to &#xD;
apply the current standard, as thickness standards unrelated to waterproofing performance are sometimes applied retroactively to past specifications, &#xD;
causing confusion. ③ Regarding the defect of inadequate tile bond strength, the warranty period for tiles is two years according to the relevant laws. &#xD;
However, it is necessary to improve the standard by taking into account the problem that inadequate tile adhesion strength is considered a defect before &#xD;
the use inspection and the decrease in strength due to the long period since the use inspection.. ④ There is confusion between the MOLIT Notice and &#xD;
the Construction Appraisal Practice Guidelines regarding defects in the substructure of sinks, and it is necessary to improve them. &#xD;
It is expected that the revision and updating of the legally binding defect assessment standards will help to improve the quality of apartment houses &#xD;
and reduce defect litigation. Because of litigation, apartment house defect lawsuits take a very long time. Contractor's defect repair is often suspended &#xD;
during the process. Therefore, further research is needed to improve the legal system to clarify the standards of defect judgment and to improve the &#xD;
construction quality of contractors to prevent such problems. &#xD;
Therefore, this study proposes the following directions for improving the legal system of defect determination standards for the four defects discussed above ① For construction joint defects with interlayer cracks of less than 3 mm, it is necessary to check whether a waterproofing key is constructed and confirm &#xD;
whether a filling crack repair method is actually required in the repair area. ② For defects with insufficient thickness of the liquid cement waterproofing, it is &#xD;
necessary to determine the defect based on the thickness specified in the drawings and other documents that are the basis for determining the defect. If &#xD;
there is no thickness standard, it is necessary to determine the defect. It is necessary to determine the defect according to the standard specifications for &#xD;
building construction at the time of the project approval. ③ In the case of defects in tile bond strength, the correction value for the change in bond strength over the years should be quantified and included in the defect evaluation criteria. ④ In the case of unfinished sinks, the conflicting defect judgment criteria of the current notification of the Ministry of Land, Infrastructure and Transport and the 2016 Construction Appraisal Practice Guidelines need to be unified.

11701.abstract_en:
Abstract&#xD;
&#xD;
A Comparative Study on the Bearing Capacity Characteristics of Drilled Shafts by performing the Dynamic Load Test and the Static Load Test&#xD;
&#xD;
Kim, Chang Kyu &#xD;
(Supervisor Roh, Young Sook)&#xD;
Dept. of the Graduate School of Housing and City&#xD;
Seoul National University of Science and Technology&#xD;
&#xD;
Due to the enlargement of the structure, the use of drilled shaft or bored piles with easy adjustment of pile diameter and length is increasing. For the design of bored piles, the design parameters for the end bearing capacity and skin friction of the piles is obtained by using the existing design formula or performing the preliminary pile load tests in the field. Most of the test methods for obtaining design parameters in the field are performed, and the static load test more than three times the design load, so there are many problems such as large scale test equipment and long time taking for test conditions. On the other hand, the dynamic load test has the advantage of a simple test device and a short test time, whereas there is a problem that is not yet realistic in replacing the static load tests due to reliability and lack of comparison data.&#xD;
&#xD;
In this study, the static load tests and the dynamic load tests were conducted using the same bored pile to compare and analyze the results of the two tests, thereby evaluating whether the dynamic load test is the test that can replace the static load test for getting the design parameter of piles. As a result of the test, the dynamic load test method that converts the dynamic behavior into a static result is almost similar to the static load test in load-displacement characteristics and bearing capacity characteristics it was able to derive the result. Through this, it was possible to propose an alternative test that could replace the static load test, which had invested a lot of time and test costs in calculating the design integer of the pile.

11703.abstract_ko:
최근 국내 하이테크 산업 건설현장에서는 대부분 BIM을 적용하고 있고, 설비 분야에서는 P&amp;ID도 같이 납품하고 있다. BIM을 적용하기에 시공사에서는 BIM 기준으로 시공을 진행하나, 같이 납품되는 설계도면 중 하나인 P&amp;ID와 BIM 모델의 불일치한 부분이 많으며 이러한 상이점으로 인하여 설계 의도와 다른 발주 및 시공이 진행되어 이를 조치하기 위해 공사금액과 일정을 손해 보는 경우가 빈번히 발생하고 있다.&#xD;
&#xD;
 또한, 산업안전보건법 법령 및 시행령 등에서 요구하는 공정안전보고서 항목 중 P&amp;ID가 포함되어 있으며, P&amp;ID와 현장 일치 여부도 평가 대상이기에 앞서 언급한 문제점들에 대한 예방과 법적 요구사항 대응을 위해 P&amp;ID와 현장 시공의 정합성을 더 효율적으로 향상시킬 수 있는 방안이 요구되고 있다.&#xD;
&#xD;
 시공사 측에서 P&amp;ID와 일치하게 현장 시공을 하기 위해선 시공하기 전에 P&amp;ID와 BIM의 상이점에 대한 충분한 검토가 필요하지만 하이테크 산업 건설현장 특성상 시장의 변화와 수요 변화 등 다양한 요인으로 인하여 대부분 패스트 트랙 방식으로 프로젝트가 진행되기에 공사 일정에 맞춰 설계 도면을 검토하기에는 시간이 부족한 상황이다.&#xD;
&#xD;
 한편, 설계사에서는 P&amp;ID와 BIM을 설계하는 업체나 엔지니어가 서로 다른 경우가 대부분이며 많은 업무량과 휴리스틱 에러 등으로 일치화가 쉽지 않은 것이 현실이다.&#xD;
&#xD;
 따라서, P&amp;ID와 BIM의 상이한 부분을 엔지니어에게 알려줄 수 있도록 P&amp;ID와 BIM을 자동으로 비교 검토하기 위해 필요한 로직과 모델링 가이드라인을 개발하기 위한 연구를 진행하였다.&#xD;
&#xD;
 연구 범위는 P&amp;ID에 표현되는 사항 중 BIM 모델과 비교할 수 있는 배관 및 배관과 직접적으로 연결되는 밸브, 부속품, 제어계기 등의 엘리먼트를 대상으로 하였으며 P&amp;ID와 BIM 상이점 관련 설계 질의 사례를 분석하여 상이점 유형을 도출한 뒤 검토 방법을 최소화하기 위해 같은 방식으로 검토가 가능한 유형을 그룹화하여 유형을 축소하였고, 최종적으로 라인 누락 유형, 엘리먼트 누락 유형, 속성 불일치 유형, 라인 위상구조 불일치 유형 총 4가지로 분류하였다.&#xD;
&#xD;
 이후 도출된 상이점 유형을 검토하기 위한 BIM 모델 요구조건 분석한 다음 상이점 유형별 검토 방법을 다음과 같이 정의 하였다.&#xD;
&#xD;
라인 누락 여부는 작성된 P&amp;ID 데이터와 BIM 모델 데이터를 서로 비교하여 누락 여부를 검출하기 위해 필요한 속성정보와 라인넘버 입력 가이드라인을 제시하였으며, 엘리먼트 누락 여부와 속성 상이점 검출은 정확성을 높이기 위한 가이드라인과 데이터를 내보낼 때 필요한 가이드라인을 제시하였고, 라인 위상구조 일치 여부는 상이점을 자동으로 검출하기 위한 다섯 가지 로직과 모델링 가이드라인을 제시하였다.&#xD;
&#xD;
 본 연구는 하이테크 산업 건설현장 설비 분야의 P&amp;ID와 BIM 상이점 자동 검출 프로그램을 만들기 위한 기초 연구로써 그 방향성을 정립하는데 의의가 있으며, 연구에서 개발한 로직과 모델링 가이드라인이 향후 개발자들이 P&amp;ID와 BIM 상이점 자동 검출 프로그램을 개발하는 데 있어 도움이 될 것이라 기대한다.

11703.abstract_en:
In recent years, most high-tech industrial construction sites in South Korea have &#xD;
adopted BIM, and in the equipment sector, P&amp;ID is also commonly delivered. &#xD;
While construction proceeds based on BIM standards, significant discrepancies &#xD;
often arise between P&amp;ID, one of the delivered design drawings, and the BIM &#xD;
model. These discrepancies frequently lead to divergences in project orders and &#xD;
construction processes, resulting in financial losses and schedule delays.&#xD;
&#xD;
 Moreover, P&amp;ID is mandated as part of the items required by laws and &#xD;
regulations such as the Industrial Safety and Health Act, and its alignment with &#xD;
on-site conditions is subject to evaluation. Therefore, there is a demand for &#xD;
more efficient methods to enhance the alignment between P&amp;ID and on-site &#xD;
construction to prevent these issues and comply with legal requirements.&#xD;
&#xD;
 To ensure on-site construction aligns with P&amp;ID, thorough review of &#xD;
discrepancies between P&amp;ID and BIM before construction is necessary. However, &#xD;
due to the fast-paced nature of high-tech industrial construction sites, where &#xD;
projects often follow a fast-track approach due to market and demand changes, &#xD;
there is insufficient time to review design drawings according to the construction &#xD;
schedule. Additionally, it is common for different entities, such as design &#xD;
companies or engineers, to handle P&amp;ID and BIM separately, leading to &#xD;
challenges in harmonization due to high workload and heuristic errors.&#xD;
&#xD;
 Therefore, research has been conducted to develop logic and modeling &#xD;
guidelines necessary for automatic comparison and review of P&amp;ID and BIM, &#xD;
aiming to inform engineers about the discrepancies between them.&#xD;
&#xD;
 The research focused on elements such as piping, valves, accessories, and &#xD;
control instruments directly connected to piping, which can be compared with the &#xD;
BIM model among the items expressed in P&amp;ID. By analyzing design query cases &#xD;
related to discrepancies between P&amp;ID and BIM, various types of discrepancies &#xD;
were identified. Subsequently, types that can be reviewed in a similar manner &#xD;
were grouped to minimize the review process, resulting in four classifications: &#xD;
line omission type, element omission type, attribute mismatch type, and line &#xD;
topology mismatch type.&#xD;
&#xD;
 Following the derivation of discrepancy types, BIM model requirements for &#xD;
review were analyzed, and review methods for each discrepancy type were &#xD;
defined as follows.&#xD;
&#xD;
 Line omission: Attribute information and line number input guidelines were &#xD;
provided to detect omissions by comparing P&amp;ID data and BIM model data.&#xD;
&#xD;
 Element omission and attribute mismatch detection: Guidelines to increase &#xD;
accuracy and requirements for exporting data were provided.&#xD;
&#xD;
 Line topology mismatch: Five logic and modeling guidelines were presented for &#xD;
automatic discrepancy detection.&#xD;
&#xD;
 This study serves as foundational research for creating an automatic &#xD;
discrepancy detection program for P&amp;ID and BIM in the equipment sector of &#xD;
high-tech industrial construction sites, establishing its direction. It is anticipated &#xD;
that the logic and modeling guidelines developed in this research will aid future &#xD;
developers in creating such programs.

11709.abstract_ko:
제목: 아실실란과 다이아릴아이오도늄 염의 팔라듐 촉매 커플링을 통한 케톤 합성법 개발 연구&#xD;
&#xD;
 본 연구에서는 아실실란과 다이아릴아이오도늄 염의 팔라듐 촉매 cross-coupling 반응을 통한 케톤 합성법을 개발하였다. 기존의 케톤 합성 반응보다 더 효율적인 반응 조건을 찾고, 다양한 종류의 치환된 케톤을 만들기 위한 연구를 진행하였다. 최적화 연구를 통해 찾은 반응 조건을 통해 다양한 작용기를 가지고 있는 아실실란 및 다이아릴아이오도늄 염 출발 물질을 이용하여 cross-coupling 반응을 진행하였다. Alkyl, halide, ester 그룹 등의 다양한 작용기를 가지고 있는 출발 물질을 사용하였으며, 원하는 케톤을 합성할 수 있었다. 또한 개발한 커플링 반응의 활용도를 확장시키기 위해 retinoid mioeties를 포함한 아실실란을 사용하였으며, 해당 되는 생성물을 성공적으로 얻을 수 있었다. 본 연구를 통해 개발된 cross-coupling 반응을 이용하여 다양한 케톤 구조 합성을 달성할 수 있을 것으로 기대한다.

11709.abstract_en:
Title: Synthesis and Structure Analysis of Ketones via Palladium-Catalyzed Coupling Reactions between Acylsilanes and Diaryliodonium Salts&#xD;
&#xD;
 In this study, we developed a method for synthesizing ketones via palladium-catalyzed cross-coupling reactions between acylsilanes and diaryliodonium salts. We aimed to find more efficient reaction conditions compared to existing ketone synthesis methods and explored the synthesis of various substituted ketones. Through optimization studies, we identified optimal reaction conditions and conducted cross-coupling reactions using acylsilanes and diaryliodonium salts with various functional groups. Starting materials included functional groups such as alkyl, halide, and ester groups were used to synthesize the desired ketones. Furthermore, to extend the applicability of the developed coupling reaction, we utilized acylsilanes containing retinoid moieties and successfully obtained the corresponding products. This study suggests that the developed cross-coupling reaction can be used to achieve the synthesis of diverse ketone structures.

11714.abstract_en:
Abstract&#xD;
Benzothiazole-based effective colorimetric sensor for Copper ion detection&#xD;
In this study, we aimed to develop a chemical sensor for selectively and effectively detecting copper ion (II). Among the methods of detecting metal ions, chemical sensors are attracting attention because they are relatively easy to handle and can be detected effectively through visible methods. Herein, HMD, a color change sensor, was successfully synthesized based on the benzothiazole structure. HMD, when bound to copper ions (II), shows a visible color change and can selectively verify only the presence of copper ions (II). The detection limit value calculated as a result of the UV-vis titration experiment is 0.47 μM. Furthermore, HMD can be expected to have practical use in that it can selectively detect copper ions (II) in the test strip state and can be easily confirmed with the naked-eye. The detection mechanism of HMD for copper ions (II) was proved through theoretical calculations as a combination of metal-to-ligand charge transfer and intramolecular charge transfer.

11717.abstract_en:
Electrochemical application through 3D printing of conductive paste that enables facile charge transfer of enzymes&#xD;
3D printing technology has been recently used in various electrochemical applications due to rapid prototyping and user-friendly electrode fabrication. Among different 3D printing systems, such as Fused deposition molding (FDM), selective laser sintering (SLS), stereolithography (SLA), and direct-ink writing (DIW), DIW is frequently used in the electrochemical research area. The DIW is an extrusion-based method with a regulated pneumatic pump. In DIW, the viscous non-Newtonian fluid made of functional material and polymer is extruded from small nozzles with pressure along digitally designed paths for 3D structure. Thus, the researchers freely change and modify the composition and dimension of the electrodes for research purposes.&#xD;
In this study, the conductive carbon paste was formulated by incorporating carbon black, TPU, and PEI, and subjected to the DIW-based 3D printing. By phase separation in DI water, the porous structures were created, and positively charged PEI in 3D structure enabled the enzyme incorporation in the strucutre.  Due to facile electrochemical charge transfer between enzyme and 3D electrode, a strong FAD/FADH2 redox peak was observed at –0.45 V(vs Ag/AgCl). The biosensor exhibited a sensitivity of 116 μA·mM-1·cm-2 in the linear range. Additionally, by loading electron mediators like Osmium and ferrocene derivatives, significant current change was observed, demonstrating the potential for multifuntional 2nd generation biosensor platform. Finally, a membrane-less enzymatic fuel cell(EFC) system was designed, showing current and power signals that increased with glucose concentration. The 3D structures developed in this study are applicable to both third- and second-generation biosensing platforms, and potential to use in glucose monitoring systems based on enzymatic biofuel cell system.

11718.abstract_en:
Enzymatic glucose biosensor based on enzyme-doped  carbon paste&#xD;
With the increasing interest and demand for diabetes management, it has become crucial to continuously and accurately monitor blood glucose levels, a major indicator of diabetes. Since the 1960s, enzymes have been utilized as biocatalysts in electrochemical biosensor systems due to their remarkable selectivity for target substrates. However, the non-conductive protein shells surrounding the active sites of enzymes hinder direct electron transfer. Therefore, immobilizing enzymes on conductive nanomaterials remains a key challenge.&#xD;
In this study, we present a novel strategy for fabricating enzyme electrodes using enzyme-doped mesoporous carbon (EDMC) paste. Glucose oxidase (GOx), a model enzyme, was first adsorbed onto mesoporous carbon, then chemically precipitated and cross-linked. The EDMC was then mixed with a water-soluble binder to form the enzyme-doped carbon paste. The prepared EDMC paste was screen-printed onto commercial Au electrodes and electrochemically analyzed.. The results showed a strong FAD/FADH2 oxidation-reduction peak at approximately -0.5 V vs. Ag/AgCl, indicating effective electron transfer between GOx and the electrode. The sensitivity of the biosensor was estimated to be approximately 100 μA mM-1 cm-2.&#xD;
This study demonstrates the potential of EDMC paste for the easy fabrication of electrochemical biosensors with high sensitivity and selectivity. This method can be adapted for various enzymes and applications.&#xD;

11719.abstract_ko:
제 목 : LIBs 직접 재활용에서 연소 온도에 따른 PVDF, CB의 제거가 NCM622 양극 성능에 미치는 영향 연구&#xD;
&#xD;
  최근 리튬 이온 배터리가 소형 전자기기와 전기차에 널리 사용되면서 배터리 시장이 급성장하고, 사용 후 배터리의 양도 급격히 증가하고 있다. 이를 효율적으로 재활용하여 자원을 회수하고 환경 문제를 해결하기 위한 연구가 활발히 진행되고 있다. 대표적인 재활용 방법으로는 건식 공정, 습식 공정, 직접 재활용이 있는데, 직접 재활용 공정은 경제적이고 친환경적이라 주목받고 있다. 이 공정은 cathode scrap에서 회수한 활성 물질(AM)을 재사용하는 것으로, binder인 PVDF와 conductive agent인 carbon black(CB)을 제거하는 것이 주안점이다. 이를 위해 solvent dissolution과 direct calcination 방법이 주로 사용되며, 두 방법에서 공통적으로 진행되는 calcination 과정에서 잔류물에 의해 발생하는 부반응에 대한 연구는 상대적으로 부족하다.&#xD;
  본 연구에서는 NCM622를 사용하여 PVDF와 CB 잔류물이 AM에 미치는 영향을 명확하게 파악하고자 하였다. Pure NCM622, NP(NCM+PVDF), NC(NCM+CB) 샘플을 400, 500, 600℃에서 calcination 진행하였고, 종합적인 분석을 위해 NPC(NCM+PVDF+CB) 샘플을 추가로 제작하였다. 전기화학적 성능 평가(CV, Cycle stability, C-rate sweep test)와 SEM, XRD, TEM, IR 분석을 통해 성능 저하의 원인을 파악하였다. Pure NCM622는 calcinaiton 후 유의미한 변화가 없었으나, NP 샘플은 500℃와 600℃에서 Li2CO3 결정성 막이 형성되어 용량이 0.1C에서 약 20mAh/g으로, no calcination NCM622가 0.1C에서 210mAh/g을 나타나는 것에 반해 크게 감소하였다. 600℃ NC 샘플도 비슷한 경향으로, AM particle이 Li2CO3, NiO, Ni 성분의 결정성 막에 둘러싸여 Li+이온 이동이 차단되어 0.1C에서 약 0.5mAh/g으로 더 극심한 용량 저하가 나타났다. NPC 샘플도 동일한 경향을 보였고, PVDF와 CB의 잔류물이 종합적으로 성능 저하를 가속화하였다. 이와 같은 성능 저하 결과를 바탕으로, 직접 재활용 공정의 calcination 과정은 400℃의 낮은 온도에서 진행되거나, PVDF와 CB를 최대한 제거할 수 있는 전처리 과정이 필수적임을 확인하였다.

11719.abstract_en:
A study on the effect of PVDF and CB removal at different calcination temperatures on the performance of NCM622 cathode in LIBS direct recycling&#xD;
&#xD;
  Recently, the lithium-ion battery market has experienced rapid growth due to its widespread use in small electronic devices and electric vehicles. Accordingly, the number of end-of-life batteries is also increasing rapidly. Thus, it is necessary to develop a method to efficiently recycle them. Typical recycling methods include pyrometallurgy, hydrometallurgy, and direct recycling. Among them, the direct recycling method attracts much interest since it does not require very high energy or produce toxic chemical waste. To collect the active material (AM) from the cathode scrap, Polyvinylidene fluoride (PVDF) binder and conductive agent of carbon black (CB) must be effectively removed. Solvent dissolution and direct calcination are commonly employed methods, but there has been relatively little research on side reactions caused by residues during the calcination process.&#xD;
  In this study, we focused on the electrochemical performance and morphological changes of collected AM after calcination steps in different temperatures. Samples of pure NCM622, NP (NCM+PVDF), and NC (NCM+CB) were calcined at 400, 500, and 600℃. For comprehensive analysis, an additional sample, NPC (NCM+PVDF+CB), was prepared. Electrochemical performance evaluations (CV, cycle stability, C-rate sweep tests), along with SEM, XRD, TEM, and IR analyses, were conducted to determine the causes of performance degradation. Pure NCM622 showed no significant changes after calcination. However, the NP sample formed a crystalline Li2CO3 layer at 500℃ and 600℃, reducing its capacity to about 20mAh/g at 0.1C, compared to 210mAh/g for no calcination NCM622. The same tendency was shown in the case of NC sample treated at 600°C. The collected AM was widely covered with crystalline film of Li2CO3, NiO, and Ni components. Due to the hindrance of Lithium intercalation, the capacity of the C-rate sweep test at 0.1C was measured to be 0.5mAh/g. Also, the NPC sample showed the same pattern, with residues of PVDF and CB collectively accelerating performance degradation. Based on these results, it was confirmed that the calcination process in direct recycling should be conducted at a lower temperature of 400℃ or that pre-treatment steps to maximally remove PVDF and CB residues are essential.&#xD;

11729.abstract_ko:
제 목 : 생활스포츠 골프지도자와 회원의 라포형성이 관계의 질과 운동지속에 미치는 영향&#xD;
&#xD;
 본 연구에서는 생활스포츠 골프지도자와 회원의 라포, 관계의 질과 운동지속의도의 상관관계를 규명하는 것에 목적이 있다. 수도권 소재의 일부 골프연습 시설에서 연습장을 이용하며 골프지도자에게 지도를 받고 있는 아마추어 골퍼 193명(총 203, 제외 10)을 대상으로 온·오프라인 설문조사를 실시하였다. 본 연구를 위해 골프지도자와 회원의 라포, 관계의 질을 묻는 설문 문항, 회원의 운동지속의사를 묻는 설문 문항을 구성하였다. 회수한 설문지는 참여자의 사회 인구통계학적 특성을 알아보기 위하여 빈도, 백분율로 구분하며, 차이검증을 하기 위하여 평균, 표준편차, t-검증과 일원변량분석(one-way ANOAVA)을 실시하였으며, 일원변량분석의 집단 간의 차이를 알아보기 위하여 LSD의 사후검정으로 검증하였다. 요인 간의 관계 정도를 알아보기 위해 상관관계분석(Correlation Analysis)을 실시하였으며, 요인 간의 구조를 확인하기 위하여 AMOS 23.0을 활용하여 모형적합도 지수와 표준화계수를 산출하고 모형구조에 대한 이론적 타당성을 검증하였다. 이러한 연구결과 다음과 같은 연구결과를 얻었다. 첫째, 골프지도자와 회원의 라포는 관계의 질에 영향을 미친다. 즐거운 관계, 개인적 유대감으로 구성된 라포는 신뢰, 만족, 몰입으로 구성된 관계의 질에 정적으로 유의한 영향을 미치는 것으로 나타났다. 둘째, 골프지도자와 회원의 관계의 질은 운동지속의도에 영향을 미친다. 골프 지도자와 회원과의 관계에서 신뢰, 만족, 몰입이 높을 때, 운동지속의도가 높은 것으로 나타났다. 셋째, 골프연습장 이용자의 인구통계학적 특성에 따라 라포, 관계의 질, 운동지속의도에 영향을 미친다. 본 연구에서 다룬 인구통계학적 특성 중 연령, 운동빈도, 이용 기간, 레슨 구매 차수 등이 변인에 영향을 미치는 것으로 나타났다. 연령에 따라 라포의 개인적 유대, 관계의 질의 신뢰, 만족에 정적인 영향을 미치는 것으로 나타났다. 운동빈도에 따라 관계의 질의 신뢰, 만족, 몰입, 운동지속의도에 정적인 영향을 미치는 것으로 나타났다. 이용기간에 따라 운동지속의도에 정적인 영향을 미치는 것으로 나타났다. 레슨 구매 차수에 따라 라포의 즐거운 관계에 정적인 영향을 미치는 것으로 나타났다. 이러한 결과를 바탕으로, 결론은 다음과 같다. 골프연습장에서 근무하는 골프지도자와 회원의 라포는 상호관의 관계의 질에 긍정적인 영향을 미치고 골프연습장 이용자가 운동을 지속하게 한다. 골프지도자의 라포형성행동은 교육적인 측면에서의 라포 효과뿐 아니라 골프연습장의 상업적 이득도 기대할 수 있다. 따라서 골프지도자는 라포형성을 통해 교육적 효과를 얻을 수 있고, 회원이 해당 골프지도자와의 관계를 지속하려고 한다. 골프연습장에서는 이용자가 직원인 골프지도자와의 관계가 만족스럽고 즐거울 경우 운동을 지속하고 연습장을 많이 이용하는 결과가 나타났다. 따라서 서비스적인 접근으로 고객만족도와 상업적 이득을 기대할 수 있다.

11729.abstract_en:
The effect of rapport between golf leaders and members on the quality of the relationship and the continuation of exercise&#xD;
&#xD;
Background: National income has risen due to the development of modern society. Work-life balance becomes a primary factor in their life. Golf is at the center of it. Compared to other sports, golf has evident characteristics. In the COVID-19 times, the golf population has increased rapidly. As time passes, the role of golf leaders is essential in establishing the inflow of amateur golfers and revitalizing the golf industry market because they greet the golfers for the first time.&#xD;
&#xD;
Objectives: The purpose is to verify whether the rapport and the relationship between the golf leaders and the golfers affect the intention to continue the exercise.&#xD;
&#xD;
Method: The questionnaires concern demographic characteristics, rapport quality, and intention to continue the exercise. The questionnaires were distributed to 203 golfers, and 193 significant questionnaires were collected. Location was restricted in the practice facilities in Seoul and Gyeonggi-do, Republic of Korea.&#xD;
&#xD;
Results: It was confirmed that demographic characteristics, age, exercise frequency, period of practice facility use, and the number of registrations with one golf leader affect each variable. In addition, it was investigated that the rapport between the golf leaders and the golfers affects the quality of the relationship. Also, it affects the intention to continue the exercise.&#xD;
&#xD;
Conclusion: The rapport between the golf leaders and the golfers working at the practice facilities has a positive effect on the quality of the relationship and allows golfers to continue the exercise. When the golfers are satisfied with the relationship, they prefer to continue the exercise and visit the practice facilities frequently. Thus, the behavior of forming a rapport with the golf leaders can expect the rapport effect from the educational perspective and commercial impact in the practice facilities. As a result, it is effective for the golf leaders to obtain educational effects and for the golfers to continue their relationship. &#xD;
&#xD;
Suggestions: 1) It indicates the obvious result by comparing before and after forming the rapport. 2) The influential factors can be accurately analyzed if classified as the motivation for the golf practice. 3) More diverse results are expected by analyzing golf lessons in the media.&#xD;
&#xD;
Keywords: Rapport, Interpersonal relationships, Continuing exercise

11735.abstract_en:
Title : An Analysis on the Effectiveness of Experiential Safety and Health Education Using Virtual Reality(VR)&#xD;
To prevent major industrial accidents in Korea, the enforcement of the Major Accident Punishment Act in January 2022 emphasized the necessity of safety management among individuals, particularly top executives, instilling the importance of preventive measures. However, despite a year passing since the law's implementation, the number of fatalities increased compared to the previous year, as many domestic companies focused more on measures to evade penalties, burdening them. Consequently, there arose a crucial moment highlighting the significance of safety health education concerning workers' safety consciousness and the risk factors involved in tasks to prevent safety incidents caused by workers' unsafe behaviors.&#xD;
 This research centered around a case study of a domestic Battery A manufacturer, proposing a shift in conventional safety health education methods by incorporating VR (Virtual Reality) experiential education to enhance workers' safety consciousness. Due to the impact of the COVID-19 pandemic, safety education predominantly shifted to remote online methods. This shift revealed the potential exacerbation of issues like decreased concentration or lack of immersion experienced in prior theoretical lectures through online safety education. From the company's perspective, there emerged an increasing necessity to transition towards experiential learning methods to enhance employees' safety consciousness and rectify unsafe behaviors, aiming to prevent safety incidents proactively.&#xD;
 This study empirically demonstrated the relationship between VR-based experiential education and its impact on the understanding, satisfaction, and effectiveness of education compared to conventional online education. To achieve this research's objectives, the study analyzed accident types within a domestic Battery A manufacturing firm, developing VR educational content based on accident cases with high occurrence rates. It sought to maximize risk sensitivity through realistic and presence-inducing experiential learning, replicating the manufacturing process and work environment of previous incidents using VR technology.&#xD;
 The study established dedicated VR safety education facilities utilizing Head-Mounted Displays(HMD) to offer immersive educational experiences within a controlled virtual environment across manufacturing facilities and corporate research institutes. Post the experiential education, surveys were conducted to ascertain and analyze the respective educational effects. The research aimed to validate the contribution of VR experiential education in enhancing safety consciousness among workers, influencing safety behaviors, thus contributing to preventing safety incidents in industrial settings.&#xD;
 According to the research analysis, experiential VR education utilizing VR technology significantly impacted safety consciousness, safety behaviors, and accident prevention compared to conventional educational methods, as indicated by survey results. Initially, in terms of understanding and concentration, VR experiential education resulted in a 12.0% increase compared to traditional education. This improvement signifies that VR experiential education effectively raised awareness of potential hazards, leading to safer behaviors and improved comprehension of company regulations. This served as a complement to the limitations of conventional education methods, highlighting the suitability of VR safety education concerning accident risks in battery manufacturing sites.&#xD;
 Secondly, the survey regarding satisfaction with VR experiential education in raising employees' safety consciousness and contributing to accident prevention and response showed a 12.4% improvement compared to traditional education. This improvement suggests that VR education significantly impacted workers' safety consciousness, necessitating continuous education and expanding experiential education durations.&#xD;
 Thirdly, the anticipated educational effect of VR experiential education in enhancing awareness of the risks associated with unsafe behaviors (human errors) and aiding in on-site safety management activities was confirmed to have a 9.5% higher impact than traditional education. These outcomes indicate the expected effectiveness of education in preventing safety incidents at manufacturing sites.&#xD;
 Lastly, comprehensive educational evaluations of VR experiential education indicated a 12.3% higher excellence rate compared to traditional education methods, validating the improvement in safety consciousness post-experiential education, leading to enhanced safety behaviors. The study conducted empirical tests in two formats: observational VR education involved watching VR videos (3D, 360 spaces) to identify hazards, while experiential VR education simulated sensations (4D, sensory stimulation) in a virtual space similar to actual workspaces, using both approaches in one-on-one equipment-based experiential education for research purposes.&#xD;
 According to the research findings, VR experiential education based on presence in the battery manufacturing industry effectively transformed workers' safety consciousness, encouraging safe behaviors and ultimately contributing to the prevention of recurrent safety incidents. Experiential safety health education, diverging from formal education, can significantly increase practical risk sensitivity at the site and induce safety behaviors. The hope is for this method to diffuse among domestic companies, preventing various safety incidents.

11737.abstract_en:
Development of MSDS System through a Survey of EHS(Environment, Health, Safety) Professionals in the Semiconductor Manufacturing Industry in Korea and other countries&#xD;
&#xD;
This study was conducted to investigate how Material Safety Data Sheets(MSDS), internationally recognized for their use in chemical safety and health, are actually utilized in industrial settings. The study aimed to assess awareness, identify implications, and derive areas for improvement through a survey, focusing on EHS (Environment, Health, and Safety) professionals, totaling 163 individuals, who are expected to have high experience and awareness of MSDS within the semiconductor manufacturing industry where various chemicals are handled. &#xD;
By utilizing group variables such as the respondents' workplace countries(Korea, the United States, China), job roles, career lengths, sub-industries, and company sizes(number of employees), the study statistically determined intergroup significance regarding five characteristics of MSDS: importance, specificity, reliability, transparency of information disclosure, and intuitiveness. The results confirmed that awareness of the MSDS system varies according to the country, specific industry, and company size. Notably, respondents in China showed a more positive evaluation of the MSDS system compared to those in Korea and the United States, perceiving MSDS information as more specific and trustworthy, with effective disclosure of hazardous information.&#xD;
Furthermore, the study revealed that the specificity, usability, and reliability of the 16 sections in the MSDS format, particularly those related to environmental hazards (12. Ecological information, 13. Disposal considerations), were lacking and not effectively utilized in the workplace.&#xD;
Approximately 20 years passing since the implementation of the UN GHS (Globally Harmonized System of Classification and Labelling of Chemicals) in 2003, the study indicated that the communication system for conveying hazardous information through MSDS has generally settled through international discussions and improvements. However, there are still areas requiring improvement, especially in certain specified items. Additionally, variations in how countries operate the MSDS system suggest needs for caution in the creation and use of MSDS when handling chemicals distributed among countries. &#xD;
As industries advance, the usage and emissions of chemical substances are consistently increasing, and the development of new chemical substances is also actively progressing. Moreover, due to the insufficient verification of the harmfulness of chemical substances, workers are experiencing harm, and chemical accidents are consistently occurring. Considering this situation, I hope that there will be continued interest and efforts from industries, academia, government agencies, and others in conveying and communicating information about the hazards of chemical substances and working towards improvement.

11740.abstract_en:
With the recent demand for high efficiency and performance in electric vehicles, power semiconductors comprising power devices are being replaced from Si to wide band gap (WBG) semiconductors such as SiC and GaN. Accordingly, development of new materials and processes for power module packaging are essential. In particular, for die-attach process, a transition from conventional bonding materials such as Sn-based solder with low melting point to metals with excellent high-temperature reliability such as Ag and Cu that can withstand high operation temperature of power devices, which can reach up to 300 ℃, is necessary.&#xD;
  Sinter-bonding using Ag and Cu is being considered as an advanced die-attach process and Ag sintering is being used for several power modules. However, Ag and Cu have fatal disadvantages of high cost and poor oxidation resistance, respectively, and various researches are being conducted to overcome them.&#xD;
  Accordingly, Ag-coated Cu (Cu@Ag) particles are attracting attention as a filler in sintering paste for next-generation die-attach. However, contrary to the expectation that it has excellent price competitiveness and anti-oxidation property, Cu oxidation owing to out-diffusion of core Cu and dewetting of Ag shell occur when exposed to high temperature in air. Hence, the use of Cu@Ag particles as a die-attach material is not being actively considered and there are no counterplans against these issues. On the other hand, considering particle size, submicron Cu@Ag particles exhibit excellent productivity and sinterability simultaneously unlike nano and micron particles, thus they are expected to be the most promising filler material for mass production of sintering paste.&#xD;
  In this study, four types of submicron Cu@Ag particles with different Ag contents were fabricated, which was followed by surface modification using stearic acid in order to improve sinterability by suppressing of Ag dewetting. The paste containing surface-modified submicron Cu@Ag particles were prepared by mixing with reductive solvent and was printed and sintered to manufacture sintered films and sinter-bonding samples. The electrical and sinter-bonding characteristics were evaluated with Ag content and sintering time by measuring the electrical resistivities of the sintered films and the shear strength of the bondlines.&#xD;
  Ag dewetting of submicron Cu@Ag particles was suppressed through surface modification, and the effectiveness was the most pronounced when the Ag content was 10 wt% (A10). While the sintered film containing initial Cu@Ag particles with Ag content of 40wt% (A40) exhibited the electrical resistivity value of 1.51×10-4 Ω·cm when sintered for 10 min, that of surface-modified A40 was  6.67×10-5 Ω·cm, which is less than half of that of initial particles, confirming improvement of electrical conductivity. The shear strength of the bondline containing initial A10 was 11.67 MPa when sintered for 3 min, and that of surface-modified A10 exhibited 17.56 MPa, which is much higher value than that of initial A10. When sintered for 10 min, shear strength of surface-modified A10 increased to 20.41 MPa, which is excellent value exceeding 20 MPa.&#xD;
  Consequently, it was confirmed that surface modification of submicron Cu@Ag particles improve the electrical and sinter-bonding characteristics owing to enhanced sinterability by suppression of Ag dewetting. In particular, it is expected that surface-modified A10 would be a promising die-attach material for power module because sinter-bonding characteristics of that, Cu@Ag particles with low Ag content, was similar to those of initial Cu@Ag particles with high Ag content.

11747.abstract_ko:
제목 : WO3-NiO-CuO 혼합분말의 수소환원 및 소결에 의한 W-Ni-Cu 중합금 제조&#xD;
&#xD;
높은 원자번호와 고밀도 특성을 나타내는 텅스텐(W)은 고강도, 고융점, 낮은 열팽창계수 등으로 인해 방사선 차폐재 및 고온 환경 재료에 적합한 물질로 평가받고 있다. 그러나 고융점에 의한 주조공정 적용의 어려움 및 높은 연성-취성 전이온도와 BCC 구조 등으로 인한 낮은 가공성 때문에 다양한 공업적 응용에 제약이 따른다. 한편, W에 비교적 낮은 융점을 갖는 Ni, Cu, Fe 등의 합금원소를 첨가한 W 중합금은 W의 우수한 고경도와 함께 합금원소에 의한 내식성, 열/전기전도성 및 연성의 부여로 소결성 및 가공성과 함께 물성의 향상이 가능하여 다양한 군사 및 항공우주 분야의 부품으로 적용되고 있다.&#xD;
텅스텐 중합금은 주로 금속 원료분말을 이용한 볼 밀링법과 액상소결로 치밀화하는 분말야금법으로 제조하지만 볼 밀링 과정 중의 응집체 형성 및 불순물 혼입의 문제로 인해 미세하고 균일한 복합분말의 합성에 어려움이 있다. 이러한 문제점을 최소화하기 위하여 취성을 가지는 금속산화물 분말을 이용하여 볼 밀링으로 미세화하고 수소분위기에서 열처리하여 나노복합분말로 제조하는 연구가 제안되었다. 이러한 공정을 이용하는 W-Cu 및 W-Ni-Fe 계 복합분말의 합성에 대해서는 많은 연구결과가 보고되었으나, W-Ni-Cu 계에 대해서는 연구가 부족한 실정이다. 특히 미세조직의 정밀 제어를 위해서는 금속산화물 복합분말의 수소환원 거동에 대한 정량적인 해석과 함께 소결조건이 최종 소결체의 미세조직과 물성에 미치는 영향에 대한 체계적 분석이 요구된다.&#xD;
본 연구에서는 WO3, NiO, CuO 분말을 이용하여 볼 밀링한 후 수소분위기에서 환원하여 최종 조성이 W-7 wt% Ni-3 wt% Cu인 합금분말을 제조하였다. 볼 밀링시간에 따른 산화물 복합분말의 크기와 미세구조를 분석하여 최적의 밀링조건을 제시하였으며, 복합분말의 수소환원 거동은 열중량분석기를 이용하여 승온속도에 따른 반응온도 변화를 측정하고 상 분석을 실시하여 해석하였다. 최적의 밀링조건으로 합성한 복합분말은 다양한 성형 및 소결조건으로 치밀화한 후 소결체의 미세조직과 물성을 분석하여 고밀도의 W-Ni-Cu 계 중합금 제조를 위한 최적의 공정조건을 제시하고자 하였다.&#xD;
밀링 시간에 따른 혼합분말의 입도분석 결과 최적의 밀링시간은 5시간이었으며 SEM으로 관찰한 분말크기는 약 1.6 ㎛, WO3에 대한 XRD peak의 반치전폭으로 계산한 crystallite size는 25.3 nm이었다. 800 ℃에서 환원한 합금분말은 금속 W 및 NiCu 상으로만 존재하며 나노크기의 입자들 간에 neck 형성과 성장이 관찰되었다.&#xD;
WO3-NiO-CuO 혼합분말의 수소환원 거동을 해석하기 위해 N2-10% H2 분위기에서 각기 다른 승온속도로 TGA를 진행하였다. 금속산화물 혼합분말은 온도증가에 따라 단계를 거쳐 환원되었으며, 263~327 ℃에서는 CuO, 391~431 ℃에서는 NiO가 환원되었다. WO3는 기존에 보고된 바와 같이 우선적으로 662~740 ℃에서 WO3 → WO2 환원반응이 일어난 후 873~980 ℃에서 WO2 → W으로 환원됨을 확인하였다. Kissinger법으로 계산한 활성화 에너지는 CuO의 경우는 74.9~109.0 kJ/mol, NiO는 122.0 kJ/mol, WO3는 114.6~124.3 kJ/mol를 나타내었다.&#xD;
수소환원 시 온도별로 분말 내 나타나는 상변화를 해석하기 위해 400, 600, 800 ℃에서 환원한 분말들을 XRD를 이용하여 상 분석을 진행하였다. 400 ℃에서 환원한 경우는 WO2.92, Ni, Cu 상이 존재하였으며, 이를 통해 해당 온도에서 CuO와 NiO가 전부 환원됨을 확인하였다. 600 ℃에서는 W, WO2, W17O47, NiCu 상이 존재하였으며 이는 WO2.92가 일부 환원되어 순수한 W과 W-oxide 상을 형성하고 먼저 환원된 Ni과 Cu가 반응하여 NiCu 고용체로 형성되는 것으로 해석하였다. 800 ℃에서 환원한 최종 분말은 W과 NiCu 상의 XRD peak만 관찰되어 금속산화물의 완전한 환원과 함께 바인더인 NiCu의 고용체상으로 존재함을 알 수 있다.&#xD;
최종 합금분말을 수소분위기에서 1100~1200 ℃로 소결하였을 때, 성형압 및 성형방법에 관계없이 모든 시편에서 액상소결 거동이 관찰되며, 고상의 W과 액상의 NiCu 바인더로 구성되었음을 확인하였다. 모든 소결체의 상대밀도는 98.4% 이상을 나타내었으며 SEM-EBSD로 소결체의 표면을 분석한 결과 1100 ℃에서 소결한 시편에서 더 미세한 결정립 크기를 나타내며, W-W contiguity도 높은 값을 나타냈다. 측정된 최대 Vickers 경도 값은 4.1 GPa이며 소결온도가 낮을수록 높은 값을 나타냈으며, 이는 기존에 보고된 내용과 같이 작은 결정립 크기와 높은 W-W contiguity 값에 기인한 것으로 해석하였다.

11747.abstract_en:
Tungsten(W) is considered as a promising candidate material for high temperature applications due to its excellent properties such as high melting point (3422 ℃), high density (19.3 g/cm3), high strength and low thermal expansion coefficient. However, W has a limitation for application because of high ductile-brittle transition temperature (DBTT) and poor ductility by  body-centered cubic (BCC) structure. Meanwhile, tungsten heavy alloys (WHAs), adding alloying element such as low melting point Ni, Cu, Fe to W,  show the combined properties of high hardness of W with thermal/electrical conductivity and improved sinterability by the alloy elements.&#xD;
WHAs powders are usually prepared by ball milling method using metal element powder, but there are problems with aggregate formation and contamination, making it difficult to fabricate a uniform nanocomposite powder. To solve this problem, a ball milling and hydrogen reduction method using brittle metal oxide powders have been reported. In this regard, many studies have been conducted on the synthesis of W-Ni-Fe alloys, but little research has been reported on the W-Ni-Cu system. Therefore, in order to manufacture a W-Ni-Cu alloy with controlled microstructure and mechanical properties, a systematic analysis of the hydrogen reduction behavior of the oxide powders and the effect of sintering conditions on the microstructure of the final sintered body is required.&#xD;
In this study, we fabricate W-7 wt% Ni-3 wt% Cu alloy powder by ball milling and hydrogen reduction using WO3, NiO, CuO powders. The alloy powders are compacted by uniaxial pressing or magnetic pulsed compaction method and then pressureless sintered in a hydrogen atmosphere. The XRD and SEM analysis of the hydrogen-reduced composite powder showed a morphology of neck growth between nano-sized particles of W and NiCu.&#xD;
The reduction behavior of WO3-NiO-CuO powder mixture was investigated by a non-isothermal analysis using TGA with different heating rate, and the activation energy for hydrogen reduction estimated by the slope of the Kissinger plot. TGA results showed that CuO is reduced at 297~327 ℃ and NiO is reduced at 391~431 ℃. After that, WO3 → WO2 and WO2 → W reduction reaction occur at 662~740 and 873~980 ℃, respectively. To understand the formation of phase with reduction temperatures, XRD analysis of powders reduced at 400, 600 and 800 ℃ is conducted. At 400 ℃, WO2.92, Ni, and Cu phases are formed. At 600 ℃, the reduced powder is composed of W, WO2, W17O47, and NiCu phases. Finally, the reduced powder at 800 ℃ consists of W and NiCu phases.&#xD;
The final alloy powder is sintered at 1100~1200 ℃ in hydrogen atmosphere. All specimens has solid-state W phases and liquid-state Ni-Cu phases regardless of compaction pressure and compaction method. SEM-EBSD analysis for surface of the sintered bodies is shown that the 1100 ℃ sintered body has a finer grain size and higher W-W contiguity value. The density of all sintered bodies are ≥ 98.4% and the highest Vickers hardness value is 4.1 GPa. Due to the fine grain size and high W-W contiguity value, as sintering temperature decreases, the hardness value increases.

11751.abstract_en:
Global fossil fuel use has developed the industry rapidly, but excessive use has caused serious environmental destruction, so rapid climate change and global warming are emerging as the biggest problems in human history. Therefore, research on electrochemical reaction-based energy storage devices is drawing attention to researchers. Among them, electrochromic devices (ECDs) has been attracting attention, which can prevent up to 60% of heat-flow through windows in summer and 25% heat loss through EC windows in winter, as an eco-friendly next-generation technology that can reduce energy loss by reducing cooling and heating costs. Typical ECDs are composed of electrolyte, cathodic EC film, anodic EC film, spacer, and transparent conductive film. ECDs can reversibly adjust their optical properties (transmittance, absorption, reflectivity, color, etc.). Among the EC materials, vanadium oxide (V2O5) can be applied as multi-color ECDs because of different colors depending on the various oxidation number. But vanadium oxide films typically showed poor electrical conductivity (＜3×10-5 S/cm), low transmittance modulation value (＜45%), slow response speeds (＞10 sec). To solve this problem, this study conducted a study on vanadium oxide films by fabricating composite films through spin coatings and optimized 3D electrode structures through 3D-printing method.&#xD;
  1) Improving EC energy storage performances by spin-coated V2O5@PFTO (Porous fluorine-doped tin oxide) films. &#xD;
At this work, a hybrid composite structure of porous FTO microspheres on a vanadium oxide film is demonstrated. The porous FTO microspheres were successfully synthesized by using solvent-assisted ultrasonic spray pyrolysis (USP) method. The coating solutions for the spin coating method were prepared with PFTO mass of 0, 1, 2, and 3 wt.%. The hybrid composite EC energy storage film with S-P2VO showed a high cycle stability of up to 500 cycles, showing excellent EC and energy storage performance with wide transmittance modulation (53.79% at 415 nm) and competitive specific capacity (486.3 F/g at 10 A/g). Therefore, the proposed S-P2VO composite film can be demonstrated feasibility as a promising research strategy for multi-functional ECDs.&#xD;
  2) Novel EC energy storage performances by 3D-printed micro-intersected thin/thick V2O5 films.&#xD;
In this study, we fabricate 3D-printed film architectures for promising EC energy storage devices, including micro-intersections of thin/thick films, by micro 3D-printing system without any active material modification. The micro-intersected lines were adjusted with 13×13, 17×17, and 21×21 lines per area (3D-LDVO, 3D-ODVO, 3D-HDVO). In addition, spin-coated vanadium oxide films (S-VO) were fabricated to compare EC energy storage performances with 3D-pinted films. The optimized 3D-ODVO film showed superior electrolyte wettability (contact angle: 12.26°), so robust infiltration of electrolyte to optimized 3D-well structure was induced. The 3D-ODVO films showed the best transmittance modulation (60.7%), the fastest response speeds (1.9 seconds for coloration, 3.7 seconds for bleaching), excellent coloration efficiency value (59.5 cm2/C), high areal capacitance values (32.5 mF/cm2 at 1 mA/cm2), and superb high-rate capability.

11753.abstract_en:
Abstract: Study on improving performance with carbon composite of cobalt vanadium oxide for ultrafast lithium ion capacitor&#xD;
As industrialization progresses, problems such as increased energy consumption, depletion of fossil fuels, and environmental pollution are emerging. As a result, demand for various renewable energy and eco-friendly energy resources is increasing. To solve these problems, energy storage devices that can store energy efficiently and effectively are needed. Accordingly, electrochemical-based energy storage devices include lithium-ion batteries, supercapacitors, vanadium redox flow batteries, and fuel cells. Among them, supercapacitors and lithium-ion batteries are currently the most widely applied devices. Lithium-ion batteries exhibit high energy density because they store charges through a faradic mechanism, and supercapacitors feature high power density because they store charges through a non-faradic mechanism. These two devices have limitations in that they each have limited power density and energy density, depending on how they store energy, respectively. Accordingly, lithium-ion capacitors that combine the advantages of lithium-ion batteries and supercapacitors are in the spotlight. Generally, lithium-ion capacitor is composed of a total of four components: anode, cathode, electrolyte, separator. Lithium-ion capacitors use a battery-type anode that provides high energy density (Li-ion intercalated and de-intercalated within the internal anode) and a capacitor-type cathode (anions adsorption and desorption within the surface of cathode) that provides high power density. The anode of a lithium-ion capacitor has the disadvantage of sluggish Li-ion diffusion reaction, because it stores energy by intercalation and de-intercalation. As a result, the power density of the lithium-ion capacitor decreases, hinders the realization of ultrafast charge/discharge performance, cycle retention, and cycle stability. Therefore, for ultra-fast lithium-ion capacitors, research is needed on anode materials that exhibit both improved lithium-ion diffusion kinetics and electrical conductivity. In this study, as a strategy to solve this problem, we conducted research on rapid performance improvement of lithium-ion capacitors by improving lithium-ion diffusion rate and electrical conductivity through the application of binary metal oxide, a high-capacity material.&#xD;
&#xD;
1) Nano CVO particles embedded in porous carbon nanofibers for ultrafast LIC performances.&#xD;
 In this study, nano CVO particles embedded in porous carbon nanofibers (CVO-PCNF) were synthesized through electro-spinning, stabilization, and carbonization processes. During the stabilization process, the CVO particles grew with through robust chemical bonds inside the CNF matrix. CNF provided a reversible lithium ion diffusion and electron transport pathway to CVO. In addition, the structure surrounding the CVO particles provides structural stability by mitigating CVO volume expansion during repeated charging and discharging processes. At the same time, the mesopore-formed CNF framework and oxygen vacancy-induced CVO exhibited enhanced lithium ion diffusion channel and accelerated electron transfer. Lithium ion storage performance was confirmed by fabricated a CVO-PCNF electrode as a half cell. The result showed a high discharge capacity (636.6 mAh/g), improved cycle stability retention of 97.9% (100 cycles at a current density of 100 mA/g), and ultrafast specific capacity retention rate of 89.5% (500 cycles at a current density of 2000 mA/g). Furthermore, when the CVO-PCNF electrode was applied as a lithium-ion capacitor full cell, it showed a specific capacitance of 138.7 F/g and a specific capacity of 38.0 mAh/g at 0.5 A/g. Additionally, it showed an energy density of 9.03 Wh/kg at a power density of 7927.3 W/kg.&#xD;
2) Boron-doped carbon nano dot-based thin film coating on the surface of CVO particles for ultrafast LIC performances.&#xD;
&#xD;
 In this study, CVO particles were synthesized through low-temperature co-precipitation, and boron-doped carbon nano-dots thin film was formed on the surface of the CVO particles through hydrothermal synthesis and carbonization (BC-CVO). By providing a buffering role for the volume expansion of CVO particles due to the carbon coating and shortening effect of the lithium ion diffusion channel due to a thin film coating of under less 10 nm. Additionally, the nano-level surface roughness caused by the nano-dot base increases the contact area of lithium ions at the electrode-electrolyte interface. In addition, boron doped in the carbon lattices improved the electron acceptance capacity and electron affinity, thereby improving the electrical conductivity of CVO. Accordingly, the lithium-ion storage capacity has a high specific capacity of 1062.6 mAh/g (at 100 mA/g), improved cycle stability of 89.6% (100 cycles at a current density of 100 mA/g), and ultra-high rate capability of 76.7% (1000 cycles at a current density of 2000 mA/g). Furthermore, Additionally, when BC-CVO was applied as a lithium-ion capacitor full cell, the specific capacitance was 55.2 F/g and 15.1 mAh/g at 5.0 A/g, respectively.

11762.abstract_ko:
Dynamic Random Access Memory (DRAM)은 1개의 트렌지스터와 1개의 커패시터로 구성된 메모리 소자이다. DRAM은 간단한 구조를 가지는 장점 덕분에 미세화 및 집적화를 통해 지속적으로 성능을 개선해 왔으나, 소자의 면적이 크게 감소함에 따라 DRAM 커패시터의 커패시턴스 감소, 누설전류 증가 등 여러 가지 열화현상이 나타나게 되면서 성능 개선 한계에 부딪히게 되었다. 그러므로 많은 연구에서는 DRAM 커패시터의 소재 변화를 통해 한계를 해결하고자 하였다. &#xD;
DRAM 커패시터의 전극은 기존에 TiN을 사용하였으나, TiN은 낮은 일함수를 가질 뿐 아니라, 계면에서 Low-K 계면층을 형성하여, DRAM 커패시터 성능에 치명적인 열화를 발생시키는 문제를 가진다. 그러므로, 더 낮은 수준의 DRAM scaling을 구현하기 위해서는 이를 대체할 수 있는 새로운 차세대 고성능 DRAM 전극 소재를 개발할 필요성이 있으며, 그 대안으로 molybdenum dioxide (MoO2)가 제시되었다. MoO2는 전도성 산화물로 150 μΩ·cm의 낮은 비저항을 가질 뿐 아니라 5 eV 이상의 높은 일함수와 높은 화학적 안정성을 갖기 때문에 TiN 대비 전극으로서 더 좋은 성능을 보일 수 있다는 장점이 있다. 그 뿐 아니라, MoO2는 distorted rutile 구조로, rutile 구조의 TiO2를 in-situ crystallization을 통해 낮은 온도에서 성장시킬 수 있다는 장점을 갖는다. &#xD;
rutile 구조의 TiO2는 축 방향에 따라 80에서 최대 170의 유전율을 갖는 소재로 현재 사용 중인 ZAZ 유전막의 낮은 유전율 한계를 해결할 수 있는 차세대 유전막 소재로 연구되고 있는 물질이다. rutile 구조의 TiO2는 800 ℃ 이상의 고온에서 결정화되는 특징 때문에 적용에 어려움을 겪고 있으나, MoO2 전극을 사용할 경우, TiO2를 낮은 온도에서 성장시킬 수 있기 때문에, 이를 통한 유전율 개선 또한 가능하다. 그러나, 몰리브데넘은 전이 금속으로 여러 가지 산화 상을 가지며, 그 중 MoO2는 더 안정적인 몰리브데넘 산화물 (MoO3, Mo4O11 등)에 비해 높은 형성에너지를 갖는 준 안정상으로, 형성이 어렵다는 단점을 가지고 있다. 그러므로, 본 연구에서는 MoO2를 증착할 수 있는 공정을 개발하고자 하며, 이를 TiO2 기반의 DRAM 커패시터 전극으로 적용하여 TiO2/MoO2 stack의 MIM 커패시터 성능 평가를 진행하고자 하였다. &#xD;
먼저 Sputtering 공정을 이용하여 MoO2를 증착하여 MoO2의 DRAM 커패시터 전극 적용 가능성을 평가하고자 하였다. 그러므로, 몰리브데넘 타겟과 O2/Ar gas를 이용하여 RF reactive magnetron sputtering 공정을 진행하였으며, 증착 온도는 500 ℃, process power는 100 W로 고정하였고, O2/Ar 비율과 압력을 변화시켜가며 MoO2가 증착되는 조건을 확보하고자 하였다. 공정 압력은 3 mtorr, 5 mtorr, 20 mtorr로 변화시켰으며, O2/Ar 비율은 0.01~0.25로 변화시켰다. 그 결과 각 공정압력에서 O2/Ar 비율이 증가함에 따라 박막의 결정상이 Mo metal에서 MoO3로 변화하는 것을 확인하였으며, 20 mtorr 압력과 0.035의 O2/Ar 비율, 5 mtorr 압력과 0.11의 O2/Ar 비율, 그리고 3 mtorr의 압력과 0.22의 O2/Ar 비율에서 MoO2 결정상이 나타나는 것을 확인하였다. 이를 통해 MoO2가 형성되는 O2/Ar 비율 범위가 매우 작긴 하지만 특정 비율에서는 MoO2를 형성할 수 있다는 것을 확인하였다. 이후에는 각 공정 압력에서 형성한 MoO2 박막의 특성을 비교하였다. 비저항과 표면 거칠기를 각각 4-point probe와 AFM으로 분석하였으며, 그 결과 낮은 압력에서 증착할수록 더 낮은 거칠기와 낮은 비저항을 갖는 것을 확인하였다. 3 mtorr에서 증착한 MoO2의 경우 비저항이 974 μΩ·cm로 각 압력에서 증착한 MoO2 중 가장 낮은 비저항을 가졌으나, 이 또한 커패시터 전극으로 사용하기에 높은 비저항이므로, 이를 감소시키기 위해 열처리를 진행하였으며, 그 결과 600 ℃의 열처리 온도에서 524 μΩ·cm의 매우 낮은 비저항을 갖는 MoO2를 형성하는데 성공하였다. 그 다음으로는 해당 MoO2를 TiO2 기반 커패시터의 하부전극으로 사용하여 전극 적용 가능성 평가를 진행하였으며, 그 결과 MoO2 위에서 ALD 공정을 이용하여 350 ℃의 낮은 온도로 증착한 TiO2가 in-situ crystallization을 통해 rutile 구조로 결정화 됨을 XRD와 TEM 분석을 이용해 확인하였다. 또한 Pt/TiO2/MoO2의 커패시터 구조를 형성하여 커패시터의 전기적 특성을 측정해본 결과 93의 높은 유전율을 갖는 커패시터가 형성되었음을 확인하였으며, 유전막 두께 대비 등가산화막 두께 그래프의 y 절편이 0에 수렴함을 통해 TiO2 유전막과 MoO2 전극 사이에 low-K interfacial layer가 형성되지 않는 것을 확인하였다. 이를 통해 MoO2를 전극으로 도입할 시 TiO2를 이용한 높은 유전율의 DRAM 커패시터를 구현할 수 있음을 확인하였다. 그러나 DRAM의 미세화가 진행됨에 따라 커패시터의 aspect ratio는 증가하였으며, 전극과 유전막의 두께는 수 나노미터로 감소하게 되었다. sputtering 공정은 두께 제어 및 단차피복성 측면에서 높은 aspect ratio를 갖는 구조에서 수 나노미터의 두께를 정밀하게 제어하여 증착하는 것이 어려우므로 DRAM 커패시터 전극 증착공정으로 부적합하다. 그러므로 다음 연구로는 원자층 증착 공정(Atomic Layer Deposition, ALD) 공정을 이용하여 MoO2를 증착하고자 하는 연구를 진행하였다. 다만 기존에 보고된 여러 가지 선행연구를 통해 범용적인 ALD 공정만으로는 MoO2를 증착하기 어렵다는 것을 확인하였으므로, 본 연구에서는 Super cycle ALD를 통하여 박막 내에 Sn을 도핑하여 안정적인 MoO2 증착 공정을 개발하였다. SnO2는 rutile 구조로 MoO2와 매우 유사한 결정구조를 가지기 때문에 MoOx 박막 내에 Sn을 도핑한 후 열처리 공정을 이용하여 박막 내에 SnO2를 형성할 경우 SnO2가 박막 내에서 template effect를 발생시켜 MoO2 결정화를 이끌어낼 수 있다. Super cycle ALD는 MoOx sub-cycle과 SnOx sub-cycle로 구성되었으며, MoOx sub-cycle은 amino기 ligand를 갖는 precursor와 O3 반응물을 이용하여 구성하였으며, SnOx sub-cycle은 Sn(dmamp)2 전구체와 H2O 반응물을 이용한 공정으로 고정하였다. 그 결과 Sn을 도핑함에 따라 박막의 결정 구조가 rutile 구조로 변화하는 것을 확인하였으며, Sn을 도핑함에 따라 열처리 이후 박막의 표면거칠기가 감소하는 것을 확인하였고, 비저항이 감소하는 것을 확인하였다. 이후 Sn-doped MoO2 박막을 전극으로 활용하여 커패시터를 증착한 결과 TiO2가 Sn-doped MoO2 박막 위에서 rutile 구조로 결정화 되는 것을 확인하였으며, MIM 구조의 커패시터를 제작하여 전기적 특성을 평가한 결과 100 이상의 높은 유전율을 갖는 커패시터를 형성할 수 있음을 확인하였다. 결과적으로, 본 연구를 통해 MoO2를 안정적으로 증착할 수 있는 ALD 증착 공정을 개발하는데 성공하였으며, 이를 통해 TiO2 기반의 고성능 커패시터를 형성할 수 있는 MoO2의 전극 적용 가능성을 확인하였다. 이는 고성능 차세대 DRAM 커패시터를 제작하는데 많은 도움이 될 것으로 기대된다.

11762.abstract_en:
Dynamic Random Access Memory (DRAM) is a memory device consisting of 1 transistor and 1 capacitor. Because of its simple structure, DRAM has continuously improved its performance through miniaturization and integration. However, as the area of the device significantly decreased, various degradation phenomena such as a decrease in the capacitance of the DRAM capacitor and an increase in leakage current appeared, leading to a performance improvement limit. Therefore, many studies have tried to solve this limit through material changes in DRAM capacitors. The electrode of the DRAM capacitor was originally using TiN, but TiN has a low work function and forms a low-K interfacial layer on the surface, causing fatal degradation to the performance of the DRAM capacitor. Therefore, to implement a lower level of DRAM scaling, there is a need to develop a new next-generation high-performance DRAM electrode material that can replace it, and molybdenum dioxide (MoO2) was suggested as an alternative. MoO2 is a conductive oxide with a low resistivity of 150μΩ·cm and a high work function of more than 5 eV, and it has high chemical stability, so it has the advantage of being able to show better performance as an electrode compared to TiN. In addition, MoO2 has a distorted rutile structure, and it has the advantage of being able to grow TiO2 of the rutile structure at a low temperature through in-situ crystallization. Rutile-sturctured TiO2 is a material with a dielectric constant ranging from 80 to a maximum of 170 depending on the axial direction, and it is a material being studied as a next-generation dielectric material that can solve the low dielectric limit of the currently used ZrO2/Al2O3/ZrO2 (ZAZ) stacked dielectric film. Rutile-structured TiO2 is crystallized at a high temperature of 800 ℃ or more, so it has a disadvantage that it is difficult to use as a dielectric film of DRAM capacitor. However, it can applied as a dielectric film through applying MoO2 as an electrode of DRAM capacitor, so it is also possible to improve the dielectric constant of DRAM capacitor through using TiO2/MoO2 stacked MIM capacitor. However, molybdenum is a transition metal with various oxidation states, and among them, MoO2 has a high formation energy as a meta-stable state compared to more stable molybdenum oxides (MoO3, Mo4O11, etc.), so it has the disadvantage of being difficult to form. Therefore, in this study,  we aimed to develop a process that can deposit MoO2, and we aimed to apply it as an electrode of a TiO2-based DRAM capacitor and evaluate the performance of the TiO2/MoO2 stacked MIM capacitor.&#xD;
Firstly, the feasibility of applying MoO2 as a DRAM capacitor electrode was evaluated by depositing MoO2 using a sputtering process. Therefore, an RF reactive magnetron sputtering process was conducted using a molybdenum target and O2/Ar gas. The deposition temperature was fixed at 500 ℃ and the process power at 100 W, and the O2/Ar ratio and pressure were varied to secure the deposition condition of MoO2. The process pressure was changed to 3 mtorr, 5 mtorr ,and 20 mtorr, and the O2/Ar ratio was changed from 0.01 to 0.25. As the O2/Ar ratio increased at each process pressure, it was confirmed that the crystal phase of the film changed from Mo metal to MoO3, and MoO2 crystal phase appeared at 20 mtorr pressure and 0.035 O2/Ar ratio, 5 mtorr pressure and 0.11 O2/Ar ratio, and 3 mtorr pressure and 0.22 O2/Ar ratio. Through this, it was confirmed that although the O2/Ar ratio range where MoO2 formed is very narrow, MoO2 can be formed at certain ratio. Afterwards, the characteristics of the MoO2 films formed at each process pressure were compared. The resistivity and surface roughness were analyzed with a 4-point probe and AFM, respectively, and as a result, it was confirmed that the MoO2 film deposited at the lower pressure has the lower roughness and the lower resistivity. The resistivity of MoO2 deposited at 3 mtorr was 974 μΩ·cm, which was the lowest resistivity among the MoO2 deposited at each pressure, but this was also a high resistivity to be used as a capacitor electrode, so post-deposition process was proceeding to reduce it, and as a result, the resistivity of 524 μΩ·cm is shown at MoO2 film annealed at 600 ℃ in N2 atmosphere. Consquently, Pt/TiO2/MoO2 stacked MIM capacitor was fabricated for evaluating the feasibility of applying MoO2 as an electrode of the TiO2 based capacitor. as a result, Tio2 deposited at a low temperature of 350 ℃ on MoO2 using ALD process was confirmed to be crystallized into a rutile structure through in-situ crystallization using XRD and TEM analysis. In addition, through the electrical characteristics evaluation, it is confirmed that Pt/TiO2/MoO2 capacitor has a high dielectric constant of 93, and through the y-intercept of the equivalent oxide thickness graph with respect to the dielectric film thickness, we confirmed that a low-K interfacial layer is not formed between the TiO2 and MoO2. through this study, it is confirmed that a high dielectric constant DRAM capacitor using TiO2 can be implemented by introducing MoO2 as an electrode. However, as the scaling of DRAM progressed, the aspect ratio of the capacitor increased, and the thickness of the electrode and dielectric decreased to a few nanometers. The sputtering process is difficult to precisely control and deposit a few nanometers of thickness in a structure with a high aspect ratio in terms of thickness control and step coverage, so it is unsuitable for the DRAM capacitor electrode deposition process. Therefore, the next research was conducted to deposit MoO2 using atomic layer deposition (ALD) process. However, through various previous studies reported so far, it was confirmed that it is difficult to deposit MoO2 with a conventional ALD process, so in this study, a stable MoO2 deposition process was developed by doping SnOx in the film through super-cycle ALD. SnO2 has a rutile structure which is similar with crystal structure of MoO2, so if SnO2 is formed in the film by doping SnOx in the MoOx film and then using a heat treatment process, SnO2 can induce MoO2 crystallization in the film through the template effect. Super-cycle ALD consists of a MoOx sub-cycle composed of a molybdenum precursor of the amino group precursor and O3, and a SnOx sub-cycle composed of Sn(dmamp)2 precursor and H2O, and the Sn doping concentration in the film was adjusted by changing the sub-cycle ratio of MoOx sub-cycle and SnOx sub-cycle from 100:1 to 100:5. As a result, it was confirmed that the crystal structure of the film changes into a rutile structure as SnOx is doped, and it was confirmed that the surface roughness of the film after heat treatment is decreased as Sn doping concentration increased, and the resistivity also decreases as Sn doping concentration increased before 20 %. To evaluate a properties of Sn-doped MoO2 film as an electrode, TiO2 is deposited on the Sn-doped MoO2 film using ALD at 350 ℃, and it is confirmed that TiO2 is crystallized into a rutile structure on the Sn-doped MoO2 film. It means that Sn-doped MoO2 film can crystallized TiO2 through the in-situ crystallization. Afterwards, the electrical characteristics of the Pt/TiO2/Sn-doped MoO2 stacked MIM capacitor fabricated on the TiN substrate was evaluated. As a result, it was confirmed that capacitor fabricated using 20 % Sn-doped MoO2 show high dielectric constant of 136.&#xD;
In conclusion, through this study, we succeeded in developing an ALD deposition process that can stably deposit MoO2. Furthermore, through  this, it is confirmed the feasibility of applying MoO2 as an electrode that can form a high-performance capacitor based on TiO2. This is expected to be of great help in manufacturing high-performance next-generation DRAM capacitors.

11764.abstract_en:
To address the sneak current issue in high-density crossbar arrays, selectors based on Ovonic threshold switch (OTS), which operate via volatile resistive switching depending on the external electrical field, have been studied. Although OTS demonstrates superior performance as a selector, chalcogenide-based devices can degrade due to Joule heating generated during operation. Previous studies have shown differences in endurance and thermal stability between GeTe (GT)-based and Se-doped GeTe (SGT)-based OTS devices, suggesting a direct impact of thermal stability on device endurance. To understand this degradation process from a thermal perspective, we conducted thermal analysis using time-domain thermoreflectance (TDTR) to confirm the thermal characteristics of chalcogenide thin films and thermoreflectance-based thermal imaging (TTI) microscopy combined with electrical measurements to observe thermal images during TS operation.&#xD;
&#xD;
In this study, we conducted TDTR and TTI analyses of GT and SGT devices to understand which factors directly affect endurance and reliability of the device. For the TDTR analysis, GT and SGT-based thin films were deposited on Si substrates, followed by the deposition of TiN and Au layers. TDTR analysis was conducted using a Transometer™ (TMX Scientific Inc., US). This analysis revealed thermal conductivities of GT films in amorphous and crystalline phases and amorphous SGT films, with similar thermal boundary resistance of the film stacks. However, it was difficult to observe the critical differences as a factor of Se doping; only the thickness effect was confirmed. Therefore, it was concluded that the thermal properties of the materials might not directly influence endurance.&#xD;
&#xD;
After evaluating the film characteristics, TTI microscopy was conducted to observe the thermal image and real-time temperature change during electrical operation using a Microsanj SanjSCOPE™ thermal imaging system. For this analysis, GT and SGT were fabricated on a Pt bottom electrode, and TiN and Au metals were deposited as the top electrode. TTI analysis revealed the localized temperature increase during operation with volatile resistive switching characteristics, which had not been well characterized before. Additionally, the breakdown of GT device was confirmed after in-situ TTI analysis, while SGT device remained stable.&#xD;
&#xD;
Subsequently, transmission electron microscopy analysis was conducted to examine how Joule heating affected the microstructural changes during operation. SGT device remained amorphous, whereas GT device exhibited localized crystallization and catastrophic failure phenomena, such as electromigration (EM) and phase separation due to heating.&#xD;
&#xD;
To further understand the inner temperature and failure process during TS operation, we used multiphysics simulation to analyze the Joule heating effect and its impact on OTS device failure. The results indicated that SGT did not reach crystallization temperatures during operation, whereas GT exceeded these temperatures. Additionally, in-situ analysis of GT device revealed that mitigating EM-induced failures is crucial. These findings suggest that reducing operating voltage and current could lower Joule heating. Furthermore, selecting elements with stronger bonding energy in the chalcogenide thin film could mitigate the EM and phase separation phenomena.

11767.abstract_en:
A Study on the application of hydrogen vehicles refueling protocol&#xD;
&#xD;
  Although positive awareness of hydrogen's eco-friendliness is increasing according to the results of the hydrogen awareness survey, there is still a negative perception that hydrogen is dangerous. As the distribution of hydrogen vehicles and hydrogen refueling stations has recently expanded, hydrogen accidents have also increased as the amount of hydrogen used increases. In addition, compared to methane and gasoline, which are automobile fuels, hydrogen has a lower combustion heat and a higher deflagration index, so it can be said to be dangerous. Therefore, there is a need to resolve the vague anxiety of the public by ensuring the safety of hydrogen refueling stations that are close to the public.&#xD;
For the safety of hydrogen vehicles and hydrogen refueling stations, the 'Hydrogen refueling Protocol' is a technology that fully charges hydrogen vehicle containers with 100% hydrogen in the shortest time while satisfying the temperature and maximum refueling pressure inside the hydrogen vehicle container. Here, the internal temperature of the hydrogen vehicle container is less than 85℃, and the maximum refueling pressure is less than 87.5MPa.&#xD;
Protocols are important from a safety perspective because failure to meet the hydrogen refueling protocol can lead to a serious accident if the hydrogen car container is damaged due to over-temperature and over-pressure. In addition, if the protocol is not met, refueling time takes a long time, failure to fully charge a hydrogen vehicle reduces driving distance, and problems arise in securing the economic feasibility of hydrogen refueling stations.&#xD;
In this study, we investigated the concept of the protocol, including the purpose of the refueling protocol and the contents of SAE J2601, which is used as the basis for hydrogen vehicle refueling around the world. In addition, we investigated the status of protocol promotion in the United States and Japan, related standards, and hydrogen refueling protocol verification equipment developed in the United States and Japan. The government's research tasks reflecting the need for related standards and protocols needed to build domestic hydrogen refueling stations were also investigated.&#xD;
And, I studied the components of domestically developed hydrogen refueling performance evaluation equipment, safety insurance methods, and hydrogen refueling stations performance and safety evaluation methods. In addition, in order to apply the performance evaluation equipment(Hy-PAS) to the field, hydrogen temperature, pressure, flow rate, and mass data were stored in a hydrogen refueling stations currently operated in Korea, and data transmission was confirmed to operate normally using IR communication. &#xD;
We investigated the government's policies and economic analysis methods to improve operating conditions, including securing the economic feasibility of hydrogen refueling stations. An economic feasibility analysis was conducted using data collected from six hydrogen refueling stations operating in Korea.&#xD;
Currently, because there is a shortage of hydrogen refueling stations, drivers of hydrogen cars feel anxious about the driving distance depending on the remaining amount of hydrogen, so they tend to recharge when about 50% of the remaining capacity remains (driving range of 155 km). As a result of the economic analysis, if it is assumed that 5kg, which is the fully charged amount, is charged, the sales price of hydrogen will decrease, so hydrogen refueling stations must be sufficiently supplied to reduce the sales price of hydrogen. If the sales price of hydrogen is reduced, the supply of hydrogen vehicles will further increase.&#xD;
In addition, in a situation where there are not many hydrogen cars like the present, only 30 to 40% of the maximum refueling capacity at the hydrogen refueling station is charged, and it was found that if the maximum refueling capacity is charged per day, the selling price of hydrogen decreases. And, assuming that 5kg, which is the average fully charged amount per unit, is charged, the annual profit was analyzed to be more than 200 million won. Therefore, economic feasibility will only be achieved when the supply of hydrogen vehicles is expanded so that the maximum number of vehicles per day can be charged according to the construction capacity of hydrogen refueling stations.&#xD;
Through this study, it was confirmed that the protocol must be satisfied for hydrogen refueling to ensure safety and economic efficiency. Currently, when building a hydrogen refueling station to ensure its safety, only the facility standards are checked and the hydrogen refueling performance cannot be confirmed. However, for safe charging, vehicle-mounted evaluation equipment and technology have been developed to evaluate whether refueling temperature, refueling pressure, and refueling flow rate are controlled within a safe range. Therefore, legislation is needed to allow hydrogen refueling stations to be operated(business commenced) only when performance and safety standards are met. &#xD;
If hydrogen charging performance is improved and hydrogen vehicles are fully charged, the selling price of hydrogen will drop, contributing to achieving the government's hydrogen charging price target. In addition, when fully charged, the charging amount of the hydrogen charging station will increase, and the increased charging amount will lead to an increase in sales, contributing to securing the economic feasibility of the hydrogen charging station. In addition, the hydrogen charging protocol can solve the problem of increased charging waiting time due to the current lack of hydrogen charging infrastructure by shortening the charging time, thereby resolving the complaints of hydrogen vehicle drivers. In addition, it will contribute to increasing the sales of hydrogen vehicles, and the increase in hydrogen vehicles will also contribute to securing the economic feasibility of hydrogen charging stations.&#xD;
  Through the performance and safety evaluation of hydrogen refueling stations, the safety of hydrogen refueling stations can be secured to relieve the public's vague anxiety, and the application of protocols will secure economic feasibility and contribute to the expansion of hydrogen refueling stations.&#xD;
&#xD;
Keywords: SAE J2601, hydrogen refueling, refueling protocol, hydrogen refueling performance evaluation, hydrogen refueling station safety evaluation, refueling pressure, refueling temperature, refueling flow rate, hydrogen mobility

11769.abstract_ko:
제 목 : 호소 수질 개선을 위한 비점오염원 관리 방안에 관한 연구 (주암호를 중심으로) &#xD;
&#xD;
본 연구에서는 댐 상류에 위치한 호소 유역의 농경지 경지정리 규모 확대, 대규모 축산 단지 신설 등 점점 증가하고 있는 비점오염원의 현황 및 문제점을 재조명하고 비점오염원이 수질에 미치는 영향을 파악하여 호소 유역 전반에 걸쳐 수질 개선을 위한 비점오염 저감을 위한 관리방안을 제안하였다. &#xD;
본 연구를 위해 오염부하량은 국가 배출부하량 자료를 바탕으로 주암호 유역에 대한 배출부하량을 세유역별로 점오염과 비점오염으로 구분하여 전체 오염원 중 비점오염이 차지하는 영향을 검토 하였으며, T-P 기준 전체 배출부하량 339.5kg/day 중 비점오염이 309.0kg/day로 약 전체의 91%인 대부분을 차지하고 있음을 확인 할 수 있었으며, 주암호로 유입되는 21개 하천 중 오염도가 큰 하천을 대상으로 총 12개 지점을 선정하여 2022년 4월 비강우시 1회, 그 해 6월과 7월 2회에 걸쳐 강우시 수질 및 유량조사를 실시하였다. 강우시 유량 조사는 1지점 당 1시간 ~ 1시간 30분 간격으로 총 10이상 실시한 후 유량가중평균농도(EMC)를 산정하여 각 강우조사 시간의 초기 발생한 오염부하에 대하여 비교하였으며, 채취 시료는 시험실로 가져와서 수질오염공정시험기준에 준하여 총 17개 항목에 대해 수질분석을 실시하여 강우시와 비강우시의 수질농도를 비교하였다. 그 결과 T-P 기준으로 강우시가 비강우시에 비해 약 2 ~ 10배 높음을 알 수 있었다. 연구 시 수행한 수질조사 및 분석결과를 바탕으로 주암호 수질개선을 위해 유역의 비점오염 관리방안을 수립하였으며, 비점오염 저감 관리방안으로 구조적 대책과 비구조적 대책으로 구분하였다. 먼저 구조적 대책으로 환경부 비점오염원관리 기준에 의거하여 저감시설 유형별 시설용량 및 삭감량을 산정하였으며, 주변 농경지 배출수 처리 목적으로 만들어진 기존 소규모 인공습지에 대신 주변 농경지 배출수 뿐 아니라 하천수를 직접 처리할 수 있으며 대규모 처리가 가능한 저류지 및 고성능 여과시설을 조합한 저감시설 19개소, 인공습지 8개소, 에코필터링 3개소와 대상 부지가 넓은 지점은 생태적으로 좋은 영향을 미치는 수변생태벨트를 조합하는 방안을 적용하였다. 또한 주암호 주변으로 위치하는 기존 습지 중 기능과 역할을 못해 개선이 필요한 습지 2곳을 선택해서 습지개선을 적용해 장래 배출부하량을 삭감하였다. 비구조적 대책으로 유역 특성에 부합하고 기존에 선행 추진사례가 있는 농업BMPs, 도랑살리기, 축사매입, 퇴비나눔 등 대상 지역에 적용하여 장래 배출부하량을 삭감하였다. &#xD;
호소 수질개선 방안으로 본 연구를 통해 제시된 비점오염 관리방안 적용시 전체 삭감 가능량은 T-P 기준 175.9kg/day으로 나타났으며, 그 중 구조적 방안인 비점 저감시설 부분이 120.5kg/day으로 전체의 84%를 차지하였다. 전체 삭감량 중 약 80%정도만 이행되어도 목표삼각량(139.9kg/day) 달성은 가능한 것으로 나타나 이를 실행하기 위한 재원적, 제도적, 정책적 보완만 이루어진다면 어느 정도 수질개선 효과는 분명히 있다고 판단되어진다.&#xD;
마지막으로 본 연구를 통해 얻어진 비점오염원 관리방안을 취수원으로 이용되는 수많은 호소의 수질개선에 적용시 어느 정도 활용이 될 것으로 사료된다. 또한 추후 이러한 기술적 방안 외에 전 세계적인 이상 기온에 따른 기후변화 위기를 극복할 탄소저감 방안으로 기후적응법 제정 등 제도 및 정책적으로도 보완되어 강우량 증가에 따른 비점오염원으로 인해서 호소 수질이 더 이상 악화되지 않고 개선되기를 기대한다.

11769.abstract_en:
A Study on the Non-point source pollution management measures to improve lake water quality&#xD;
– Focusing on the case of Juam Lake&#xD;
&#xD;
In this study, to manage the water quality of Juam Lake, located upstream of the Boseong River in the Seomjin River water system, we conducted water quality and pollution source surveys in the Juam Lake basin. These surveys aimed to manage Non-point source pollution, which constitute the majority of the pollution, identify major issues, and achieve target water quality levels. We refer to this as a comprehensive plan for lake water quality conservation, taking into account local watershed characteristics and issues. We will review and develop a management plan for Non-point source pollution located upstream of the lake, focusing on water quality conservation for Juam Lake, which serves as a water intake source. Our goal is to contribute to this effort.&#xD;
In this study, water quality surveys were conducted three times : once during non-rainfall periods and twice during rain, on 12 major rivers with high pollution levels among the 21 rivers flowing into the lake. We analyzed the discharge load for each sub-basin in the Juam Lake basin. Based on the survey results, we developed a Non-point source management plan to improve the lake's water quality. Structural measures to reduce Non-point source pollution include the installation of reduction facilities such as retention ponds, filtration facilities, artificial wetlands, eco-filters, waterside ecological belts, improvement of existing wetlands, small-scale sewage treatment plants, and livestock manure management. Agricultural BMPs, livestock purchase programs, compost sharing, and ditch revitalization were applied and analyzed as new public treatment plants and non-structural measures.&#xD;
When applying the Non-point source pollution management plan presented in this study, the total reduction achievable is 175.9 kg/day, with structural measures contributing 120.5 kg/day, accounting for 84% of the total reduction. It appears possible to achieve the target reduction amount (139.9 kg/day) even if only about 80% of the total reduction measures are implemented.&#xD;

11770.abstract_en:
Sanitary landfill is one of the crucial facilities for environmental conservation and public health in our society, and their management standards have been continuously strengthened. Since the initial establishment of standard for the installation and operation of a sanitary landfill in 1991, additional measures have been provided in response to various environmental demands and increasing scientific understanding.&#xD;
  In 2003, a direct landfill of sewage sludge was banned, and in 2005, the direct landfilling of high-moisture organic waste, including food waste, was also prohibited. These measures aim to minimize the negative environmental impacts from the landfill, and those developments in landfilling and its monitoring are essential for environmental conservation and sustainable development.&#xD;
  Strengthening standards of daily and intermediate cover is one of the measures, which aims to reduce landfill gas, prevent rainwater infiltration into the landfill, minimize leachate production, and reduce public health issues such as odors, insects, and disease transmission. In the meantime it, however, causes a new challenge.&#xD;
  For example, the prevention of rainwater infiltration into the landfill can lead to a drier environment of the landfill, impeding decomposition of biodegradable organic materials. This, in turn, extends the post-closure period of the landfill. To address this issue, the bioreactor landfill method has been introduced to conventional landfill methodologies. This method increases the moisture content within the landfill without a net increase of an accumulated leachate, consequently promoting the decomposition of landfill waste. &#xD;
  By applying the optimal coefficients obtained from this study for a total of 53 months from June 2019 to October 2023, The result shows total leachate transfer volume through the pump station of the 2nd landfill was 4,449,342 ㎥, while the total leachate discharge volume according to the modeling results was 4,066,833 ㎥, accounting for 91.4% of the actual volume. The correlation coefficient of the transfer volume was found very high at 0.849. Deviation between the transfer volume and the modeled leachate volume by a month was 14,074 ㎥ on average. &#xD;
  During the modeling period, the contribution rates to leachate generation from each source according to the modeling were as follows: 58.2% from rainwater, 37.4% from the injected leachate, and 4.4% from existing moisture. As for existing moisture, its influence was significant during the initial approximately 5 months of the modeling period, but about 1 year later, its impact on the overall generation became weak, with subsequent influence being dominated by precipitation and leachate injection.&#xD;
  Based on the modeling results of the variation in landfill internal moisture content due to leachate injection and precipitation infiltration, the infiltration rate of precipitation was measured at 21.9%. The total moisture content within the 2nd landfill site was analyzed to be 38,244×103 ㎥ in March 2021. During this period, a total of 4,449×103 ㎥ of moisture was supplied, while 3,310×103 ㎥ was discharged, resulting in a net increase of 1,180×103 ㎥. Therefore, the porosity rate as of October 2023 stood at 37.5%, indicating a 0.7% point increase compared to March 2021.&#xD;
  According to the result, through an analysis of the moisture behavior within a landfill with the bioreactor method, it was examined that a change in precipitation shows a greater impact on leachate generation than the leachate injection. Particularly in climate condition of South Korea, where distinct wet and dry seasons prevail, variations in precipitation can lead to excessive moisture saturation within landfills and increased leachate generation. Therefore, it is necessary to adjust the quantity of leachate injection in response to changes in precipitation during landfill operation. It is consequently expected that the efficient control of moisture within the landfill can be achieved and leads to minimization of leachate generation. &#xD;
  Furthermore, the current "Appendix 11 of Enforcement Rules, Waste Management Act" regulate to maintain the moisture content within the landfill below 50% considering the stability of the bioreactor landfill. These policy regulations play a pivotal role in preventing safety issues during landfill operation and improving environmentality.&#xD;
  Lastly, if a cover of landfill is managed without the final cover, continuous increases in the infiltration rate of precipitation is highly expected due to loss of cover material from rainfall or differential settlement occurring over time. Therefore, continuous attention and supervision are necessary for cover management. This study is expected to identify an effective operation and improvement method for a landfill with bioreactor method.

11775.abstract_ko:
서울과학기술대학교는 화물 용량 증대를 포함한 철도 운송 서비스를 개발하기 위해 국가 단일 기업 '타직 철도'가 수명이 다한 구형 및 구형 차량의 기단 재구축 공사를 진행하고 있습니다.&#xD;
 주목할 점은 국가통일기업 '타직철도'가 여객 및 화물차의 서비스 수준과 질을 높이고 현대화를 위해 투자사업인 '공포의 마차 1천대, 여객용 밴 30대 구매에 관하여'를 개발했다는 점입니다. 관계부처에서 재원마련에 힘쓰고 있습니다.&#xD;
주목할 점은 2019-136개의 마차가 정비되고 1224개의 난파선이 기지에서 수리됨으로써 철도에 의한 화물 서비스의 수준과 품질이 크게 강화되었다는 것입니다.&#xD;
또한, 최대 60% 할인을 제공하는 우즈베키스탄 공화국의 철도 이용에 대한 할인 및 양보 제공 문제는 이번 노선을 포함하여 CIS 국가들의 국제 교통 발전을 강화하는 데 긍정적인 영향을 미쳤습니다.

11775.abstract_en:
University Seoul National University of Science and Technology in order to develop railway transport  services, including the increase of freight capacity, the State Unitary Enterprise “Tajik Railways” is carrying out the reconstruction of the fleet of old and obsolete vehicles, which have expired.&#xD;
It should be noted that in order to improve the level and quality of service and modernization of the fleet of passenger and freight cars, the State Unitary Enterprise “Tajik Railways” has developed an investment project “On the purchase of 1,000 fright wagons and 30 passenger vagons” Relevant ministries are working to raise funds.&#xD;
It should be noted that in 2019-136 wagons were overhauled and 1224 wrecks were repaired at the base, which significantly strengthened the level and quality of freight services by rail.&#xD;
Also, the issue of providing discount and concessions for the use of railways of the Republic of Uzbekistan, which offers up to 60% discount, has had a positive impact on strengthening the development of international transportation to CIS countries, including this rout.

11777.abstract_ko:
광산 부문은 몽골의 주요 대외 무역 부문입니다. 그리고 산업의 발달과 함께 운송량도 증가하고 있습니다. 생산이 증가하는 반면 운송능력은 최고조에 달해 수출 둔화의 근본 원인이 되고 있습니다.&#xD;
몽골 정부는 운송 지연을 해소하기 위해 철도 개발 정책을 단계적으로 추진하고 있습니다.&#xD;
내륙국의 경우, 운송 병목 현상을 해소하고 수출을 늘려 경제를 확대하는 철도 건설이 특히 중요합니다.&#xD;
Shiveehuren 항구에 가까운 광산에서 화물을 운송하기 위해 민간 철도를 건설하는 것은 수익성이 높은 사업으로 간주됩니다. 수출이 증가함에 따라 몽골의 경제는 강화되고 선진국이 될 것입니다.

11777.abstract_en:
The mining sector is the leading foreign trade sector of Mongolia. Along with the development of the industry, the volume of transportation is increasing. While production is rising, transportation capacity has reached its peak, which is the underlying reason for the slowdown in exports.&#xD;
In order to eliminate the delay in transportation, the Mongolian government is implementing the railway development policy in stages.&#xD;
For a landlocked country, the construction of railways to eliminate transport bottlenecks to increase exports to expand its economy is particularly important.&#xD;

11780.abstract_ko:
이집트 정부는 이집트의 대중교통 발전 계획을 채택하고 있습니다. 이 계획은 이집트의 비전 2030과 지속 가능한 발전 계획에 부응하고 있습니다. 그러나 이집트의 대중교통 시스템은 요구되는 발전을 달성하고 고품질의 서비스가 되기 위해서는 아직 멀었습니다. 달성하기 위해 필요한 주요 목표는 복합 교통 시스템이며 모든 교통 수단의 통합이 교통 시스템 개선의 핵심입니다.&#xD;
본 연구는 복합운송시스템을 시행함에 있어 이집트가 직면할 수 있는 성공요인, 도전과제, 그리고 이 시스템의 이점을 손에 넣기 위해 한국의 교통시스템을 연구하고 있습니다.&#xD;
이 연구는 이 시스템의 성공에 필요한 발권 시스템, 교통 인프라 및 교통 정책 측면에 초점을 맞출 것입니다.

11780.abstract_en:
The Egyptian government is adopting a development plan for public transportation in Egypt. This plan is serving Egypt's vision 2030 and the sustainable development plan in the country. However, the public transportation system in Egypt still has a long way to achieve the required development and be a high-quality service. The main goal required to be achieved is the intermodal transportation system, the integration of all modes of transportation is the key to transportation system improvement.&#xD;
This Research is studying the transportation system in South Korea to put our hands on the success factors, challenges that can face Egypt in implementing the intermodal transportation system, and the benefits from this system.&#xD;
The study will focus on the aspects of the ticketing system, transportation infrastructure, and transportation policies required for the success of this system.

11781.abstract_en:
This thesis delves into the critical domain of tunnel engineering, specifically focusing on the intricate dynamics of tunnel face pressure. Through rigorous analytical and numerical investigations, this study explore the significance of comprehending and managing actual tunnel face pressure during underground tunneling and excavation. The study begins by introducing the concept of tunnel face pressure as the force exerted by surrounding earth or rock mass on the tunnel face, influenced by the weight of overlying materials and lateral confinement. This study emphasize its pivotal role in ensuring worker safety and tunnel stability.&#xD;
Utilizing the Strength Reduction Method, a versatile numerical technique, we scrutinize actual tunnel face pressure and its implications. Our findings reveal that while most face pressure falls within predefined boundaries, certain segments exhibit deviations, accentuating the potential for more advanced soil investigations in future projects. Moreover, this research transcends conventional applications of the Strength Reduction Method in slope stability analysis, demonstrating its adaptability in addressing a spectrum of geotechnical challenges beyond the traditional scope.&#xD;
In conclusion, this study highlights the integral nature of tunnel face pressure in the successful execution of tunnel engineering projects. It emphasizes the need for precision in analyses and innovative safety measures during construction. By extending the applicability of the Strength Reduction Method, this study contribute to the evolving landscape of geotechnical engineering. This research serves as a beacon, illuminating the path towards safer and more efficient tunneling and excavation endeavors.

11785.abstract_ko:
세계적으로 진행되는 세계화 과정에서 철도운송산업과 이에 따른 물류 인프라의 중요성은 더욱 커지고 있습니다. 이와 관련하여 철도 운송 네트워크의 효과적인 개발을 보장하는 경제적 접근 방식 형성에 대해 수행되는 과학적 연구 및 연구가 특히 우선시됩니다.&#xD;
그러나 승용차의 건설, 수리 등 철도교통망의 발전과정과 혁신기술을 활용한 승용차의 효율성에 대해서는 충분한 관심을 기울이지 않았습니다. 따라서 혁신적인 기술을 기반으로 한 철도교통망 개발 과정에서 기존의 문제점을 파악하고, 이에 영향을 미치는 요인을 정의하며, 이러한 문제점을 제거하기 위한 과학적 기반의 제안을 개발하는 것이 오늘날 시급한 문제로 간주됩니다.&#xD;
연구는 발전하지 않는 산업 철도 기업을 밝히고 철도 기업의 발전을 방해하는 다양한 외부 및 내부 요인, 즉 마차, 컨테이너, 탱크 등의 건설에 미치는 영향을 탐색하는 것입니다.&#xD;
JSC "타슈켄트 여객 운송 건설 및 수리 공장". 이 공장은 중앙아시아 유일의 승용차 건설 및 수리 공장입니다. 이 공장은 다양한 승용차의 건설 및 수리에 종사하고 있습니다. 불행히도 오늘날 왜건에 대한 수요가 감소하고 있습니다. 마차 생산과 마차 수리에 경제적 감소가 있습니다. 이런 상황에서는 공장이 실패 신청을 하게 될 것입니다. 파산은 공장의 실직으로 이어질 수 있습니다.

11785.abstract_en:
The importance of the railway transport industry and its logistics infrastructures is increasing in the processes of globalization taking place in the world. In this regard, special priority is being given to the scientific researches and researches that are being carried out on the formation of economic approaches that ensure the effective development of the railway transport network&#xD;
However, not enough attention has been paid to the processes of development of the railway transport network, including the construction and repair of passenger cars, and the efficiency of them based on the use of innovative technologies. Therefore, identifying the existing problems in the processes of development of the railway transport network based on innovative technologies, defining the factors affecting them and developing scientifically based proposals for the elimination of these problems are considered to be urgent issues today.&#xD;
Research is that it reveals a non-developing industrial railway enterprise and explore the influence of various external and internal factors that hinder the development of a railway enterprise, that is, the construction of wagons, containers, tanks, etc.&#xD;
JSC "Tashkent Passenger Carriage Construction and Repair Plant". This is plant is the only plant for the construction and repair of passenger cars in Central Asia. This plant is engaged in the construction and repair of various passenger cars. Unfortunately, today there is a decrease in demand for wagons. There is an economic decline in the production of wagons and, as well as the repair of wagons. In this situation, the plant will be forced to file for failure. Bankruptcy could lead to job losses at the plant.

11788.abstract_ko:
본 연구는 고속철도 개통으로 국민이 선택할 수 있는 교통수단의 변화와 철도환경에 큰 역할을 하는 이용자가 지각하는 고객 서비스품질을 보다 효과적으로 분석하고 개선하기 위한 경영 서비스 전략의 논리적 근거를 제공하고자 하는 것이다. &#xD;
 &#xD;
 2016년 고속철도 경쟁체제를 시작으로 2024년 현재 KTX 고속철도 개통 20주년, SRT 고속철도 개통 7주년이 되었다. 두 고속철도의 운영기관은 국민의 교통비 절감과 철도 산업 발전 등 사회적 편익을 확대 하고 있는 중이다. 고속철도는 친환경 교통수단으로서 전 세계적으로 탄소중립 시대를 견인하고 있으며, 기후 위기 시대에 지속 가능한 미래 환경 변화의 큰 도약이 될 것으로 기대된다.&#xD;
&#xD;
 이 연구는 국내 고속철도가 제공하고 있는 고객 서비스품질 현황을 이용자와 전문가 관점에서 조사 및 분석하고 고속철도가 제공하는 서비스품질의 현 상황을 규명하였다. 실증분석을 통해 고속철도 이용자와 철도 전문가의 인식 차이를 비교하고 운영기관의 효율적인 서비스 성과 전략을 도출함으로써 고객 서비스품질 개선방안을 제시하는 데 연구의 목적이 있다. &#xD;
&#xD;
 본 연구 결과를 요약하면 다음과 같다.&#xD;
&#xD;
 첫째, 고속철도 서비스품질을 구성하는 위계적 모형(Hierarchical model)을 3차원 9가지 요인, 즉 상호작용품질(직원의 친절도, 직원의 적극적 대응, 직원의 전문성), 물리적 환경품질(객실의 쾌적성, 역 접근성, 발권의 용이성), 결과품질(정시운행, 요금의 적정성, 안전과 보안)으로 구성하였다. &#xD;
&#xD;
 둘째, 이용자 관점에서 IPA 분석을 실시하여 고속철도 운영기관이 제공하고 있는 고객 서비스에 대한 중요도와 만족도를 KTX와 SRT 비교를 통해 규명하였다. KTX 선택속성에 대한 IPA 분석 결과 3개의 품질 요인이 유지강화 부분으로, 3개의 품질 요인이 현상유지 부분으로, 3개의 품질 요인이 중점개선 부분으로 확인되었고 개선요망 부분은 해당 품질 요인이 해당 없음으로 확인되었다.&#xD;
 또한 SRT 선택속성에 대한 IPA 분석 결과 5개의 품질 요인이 유지강화 부분으로, 3개의 품질 요인이 개선요망 부분으로, 1개의 품질 요인이 중점개선 부분으로 확인되었고 현상유지 부분은 해당 품질 요인이 해당 없음으로 확인되었다.   &#xD;
&#xD;
 셋째, 철도 전문가 관점에서 AHP 분석을 실시하여 고속철도 고객 서비스품질을 위한 개별 항목에 대한 상대적 비교를 통한 중요도를 도출하였다. &#xD;
연구 결과, 제1계층에서는 결과품질, 물리적 환경품질, 상호작용품질 순으로 가중치가 나타났고 제2계층 전체에서는 안전과 보안, 역 접근성, 정시 운행, 요금의 적정성 부분이 상위순위를 차지하였으며, 직원의 적극적 대응, 직원의 전문성, 발권의 용이성, 객실의 쾌적성, 직원의 친절도 부분이 하위순위에 차지하는 것으로 확인되었다.&#xD;
&#xD;
 본 연구는 철도 관련 선행연구를 분석하여 고속철도 특성을 반영한 고객 서비스품질 측정 요인을 설계하고 이를 이용자 관점과 전문가 관점 양측에 적합한 분석 기법을 활용하여 측정하였다.&#xD;
 그 결과를 객관적으로 분석하여 중요도 인식 차이를 통한 개선방안을 제시한 것에 의의가 있다.&#xD;
&#xD;
 마지막으로 본 연구를 통해 경쟁체제 고속철도 운영기관의 개선항목 기준을 마련함으로써 고속철도 산업의 경쟁력 부분에 해당하는 품질 요인의 중요성을 더욱 확대하여 이용자와 전문가 의견을 반영한 경쟁우위의 원천이 되는 맞춤형 서비스 전략을 선점하는 목표에 기여 할 것으로 기대된다.

11788.abstract_en:
This study aims to provide a logical basis for a management service strategy to more effectively analyze and improve the changes in the means of transportation that citizens can choose with the opening of the high-speed rail and the customer service quality perceived by users, which plays a major role in the railroad environment.&#xD;
&#xD;
Starting with the high-speed rail competition system in 2016, 2024 marks the 20th anniversary of the opening of the KTX high-speed rail and the 7th anniversary of the opening of the SRT high-speed rail. The two high-speed rail operators are expanding social benefits, such as reducing transportation costs for the public and expanding the railroad industry. High-speed rail is an eco-friendly means of transportation that is leading the era of carbon neutrality around the world, and is expected to be a big leap forward in sustainable future environmental change in the era of climate crisis.&#xD;
&#xD;
This study investigated and analyzed the current status of customer service quality provided by domestic high-speed rail from the perspectives of users and experts, and identified the current status of service quality provided by high-speed rail. The purpose of the study is to suggest ways to improve customer service quality by comparing the perceptions of high-speed rail users and railroad experts through empirical analysis to derive efficient performance and service strategies of operating organizations.&#xD;
The results of this study are summarized as follows.&#xD;
&#xD;
First, the hierarchical model that constitutes high-speed rail service quality is divided into nine three-dimensional factors, namely, interaction quality (staff friendliness, staff active response, staff expertise), physical environment quality (room comfort, It consists of station accessibility, ease of ticketing), and result quality (on-time operation, adequacy of fares, safety and security).&#xD;
&#xD;
Second, IPA analysis was conducted from the user's perspective to identify the importance and satisfaction of customer services provided by high-speed rail operators through comparison with KTX and SRT. As a result of IPA analysis of KTX selection attributes, three quality factors were identified as areas for maintenance and strengthening, three quality factors as areas for maintaining the status quo, and three quality factors as areas for key improvement, and the area requiring improvement was identified as not applicable to the relevant quality factors. Confirmed.&#xD;
&#xD;
In addition, as a result of IPA analysis of SRT selection attributes, 5 quality factors were identified as areas for maintenance and strengthening, 3 quality factors as areas requiring improvement, and 1 quality factor as area for intensive improvement, and the maintenance of the status quo area was not applicable to the relevant quality factors. It was confirmed.&#xD;
&#xD;
Third, AHP analysis was conducted from the perspective of railway experts to derive the importance through relative comparison of individual items for high-speed rail customer service quality. As a result of the study, in the first tier, the weighting was in the order of result quality, physical environment quality, and interaction quality, and in the entire 2nd tier, safety and security, station accessibility, on-time operation, and adequacy of fares were ranked highest, and employees It was confirmed that proactive response, staff expertise, ease of ticketing, room comfort, and staff friendliness were ranked low.&#xD;
&#xD;
This study analyzed previous research on railways, designed customer service quality measurement factors that reflect the characteristics of high-speed railways, and measured them using analysis techniques suitable for both user and expert perspectives.&#xD;
 It is significant that the results were objectively analyzed and improvement measures were presented through differences in importance perception. Lastly, through this study, by establishing standards for improvement items for high-speed rail operating organizations in a competitive system, the importance of quality factors corresponding to the competitiveness of the high-speed rail industry has been further expanded, and a customized service strategy that is a source of competitive advantage that reflects the opinions of users and experts has been developed. It is expected to contribute to the goal of taking the lead.

11790.abstract_en:
Abstract&#xD;
Title : Analyzing Passengers' Usage Behavior and Effectiveness of  the Climate Card in Seoul&#xD;
Referring to Germany's success story of 9-euro and 49-euro tickets, our government and local governments have begun discussing policies to revitalize public transportation to respond to the climate crisis and reduce greenhouse gases from 2023. Among them, Seoul City is the first to pilot the Climate Card, which allows unlimited use of public transportation for 60,000 won per month, starting from January 27, 2024.&#xD;
It is still in the early stages of implementation, and there is no research analyzing the effects of this policy on transportation mode selection, increase in frequency of use, appropriateness of support amount, and mode conversion rate of private car users to public transportation. Therefore, this paper is one of several public transportation support projects. Limited to the Seoul Climate Card pilot project, this study was conducted for the purpose of analyzing whether it was being implemented in line with policy objectives such as revitalizing public transportation and alleviating the burden of transportation costs.&#xD;
This study was conducted in parallel with a survey and big data analysis to analyze the effects before and after the implementation of the Climate Card system. Passenger satisfaction, system implementation effectiveness, and mode conversion rate were estimated through a survey, and Big Data was used to verify whether the actual numbers matched. SPSS Statistics 26 was used for survey statistical analysis, and R was used for Trip Chain Big Data analysis.&#xD;
As a result of the study, the higher the frequency of using the Climate Card, the higher the level of satisfaction, and through big data analysis, a change in travel patterns was confirmed that reduced transfer resistance between subways and buses. In addition, it was verified that the survey result showing that 3.8% of private car users switched to the Climate Card was meaningful.&#xD;
Based on the analysis results, it was emphasized that as user satisfaction increases, it is necessary to prepare support measures for operational losses of the Seoul Transportation Corporation, which is only compensated for 50% of excess usage.&#xD;
In addition, in terms of fares, the amount is reduced to 50,000 won or less, activation of the miscellaneous ticket system, in terms of spatial scope, the scope of applicable areas is expanded, and in terms of operation, the phased abolition of the subway commuter pass system is implemented in parallel with various measures to suppress demand for passenger cars, and in the metropolitan area The establishment of transportation administrative governance and the promotion of a new transportation tax were suggested as ways to improve the system.&#xD;
As a limitation of the study, it is regrettable that a more advanced analysis of Big Data could not be performed due to limitations in analysis capacity and time. Therefore, research was conducted on the design of various means selection models or path selection models related to Climate Card Trip Chain Big Data. It was decided to leave this as a future research topic.&#xD;
This study is considered to be significant in its differentiation and uniqueness in that it is the first paper on the Climate Card, an unlimited monthly pass for buses, subways, and Ttareungi(public bicycle in Seoul), which was implemented for the first time in Korea. The expected effect is that it can be used as basic research data for future Climate Card Trip Chain Big Data research.&#xD;
&#xD;
